export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"takeoffcraft","name":"TakeoffDesk","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Getting started with TakeoffDesk","summary":"What TakeoffDesk does, where it runs, and your first measured and priced item from a PDF plan set.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["start","first takeoff","quick start","introduction","estimate","quantity takeoff","plan set","pdf"],"headings":[{"id":"where-it-runs","text":"Where it runs","level":2},{"id":"your-first-takeoff-in-ten-steps","text":"Your first takeoff in ten steps","level":2},{"id":"what-to-read-next","text":"What to read next","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk measures plan sets, PDFs and DWG or DXF drawings, and turns the measurements into a priced estimate. You open the files (a drawing counts straight from its blocks: see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EOpen a DWG or DXF drawing\u003C/a\u003E), give each sheet a scale (a drawing brings its own), make \u003Cstrong\u003Eitems\u003C/strong\u003E (a wall type, a floor finish, a fixture), and click on the sheets to take them off. Quantities, costs and the job total update as you go. You can export the estimate as a spreadsheet and a copy of the PDFs with your takeoff drawn in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you have done takeoff in other programs, read \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EComing from other takeoff software\u003C/a\u003E next. Some things work differently here.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-it-runs\"\u003EWhere it runs\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in your web browser. Open TakeoffDesk and the screen is ready at once; there is nothing to install.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYour PDFs stay on your computer.\u003C/strong\u003E They are opened by the browser and never uploaded. Saving is a download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt works in current Chrome, Edge, Firefox and Safari. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowsers and computers\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt works with no internet connection once you choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar and it says \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EWorking offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECloud saving is not available: your files stay on your computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-first-takeoff-in-ten-steps\"\u003EYour first takeoff in ten steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis walk-through measures one wall type and prices it. It takes a few minutes on any plan you have.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E group of the toolbar (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), pick one or more PDFs, and choose Open. You can also drop the PDFs anywhere on the page. The sheets appear on the left and the first sheet opens in the middle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFind the sheet&#039;s printed scale in its title block or under a drawing title.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E group and pick that scale, for example \u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. The bar at the bottom of the sheet now says &quot;Scale 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and click the two ends of a dimension printed on the drawing. The readout in the status bar at the bottom left should match the printed dimension. If it does not, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panel on the right, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E, type a name like \u003Ccode\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/code\u003E, leave the type on \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E in the toolbar (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the start of a wall, then each corner along it. Double-click, press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or right-click to finish the run. The run is drawn in the item&#039;s color and its length appears next to the item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the item editor under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E, type \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.85\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $/LF\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003E1.20\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $/LF\u003C/span\u003E. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table at the bottom shows the length, the extended material and labor, and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Your browser downloads a \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file. It holds your items, scales and marks, and reopens on top of the same PDFs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E menu in the toolbar and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E to download the estimate as a spreadsheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to stop whatever you are doing and go back to the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E tool. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E undoes any change.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-to-read-next\"\u003EWhat to read next\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003EThe TakeoffDesk screen\u003C/a\u003E names every part of the window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EStart a takeoff and open a plan set\u003C/a\u003E covers several PDFs and the sheets list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E explains types, units, waste and rates.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EAssemblies and formulas\u003C/a\u003E turns one measurement into studs, sheets of board and more.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKeyboard and mouse\u003C/a\u003E lists every key.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk measures plan sets, PDFs and DWG or DXF drawings, and turns the measurements into a priced estimate. You open the files (a drawing counts straight from its blocks: see Open a DWG or DXF drawing), give each sheet a scale (a drawing brings its own), make items (a wall type, a floor finish, a fixture), and click on the sheets to take them off. Quantities, costs and the job total update as you go. You can export the estimate as a spreadsheet and a copy of the PDFs with your takeoff drawn in. If you have done takeoff in other programs, read Coming from other takeoff software next. Some things work differently here. Where it runs TakeoffDesk runs in your web browser. Open TakeoffDesk and the screen is ready at once; there is nothing to install. Your PDFs stay on your computer. They are opened by the browser and never uploaded. Saving is a download. It works in current Chrome, Edge, Firefox and Safari. See Browsers and computers. It works with no internet connection once you choose Save for offline in the app bar and it says Offline ready. See Working offline. Cloud saving is not available: your files stay on your computer. Your first takeoff in ten steps This walk-through measures one wall type and prices it. It takes a few minutes on any plan you have. Choose Open plans in the File group of the toolbar (or press Ctrl+O), pick one or more PDFs, and choose Open. You can also drop the PDFs anywhere on the page. The sheets appear on the left and the first sheet opens in the middle. Find the sheet's printed scale in its title block or under a drawing title. Open the Preset list in the Scale group and pick that scale, for example 1/4\" = 1'-0\". The bar at the bottom of the sheet now says \"Scale 1/4\" = 1'-0\"\". Choose Check (or press D) and click the two ends of a dimension printed on the drawing. The readout in the status bar at the bottom left should match the printed dimension. If it does not, see Set the scale. In the Items panel on the right, choose New item, type a name like Interior wall type A, leave the type on Linear (length), and choose Add. Choose Linear in the toolbar (or press L). Click the start of a wall, then each corner along it. Double-click, press Enter or right-click to finish the run. The run is drawn in the item's color and its length appears next to the item. In the item editor under Items, type 9'-0\" in Height, 0.85 in Material $/LF and 1.20 in Labor $/LF. The Quantities table at the bottom shows the length, the extended material and labor, and the Job total. Choose Save takeoff (or press Ctrl+S). Your browser downloads a .takeoff.json file. It holds your items, scales and marks, and reopens on top of the same PDFs. Open the Export menu in the toolbar and choose XLSX to download the estimate as a spreadsheet. Press Esc to stop whatever you are doing and go back to the Select tool. Ctrl+Z undoes any change. What to read next The TakeoffDesk screen names every part of the window. Start a takeoff and open a plan set covers several PDFs and the sheets list. Create takeoff items explains types, units, waste and rates. Assemblies and formulas turns one measurement into studs, sheets of board and more. Keyboard and mouse lists every key.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"The TakeoffDesk screen","summary":"A tour of the window by on-screen name - the toolbar, the sheets list, the sheet, the Items panel, the Quantities table and the status bar.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["screen","layout","layouts","ribbon","project browser","toolbox","info box","toolbar","panels","sheets list","items panel","quantities","status bar","tour","interface"],"headings":[{"id":"the-toolbar","text":"The toolbar","level":2},{"id":"sheets-left","text":"Sheets (left)","level":2},{"id":"the-sheet-middle","text":"The sheet (middle)","level":2},{"id":"items-right","text":"Items (right)","level":2},{"id":"quantities-bottom","text":"Quantities (bottom)","level":2},{"id":"status-bar-bottom","text":"Status bar (bottom)","level":2},{"id":"other-layouts","text":"Other layouts","level":2},{"id":"full-screen-and-themes","text":"Full screen and themes","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk fills the browser window under the app bar. From top to bottom and left to right:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPart\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhere\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it is for\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApp bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVery top\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe app name, the version, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout TakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E button and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E theme switch.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnder the app bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery command, in groups: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery page of every open PDF, with a thumbnail, its scale and its mark count.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe sheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiddle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe open page. You measure here.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItems\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYour takeoff items, the selected item&#039;s settings, and the selected mark.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBottom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities and costs by item or by sheet, and the job total.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStatus bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVery bottom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe live measurement, messages, the 45° hint and the zoom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar\"\u003EThe toolbar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover over any button to see what it does and its key.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGroup\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EButtons\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E (empty takeoff), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen PDFs\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (a \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E project), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne menu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, an on/off switch), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, an on/off switch), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste in place\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect all\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect none\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe tool you are using is shown pressed. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E buttons stay pressed while they are on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sheets-left\"\u003ESheets (left)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESearch sheets\u003C/strong\u003E filters the list by sheet name, file name or page label.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach sheet shows a thumbnail (drawn as you scroll), its name, and either its scale or \u003Cstrong\u003ENo scale\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe right side of each row shows how many marks the sheet has. While an item is highlighted, it shows how many of that item&#039;s marks are on the sheet instead.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick a sheet to open it. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E move to the next and previous sheet in the list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen a takeoff covers PDFs that are not open, a note under the list names them. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESheet names come from the PDF: a page label such as \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E becomes the sheet name. A page with no label is named after its file and page number, like &quot;Plans, page 3&quot;. With several PDFs open, labeled sheets also show the file name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-sheet-middle\"\u003EThe sheet (middle)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar under the sheet shows the sheet name and its scale, or &quot;No scale yet: pick a preset or calibrate&quot;. Its buttons: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E (when that app can take the PDF; see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EStart a takeoff and open a plan set\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompare\u003C/span\u003E (an older version of the sheet over this one: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003ECompare a revised sheet\u003C/a\u003E), &quot;(n) to check&quot; (flagged marks, when there are any) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E (the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBefore any PDF is open, the middle shows a short five-step guide.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe wheel zooms at the pointer. Drag to pan. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKeyboard and mouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhile you use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, a bar with its controls appears at the top of the sheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"items-right\"\u003EItems (right)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E list: the building, floor or phase new marks go in (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EBid areas\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E opens a small form: a name, a type (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe list shows each item&#039;s color, type icon, name and quantity. Click an item to draw with it and highlight its marks on every sheet. Click it again to stop highlighting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder the list, \u003Cstrong\u003EItem: (name)\u003C/strong\u003E is the item editor: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, material and labor rates, the measured values, and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E appears when you select a mark: which item it belongs to, its sheet, its measurements, and buttons such as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a cut-out\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E. With several marks selected it becomes \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected marks\u003C/strong\u003E: how many of each item, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete marks\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe item editor ends with \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy item\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate item\u003C/span\u003E: an item with its assembly and costs, without marks. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ECopy, paste and duplicate marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"quantities-bottom\"\u003EQuantities (bottom)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E lists every item and its assembly components with quantity, waste, rates and extended costs. You can type waste and rates straight into the table.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E lists each item&#039;s quantity on each sheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA warning starting with \u003Cstrong\u003EIncomplete:\u003C/strong\u003E appears when something is left out of the totals.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E is at the right of the header.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe arrow button at the far right hides or shows the table to give the sheet more room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\"\u003ERead quantities and the estimate\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"status-bar-bottom\"\u003EStatus bar (bottom)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFrom left to right: the live measurement while you draw (length, area, radius or a check result), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E box while you type a length, messages from TakeoffDesk, the reminder &quot;Shift snaps to 45°&quot; (or &quot;Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle&quot; when that is on in \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003ESettings\u003C/a\u003E), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E button (snapping to the drawing&#039;s lines, on when highlighted; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and the zoom percentage.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERead the status bar when something does not happen. TakeoffDesk explains there why it refused a click, for example &quot;This sheet has no scale yet&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"other-layouts\"\u003EOther layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEverything above is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk classic\u003C/span\u003E layout, the start. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E offers two more; the same tools and keys work in all three, and picking \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk classic\u003C/span\u003E again puts every control back where it was.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELayout\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIn TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff ribbon\u003C/span\u003E across the top (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/a\u003E), a bar for the running tool, a tab for each sheet you open (a drawing&#039;s Model and layouts are sheets too) with the scale presets and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E under the sheet. The left panel holds \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E (the selected item, note or mark) over the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff browser\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E (click one to open it in a tab), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConditions\u003C/span\u003E (click one to draw with it) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E (each item&#039;s total and the job total); the thumbnails are its second tab.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe toolbar over the sheet, an info box with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E, the running tool or the selection and the sheet bar, a column of the takeoff tools on the left, a tab for every sheet, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E and the zoom under the sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E is open, the sheet tabs and the bar under the sheet step aside; close the 3D view to measure again. On a phone the phone layout always runs.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"full-screen-and-themes\"\u003EFull screen and themes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E button in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (Control on every platform, also on a Mac), cycles through normal, full screen, and full screen with the bars hidden. With the bars hidden, move the pointer to the top edge to show them again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E is the light theme and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E the dark one. In \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E the drawing is shown inverted (light lines on dark) on screen only; exports are never changed.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk fills the browser window under the app bar. From top to bottom and left to right: Part Where What it is for App bar Very top The app name, the version, About TakeoffDesk, Help (F1), Save for offline, Settings (Ctrl+,), the Full screen button and the Paper / Model theme switch. Toolbar Under the app bar Every command, in groups: File, Export, Scale, Takeoff, Edit, View. Sheets Left Every page of every open PDF, with a thumbnail, its scale and its mark count. The sheet Middle The open page. You measure here. Items Right Your takeoff items, the selected item's settings, and the selected mark. Quantities Bottom Quantities and costs by item or by sheet, and the job total. Status bar Very bottom The live measurement, messages, the 45° hint and the zoom. The toolbar Hover over any button to see what it does and its key. Group Buttons File New (empty takeoff), Open PDFs (Ctrl+O), Open takeoff (a .takeoff.json project), Save takeoff (Ctrl+S) Export One menu: XLSX, CSV, Marked PDF Scale Calibrate (K), Check (D), and the Preset list Takeoff Select (V), Linear (L), Area (A), Circle (O), Arc (R, an on/off switch), Deduct (E, an on/off switch), Cut-out (X), Count (C), Auto count (S) Edit Undo (Ctrl+Z), Redo (Ctrl+Y), Copy (Ctrl+C), Paste (Ctrl+V), and More: Cut, Copy, Paste, Paste in place, Duplicate, Delete, Select all, Select none View Fit page (F), Fit width (W) The tool you are using is shown pressed. The Arc and Deduct buttons stay pressed while they are on. Sheets (left) Search sheets filters the list by sheet name, file name or page label. Each sheet shows a thumbnail (drawn as you scroll), its name, and either its scale or No scale. The right side of each row shows how many marks the sheet has. While an item is highlighted, it shows how many of that item's marks are on the sheet instead. Click a sheet to open it. Page Down and Page Up move to the next and previous sheet in the list. When a takeoff covers PDFs that are not open, a note under the list names them. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Sheet names come from the PDF: a page label such as A-101 becomes the sheet name. A page with no label is named after its file and page number, like \"Plans, page 3\". With several PDFs open, labeled sheets also show the file name. The sheet (middle) The bar under the sheet shows the sheet name and its scale, or \"No scale yet: pick a preset or calibrate\". Its buttons: MarkupCraft (when that app can take the PDF; see Start a takeoff and open a plan set), Compare (an older version of the sheet over this one: Compare a revised sheet), \"(n) to check\" (flagged marks, when there are any) and 3D (the 3D check view). Before any PDF is open, the middle shows a short five-step guide. The wheel zooms at the pointer. Drag to pan. See Keyboard and mouse. While you use Auto count, a bar with its controls appears at the top of the sheet. Items (right) At the top, the Bid area list: the building, floor or phase new marks go in (Bid areas). New item opens a small form: a name, a type (Linear (length), Area or Count) and Add. The list shows each item's color, type icon, name and quantity. Click an item to draw with it and highlight its marks on every sheet. Click it again to stop highlighting. Under the list, Item: (name) is the item editor: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, material and labor rates, the measured values, and the Assembly. See Create takeoff items. Selected mark appears when you select a mark: which item it belongs to, its sheet, its measurements, and buttons such as Add a cut-out and Delete mark. With several marks selected it becomes Selected marks: how many of each item, and Copy, Duplicate, Cut and Delete marks. The item editor ends with Copy item and Duplicate item: an item with its assembly and costs, without marks. See Copy, paste and duplicate marks. Quantities (bottom) By item lists every item and its assembly components with quantity, waste, rates and extended costs. You can type waste and rates straight into the table. By sheet lists each item's quantity on each sheet. A warning starting with Incomplete: appears when something is left out of the totals. Job total is at the right of the header. The arrow button at the far right hides or shows the table to give the sheet more room. See Read quantities and the estimate. Status bar (bottom) From left to right: the live measurement while you draw (length, area, radius or a check result), the Type box while you type a length, messages from TakeoffDesk, the reminder \"Shift snaps to 45°\" (or \"Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle\" when that is on in Settings), the Snap button (snapping to the drawing's lines, on when highlighted; F3), and the zoom percentage. Read the status bar when something does not happen. TakeoffDesk explains there why it refused a click, for example \"This sheet has no scale yet\". Other layouts Everything above is the TakeoffDesk classic layout, the start. Settings (Ctrl+,) › Global › Layout offers two more; the same tools and keys work in all three, and picking TakeoffDesk classic again puts every control back where it was. Layout In TakeoffDesk Ribbon and project browser The Takeoff ribbon across the top (Menus, keys and mouse), a bar for the running tool, a tab for each sheet you open (a drawing's Model and layouts are sheets too) with the scale presets and Fit page under the sheet. The left panel holds Properties (the selected item, note or mark) over the Takeoff browser: Sheets (click one to open it in a tab), Conditions (click one to draw with it) and Estimate (each item's total and the job total); the thumbnails are its second tab. Toolbox and info box The toolbar over the sheet, an info box with the Bid area, the running tool or the selection and the sheet bar, a column of the takeoff tools on the left, a tab for every sheet, and Snap and the zoom under the sheet. While the 3D check view is open, the sheet tabs and the bar under the sheet step aside; close the 3D view to measure again. On a phone the phone layout always runs. Full screen and themes The Full screen button in the app bar, or Ctrl+Shift+F (Control on every platform, also on a Mac), cycles through normal, full screen, and full screen with the bars hidden. With the bars hidden, move the pointer to the top edge to show them again. Paper is the light theme and Model the dark one. In Model the drawing is shown inverted (light lines on dark) on screen only; exports are never changed.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"files","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Files TakeoffDesk opens and saves","summary":"PDFs in, a takeoff project file, spreadsheets and marked PDFs out - what each holds, where it goes, and what changes online, offline and between browsers.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["files","formats","pdf","takeoff.json","project file","xlsx","csv","marked pdf","download","save","open","offline"],"headings":[{"id":"what-it-opens","text":"What it opens","level":2},{"id":"what-it-saves","text":"What it saves","level":2},{"id":"where-downloads-go","text":"Where downloads go","level":2},{"id":"why-the-project-file-and-the-pdfs-are-separate","text":"Why the project file and the PDFs are separate","level":2},{"id":"online-and-offline","text":"Online and offline","level":2},{"id":"spreadsheets","text":"Spreadsheets","level":2},{"id":"desktop-and-cloud","text":"Desktop and cloud","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-opens\"\u003EWhat it opens\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFile\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHow\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENotes\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF (\u003Ccode\u003E.pdf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, or drop on the page\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESeveral at once. Each page becomes a sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff project (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, or drop on the page\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYour items, scales and marks. You can drop it together with its PDFs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOther files dropped on the page are skipped, and the status bar names them.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPassword-protected PDFs\u003C/strong\u003E do not open: &quot;(name) is password-protected. Open an unprotected copy.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe same PDF twice\u003C/strong\u003E is opened once: &quot;(name) is already open.&quot; TakeoffDesk knows files by their contents, not their names.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScanned PDFs\u003C/strong\u003E open and measure like any other; TakeoffDesk does not need the text in the PDF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELarge plan sets\u003C/strong\u003E: every PDF is read in full when it opens (to fingerprint it), so a very large file takes a moment. Thumbnails are drawn one at a time as you scroll.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-saves\"\u003EWhat it saves\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery save is a download. Nothing is written back into your PDFs.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou choose\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou get\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat is in it\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItems, assemblies, rates, sheet scales and every mark, keyed to each PDF by its contents. No PDF pages.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFour worksheets: Estimate (with live formulas), By sheet, Marks, Scales.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe estimate as plain values, one row per item and component.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA copy of each open PDF that has marks, with the takeoff drawn on its pages and a legend. One file per PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe name is taken from the first PDF you opened in this takeoff. There is no rename box yet: rename the downloaded file if you want another name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EExport the estimate and a marked PDF\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EExport columns\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-downloads-go\"\u003EWhere downloads go\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour browser saves them where it saves every download, usually the Downloads folder. Find it in \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eyour file manager\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E. If your browser is set to ask where to save each file, it asks.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E with several marked PDFs downloads several files at once. Chrome and Edge may ask once whether this site may download multiple files. Choose Allow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari saves to Downloads unless you changed the download location in Safari Settings, under General.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-the-project-file-and-the-pdfs-are-separate\"\u003EWhy the project file and the PDFs are separate\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file holds only your takeoff. It finds its PDFs again by their contents (a fingerprint of each file), so:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERenaming or moving a PDF does not matter.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA PDF that was changed or saved again by another program counts as a different file, even with the same name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarks on PDFs that are not open still count in the totals.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"online-and-offline\"\u003EOnline and offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour PDFs and takeoffs never leave your computer, online or offline. The connection matters only for loading TakeoffDesk itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo work with no connection, save the app first, while you are online:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar at the top. The button counts up, &quot;Saving 12 of 40&quot;, while it saves.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWait for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaving TakeoffDesk keeps the app, this help, the PDF reader, the PDF writer used by \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E and the auto count worker in your browser, about 6 MB. Once it says \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, everything works offline: opening PDFs, measuring, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EThe button says\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeaning\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot saved in this browser yet. Choose it to save.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaving (n) of (m)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaving now.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaved. Choose it for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave again (get the newest version)\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove the offline copy\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECould not save\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESome files did not download. Check your connection and choose it again.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline not available\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis browser window cannot keep an offline copy (private windows and some managed computers block it).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMore, including how long a saved copy lasts in each browser: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EWorking offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou are offline. If the app bar shows \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, everything works. If it does not, the parts TakeoffDesk has not loaded yet in this tab (the PDF writer for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E, the auto count worker) cannot load now, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E stops with &quot;The marked PDF could not be written&quot;. Your takeoff is safe either way: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E need no connection. Do not reload the tab until you are online again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou are online. Before a site visit or a flight, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E and wait for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spreadsheets\"\u003ESpreadsheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe XLSX keeps live formulas, so a spreadsheet program recalculates the estimate when it opens the file and keeps it right when you change a rate or waste there. The workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent. It has not been opened in Excel yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe CSV is plain values with a byte order mark, so spreadsheet programs read characters such as m² correctly.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"desktop-and-cloud\"\u003EDesktop and cloud\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in the browser; there is no installer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECloud saving is not available yet. Keep your \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E files with the job&#039;s PDFs, and back them up like any other file. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EWhere your files go\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What it opens File How Notes PDF (.pdf) Open plans, Ctrl+O, or drop on the page Several at once. Each page becomes a sheet. Takeoff project (.takeoff.json) Open takeoff, or drop on the page Your items, scales and marks. You can drop it together with its PDFs. Other files dropped on the page are skipped, and the status bar names them. Password-protected PDFs do not open: \"(name) is password-protected. Open an unprotected copy.\" The same PDF twice is opened once: \"(name) is already open.\" TakeoffDesk knows files by their contents, not their names. Scanned PDFs open and measure like any other; TakeoffDesk does not need the text in the PDF. Large plan sets: every PDF is read in full when it opens (to fingerprint it), so a very large file takes a moment. Thumbnails are drawn one at a time as you scroll. What it saves Every save is a download. Nothing is written back into your PDFs. You choose You get What is in it Save takeoff (name).takeoff.json Items, assemblies, rates, sheet scales and every mark, keyed to each PDF by its contents. No PDF pages. XLSX (name).xlsx Four worksheets: Estimate (with live formulas), By sheet, Marks, Scales. CSV (name).csv The estimate as plain values, one row per item and component. Marked PDF (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf A copy of each open PDF that has marks, with the takeoff drawn on its pages and a legend. One file per PDF. The name is taken from the first PDF you opened in this takeoff. There is no rename box yet: rename the downloaded file if you want another name. See Export the estimate and a marked PDF and Export columns. Where downloads go Your browser saves them where it saves every download, usually the Downloads folder. Find it in Finder / File Explorer / your file manager. If your browser is set to ask where to save each file, it asks. Marked PDF with several marked PDFs downloads several files at once. Chrome and Edge may ask once whether this site may download multiple files. Choose Allow. Safari saves to Downloads unless you changed the download location in Safari Settings, under General. Why the project file and the PDFs are separate The .takeoff.json file holds only your takeoff. It finds its PDFs again by their contents (a fingerprint of each file), so: Renaming or moving a PDF does not matter. A PDF that was changed or saved again by another program counts as a different file, even with the same name. Marks on PDFs that are not open still count in the totals. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Online and offline Your PDFs and takeoffs never leave your computer, online or offline. The connection matters only for loading TakeoffDesk itself. To work with no connection, save the app first, while you are online: Choose Save for offline in the app bar at the top. The button counts up, \"Saving 12 of 40\", while it saves. Wait for Offline ready. Saving TakeoffDesk keeps the app, this help, the PDF reader, the PDF writer used by Marked PDF and the auto count worker in your browser, about 6 MB. Once it says Offline ready, everything works offline: opening PDFs, measuring, Auto count, Save takeoff, XLSX, CSV and Marked PDF. The button says Meaning Save for offline Not saved in this browser yet. Choose it to save. Saving (n) of (m) Saving now. Offline ready Saved. Choose it for Save again (get the newest version) or Remove the offline copy. Could not save Some files did not download. Check your connection and choose it again. Offline not available This browser window cannot keep an offline copy (private windows and some managed computers block it). More, including how long a saved copy lasts in each browser: Working offline. You are offline. If the app bar shows Offline ready, everything works. If it does not, the parts TakeoffDesk has not loaded yet in this tab (the PDF writer for Marked PDF, the auto count worker) cannot load now, and Marked PDF stops with \"The marked PDF could not be written\". Your takeoff is safe either way: Save takeoff, XLSX and CSV need no connection. Do not reload the tab until you are online again. You are online. Before a site visit or a flight, choose Save for offline and wait for Offline ready. Spreadsheets The XLSX keeps live formulas, so a spreadsheet program recalculates the estimate when it opens the file and keeps it right when you change a rate or waste there. The workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent. It has not been opened in Excel yet. The CSV is plain values with a byte order mark, so spreadsheet programs read characters such as m² correctly. Desktop and cloud TakeoffDesk runs in the browser; there is no installer. Cloud saving is not available yet. Keep your .takeoff.json files with the job's PDFs, and back them up like any other file. See Where your files go.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"open-plan-set","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Anza ukadiriaji na fungua seti ya mipango","summary":"Fungua PDF moja au kadhaa kama seti ya mipango, tafuta njia yako kwenye karatasi, na usogee kati yake.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["fungua","seti ya mipango","PDF nyingi","faili nyingi","karatasi","michoro","lebo za kurasa","orodha ya karatasi","sogeza","dondosha","makabidhiano","fungua kwenye programu nyingine","alama za marekebisho"],"headings":[{"id":"fungua-pdf","text":"Fungua PDF","level":2},{"id":"michoro-pamoja-na-pdf","text":"Michoro pamoja na PDF","level":2},{"id":"pdf-iliyokabidhiwa-kutoka-programu-nyingine","text":"PDF iliyokabidhiwa kutoka programu nyingine","level":2},{"id":"tafuta-karatasi","text":"Tafuta karatasi","level":2},{"id":"karatasi-zinavyopewa-majina","text":"Karatasi zinavyopewa majina","level":2},{"id":"tazama-karibu-na-karatasi","text":"Tazama karibu na karatasi","level":2},{"id":"hatua-inayofuata","text":"Hatua inayofuata","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESeti ya mipango mara nyingi ni PDF kadhaa: za usanifu, muundo, mitambo. TakeoffDesk huzifungua kando kwa kando kama orodha moja ya karatasi, na ukadiriaji mmoja unaweza kufunika zote.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fungua-pdf\"\u003EFungua PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kundi la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. (Mitindo mingine ya menyu inaiita \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen PDFs…\u003C/span\u003E.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye dirisha la faili, chagua kila PDF ya seti. Shikilia \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003ECommand\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E ili kuchagua kadhaa, au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuchagua safu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua Fungua. Ujumbe &quot;Inafungua (jina)…&quot; huonekana kila faili inaposomwa. Kisha kila ukurasa unaonekana chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E, na ukurasa wa kwanza wa PDF mpya ya kwanza unafunguka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnaweza pia kuburuta PDF kutoka \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eyour file manager\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E na kuziangusha popote kwenye TakeoffDesk. Fremu ya &quot;Dondosha PDF, michoro ya DWG au DXF, au .takeoff.json&quot; huonekana unapoburuta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuongeza PDF zaidi baadaye, fanya vivyo hivyo tena. PDF ambazo tayari zimefunguliwa zinaruka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkurasa wa kuanza pia huorodhesha PDF na ukadiriaji ulioufungua hivi karibuni, kwenye vivinjari vinavyoruhusu ukurasa kufungua faili tena (Chrome na Edge). Bofya moja kuifungua; kivinjari kinaweza kuomba ruhusa kwanza. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EFaili zako\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHakuna kinachopakiwa. Kivinjari husoma PDF kwenye kompyuta yako, na zinaondoka TakeoffDesk unapofunga kichupo au kuchagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"michoro-pamoja-na-pdf\"\u003EMichoro pamoja na PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E pia hupokea michoro ya DWG na DXF, peke yake au pamoja na PDF: nafasi ya modeli ya kila mchoro na mipangilio yake huwa karatasi kwenye orodha ile ile. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EFungua mchoro wa DWG au DXF\u003C/a\u003E, kisha \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EHesabu kutoka mchoro\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-iliyokabidhiwa-kutoka-programu-nyingine\"\u003EPDF iliyokabidhiwa kutoka programu nyingine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProgramu nyingine ya familia hii inaweza kukupa PDF iliyo wazi kwake: hufungua TakeoffDesk kwenye kichupo kipya na PDF inafunguka hapo kana kwamba uliidondosha. Upau wa hali unasema &quot;Imefunguliwa (jina), imekabidhiwa kutoka (programu). Faili ya asili haijabadilika.&quot; Hakuna kinachopakiwa; faili hupitia hifadhi ya kivinjari hiki na huondoka humo mara inapofunguka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkiwa upau wa hali unasema PDF &quot;haikufika&quot;, kichupo kilisubiri kwa muda mrefu au PDF ilikuwa imefunguliwa kwenye kichupo kingine: ifungue kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwa upande mwingine, MarkupCraft ikiwa inaendeshwa mahali ulipo na inaweza kupokea faili, upau wa karatasi chini ya mchoro una kitufe cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E: hufungua PDF ya karatasi iliyo kwenye skrini kwenye MarkupCraft, kwenye kichupo kipya, kwa ukaguzi na kuweka alama za marekebisho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafuta-karatasi\"\u003ETafuta karatasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESogeza orodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E upande wa kushoto na ubofye karatasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAndika kwenye \u003Cstrong\u003ETafuta karatasi\u003C/strong\u003E juu ya orodha ili kuchuja kwa nambari ya karatasi, jina la faili au lebo ya ukurasa. Hesabu iliyo kando ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E inaonyesha &quot;3 kati ya 40&quot; wakati kichujio kimewashwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwa karatasi inayofuata na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwa iliyotangulia. Zinafuata orodha kama ilivyochujwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye kibodi ya Mac isiyo na vitufe vya Page Up na Page Down, bonyeza fn pamoja na kishale cha juu au chini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"karatasi-zinavyopewa-majina\"\u003EKaratasi zinavyopewa majina\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkurasa ambao PDF yake inaupa lebo, kama \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E, hupewa jina la lebo hiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkurasa usio na lebo (au lebo ambayo ni nambari yake ya ukurasa tu) huitwa &quot;(jina la faili), ukurasa (n)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWakati PDF kadhaa zimefunguliwa, karatasi zenye lebo pia hubeba jina la faili: &quot;A-101 — Usanifu&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMajina ya karatasi bado hayawezi kuandikwa kwa mkono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tazama-karibu-na-karatasi\"\u003ETazama karibu na karatasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZungusha gurudumu la kipanya kukuza kwenye kielekezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuruta kwa kitufe cha kushoto au cha kati kusogeza. Kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, au unapoanza kwenye kona ya alama, shikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E unapoburuta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kati.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E kuona karatasi nzima; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E hutosha upana wake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kukuza ndani na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kukuza nje, kuzunguka katikati ya mwonekano.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila karatasi hukumbuka kukuza na nafasi yake wakati inabaki wazi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hatua-inayofuata\"\u003EHatua inayofuata\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKabla ya kupima karatasi, inahitaji skeli: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EWeka skeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Seti ya mipango mara nyingi ni PDF kadhaa: za usanifu, muundo, mitambo. TakeoffDesk huzifungua kando kwa kando kama orodha moja ya karatasi, na ukadiriaji mmoja unaweza kufunika zote. Fungua PDF Chagua Open plans kwenye kundi la File, au bonyeza Ctrl+O. (Mitindo mingine ya menyu inaiita Open PDFs….) Kwenye dirisha la faili, chagua kila PDF ya seti. Shikilia Command / Ctrl / Ctrl ili kuchagua kadhaa, au Shift kuchagua safu. Chagua Fungua. Ujumbe \"Inafungua (jina)…\" huonekana kila faili inaposomwa. Kisha kila ukurasa unaonekana chini ya Sheets, na ukurasa wa kwanza wa PDF mpya ya kwanza unafunguka. Unaweza pia kuburuta PDF kutoka Finder / File Explorer / your file manager na kuziangusha popote kwenye TakeoffDesk. Fremu ya \"Dondosha PDF, michoro ya DWG au DXF, au .takeoff.json\" huonekana unapoburuta. Kuongeza PDF zaidi baadaye, fanya vivyo hivyo tena. PDF ambazo tayari zimefunguliwa zinaruka. Ukurasa wa kuanza pia huorodhesha PDF na ukadiriaji ulioufungua hivi karibuni, kwenye vivinjari vinavyoruhusu ukurasa kufungua faili tena (Chrome na Edge). Bofya moja kuifungua; kivinjari kinaweza kuomba ruhusa kwanza. Angalia Faili zako. Hakuna kinachopakiwa. Kivinjari husoma PDF kwenye kompyuta yako, na zinaondoka TakeoffDesk unapofunga kichupo au kuchagua New. Michoro pamoja na PDF Open plans pia hupokea michoro ya DWG na DXF, peke yake au pamoja na PDF: nafasi ya modeli ya kila mchoro na mipangilio yake huwa karatasi kwenye orodha ile ile. Angalia Fungua mchoro wa DWG au DXF, kisha Hesabu kutoka mchoro. PDF iliyokabidhiwa kutoka programu nyingine Programu nyingine ya familia hii inaweza kukupa PDF iliyo wazi kwake: hufungua TakeoffDesk kwenye kichupo kipya na PDF inafunguka hapo kana kwamba uliidondosha. Upau wa hali unasema \"Imefunguliwa (jina), imekabidhiwa kutoka (programu). Faili ya asili haijabadilika.\" Hakuna kinachopakiwa; faili hupitia hifadhi ya kivinjari hiki na huondoka humo mara inapofunguka. Ikiwa upau wa hali unasema PDF \"haikufika\", kichupo kilisubiri kwa muda mrefu au PDF ilikuwa imefunguliwa kwenye kichupo kingine: ifungue kwa Open plans. Kwa upande mwingine, MarkupCraft ikiwa inaendeshwa mahali ulipo na inaweza kupokea faili, upau wa karatasi chini ya mchoro una kitufe cha MarkupCraft: hufungua PDF ya karatasi iliyo kwenye skrini kwenye MarkupCraft, kwenye kichupo kipya, kwa ukaguzi na kuweka alama za marekebisho. Tafuta karatasi Sogeza orodha ya Sheets upande wa kushoto na ubofye karatasi. Andika kwenye Tafuta karatasi juu ya orodha ili kuchuja kwa nambari ya karatasi, jina la faili au lebo ya ukurasa. Hesabu iliyo kando ya Sheets inaonyesha \"3 kati ya 40\" wakati kichujio kimewashwa. Bonyeza Page Down kwa karatasi inayofuata na Page Up kwa iliyotangulia. Zinafuata orodha kama ilivyochujwa. Kwenye kibodi ya Mac isiyo na vitufe vya Page Up na Page Down, bonyeza fn pamoja na kishale cha juu au chini. Karatasi zinavyopewa majina Ukurasa ambao PDF yake inaupa lebo, kama A-101, hupewa jina la lebo hiyo. Ukurasa usio na lebo (au lebo ambayo ni nambari yake ya ukurasa tu) huitwa \"(jina la faili), ukurasa (n)\". Wakati PDF kadhaa zimefunguliwa, karatasi zenye lebo pia hubeba jina la faili: \"A-101 — Usanifu\". Majina ya karatasi bado hayawezi kuandikwa kwa mkono. Tazama karibu na karatasi Zungusha gurudumu la kipanya kukuza kwenye kielekezi. Buruta kwa kitufe cha kushoto au cha kati kusogeza. Kwa Auto count, au unapoanza kwenye kona ya alama, shikilia Space unapoburuta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kati. Bonyeza F au chagua Fit page kuona karatasi nzima; W au Fit width hutosha upana wake. Bonyeza + au = kukuza ndani na − kukuza nje, kuzunguka katikati ya mwonekano. Kila karatasi hukumbuka kukuza na nafasi yake wakati inabaki wazi. Hatua inayofuata Kabla ya kupima karatasi, inahitaji skeli: Weka skeli.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"open-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Fungua mchoro wa DWG au DXF","summary":"Fungua faili ya mchoro kama karatasi (nafasi ya modeli na kila mpangilio), anza na skeli ambayo mchoro unatoa, onyesha au ficha tabaka zake, na uingize michoro iliyounganishwa.","section":"tasks","order":12,"keywords":["dwg","dxf","cad","mchoro","fungua mchoro","mipangilio","nafasi ya modeli","nafasi ya karatasi","karatasi","vitengo","insunits","skeli ya dirisha la mwonekano","xref","mchoro uliounganishwa","tabaka","zilizogandishwa","hakuna pdf","chapa","bila kuchapisha"],"headings":[{"id":"fungua-mchoro","text":"Fungua mchoro","level":2},{"id":"karatasi","text":"Karatasi","level":2},{"id":"skeli","text":"Skeli","level":2},{"id":"tabaka","text":"Tabaka","level":2},{"id":"michoro-iliyounganishwa-xrefs","text":"Michoro iliyounganishwa (xrefs)","level":2},{"id":"vikomo","text":"Vikomo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk hufungua mchoro wa DWG au DXF kama inavyofungua PDF: huhitaji kuuchapisha kuwa PDF kwanza. Kuhesabu kutoka mchoro wenyewe ni sahihi, kwa sababu mchoro unajua kila kitu ni nini. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EHesabu kutoka mchoro\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fungua-mchoro\"\u003EFungua mchoro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kundi la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua faili ya DWG au DXF. Unaweza kuchagua nyingi, na PDF pamoja nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua Fungua.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnaweza pia kudondosha faili za mchoro kwenye TakeoffDesk, kama PDF. Hakuna kinachopakiwa: kivinjari husoma faili kwenye kompyuta yako.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk husoma DWG kuanzia AutoCAD 2000 hadi 2018 na DXF ya ASCII kuanzia R12 hadi 2018. Hukataa DXF ya binary (ihifadhi kama ASCII, au kama DWG) na faili isiyo ya aina hizo, na husema kwa nini. Faili iliyoharibika hufunguka na kile kilichoweza kusomwa, na ujumbe husema hivyo; hesabu zake zinaweza kuwa pungufu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"karatasi\"\u003EKaratasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModeli\u003C/strong\u003E ni nafasi ya modeli ya mchoro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKila mpangilio\u003C/strong\u003E (kichupo cha nafasi ya karatasi) ni karatasi, inayoitwa kwa kichupo chake, kwa mpangilio wa vichupo. Mpangilio huonyesha modeli kupitia madirisha yake ya mwonekano, kama inavyochapishwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuza, kusogeza, kunasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro yenyewe, alama, maelezo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E na mengine yanafanya kazi kama kwenye PDF. Karatasi za mchoro huhifadhiwa kwenye ukadiriaji kwa jina la faili na alama ya vidole ya yaliyomo, kama PDF: fungua faili ile ile tena na alama ziko kwenye karatasi zake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skeli\"\u003ESkeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaratasi huanza na skeli ambayo mchoro unatoa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMpangilio\u003C/strong\u003E unachukua skeli ya dirisha lake kubwa zaidi. Skeli kama 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; hutajwa kama kipimo kilichowekwa inachokuwa; nyingine yoyote inaonyeshwa kama &quot;Kutoka dirisha la mchoro: 1&quot; = 2.5&#039;&quot;. Ikiwa mpangilio una madirisha ya skeli nyingine, dirisha kubwa zaidi huweka skeli ya karatasi: zikague nyingine kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModeli\u003C/strong\u003E huchukua vitengo vya mchoro (inchi, milimita, futi…) kama skeli yake, &quot;Vitengo vya mchoro (inchi)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMchoro usio na vitengo\u003C/strong\u003E (mchoro haujasema kama kitengo ni inchi au milimita) hauna skeli: karatasi inasema &quot;Hakuna skeli&quot;, na kupima juu yake kunakataliwa, kama kwenye PDF isiyo na skeli. Kuhesabu hakuhitaji skeli. Ipe moja kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E na orodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E hubadilisha skeli wakati wowote na hushinda ile ya mchoro. Orodha ya kipimo kilichowekwa imezimwa kwenye Modeli, ambayo haina ukubwa wa karatasi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tabaka\"\u003ETabaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa karatasi huorodhesha tabaka za mchoro na idadi ya vitu kila tabaka ina kwenye karatasi hii. Tabaka ambazo faili iliwazima au kuzigandisha huanza zimefichwa. Ondoa tiki kwenye tabaka ili kuificha, au weka tiki kwenye iliyofichwa ili kuionyesha: karatasi huchorwa upya, na kilichofichwa hakihesabiwi wala hakitolewi kwenye vitu vinavyotolewa kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E, isipokuwa uombe kuhesabu tabaka zilizofichwa pia. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all\u003C/span\u003E huonyesha kila tabaka; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the file&#039;s layers\u003C/span\u003E hurudisha mabadiliko yako. Chaguo za tabaka ni za kikao hiki, si za faili ya ukadiriaji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"michoro-iliyounganishwa-xrefs\"\u003EMichoro iliyounganishwa (xrefs)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMchoro unaounganisha michoro mingine huzionyesha mahali zilipoingizwa. TakeoffDesk hupata mchoro uliounganishwa kati ya \u003Cstrong\u003Efaili zilizofunguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E, kwa jina lake la faili: fungua mchoro mwenyeji na mchoro wake uliounganishwa pamoja (au moja baada ya nyingine). Hadi hapo upau wa hali unasema michoro iliyounganishwa ngapi haikupatikana, kile zinachochora hakipo, na hesabu zinasema hivyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vikomo\"\u003EVikomo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVitu ambavyo TakeoffDesk haiwezi kusoma au kuweka (vitu vya proksi, madarasa yasiyojulikana) huorodheshwa kwenye dirisha la hesabu kwa aina; havitupwi kimya kimya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMichoro mikubwa sana huchorwa kwa sehemu, na hesabu hukoma kwenye kikomo, zikisema hivyo. Fungua chapa ya PDF ya mchoro kama huo badala yake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMchoro huchorwa kwa nyeusi na kwa rangi zake, zikififishwa kwa karatasi nyeupe. Jedwali za mitindo ya kuchapa na mgawo wa kalamu hazitumiki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk hufungua mchoro wa DWG au DXF kama inavyofungua PDF: huhitaji kuuchapisha kuwa PDF kwanza. Kuhesabu kutoka mchoro wenyewe ni sahihi, kwa sababu mchoro unajua kila kitu ni nini. Angalia Hesabu kutoka mchoro. Fungua mchoro Chagua Open plans kwenye kundi la File, au bonyeza Ctrl+O. Chagua faili ya DWG au DXF. Unaweza kuchagua nyingi, na PDF pamoja nazo. Chagua Fungua. Unaweza pia kudondosha faili za mchoro kwenye TakeoffDesk, kama PDF. Hakuna kinachopakiwa: kivinjari husoma faili kwenye kompyuta yako. TakeoffDesk husoma DWG kuanzia AutoCAD 2000 hadi 2018 na DXF ya ASCII kuanzia R12 hadi 2018. Hukataa DXF ya binary (ihifadhi kama ASCII, au kama DWG) na faili isiyo ya aina hizo, na husema kwa nini. Faili iliyoharibika hufunguka na kile kilichoweza kusomwa, na ujumbe husema hivyo; hesabu zake zinaweza kuwa pungufu. Karatasi Modeli ni nafasi ya modeli ya mchoro. Kila mpangilio (kichupo cha nafasi ya karatasi) ni karatasi, inayoitwa kwa kichupo chake, kwa mpangilio wa vichupo. Mpangilio huonyesha modeli kupitia madirisha yake ya mwonekano, kama inavyochapishwa. Kuza, kusogeza, kunasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro yenyewe, alama, maelezo, Calibrate na mengine yanafanya kazi kama kwenye PDF. Karatasi za mchoro huhifadhiwa kwenye ukadiriaji kwa jina la faili na alama ya vidole ya yaliyomo, kama PDF: fungua faili ile ile tena na alama ziko kwenye karatasi zake. Skeli Karatasi huanza na skeli ambayo mchoro unatoa: Mpangilio unachukua skeli ya dirisha lake kubwa zaidi. Skeli kama 1/2\" = 1'-0\" hutajwa kama kipimo kilichowekwa inachokuwa; nyingine yoyote inaonyeshwa kama \"Kutoka dirisha la mchoro: 1\" = 2.5'\". Ikiwa mpangilio una madirisha ya skeli nyingine, dirisha kubwa zaidi huweka skeli ya karatasi: zikague nyingine kwa Check. Modeli huchukua vitengo vya mchoro (inchi, milimita, futi…) kama skeli yake, \"Vitengo vya mchoro (inchi)\". Mchoro usio na vitengo (mchoro haujasema kama kitengo ni inchi au milimita) hauna skeli: karatasi inasema \"Hakuna skeli\", na kupima juu yake kunakataliwa, kama kwenye PDF isiyo na skeli. Kuhesabu hakuhitaji skeli. Ipe moja kwa Calibrate. Calibrate, Check na orodha ya Preset hubadilisha skeli wakati wowote na hushinda ile ya mchoro. Orodha ya kipimo kilichowekwa imezimwa kwenye Modeli, ambayo haina ukubwa wa karatasi. Tabaka Layers kwenye upau wa karatasi huorodhesha tabaka za mchoro na idadi ya vitu kila tabaka ina kwenye karatasi hii. Tabaka ambazo faili iliwazima au kuzigandisha huanza zimefichwa. Ondoa tiki kwenye tabaka ili kuificha, au weka tiki kwenye iliyofichwa ili kuionyesha: karatasi huchorwa upya, na kilichofichwa hakihesabiwi wala hakitolewi kwenye vitu vinavyotolewa kwa Measure drawing, isipokuwa uombe kuhesabu tabaka zilizofichwa pia. Show all huonyesha kila tabaka; Back to the file's layers hurudisha mabadiliko yako. Chaguo za tabaka ni za kikao hiki, si za faili ya ukadiriaji. Michoro iliyounganishwa (xrefs) Mchoro unaounganisha michoro mingine huzionyesha mahali zilipoingizwa. TakeoffDesk hupata mchoro uliounganishwa kati ya faili zilizofunguliwa, kwa jina lake la faili: fungua mchoro mwenyeji na mchoro wake uliounganishwa pamoja (au moja baada ya nyingine). Hadi hapo upau wa hali unasema michoro iliyounganishwa ngapi haikupatikana, kile zinachochora hakipo, na hesabu zinasema hivyo. Vikomo Vitu ambavyo TakeoffDesk haiwezi kusoma au kuweka (vitu vya proksi, madarasa yasiyojulikana) huorodheshwa kwenye dirisha la hesabu kwa aina; havitupwi kimya kimya. Michoro mikubwa sana huchorwa kwa sehemu, na hesabu hukoma kwenye kikomo, zikisema hivyo. Fungua chapa ya PDF ya mchoro kama huo badala yake. Mchoro huchorwa kwa nyeusi na kwa rangi zake, zikififishwa kwa karatasi nyeupe. Jedwali za mitindo ya kuchapa na mgawo wa kalamu hazitumiki.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"open-an-ifc-file","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Leta viasi kutoka faili ya IFC 4.3","summary":"Fungua faili ya IFC 4.3 ya barabara, reli, daraja au kazi za ardhi na upate hesabu kwa kila darasa, pamoja na urefu, maeneo na ujazo ambavyo faili inataja, kama viasi vilivyoandikwa.","section":"tasks","order":13,"keywords":["ifc","ifc4x3","ifc 4.3","barabara","reli","daraja","lami","ukingo","tabaka za barabara","kazi za ardhi","kiegemezi","miundombinu","viasi","bim","uhandisi wa kiraia","viasi vilivyoainishwa"],"headings":[{"id":"fungua-faili","text":"Fungua faili","level":2},{"id":"usichofanya","text":"Usichofanya","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFaili ya IFC 4.3 inaweza kubeba barabara, reli, madaraja, kazi za baharini na sehemu zake: lami, tabaka za barabara, ukingo, reli, kazi za ardhi, viegemezi, nguzo za msingi na zaidi. TakeoffDesk huvisoma na kuvigeuza kuwa viasi vilivyoainishwa unavyoweza kupanga bei.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fungua-faili\"\u003EFungua faili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kundi la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua faili ya IFC (unaweza kuichagua pamoja na PDF), au iangushe kwenye TakeoffDesk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiasi kimoja kilichoainishwa hutengenezwa kwa kila darasa na aina iliyoainishwa awali, kwa mfano &quot;Lami (inayonyumbulika): hesabu&quot;, na, faili inapozitaja, &quot;urefu&quot; kwa m, &quot;eneo&quot; kwa m² na &quot;ujazo&quot; kwa m³. Maelezo kwenye kila kipengee yanasema vipengele vingapi vilihesabiwa na vingapi havikutaja kiasi. Kufungua faili mpya ya jina lile lile husasisha viasi hivyo badala ya kuongeza zaidi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usichofanya\"\u003EUsichofanya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInasoma seti za viasi (IfcElementQuantity) ambazo faili inabeba. Haipimi maumbo ya 3D, kwa hivyo kipengele ambacho hakina seti ya viasi kinahesabiwa lakini hakiongezi urefu, eneo au ujazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMadarasa ya miundombinu ya IFC 4.3 pekee ndiyo yanayosomwa. Faili ya jengo (kuta, milango, slaba) haibadilishwi kuwa viasi hapa; faili isiyo IFC 4.3 husema hivyo na haileti chochote.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVitengo ni vya faili yenyewe, vikibadilishwa kuwa mita.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Faili ya IFC 4.3 inaweza kubeba barabara, reli, madaraja, kazi za baharini na sehemu zake: lami, tabaka za barabara, ukingo, reli, kazi za ardhi, viegemezi, nguzo za msingi na zaidi. TakeoffDesk huvisoma na kuvigeuza kuwa viasi vilivyoainishwa unavyoweza kupanga bei. Fungua faili Chagua Open plans kwenye kundi la File, au bonyeza Ctrl+O. Chagua faili ya IFC (unaweza kuichagua pamoja na PDF), au iangushe kwenye TakeoffDesk. Kiasi kimoja kilichoainishwa hutengenezwa kwa kila darasa na aina iliyoainishwa awali, kwa mfano \"Lami (inayonyumbulika): hesabu\", na, faili inapozitaja, \"urefu\" kwa m, \"eneo\" kwa m² na \"ujazo\" kwa m³. Maelezo kwenye kila kipengee yanasema vipengele vingapi vilihesabiwa na vingapi havikutaja kiasi. Kufungua faili mpya ya jina lile lile husasisha viasi hivyo badala ya kuongeza zaidi. Usichofanya Inasoma seti za viasi (IfcElementQuantity) ambazo faili inabeba. Haipimi maumbo ya 3D, kwa hivyo kipengele ambacho hakina seti ya viasi kinahesabiwa lakini hakiongezi urefu, eneo au ujazo. Madarasa ya miundombinu ya IFC 4.3 pekee ndiyo yanayosomwa. Faili ya jengo (kuta, milango, slaba) haibadilishwi kuwa viasi hapa; faili isiyo IFC 4.3 husema hivyo na haileti chochote. Vitengo ni vya faili yenyewe, vikibadilishwa kuwa mita.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"set-the-scale","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Weka skeli","summary":"Mpe kila karatasi skeli kwa kutumia kipimo kilichowekwa au kwa kurekebisha kwenye kipimo kinachojulikana, ikague, na elewe kwa nini karatasi zisizo na skeli zinaachwa nje ya jumla.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["tambua skeli","soma skeli","skeli kutoka kwenye maandishi","karatasi zote","skeli","rekebisha","kipimo kilichowekwa","kagua skeli","thibitisha","kipimo kinachojulikana","bila skeli","hakuna skeli","uwiano","weka skeli"],"headings":[{"id":"tumia-kipimo-kilichowekwa-karatasi-inapochapishwa-kwa-ukubwa-kamili","text":"Tumia kipimo kilichowekwa (karatasi inapochapishwa kwa ukubwa kamili)","level":2},{"id":"soma-skeli-kutoka-kwenye-maandishi-ya-karatasi","text":"Soma skeli kutoka kwenye maandishi ya karatasi","level":2},{"id":"rekebisha-kwenye-kipimo-kinachojulikana","text":"Rekebisha kwenye kipimo kinachojulikana","level":2},{"id":"kagua-skeli","text":"Kagua skeli","level":2},{"id":"badilisha-skeli","text":"Badilisha skeli","level":2},{"id":"kwa-nini-karatasi-zisizo-na-skeli-hazihesabiwi-kama-sifuri","text":"Kwa nini karatasi zisizo na skeli hazihesabiwi kama sifuri","level":2},{"id":"vidokezo","text":"Vidokezo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKila karatasi ina skeli yake. Wewe unaiweka, au unaruhusu TakeoffDesk iisome kutoka kwenye maandishi ya karatasi (hapa chini), kisha uikague. Hadi karatasi iwe na skeli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMstari\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuara\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShimo\u003C/span\u003E vinakataa kupima juu yake. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E vinafanya kazi bila skeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOrodha ya karatasi inaonyesha skeli ya kila karatasi, au \u003Cstrong\u003EHakuna skeli\u003C/strong\u003E. Upau chini ya karatasi iliyo wazi unasema vivyo hivyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tumia-kipimo-kilichowekwa-karatasi-inapochapishwa-kwa-ukubwa-kamili\"\u003ETumia kipimo kilichowekwa (karatasi inapochapishwa kwa ukubwa kamili)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua karatasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua orodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipimo kilichowekwa\u003C/span\u003E katika kikundi cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipimo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua skeli iliyochapishwa kwenye mchoro, kwa mfano \u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E chini ya Usanifu. Upau wa hali unasema &quot;Skeli ya karatasi hii: 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkague (hapa chini).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKipimo kilichowekwa kinadhani PDF ni ukubwa halisi wa karatasi ambao mchoro ulitengenezwa kwa ajili yake. Ikiwa PDF ilitengenezwa kwa &quot;fit to page&quot;, au ni seti ya nusu ya ukubwa, kipimo ni kibaya. Rekebisha badala yake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOrodha kamili iko kwenye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003EVipimo vilivyowekwa vya skeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soma-skeli-kutoka-kwenye-maandishi-ya-karatasi\"\u003ESoma skeli kutoka kwenye maandishi ya karatasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMichoro mingi inasema skeli yake: \u003Ccode\u003ESCALE: 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E kwenye kizuizi cha kichwa, au \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E chini ya mwonekano. TakeoffDesk inaweza kuisoma na kuweka kila karatasi kwa mara moja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua orodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipimo kilichowekwa\u003C/span\u003E kisha chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKutoka kwenye maandishi ya karatasi…\u003C/span\u003E (juu kabisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOrodha inaonyesha kila karatasi: skeli yake sasa, na inachosema maandishi yake — \u003Cstrong\u003EInasema 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EHakuna skeli kwenye maandishi yake\u003C/strong\u003E, au \u003Cstrong\u003EInasema isipimwe kwa skeli\u003C/strong\u003E (NTS).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaratasi zisizo na skeli zinazosema moja zimewekwa alama. Weka au ondoa alama yoyote, kisha chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka skeli zilizowekwa alama\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mmoja unazirudisha zote.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPima kipimo kimoja kwenye kila karatasi kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKagua\u003C/span\u003E (hapa chini): kipimo kilichowekwa ni sahihi tu ikiwa PDF imechapishwa kwa ukubwa kamili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInasoma nukuu za usanifu (\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), za uhandisi (\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E) na za metriki (\u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E) zinazolingana na \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003Ekipimo kilichowekwa\u003C/a\u003E. Karatasi inapotaja skeli zaidi ya moja (mpango wenye maelezo yaliyokuzwa), inachukua ile inayotajwa mara nyingi zaidi, na ile iliyoandikwa baada ya neno SCALE inahesabiwa mara mbili; nyingine zinaonyeshwa kwa rangi nyekundu ili ukague. Karatasi iliyoskaniwa haina maandishi: weka skeli yake kwa mkono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rekebisha-kwenye-kipimo-kinachojulikana\"\u003ERekebisha kwenye kipimo kinachojulikana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETumia hili pale ambapo hakuna skeli iliyochapishwa unayoiamini, seti ilibadilishwa ukubwa, au karatasi inasema &quot;isipimwe kwa skeli&quot; lakini ina vipimo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua karatasi na ukuze kwenye kipimo kirefu unachokijua, kama nafasi ya gridi au kipimo cha jengo zima. Kikiwa kirefu zaidi, ndivyo kilivyo sahihi zaidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERekebisha\u003C/span\u003E katika kikundi cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipimo\u003C/span\u003E, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya ncha moja ya kipimo. Kuza kwenye kila ncha kwa usahihi; unaweza kukuza na kusogeza kati ya mibofyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya ncha nyingine. Shikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili mstari ubaki kwenye 0°, 45° au 90°. Kisanduku cha \u003Cstrong\u003ERekebisha karatasi hii\u003C/strong\u003E kinafunguka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAndika umbali halisi kwenye \u003Cstrong\u003EUmbali halisi\u003C/strong\u003E, kwa mfano \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E (futi za desimali), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUingizaji wa urefu, kiwango na asilimia\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka skeli\u003C/span\u003E. Upau wa hali unaonyesha skeli kama &quot;1&quot; = (n)&#039;&quot;, na ikiwa iko ndani ya 0.5% ya kipimo kilichowekwa unasema ni kipi, kwa mfano &quot;ambacho kinalingana na 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; (chagua kipimo hicho kwa skeli sahihi)&quot;. TakeoffDesk inarudi kwenye zana ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUrekebishaji unapolingana na kipimo kilichowekwa, kuchagua kipimo hicho kunatoa skeli sahihi badala ya ile inayotegemea mahali ulipobofya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kagua-skeli\"\u003EKagua skeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKagua skeli mpya kila wakati kwenye kipimo cha pili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKagua\u003C/span\u003E katika kikundi cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipimo\u003C/span\u003E, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya ncha zote mbili za kipimo kilichochapishwa kwenye mchoro. Upau wa hali unaonyesha &quot;Kagua: 12&#039;-6&quot;&quot; pamoja na urefu uleule kwa futi za desimali na mita, na mstari wa ukaguzi unabaki kwenye karatasi na urefu wake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinganisha na kipimo kilichochapishwa. Ikiwa kimetofautiana, rekebisha kwenye kipimo kirefu zaidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili kufuta mstari wa ukaguzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badilisha-skeli\"\u003EBadilisha skeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua kipimo kingine kilichowekwa au rekebisha tena. Karatasi ikiwa tayari ina vipimo, TakeoffDesk inauliza \u003Cstrong\u003EBadilisha skeli ya karatasi hii?\u003C/strong\u003E na kusema vipimo vingapi vitapimwa upya. Chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBadilisha skeli\u003C/span\u003E. Kila mstari na eneo kwenye karatasi hupimwa upya kwa skeli mpya. Unaweza kuirudisha kwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwa-nini-karatasi-zisizo-na-skeli-hazihesabiwi-kama-sifuri\"\u003EKwa nini karatasi zisizo na skeli hazihesabiwi kama sifuri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlama kwenye karatasi isiyo na skeli haina urefu wala eneo halisi. TakeoffDesk haihesabu kamwe kama sifuri, kwa sababu hilo lingefanya makadirio yako kuwa ya chini bila wewe kujua. Badala yake:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einaacha alama hizo nje ya jumla,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einaonyesha &quot;+(n) bila skeli&quot; karibu na kipengee katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einaonyesha &quot;Haijakamilika: (n) alama kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli (hazimo kwenye jumla)&quot; kwenye kichwa cha jedwali,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einaandika idadi hiyo kwenye safu ya maelezo ya usafirishaji wa jedwali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHili linaweza kutokea unapofungua mradi ambao skeli zake hazikuwahi kuwekwa. Mpe karatasi skeli na alama zitahesabiwa mara moja. Alama za hesabu zinahesabiwa kila wakati; hazihitaji skeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vidokezo\"\u003EVidokezo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWeka skeli kwenye kila karatasi utakayopima kabla hujaanza. Tafuta \u003Cstrong\u003EHakuna skeli\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye orodha ya karatasi ili kupata zilizobaki (kisanduku cha kutafuta kinatazama majina ya karatasi, si skeli).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMaelezo na michoro iliyokuzwa kwenye karatasi moja mara nyingi hutumia skeli nyingine. TakeoffDesk ina skeli moja kwa kila karatasi; angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EKisichojengwa bado\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMichoro ya metriki: chagua kipimo cha metriki kama \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, au rekebisha kwa umbali wa metriki kama \u003Ccode\u003E6000 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Kila karatasi ina skeli yake. Wewe unaiweka, au unaruhusu TakeoffDesk iisome kutoka kwenye maandishi ya karatasi (hapa chini), kisha uikague. Hadi karatasi iwe na skeli, Mstari, Eneo, Duara na Shimo vinakataa kupima juu yake. Hesabu na Hesabu otomatiki vinafanya kazi bila skeli. Orodha ya karatasi inaonyesha skeli ya kila karatasi, au Hakuna skeli. Upau chini ya karatasi iliyo wazi unasema vivyo hivyo. Tumia kipimo kilichowekwa (karatasi inapochapishwa kwa ukubwa kamili) Fungua karatasi. Fungua orodha ya Kipimo kilichowekwa katika kikundi cha Kipimo. Chagua skeli iliyochapishwa kwenye mchoro, kwa mfano 1/8\" = 1'-0\" chini ya Usanifu. Upau wa hali unasema \"Skeli ya karatasi hii: 1/8\" = 1'-0\".\" Ikague (hapa chini). Kipimo kilichowekwa kinadhani PDF ni ukubwa halisi wa karatasi ambao mchoro ulitengenezwa kwa ajili yake. Ikiwa PDF ilitengenezwa kwa \"fit to page\", au ni seti ya nusu ya ukubwa, kipimo ni kibaya. Rekebisha badala yake. Orodha kamili iko kwenye Vipimo vilivyowekwa vya skeli. Soma skeli kutoka kwenye maandishi ya karatasi Michoro mingi inasema skeli yake: SCALE: 1/4\" = 1'-0\" kwenye kizuizi cha kichwa, au 1:100 chini ya mwonekano. TakeoffDesk inaweza kuisoma na kuweka kila karatasi kwa mara moja. Fungua orodha ya Kipimo kilichowekwa kisha chagua Kutoka kwenye maandishi ya karatasi… (juu kabisa). Orodha inaonyesha kila karatasi: skeli yake sasa, na inachosema maandishi yake — Inasema 1/4\" = 1'-0\", Hakuna skeli kwenye maandishi yake, au Inasema isipimwe kwa skeli (NTS). Karatasi zisizo na skeli zinazosema moja zimewekwa alama. Weka au ondoa alama yoyote, kisha chagua Weka skeli zilizowekwa alama. Ctrl+Z mmoja unazirudisha zote. Pima kipimo kimoja kwenye kila karatasi kwa Kagua (hapa chini): kipimo kilichowekwa ni sahihi tu ikiwa PDF imechapishwa kwa ukubwa kamili. Inasoma nukuu za usanifu (3/16\" = 1'-0\", 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\"), za uhandisi (1\" = 20') na za metriki (1:50) zinazolingana na kipimo kilichowekwa. Karatasi inapotaja skeli zaidi ya moja (mpango wenye maelezo yaliyokuzwa), inachukua ile inayotajwa mara nyingi zaidi, na ile iliyoandikwa baada ya neno SCALE inahesabiwa mara mbili; nyingine zinaonyeshwa kwa rangi nyekundu ili ukague. Karatasi iliyoskaniwa haina maandishi: weka skeli yake kwa mkono. Rekebisha kwenye kipimo kinachojulikana Tumia hili pale ambapo hakuna skeli iliyochapishwa unayoiamini, seti ilibadilishwa ukubwa, au karatasi inasema \"isipimwe kwa skeli\" lakini ina vipimo. Fungua karatasi na ukuze kwenye kipimo kirefu unachokijua, kama nafasi ya gridi au kipimo cha jengo zima. Kikiwa kirefu zaidi, ndivyo kilivyo sahihi zaidi. Chagua Rekebisha katika kikundi cha Kipimo, au bonyeza K. Bofya ncha moja ya kipimo. Kuza kwenye kila ncha kwa usahihi; unaweza kukuza na kusogeza kati ya mibofyo. Bofya ncha nyingine. Shikilia Shift ili mstari ubaki kwenye 0°, 45° au 90°. Kisanduku cha Rekebisha karatasi hii kinafunguka. Andika umbali halisi kwenye Umbali halisi, kwa mfano 24'-6 1/2\", 24.5 (futi za desimali), 30\" au 7.5 m. Angalia Uingizaji wa urefu, kiwango na asilimia. Chagua Weka skeli. Upau wa hali unaonyesha skeli kama \"1\" = (n)'\", na ikiwa iko ndani ya 0.5% ya kipimo kilichowekwa unasema ni kipi, kwa mfano \"ambacho kinalingana na 1/4\" = 1'-0\" (chagua kipimo hicho kwa skeli sahihi)\". TakeoffDesk inarudi kwenye zana ya Chagua. Urekebishaji unapolingana na kipimo kilichowekwa, kuchagua kipimo hicho kunatoa skeli sahihi badala ya ile inayotegemea mahali ulipobofya. Kagua skeli Kagua skeli mpya kila wakati kwenye kipimo cha pili. Chagua Kagua katika kikundi cha Kipimo, au bonyeza D. Bofya ncha zote mbili za kipimo kilichochapishwa kwenye mchoro. Upau wa hali unaonyesha \"Kagua: 12'-6\"\" pamoja na urefu uleule kwa futi za desimali na mita, na mstari wa ukaguzi unabaki kwenye karatasi na urefu wake. Linganisha na kipimo kilichochapishwa. Ikiwa kimetofautiana, rekebisha kwenye kipimo kirefu zaidi. Bonyeza Esc ili kufuta mstari wa ukaguzi. Badilisha skeli Chagua kipimo kingine kilichowekwa au rekebisha tena. Karatasi ikiwa tayari ina vipimo, TakeoffDesk inauliza Badilisha skeli ya karatasi hii? na kusema vipimo vingapi vitapimwa upya. Chagua Badilisha skeli. Kila mstari na eneo kwenye karatasi hupimwa upya kwa skeli mpya. Unaweza kuirudisha kwa Ctrl+Z. Kwa nini karatasi zisizo na skeli hazihesabiwi kama sifuri Alama kwenye karatasi isiyo na skeli haina urefu wala eneo halisi. TakeoffDesk haihesabu kamwe kama sifuri, kwa sababu hilo lingefanya makadirio yako kuwa ya chini bila wewe kujua. Badala yake: inaacha alama hizo nje ya jumla, inaonyesha \"+(n) bila skeli\" karibu na kipengee katika Viasi, inaonyesha \"Haijakamilika: (n) alama kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli (hazimo kwenye jumla)\" kwenye kichwa cha jedwali, inaandika idadi hiyo kwenye safu ya maelezo ya usafirishaji wa jedwali. Hili linaweza kutokea unapofungua mradi ambao skeli zake hazikuwahi kuwekwa. Mpe karatasi skeli na alama zitahesabiwa mara moja. Alama za hesabu zinahesabiwa kila wakati; hazihitaji skeli. Vidokezo Weka skeli kwenye kila karatasi utakayopima kabla hujaanza. Tafuta Hakuna skeli kwenye orodha ya karatasi ili kupata zilizobaki (kisanduku cha kutafuta kinatazama majina ya karatasi, si skeli). Maelezo na michoro iliyokuzwa kwenye karatasi moja mara nyingi hutumia skeli nyingine. TakeoffDesk ina skeli moja kwa kila karatasi; angalia Kisichojengwa bado. Michoro ya metriki: chagua kipimo cha metriki kama 1:100, au rekebisha kwa umbali wa metriki kama 6000 mm.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"create-items","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Unda vipengee vya ukadiriaji wa kiasi","summary":"Tengeneza vipengee vya mstari, eneo na hesabu, kisha uweke kitengo, kimo au kina, upotevu, na viwango vya nyenzo na kazi.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["kikundi","kiwango cha uzalishaji","ukubwa wa kikundi","mshahara","saa","saa za watu","saa za wafanyakazi","siku za kikundi","saa za kazi","kipengee","kipengee kipya","hali","hali nyingi","pima pia","aina kadhaa","chumba","mstari","eneo","hesabu","kiasi kilichoandikwa","kitengo","kimo","kina","upotevu","nyenzo","kazi","kiwango","rangi","gharama"],"headings":[{"id":"kiasi-kilichoandikwa-bila-mchoro","text":"Kiasi kilichoandikwa (bila mchoro)","level":2},{"id":"tengeneza-kipengee","text":"Tengeneza kipengee","level":2},{"id":"chagua-kipengee-utakachochora-nacho","text":"Chagua kipengee utakachochora nacho","level":2},{"id":"sanidi-kipengee","text":"Sanidi kipengee","level":2},{"id":"aina-kadhaa-za-alama-kwa-kipengee-kimoja","text":"Aina kadhaa za alama kwa kipengee kimoja","level":2},{"id":"viwango-kwenye-jedwali","text":"Viwango kwenye jedwali","level":2},{"id":"bei-inavyofanya-kazi","text":"Bei inavyofanya kazi","level":2},{"id":"kazi-kwa-kikundi-cha-wafanyakazi","text":"Kazi kwa kikundi cha wafanyakazi","level":2},{"id":"vipengee-vya-metri","text":"Vipengee vya metri","level":2},{"id":"inayofuata","text":"Inayofuata","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKipengee\u003C/strong\u003E ni kitu kimoja unachopima na kukipangia bei: aina ya ukuta, umaliziaji wa sakafu, dari, mlango, kifaa cha taa. Kila alama unayochora ni ya kipengee. Programu nyingine huviita masharti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila kipengee kina aina (na kinaweza kuchukua aina nyingine za alama pia, tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EKipengee kimoja, aina kadhaa za alama\u003C/a\u003E):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAndika\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnachochora\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInaripoti\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVitengo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMfululizo wa nukta zilizounganishwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUrefu, idadi ya mikondo, na eneo la ukuta likiwa na kimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF au m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMistari funge yenye sehemu zilizokatwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo, mzunguko, idadi ya maeneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF, SY, SQ, ac, ha au m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHesabu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya moja kwa kila kitu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgapi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiasi kilichoandikwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna: unaandika kiasi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENambari uliyoandika (au moja iliyoletwa kutoka CivilCraft)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha au m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kiasi-kilichoandikwa-bila-mchoro\"\u003EKiasi kilichoandikwa (bila mchoro)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaadhi ya vitu katika makadirio hayachorwi kamwe: uhamasishaji, vibali, akiba ya dharura, mkataba mdogo wa jumla, na ukataji na ujazaji ambao CivilCraft ilihesabu. Vifanye kuwa \u003Cstrong\u003EKiasi kilichoandikwa\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipengee kipya\u003C/span\u003E, andika jina, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKiasi kilichoandikwa (hakuna mchoro)\u003C/span\u003E kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKatika kihariri cha kipengee, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKitengo\u003C/span\u003E (LS kwa jumla ya kiasi) kisha uandike \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKiasi\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWeka upotevu na viwango kama kwa kipengee kingine chochote. Fomula za mkusanyiko hutumia \u003Ccode\u003EQ\u003C/code\u003E, yaani kiasi, kwa mfano \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(Q / 12)\u003C/code\u003E mizigo ya malori.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiasi kilichoandikwa hakichukui alama kamwe, na hakifanyi makadirio kuwa hayajakamilika. Makadirio yanapokuwa na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo la zabuni\u003C/span\u003E, kihariri pia kina \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo la zabuni\u003C/span\u003E: kiasi basi huhesabiwa katika eneo hilo, mbadala zake na jumla zake, kama vile alama ingekavyofanya hapo. Viasi vilivyoletwa kutoka programu nyingine vinaonyesha vilikotoka; tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/earthwork#cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/earthwork\" data-hash=\"cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\"\u003EUchimbaji na pointi za mwinuko\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tengeneza-kipengee\"\u003ETengeneza kipengee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKatika paneli ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E upande wa kulia, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipengee kipya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAndika jina, kama \u003Ccode\u003EAina ya ukuta wa ndani A\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003EVigae vya zulia\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua aina: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMstari (urefu)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza\u003C/span\u003E (au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Kipengee kinaonekana kwenye orodha kikiwa na rangi yake, kinakuwa kipengee utakachochora nacho, na kihariri chake kinafunguka chini ya orodha. Upau wa hali unakuambia zana ya kuchagua inayofuata.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwenye fomu ili kuifunga bila kuongeza kipengee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkichagua zana ya kupima kwanza, TakeoffDesk hutumia kipengee cha mwisho cha aina sahihi, au hufungua fomu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipengee kipya\u003C/span\u003E ikiwa aina hiyo tayari imechaguliwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chagua-kipengee-utakachochora-nacho\"\u003EChagua kipengee utakachochora nacho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBofya kipengee kwenye orodha. Kinakuwa kipengee ambacho alama mpya huenda kwake, na alama zake huangaziwa kwenye kila karatasi huku vingine vikififia. Kama karatasi iliyofunguliwa haina alama zake, TakeoffDesk inaruka hadi karatasi yenye alama hizo. Bofya kipengee tena ili kusimamisha kuangazia; bado kinabaki kipengee utakachochora nacho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKubofya alama kwa zana ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E pia hufanya kipengee chake kuwa cha sasa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanidi-kipengee\"\u003ESanidi kipengee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKihariri cha kipengee (\u003Cstrong\u003EKipengee: (jina)\u003C/strong\u003E) kina sehemu hizi. Kila moja huhifadhiwa unapotoka kwenye sehemu hiyo au unapobonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, na kila mabadiliko yanaweza kutenduliwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESehemu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJina\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInaonyeshwa kwenye orodha, majedwali na mauzo ya nje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAndika\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari, Eneo au Hesabu. Imefungwa mara kipengee kikiwa na alama (&quot;Kipengee chenye alama kinabaki na aina yake&quot;).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERangi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERangi ya alama zake kwenye skrini na kwenye PDF iliyowekewa alama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKitengo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiasi kinaripotiwa kwa kitengo gani: LF au m kwa mstari; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha au m² kwa eneo; EA kwa hesabu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPima pia\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAina nyingine za alama ambazo kipengee kinazichukua, kila moja na kitengo chake. Tazama hapa chini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimo\u003C/span\u003E (mstari)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKimo cha ukuta. Kipengee basi pia huripoti eneo la ukuta (urefu × kimo). Mikondo iliyotoka kwenye modeli ya BimCraft hubeba milango na madirisha yake: hizo hutolewa mara moja, na kipengee kinasema eneo ghafi, nafasi zilizo wazi na eneo halisi. Makadirio kutoka mradi wa BimCraft uliochagua mbinu ya kupima hupimwa kwa mbinu hiyo hapa pia (dokezo linataja mbinu, chanzo chake, na kwamba mpima viasi hajaikagua); mbinu haiwezi kubadilishwa kwenye TakeoffDesk. Matofali au vizuizi na chokaa kutoka aina ya ukuta vinafika kama vipengele viwili: vitengo vya kuagiza na ujazo wa chokaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKina\u003C/span\u003E (eneo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKina au unene, kinachotumika kwenye fomula za mkusanyiko (kwa mfano ujazo wa zege).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpotevu %\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKinaongezwa kwenye kiasi kabla ya kupanga bei: 10 maana yake kiasi × 1.10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENyenzo $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGharama ya nyenzo kwa kila kitengo. Lebo inafuata kitengo: $/SF, $/EA na kadhalika.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKazi $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGharama ya kazi kwa kila kitengo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENambari ya CSI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENambari yake ya CSI MasterFormat, kama \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E (au mgawanyo tu, \u003Ccode\u003E09\u003C/code\u003E). Laha ya kazi ya By division ya kitabu cha kazi hupanga gharama kwa nambari hiyo. Vipengee kutoka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Evifurushi vya biashara\u003C/a\u003E tayari vina nambari hiyo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKimo na kina hupokea futi na inchi (\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E8&#039; 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E) au futi za desimali (\u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E) kwa vitengo vya kifalme, na mita (\u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2700 mm\u003C/code\u003E) kwa vitengo vya metri. Viwango hupokea kiasi kama \u003Ccode\u003E12.50\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E, hadi desimali nne. Tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUingizaji wa urefu, kiwango na asilimia\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChini ya sehemu, \u003Cstrong\u003EImepimwa\u003C/strong\u003E inaonyesha jumla ambazo fomula za kipengee zinaweza kutumia, pamoja na herufi zake: Urefu (L), Mikondo (N), Eneo la ukuta (A) kwa mstari; Eneo (A), Mzunguko (P), Maeneo (N) kwa eneo; Hesabu (N) kwa hesabu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aina-kadhaa-za-alama-kwa-kipengee-kimoja\"\u003EAina kadhaa za alama kwa kipengee kimoja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVitu vingine hupimwa kwa njia zaidi ya moja: chumba kina sakafu (eneo), msingi kando ya kuta zake (urefu) na milango (hesabu). Badala ya vipengee vitatu, tengeneza kimoja:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETengeneza kipengee chenye aina yake kuu, kama kipengee cha eneo \u003Ccode\u003EChumba 101\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPima pia\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kihariri chake, weka tiki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMstari\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu\u003C/span\u003E au zote mbili. Kila moja hupata kitengo karibu nayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChora kwa zana yoyote ambayo aina yake kipengee kinachukua: \u003Ccode\u003EChumba 101\u003C/code\u003E kikiwa cha sasa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E huchora sakafu yake, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMstari\u003C/span\u003E huchora msingi wake, na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu\u003C/span\u003E huchora milango yake. TakeoffDesk haiulizi kipengee kingine.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOrodha ya vipengee inaonyesha kila kiasi (\u003Ccode\u003E50.00 SF + 2 EA\u003C/code\u003E). Kwenye jedwali la viasi, safu ya kipengee ina kiasi chake kikuu, na kila aina nyingine ina safu yake chini yake, kama \u003Cstrong\u003EChumba 101 (hesabu)\u003C/strong\u003E, yenye upotevu wake na viwango vyake vya nyenzo na kazi. Mauzo ya nje, jedwali la kila karatasi, na maelezo ya alama ya PDF iliyowekewa alama yanayaorodhesha kwa njia hiyo hiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESehemu za aina kuu zinabaki za aina kuu: kimo au kina, mwelekeo, kurudishwa nyuma na umbo la 3D yanatumika kwa alama zake tu. Mstari wa msingi uliochorwa kwa kipengee cha eneo hupimwa moja kwa moja kando ya mpango, na huonyeshwa bapa kwenye 3D. Fomula za mkusanyiko hutumia jumla za aina kuu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAina inaweza kuondolewa tu wakati kipengee hakina alama zake; zifute, au kwanza zihamishe kwenye kipengee kingine chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E. Alama zinaweza kuhamia kipengee chochote kinachochukua aina yao.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZaidi chini ni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMkusanyiko\u003C/span\u003E: vipengele kama vijiti au ubao, kila kimoja na fomula na viwango vyake. Tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EMikusanyiko na fomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChini kabisa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESogeza juu\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESogeza chini\u003C/span\u003E hubadilisha nafasi ya kipengee kwenye orodha na mauzo ya nje, na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuta kipengee\u003C/span\u003E huondoa kipengee pamoja na alama zake zote (baada ya kuuliza; unaweza kutengua).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVipengee vya eneo pia vina \u003Cstrong\u003EMteremko\u003C/strong\u003E (ndege za paa zinazopimwa kwenye mteremko: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\"\u003EPaa na miteremko\u003C/a\u003E) na \u003Cstrong\u003EKurudisha nyuma\u003C/strong\u003E (alama zake hutolewa kwenye maeneo ya vipengee vingine: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\"\u003EPima maeneo\u003C/a\u003E). Vipengee vya mstari vina \u003Cstrong\u003EMwelekeo\u003C/strong\u003E (Level, Rake, Hip au valley) na, kwa rake na hip, \u003Cstrong\u003EMteremko\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"viwango-kwenye-jedwali\"\u003EViwango kwenye jedwali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnaweza pia kuandika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpotevu %\u003C/span\u003E, viwango vya nyenzo na kazi moja kwa moja kwenye jedwali la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E chini (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa kipengee\u003C/span\u003E). Ni mpangilio uleule kama kwenye kihariri.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bei-inavyofanya-kazi\"\u003EBei inavyofanya kazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwa kila kipengee na kila kipengele cha mkusanyiko:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPamoja na upotevu\u003C/strong\u003E = kiasi × (1 + upotevu %).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENyenzo\u003C/strong\u003E = pamoja na upotevu × nyenzo kwa kitengo, imezungushwa hadi senti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKazi\u003C/strong\u003E = pamoja na upotevu × kazi kwa kitengo, imezungushwa hadi senti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJumla\u003C/strong\u003E = nyenzo + kazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJumla ya kazi\u003C/span\u003E inaongeza kila kipengee na kila kipengele. Kipengee kinaweza kubeba viwango vyake na mkusanyiko kwa wakati mmoja; zote mbili zinahesabiwa, kwa hiyo acha viwango vya kipengee kuwa 0 pale vipengele vyake vinapobeba gharama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kazi-kwa-kikundi-cha-wafanyakazi\"\u003EKazi kwa kikundi cha wafanyakazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadala ya kiwango cha kazi kwa kila kitengo, kazi ya kipengee inaweza kutoka kwa kikundi: kinafanya kiasi gani kwa saa, watu wangapi, na kila mmoja analipwa kiasi gani. Chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKazi kwa kikundi cha wafanyakazi\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kihariri cha kipengee, weka tiki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPiga bei ya kazi kutoka kikundi cha wafanyakazi\u003C/span\u003E kisha ujaze:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESehemu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMfano\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUzalishaji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E20\u003C/code\u003E LF kwa saa (katika kitengo cha kipengee) kwa kikundi kizima\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubwa wa kikundi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E watu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMshahara $/saa kwa kila mtu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk inahesabu, kutoka kiasi pamoja na upotevu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Esaa-za-kikundi\u003C/strong\u003E = kiasi ÷ uzalishaji (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Esaa-za-wafanyakazi\u003C/strong\u003E = saa-za-kikundi × ukubwa wa kikundi (11),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Esiku-za-kikundi\u003C/strong\u003E = saa-za-kikundi ÷ 8 (0.69),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ekazi\u003C/strong\u003E = saa-za-wafanyakazi × mshahara ($495.00).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKihariri kinaonyesha matokeo na kiwango kinachotokana nayo ($4.50/LF). Kiwango cha kazi cha kipengee chenyewe basi kinakuwa cha kusoma tu, kwenye kihariri na kwenye jedwali. Kichwa cha jedwali la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E kinaongeza saa-za-wafanyakazi na siku-za-kikundi za kazi nzima. Mauzo ya nje yanaonyesha saa za kila kikundi, na kwenye kitabu cha kazi seli ya kazi ni fomula kwenye kikundi (\u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)\u003C/code\u003E). Ondoa tiki kwenye kisanduku ili kurudi kwenye kiwango kwa kila kitengo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vipengee-vya-metri\"\u003EVipengee vya metri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua m (mstari) au m² (eneo) kama kitengo. Viasi, vimo na thamani za fomula basi ziko kwenye mita. Kiwango cha karatasi kinaweza kuwa chochote kilichowekwa awali au kilichopimwa; vitengo na viwango havitegemeani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"inayofuata\"\u003EInayofuata\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EPima mikondo ya mstari\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003EPima maeneo yenye sehemu zilizokatwa\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\"\u003EHesabu kwa mkono\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Kipengee ni kitu kimoja unachopima na kukipangia bei: aina ya ukuta, umaliziaji wa sakafu, dari, mlango, kifaa cha taa. Kila alama unayochora ni ya kipengee. Programu nyingine huviita masharti. Kila kipengee kina aina (na kinaweza kuchukua aina nyingine za alama pia, tazama Kipengee kimoja, aina kadhaa za alama): Andika Unachochora Inaripoti Vitengo Mstari Mfululizo wa nukta zilizounganishwa Urefu, idadi ya mikondo, na eneo la ukuta likiwa na kimo LF au m Eneo Mistari funge yenye sehemu zilizokatwa Eneo, mzunguko, idadi ya maeneo SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha au m² Hesabu Bofya moja kwa kila kitu Ngapi EA Kiasi kilichoandikwa Hakuna: unaandika kiasi Nambari uliyoandika (au moja iliyoletwa kutoka CivilCraft) LS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha au m² Kiasi kilichoandikwa (bila mchoro) Baadhi ya vitu katika makadirio hayachorwi kamwe: uhamasishaji, vibali, akiba ya dharura, mkataba mdogo wa jumla, na ukataji na ujazaji ambao CivilCraft ilihesabu. Vifanye kuwa Kiasi kilichoandikwa: Chagua Kipengee kipya, andika jina, chagua Kiasi kilichoandikwa (hakuna mchoro) kisha uchague Ongeza. Katika kihariri cha kipengee, chagua Kitengo (LS kwa jumla ya kiasi) kisha uandike Kiasi: 1, 2.5 au 1,250. Weka upotevu na viwango kama kwa kipengee kingine chochote. Fomula za mkusanyiko hutumia Q, yaani kiasi, kwa mfano ceil(Q / 12) mizigo ya malori. Kiasi kilichoandikwa hakichukui alama kamwe, na hakifanyi makadirio kuwa hayajakamilika. Makadirio yanapokuwa na Eneo la zabuni, kihariri pia kina Eneo la zabuni: kiasi basi huhesabiwa katika eneo hilo, mbadala zake na jumla zake, kama vile alama ingekavyofanya hapo. Viasi vilivyoletwa kutoka programu nyingine vinaonyesha vilikotoka; tazama Uchimbaji na pointi za mwinuko. Tengeneza kipengee Katika paneli ya Vipengee upande wa kulia, chagua Kipengee kipya. Andika jina, kama Aina ya ukuta wa ndani A au Vigae vya zulia. Chagua aina: Mstari (urefu), Eneo au Hesabu. Chagua Ongeza (au bonyeza Enter). Kipengee kinaonekana kwenye orodha kikiwa na rangi yake, kinakuwa kipengee utakachochora nacho, na kihariri chake kinafunguka chini ya orodha. Upau wa hali unakuambia zana ya kuchagua inayofuata. Bonyeza Esc kwenye fomu ili kuifunga bila kuongeza kipengee. Ukichagua zana ya kupima kwanza, TakeoffDesk hutumia kipengee cha mwisho cha aina sahihi, au hufungua fomu ya Kipengee kipya ikiwa aina hiyo tayari imechaguliwa. Chagua kipengee utakachochora nacho Bofya kipengee kwenye orodha. Kinakuwa kipengee ambacho alama mpya huenda kwake, na alama zake huangaziwa kwenye kila karatasi huku vingine vikififia. Kama karatasi iliyofunguliwa haina alama zake, TakeoffDesk inaruka hadi karatasi yenye alama hizo. Bofya kipengee tena ili kusimamisha kuangazia; bado kinabaki kipengee utakachochora nacho. Kubofya alama kwa zana ya Chagua pia hufanya kipengee chake kuwa cha sasa. Sanidi kipengee Kihariri cha kipengee (Kipengee: (jina)) kina sehemu hizi. Kila moja huhifadhiwa unapotoka kwenye sehemu hiyo au unapobonyeza Enter, na kila mabadiliko yanaweza kutenduliwa. Sehemu Inachofanya Jina Inaonyeshwa kwenye orodha, majedwali na mauzo ya nje. Andika Mstari, Eneo au Hesabu. Imefungwa mara kipengee kikiwa na alama (\"Kipengee chenye alama kinabaki na aina yake\"). Rangi Rangi ya alama zake kwenye skrini na kwenye PDF iliyowekewa alama. Kitengo Kiasi kinaripotiwa kwa kitengo gani: LF au m kwa mstari; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha au m² kwa eneo; EA kwa hesabu. Pima pia Aina nyingine za alama ambazo kipengee kinazichukua, kila moja na kitengo chake. Tazama hapa chini. Kimo (mstari) Kimo cha ukuta. Kipengee basi pia huripoti eneo la ukuta (urefu × kimo). Mikondo iliyotoka kwenye modeli ya BimCraft hubeba milango na madirisha yake: hizo hutolewa mara moja, na kipengee kinasema eneo ghafi, nafasi zilizo wazi na eneo halisi. Makadirio kutoka mradi wa BimCraft uliochagua mbinu ya kupima hupimwa kwa mbinu hiyo hapa pia (dokezo linataja mbinu, chanzo chake, na kwamba mpima viasi hajaikagua); mbinu haiwezi kubadilishwa kwenye TakeoffDesk. Matofali au vizuizi na chokaa kutoka aina ya ukuta vinafika kama vipengele viwili: vitengo vya kuagiza na ujazo wa chokaa. Kina (eneo) Kina au unene, kinachotumika kwenye fomula za mkusanyiko (kwa mfano ujazo wa zege). Upotevu % Kinaongezwa kwenye kiasi kabla ya kupanga bei: 10 maana yake kiasi × 1.10. Nyenzo $/LF Gharama ya nyenzo kwa kila kitengo. Lebo inafuata kitengo: $/SF, $/EA na kadhalika. Kazi $/LF Gharama ya kazi kwa kila kitengo. Nambari ya CSI Nambari yake ya CSI MasterFormat, kama 09 21 16 (au mgawanyo tu, 09). Laha ya kazi ya By division ya kitabu cha kazi hupanga gharama kwa nambari hiyo. Vipengee kutoka vifurushi vya biashara tayari vina nambari hiyo. Kimo na kina hupokea futi na inchi (9'-0\", 8' 6\") au futi za desimali (9) kwa vitengo vya kifalme, na mita (2.7, 2700 mm) kwa vitengo vya metri. Viwango hupokea kiasi kama 12.50 au $1,250, hadi desimali nne. Tazama Uingizaji wa urefu, kiwango na asilimia. Chini ya sehemu, Imepimwa inaonyesha jumla ambazo fomula za kipengee zinaweza kutumia, pamoja na herufi zake: Urefu (L), Mikondo (N), Eneo la ukuta (A) kwa mstari; Eneo (A), Mzunguko (P), Maeneo (N) kwa eneo; Hesabu (N) kwa hesabu. Aina kadhaa za alama kwa kipengee kimoja Vitu vingine hupimwa kwa njia zaidi ya moja: chumba kina sakafu (eneo), msingi kando ya kuta zake (urefu) na milango (hesabu). Badala ya vipengee vitatu, tengeneza kimoja: Tengeneza kipengee chenye aina yake kuu, kama kipengee cha eneo Chumba 101. Chini ya Pima pia kwenye kihariri chake, weka tiki Mstari, Hesabu au zote mbili. Kila moja hupata kitengo karibu nayo. Chora kwa zana yoyote ambayo aina yake kipengee kinachukua: Chumba 101 kikiwa cha sasa, Eneo huchora sakafu yake, Mstari huchora msingi wake, na Hesabu huchora milango yake. TakeoffDesk haiulizi kipengee kingine. Orodha ya vipengee inaonyesha kila kiasi (50.00 SF + 2 EA). Kwenye jedwali la viasi, safu ya kipengee ina kiasi chake kikuu, na kila aina nyingine ina safu yake chini yake, kama Chumba 101 (hesabu), yenye upotevu wake na viwango vyake vya nyenzo na kazi. Mauzo ya nje, jedwali la kila karatasi, na maelezo ya alama ya PDF iliyowekewa alama yanayaorodhesha kwa njia hiyo hiyo. Sehemu za aina kuu zinabaki za aina kuu: kimo au kina, mwelekeo, kurudishwa nyuma na umbo la 3D yanatumika kwa alama zake tu. Mstari wa msingi uliochorwa kwa kipengee cha eneo hupimwa moja kwa moja kando ya mpango, na huonyeshwa bapa kwenye 3D. Fomula za mkusanyiko hutumia jumla za aina kuu. Aina inaweza kuondolewa tu wakati kipengee hakina alama zake; zifute, au kwanza zihamishe kwenye kipengee kingine chini ya Alama iliyochaguliwa. Alama zinaweza kuhamia kipengee chochote kinachochukua aina yao. Zaidi chini ni Mkusanyiko: vipengele kama vijiti au ubao, kila kimoja na fomula na viwango vyake. Tazama Mikusanyiko na fomula. Chini kabisa: Sogeza juu na Sogeza chini hubadilisha nafasi ya kipengee kwenye orodha na mauzo ya nje, na Futa kipengee huondoa kipengee pamoja na alama zake zote (baada ya kuuliza; unaweza kutengua). Vipengee vya eneo pia vina Mteremko (ndege za paa zinazopimwa kwenye mteremko: Paa na miteremko) na Kurudisha nyuma (alama zake hutolewa kwenye maeneo ya vipengee vingine: Pima maeneo). Vipengee vya mstari vina Mwelekeo (Level, Rake, Hip au valley) na, kwa rake na hip, Mteremko. Viwango kwenye jedwali Unaweza pia kuandika Upotevu %, viwango vya nyenzo na kazi moja kwa moja kwenye jedwali la Viasi chini (Kwa kipengee). Ni mpangilio uleule kama kwenye kihariri. Bei inavyofanya kazi Kwa kila kipengee na kila kipengele cha mkusanyiko: Pamoja na upotevu = kiasi × (1 + upotevu %). Nyenzo = pamoja na upotevu × nyenzo kwa kitengo, imezungushwa hadi senti. Kazi = pamoja na upotevu × kazi kwa kitengo, imezungushwa hadi senti. Jumla = nyenzo + kazi. Jumla ya kazi inaongeza kila kipengee na kila kipengele. Kipengee kinaweza kubeba viwango vyake na mkusanyiko kwa wakati mmoja; zote mbili zinahesabiwa, kwa hiyo acha viwango vya kipengee kuwa 0 pale vipengele vyake vinapobeba gharama. Kazi kwa kikundi cha wafanyakazi Badala ya kiwango cha kazi kwa kila kitengo, kazi ya kipengee inaweza kutoka kwa kikundi: kinafanya kiasi gani kwa saa, watu wangapi, na kila mmoja analipwa kiasi gani. Chini ya Kazi kwa kikundi cha wafanyakazi kwenye kihariri cha kipengee, weka tiki Piga bei ya kazi kutoka kikundi cha wafanyakazi kisha ujaze: Sehemu Mfano Uzalishaji 20 LF kwa saa (katika kitengo cha kipengee) kwa kikundi kizima Ukubwa wa kikundi 2 watu Mshahara $/saa kwa kila mtu 45 TakeoffDesk inahesabu, kutoka kiasi pamoja na upotevu: saa-za-kikundi = kiasi ÷ uzalishaji (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5), saa-za-wafanyakazi = saa-za-kikundi × ukubwa wa kikundi (11), siku-za-kikundi = saa-za-kikundi ÷ 8 (0.69), kazi = saa-za-wafanyakazi × mshahara ($495.00). Kihariri kinaonyesha matokeo na kiwango kinachotokana nayo ($4.50/LF). Kiwango cha kazi cha kipengee chenyewe basi kinakuwa cha kusoma tu, kwenye kihariri na kwenye jedwali. Kichwa cha jedwali la Viasi kinaongeza saa-za-wafanyakazi na siku-za-kikundi za kazi nzima. Mauzo ya nje yanaonyesha saa za kila kikundi, na kwenye kitabu cha kazi seli ya kazi ni fomula kwenye kikundi (ROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)). Ondoa tiki kwenye kisanduku ili kurudi kwenye kiwango kwa kila kitengo. Vipengee vya metri Chagua m (mstari) au m² (eneo) kama kitengo. Viasi, vimo na thamani za fomula basi ziko kwenye mita. Kiwango cha karatasi kinaweza kuwa chochote kilichowekwa awali au kilichopimwa; vitengo na viwango havitegemeani. Inayofuata Pima mikondo ya mstari Pima maeneo yenye sehemu zilizokatwa Hesabu kwa mkono","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"measure-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Pima kutoka kwenye mchoro","summary":"Chukua urefu na maeneo kutoka kwenye mistari, matao, polilaini na hatchi za mchoro wenyewe kwa kuzichagua, zikiwa na matao na mashimo sahihi, badala ya kufuatilia kwa mibofyo.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["pima mchoro","jiometria","polilaini","tao","duara","hatchi","bulge","urefu halisi","eneo halisi","chagua","dirisha","fuatilia","kutoka cad","mstari","eneo"],"headings":[{"id":"chukua-vitu-kama-kipengee-cha-mstari-au-eneo","text":"Chukua vitu kama kipengee cha mstari au eneo","level":2},{"id":"kinachochukuliwa-na-kila-aina-ya-kipengee","text":"Kinachochukuliwa na kila aina ya kipengee","level":2},{"id":"sahihi-na-karibu-sahihi","text":"Sahihi, na karibu sahihi","level":2},{"id":"inachukua-kutoka-wapi","text":"Inachukua kutoka wapi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPima mchoro\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa karatasi wa karatasi ya DWG au DXF huchukua vitu vya mchoro wenyewe kama alama, ili usivifuatilie kwa mibofyo. Urefu wa polilaini, urefu wa tao, eneo la duara na eneo la hatchi pamoja na mashimo yake vinatoka sahihi, kutoka kwenye hesabu ile ile ambayo ukadiriaji hutumia kwa kila alama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chukua-vitu-kama-kipengee-cha-mstari-au-eneo\"\u003EChukua vitu kama kipengee cha mstari au eneo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETengeneza au bofya kipengee cha \u003Cstrong\u003Emstari\u003C/strong\u003E au cha \u003Cstrong\u003Eeneo\u003C/strong\u003E chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E. Karatasi inahitaji skeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPima mchoro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya vitu kwenye karatasi ili uvichague, au buruta dirisha kuvizunguka: kila kitu kilicho ndani yake kabisa kinachaguliwa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huongeza dirisha kwenye kilichochaguliwa; bofya kitu kilichochaguliwa tena ili kukiondoa. Upau unaonyesha jumla: &quot;Mistari 6: 108&#039;-9 1/8 kwa jumla.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua kitufe cha kuongeza, ambacho kinataja idadi na kipengee, kama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza 6 kwenye Edge\u003C/span\u003E (au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Kila kitu kinakuwa alama moja ya kipengee, kwa hatua moja ya kutendua. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E husafisha kilichochaguliwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kinachochukuliwa-na-kila-aina-ya-kipengee\"\u003EKinachochukuliwa na kila aina ya kipengee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKipengee cha \u003Cstrong\u003Emstari\u003C/strong\u003E kinachukua mistari, matao, polilaini, duara na splines kwa urefu. Umbo lililofungwa linahesabiwa kwa mzingo wake. Hatchi haichukuliwi: ina eneo, si urefu, na upau unasema hivyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKipengee cha \u003Cstrong\u003Eeneo\u003C/strong\u003E kinachukua maumbo yaliyofungwa: polilaini zilizofungwa, duara, miili ya 2D, na hatchi pamoja na mashimo yake. Mistari wazi haichukuliwi, na upau unasema hivyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sahihi-na-karibu-sahihi\"\u003ESahihi, na karibu sahihi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMistari, matao (bulge yoyote), polilaini zenye bulge na duara ni sahihi: urefu na maeneo yanatumia radius na sweep ya tao, si picha yake. Elipsi, splines na hatchi ambazo mpaka wake umeundwa na kingo hupimwa kwa chords za digrii moja au ndogo zaidi. Hiyo iko ndani ya sehemu moja ya mia ya asilimia kwa elipsi, na sehemu moja ya kumi ya asilimia kwa nyingine. Upau unasema ni vitu vingapi ulivyochagua ni mikunjo ya aina hii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"inachukua-kutoka-wapi\"\u003EInachukua kutoka wapi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModeli\u003C/strong\u003E: vitu kwenye nafasi ya modeli. \u003Cstrong\u003EMpangilio\u003C/strong\u003E: mistari yake yenyewe, na vitu vya modeli ndani ya viewport, vikipimwa kupitia hiyo. Kitu kinachovuka ukingo wa viewport hakitolewi (kitachapishwa kimekatwa); kitu ambacho viewport mbili zote zinakionyesha kinachukuliwa mara moja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETabaka zinazoonyeshwa na karatasi pekee. Bloku zinahesabiwa, hazipimwi: angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EHesabu kutoka kwenye mchoro\u003C/a\u003E. Polilaini za 3D, meshes, solids na regions hazitolewi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Pima mchoro kwenye upau wa karatasi wa karatasi ya DWG au DXF huchukua vitu vya mchoro wenyewe kama alama, ili usivifuatilie kwa mibofyo. Urefu wa polilaini, urefu wa tao, eneo la duara na eneo la hatchi pamoja na mashimo yake vinatoka sahihi, kutoka kwenye hesabu ile ile ambayo ukadiriaji hutumia kwa kila alama. Chukua vitu kama kipengee cha mstari au eneo Tengeneza au bofya kipengee cha mstari au cha eneo chini ya Vipengee. Karatasi inahitaji skeli. Chagua Pima mchoro. Bofya vitu kwenye karatasi ili uvichague, au buruta dirisha kuvizunguka: kila kitu kilicho ndani yake kabisa kinachaguliwa. Shift huongeza dirisha kwenye kilichochaguliwa; bofya kitu kilichochaguliwa tena ili kukiondoa. Upau unaonyesha jumla: \"Mistari 6: 108'-9 1/8 kwa jumla.\" Chagua kitufe cha kuongeza, ambacho kinataja idadi na kipengee, kama Ongeza 6 kwenye Edge (au bonyeza Enter). Kila kitu kinakuwa alama moja ya kipengee, kwa hatua moja ya kutendua. Esc husafisha kilichochaguliwa. Kinachochukuliwa na kila aina ya kipengee Kipengee cha mstari kinachukua mistari, matao, polilaini, duara na splines kwa urefu. Umbo lililofungwa linahesabiwa kwa mzingo wake. Hatchi haichukuliwi: ina eneo, si urefu, na upau unasema hivyo. Kipengee cha eneo kinachukua maumbo yaliyofungwa: polilaini zilizofungwa, duara, miili ya 2D, na hatchi pamoja na mashimo yake. Mistari wazi haichukuliwi, na upau unasema hivyo. Sahihi, na karibu sahihi Mistari, matao (bulge yoyote), polilaini zenye bulge na duara ni sahihi: urefu na maeneo yanatumia radius na sweep ya tao, si picha yake. Elipsi, splines na hatchi ambazo mpaka wake umeundwa na kingo hupimwa kwa chords za digrii moja au ndogo zaidi. Hiyo iko ndani ya sehemu moja ya mia ya asilimia kwa elipsi, na sehemu moja ya kumi ya asilimia kwa nyingine. Upau unasema ni vitu vingapi ulivyochagua ni mikunjo ya aina hii. Inachukua kutoka wapi Modeli: vitu kwenye nafasi ya modeli. Mpangilio: mistari yake yenyewe, na vitu vya modeli ndani ya viewport, vikipimwa kupitia hiyo. Kitu kinachovuka ukingo wa viewport hakitolewi (kitachapishwa kimekatwa); kitu ambacho viewport mbili zote zinakionyesha kinachukuliwa mara moja. Tabaka zinazoonyeshwa na karatasi pekee. Bloku zinahesabiwa, hazipimwi: angalia Hesabu kutoka kwenye mchoro. Polilaini za 3D, meshes, solids na regions hazitolewi.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"snap-to-the-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Nasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro","summary":"Pointi huruka hadi kwenye mistari yenyewe ya PDF unapopima au kurekebisha: ncha, katikati, makutano au popote kwenye mstari, pamoja na alama inayoonyesha ni ipi.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["nasa","osnap","nasa kitu","ncha","katikati","makutano","karibu zaidi","vekta","mistari ya mchoro","mistari","sahihi","halisi","f3","sumaku","kona"],"headings":[{"id":"inachonasa","text":"Inachonasa","level":2},{"id":"mahali-inapofanya-kazi","text":"Mahali inapofanya kazi","level":2},{"id":"karatasi-ambazo-haziwezi-kunasiwa","text":"Karatasi ambazo haziwezi kunasiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESeti nyingi za michoro ni PDF za vekta: kuta na kingo zake ni mistari halisi, si pikseli. Unapopima, TakeoffDesk inanasa mibofyo yako kwenye mistari hiyo, hivyo njia huanza hasa kwenye kona ya ukuta, na urekebishaji husoma kipimo alichochora mchoraji, si pikseli uliyogusa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENasa imewashwa unapoanza. Iwashe au izime kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENasa\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa hali au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; mpangilio huhifadhiwa kwenye kivinjari hiki (pia uko chini ya \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"inachonasa\"\u003EInachonasa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKielekezi kikikaribia mstari ndani ya takriban pikseli 10 za skrini, alama inaonyesha mahali bofyo litakapotua, pamoja na jina lake:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAlama\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJina\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMahali\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMraba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENcha\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENcha ya mstari, au kona ambapo mistari hukutana. Ncha mbili za mkunjo zinahesabiwa; pointi zilizo kando yake hazihesabiwi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPembetatu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKatikati\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKatikati ya mstari ulionyooka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMsalaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMakutano\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMahali ambapo mistari miwili inavuka, au mmoja unapoishia kwenye mwingine.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKioo cha saa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKwenye mstari\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPointi iliyo karibu zaidi kwenye mstari, wakati hakuna ncha, katikati au makutano iliyo karibu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENcha, katikati au makutano iliyo karibu zaidi ndiyo inashinda. Ni pale tu ambapo hakuna iliyo karibu ndipo pointi huenda kwenye mstari wenyewe. Kuza ndani ili kuchagua kati ya pointi zilizo karibu sana: pikseli 10 ni pikseli za skrini, hivyo ukuzaji ukiwa juu hufunika sehemu ndogo zaidi ya mchoro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mahali-inapofanya-kazi\"\u003EMahali inapofanya kazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENasa inafanya kazi kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMstari\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuara\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShimo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERekebisha\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKagua\u003C/span\u003E, na unapovuta kona ya alama iliyochaguliwa. Pia huweka pointi za tao. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E na kubandika havinasiwi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPointi iliyonaswa inashinda nyongeza ya 45° ya \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: ili kuchora kwa 45° mbali na mistari, zima Nasa kwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwanza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERekebisha ukiwa na Nasa imewashwa. Bofya karibu na ncha mbili za mstari wa kipimo au ukuta unaoujua: pointi zote mbili zinatua hasa kwenye mchoro, na kipimo kinatoka sahihi (upau wa hali kisha unataja kipimo kilichowekwa kinacholingana).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"karatasi-ambazo-haziwezi-kunasiwa\"\u003EKaratasi ambazo haziwezi kunasiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaratasi zilizochanganuliwa\u003C/strong\u003E ni picha zisizo na mistari ya kunasa. Upau wa hali unasema &quot;Karatasi hii haina mistari ya kunasa (ukurasa uliochanganuliwa ni picha).&quot; na pointi huenda pale unapobofya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMichoro mikubwa sana\u003C/strong\u003E: nasa husoma hadi sehemu 400,000 za mistari kwa karatasi. Karatasi yenye zaidi ya hapo inasema hivyo na inanasa kwenye zile za kwanza tu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaandishi\u003C/strong\u003E hayanasiwi, isipokuwa PDF inachora herufi zake kama mistari (baadhi ya printa za michoro hufanya hivyo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMistari ya karatasi inasomwa mara ya kwanza unapoifungua, chinichini; karatasi kubwa inaweza kuchukua sekunde moja kabla alama hazijaonekana.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Seti nyingi za michoro ni PDF za vekta: kuta na kingo zake ni mistari halisi, si pikseli. Unapopima, TakeoffDesk inanasa mibofyo yako kwenye mistari hiyo, hivyo njia huanza hasa kwenye kona ya ukuta, na urekebishaji husoma kipimo alichochora mchoraji, si pikseli uliyogusa. Nasa imewashwa unapoanza. Iwashe au izime kwa Nasa kwenye upau wa hali au F3; mpangilio huhifadhiwa kwenye kivinjari hiki (pia uko chini ya Mipangilio). Inachonasa Kielekezi kikikaribia mstari ndani ya takriban pikseli 10 za skrini, alama inaonyesha mahali bofyo litakapotua, pamoja na jina lake: Alama Jina Mahali Mraba Ncha Ncha ya mstari, au kona ambapo mistari hukutana. Ncha mbili za mkunjo zinahesabiwa; pointi zilizo kando yake hazihesabiwi. Pembetatu Katikati Katikati ya mstari ulionyooka. Msalaba Makutano Mahali ambapo mistari miwili inavuka, au mmoja unapoishia kwenye mwingine. Kioo cha saa Kwenye mstari Pointi iliyo karibu zaidi kwenye mstari, wakati hakuna ncha, katikati au makutano iliyo karibu. Ncha, katikati au makutano iliyo karibu zaidi ndiyo inashinda. Ni pale tu ambapo hakuna iliyo karibu ndipo pointi huenda kwenye mstari wenyewe. Kuza ndani ili kuchagua kati ya pointi zilizo karibu sana: pikseli 10 ni pikseli za skrini, hivyo ukuzaji ukiwa juu hufunika sehemu ndogo zaidi ya mchoro. Mahali inapofanya kazi Nasa inafanya kazi kwenye Mstari, Eneo, Duara, Shimo, Rekebisha na Kagua, na unapovuta kona ya alama iliyochaguliwa. Pia huweka pointi za tao. Hesabu, Hesabu otomatiki na kubandika havinasiwi. Pointi iliyonaswa inashinda nyongeza ya 45° ya Shift: ili kuchora kwa 45° mbali na mistari, zima Nasa kwa F3 kwanza. Rekebisha ukiwa na Nasa imewashwa. Bofya karibu na ncha mbili za mstari wa kipimo au ukuta unaoujua: pointi zote mbili zinatua hasa kwenye mchoro, na kipimo kinatoka sahihi (upau wa hali kisha unataja kipimo kilichowekwa kinacholingana). Karatasi ambazo haziwezi kunasiwa Karatasi zilizochanganuliwa ni picha zisizo na mistari ya kunasa. Upau wa hali unasema \"Karatasi hii haina mistari ya kunasa (ukurasa uliochanganuliwa ni picha).\" na pointi huenda pale unapobofya. Michoro mikubwa sana: nasa husoma hadi sehemu 400,000 za mistari kwa karatasi. Karatasi yenye zaidi ya hapo inasema hivyo na inanasa kwenye zile za kwanza tu. Maandishi hayanasiwi, isipokuwa PDF inachora herufi zake kama mistari (baadhi ya printa za michoro hufanya hivyo). Mistari ya karatasi inasomwa mara ya kwanza unapoifungua, chinichini; karatasi kubwa inaweza kuchukua sekunde moja kabla alama hazijaonekana.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"pick-the-lines","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Chagua mistari ya PDF","summary":"Bofya mstari wa PDF ya vekta kupima njia yake yote iliyounganishwa, au bofya ndani ya mpaka uliofungwa kwa eneo lake, ukiwa umeonyesha uvumilivu wa pengo na tendua moja kwa kila sehemu.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["njia","chagua","mistari ya mchoro","mistari","iliyounganishwa","mbio nzima","fuatilia","mpaka","mzunguko","pengo","uvumilivu","daraja","sehemu","kichupo","vekta","eneo kutoka mistari","p"],"headings":[{"id":"chagua-njia-au-mpaka","text":"Chagua njia au mpaka","level":2},{"id":"uvumilivu-wa-pengo","text":"Uvumilivu wa pengo","level":2},{"id":"vitufe","text":"Vitufe","level":2},{"id":"mambo-ya-kujua","text":"Mambo ya kujua","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKwenye PDF ya vekta kuta na kingo ni mistari halisi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) huzichukua kama zilivyochorwa: bofya moja kwenye mstari hupima kila kitu kilichounganishwa nao, mwisho hadi mwisho, kwa hivyo huhitaji kufuatilia ukuta kwa kubofya pembe zake. Karatasi inahitaji skeli. Ukurasa uliochanganuliwa hauna mistari ya kuchagua; tumia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EMstari\u003C/a\u003E au \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003EEneo\u003C/a\u003E hapo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chagua-njia-au-mpaka\"\u003EChagua njia au mpaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath\u003C/span\u003E. Mstari chini ya kielekezi umeonyeshwa kwa mpaka, na njia nyingine ambazo inaweza kuwa nazo zimechorwa kwa nyembamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya mstari: njia yote iliyounganishwa inachaguliwa. Upau chini ya upau wa zana unatoa sehemu zake, urefu, uvumilivu wa pengo na idadi ya mapengo yaliyovukwa. Njia inayorudi kwenye mwanzo wake imefungwa na pia inaripoti mzunguko wake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAu bofya ndani ya mpaka uliofungwa, mbali na mstari wowote: mpaka unaouzunguka nukta hiyo unachaguliwa kama eneo. Ndogo kabisa huja kwanza; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hujaribu inayofuata kubwa zaidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (au bofya kulia, au bofya mara mbili) kuongeza alama. Njia iliyochaguliwa inakuwa alama ya kipengee cha \u003Cstrong\u003Emstari\u003C/strong\u003E, na mpaka unakuwa alama ya kipengee cha \u003Cstrong\u003Eeneo\u003C/strong\u003E: kipengee kinachotumika ikiwa kina aina hiyo, la sivyo kile cha aina hiyo kilichoundwa hivi karibuni. Bila kipengee chochote, fomu ya kipengee kipya inafunguka na hakuna kitakachoongezwa hadi ubonyeze \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tena. Kila kilichochaguliwa kinaongezwa kwa hatua moja ya kutendua.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uvumilivu-wa-pengo\"\u003EUvumilivu wa pengo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWachoraji huacha mashimo madogo mahali mistari inapaswa kukutana. Mistari miwili huungana ncha zao zinapokuwa karibu kuliko \u003Cstrong\u003Euvumilivu wa pengo\u003C/strong\u003E. Huanza kwa pointi 1.5 kwenye karatasi (inaonyeshwa kwa futi na inchi kwenye skeli ya karatasi), na pete ya mstari-nukta yenye upana huo hufuata kielekezi na kukaa kwenye kila ncha ya njia chini yake. Kila shimo lililovukwa linazungushwa kwa rangi ya chungwa kwenye njia iliyochaguliwa, na upau unazihesabu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hufanya uvumilivu kuwa mpana, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuwa mwembamba. Njia iliyochaguliwa huunganishwa tena mara moja kwenye uvumilivu mpya. Kwenye makutano, njia huendelea moja kwa moja, kwa namna inayopinda kidogo zaidi, na kuacha tawi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vitufe\"\u003EVitufe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe au kitendo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChagua njia iliyo chini ya kielekezi, au mpaka unaouzunguka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bofya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOngeza njia nyingine au mpaka kwa kilichochaguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJaribu njia inayofuata chini ya kielekezi, au mpaka mkubwa unaofuata.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOndoa sehemu ya mwisho kutoka njia ya mwisho iliyochaguliwa, sehemu moja kwa wakati. Njia isiyo na sehemu zilizobaki hutoweka. Bila kitu kilichochaguliwa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni kutendua kwa kawaida.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUvumilivu mwembamba na mpana wa pengo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOngeza alama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFuta kilichochaguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mambo-ya-kujua\"\u003EMambo ya kujua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMkunjo kwenye mchoro ni mnyororo wa vipande vifupi vilivyonyooka, kwa hivyo urefu wake ni kidogo chini ya arc halisi. Kwa arc sahihi, pima faili ya mchoro yenyewe (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003EPima kutoka mchoro\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPengo lililovukwa linahesabiwa kama kuruka kwa mstari-nyoofu juu yake, kwa hivyo mzunguko wa mpaka uliofungwa unajumuisha hilo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMistari ni viharusi na ujazo kwenye njia za ukurasa wenyewe pekee. Maandishi yaliyochorwa kama herufi, na picha, si mistari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Kwenye PDF ya vekta kuta na kingo ni mistari halisi. Path (P) huzichukua kama zilivyochorwa: bofya moja kwenye mstari hupima kila kitu kilichounganishwa nao, mwisho hadi mwisho, kwa hivyo huhitaji kufuatilia ukuta kwa kubofya pembe zake. Karatasi inahitaji skeli. Ukurasa uliochanganuliwa hauna mistari ya kuchagua; tumia Mstari au Eneo hapo. Chagua njia au mpaka Chagua Path. Mstari chini ya kielekezi umeonyeshwa kwa mpaka, na njia nyingine ambazo inaweza kuwa nazo zimechorwa kwa nyembamba. Bofya mstari: njia yote iliyounganishwa inachaguliwa. Upau chini ya upau wa zana unatoa sehemu zake, urefu, uvumilivu wa pengo na idadi ya mapengo yaliyovukwa. Njia inayorudi kwenye mwanzo wake imefungwa na pia inaripoti mzunguko wake. Au bofya ndani ya mpaka uliofungwa, mbali na mstari wowote: mpaka unaouzunguka nukta hiyo unachaguliwa kama eneo. Ndogo kabisa huja kwanza; Tab hujaribu inayofuata kubwa zaidi. Bonyeza Enter (au bofya kulia, au bofya mara mbili) kuongeza alama. Njia iliyochaguliwa inakuwa alama ya kipengee cha mstari, na mpaka unakuwa alama ya kipengee cha eneo: kipengee kinachotumika ikiwa kina aina hiyo, la sivyo kile cha aina hiyo kilichoundwa hivi karibuni. Bila kipengee chochote, fomu ya kipengee kipya inafunguka na hakuna kitakachoongezwa hadi ubonyeze Enter tena. Kila kilichochaguliwa kinaongezwa kwa hatua moja ya kutendua. Uvumilivu wa pengo Wachoraji huacha mashimo madogo mahali mistari inapaswa kukutana. Mistari miwili huungana ncha zao zinapokuwa karibu kuliko uvumilivu wa pengo. Huanza kwa pointi 1.5 kwenye karatasi (inaonyeshwa kwa futi na inchi kwenye skeli ya karatasi), na pete ya mstari-nukta yenye upana huo hufuata kielekezi na kukaa kwenye kila ncha ya njia chini yake. Kila shimo lililovukwa linazungushwa kwa rangi ya chungwa kwenye njia iliyochaguliwa, na upau unazihesabu. ] hufanya uvumilivu kuwa mpana, [ kuwa mwembamba. Njia iliyochaguliwa huunganishwa tena mara moja kwenye uvumilivu mpya. Kwenye makutano, njia huendelea moja kwa moja, kwa namna inayopinda kidogo zaidi, na kuacha tawi. Vitufe Kitufe au kitendo Kinachofanya Bofya Chagua njia iliyo chini ya kielekezi, au mpaka unaouzunguka. Shift + bofya Ongeza njia nyingine au mpaka kwa kilichochaguliwa. Tab Jaribu njia inayofuata chini ya kielekezi, au mpaka mkubwa unaofuata. Backspace au Ctrl+Z Ondoa sehemu ya mwisho kutoka njia ya mwisho iliyochaguliwa, sehemu moja kwa wakati. Njia isiyo na sehemu zilizobaki hutoweka. Bila kitu kilichochaguliwa, Ctrl+Z ni kutendua kwa kawaida. [ na ] Uvumilivu mwembamba na mpana wa pengo. Enter Ongeza alama. Esc Futa kilichochaguliwa. Mambo ya kujua Mkunjo kwenye mchoro ni mnyororo wa vipande vifupi vilivyonyooka, kwa hivyo urefu wake ni kidogo chini ya arc halisi. Kwa arc sahihi, pima faili ya mchoro yenyewe (Pima kutoka mchoro). Pengo lililovukwa linahesabiwa kama kuruka kwa mstari-nyoofu juu yake, kwa hivyo mzunguko wa mpaka uliofungwa unajumuisha hilo. Mistari ni viharusi na ujazo kwenye njia za ukurasa wenyewe pekee. Maandishi yaliyochorwa kama herufi, na picha, si mistari.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"measure-linear","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Pima mistari ya mfululizo","summary":"Chukua kuta, mabomba, trim na urefu mwingine kama mfululizo, ukiwa na sehemu za moja kwa moja, matao na nyongeza ya digrii 45 ya Shift.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["mstari","urefu","mfululizo","polilaini","kuta","lf","futi za mstari","tao","mkunjo","digrii 45","ortho","nasa","sehemu","polilength","punguza","fursa","mlango","pengo","andika","viwianishi","umbali","umbali wa moja kwa moja","polar"],"headings":[{"id":"chora-mfululizo","text":"Chora mfululizo","level":2},{"id":"mistari-ya-moja-kwa-moja-kwa-hatua-za-45","text":"Mistari ya moja kwa moja kwa hatua za 45°","level":2},{"id":"matao-na-kuta-zilizopinda","text":"Matao na kuta zilizopinda","level":2},{"id":"andika-urefu-na-viwianishi","text":"Andika urefu na viwianishi","level":2},{"id":"punguza-sehemu-ya-mfululizo","text":"Punguza sehemu ya mfululizo","level":2},{"id":"angalia-maelezo-ya-mfululizo","text":"Angalia maelezo ya mfululizo","level":2},{"id":"rekebisha-mfululizo","text":"Rekebisha mfululizo","level":2},{"id":"eneo-la-ukuta","text":"Eneo la ukuta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKipengee cha mstari hupima urefu. Kila mfululizo ni mnyororo wa nukta: sehemu za moja kwa moja, na matao pale unapowasha hali ya tao. Kipengee kinaweza kuwa na mfululizo wowote kwenye karatasi yoyote.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKabla ya kuanza: karatasi inahitaji skeli (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EWeka skeli\u003C/a\u003E) na unahitaji kipengee cha mstari (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EUnda vipengee vya ukadiriaji\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye PDF ya vekta, mibofyo yako inanasa kwenye mistari yenyewe ya mchoro: ncha, katikati na makutano (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003ENasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro\u003C/a\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inaizima).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chora-mfululizo\"\u003EChora mfululizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya kipengee cha mstari chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMstari\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya mwanzo wa mfululizo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya kila kona kwenye urefu wake. Upau wa hali unaonyesha &quot;Urefu&quot; (mfululizo hadi sasa, hadi kielekezi) na &quot;sehemu&quot; (sehemu unayoichora), kwa futi na inchi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMaliza mfululizo: bofya mara mbili nukta ya mwisho, bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, au bofya kulia. Mfululizo unachorwa kwa rangi ya kipengee na unakuwa alama iliyochaguliwa. Urefu wa kipengee kwenye orodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E na jedwali la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E unapanda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZana inabaki kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMstari\u003C/span\u003E, kwa hiyo unaweza kuanza mfululizo unaofuata mara moja. Bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kurudi kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWakati wa kuchora:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) huondoa nukta ya mwisho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hutupa mfululizo ambao haujakamilika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuburuta husogeza karatasi na gurudumu hukuza, bila kuongeza nukta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye pedi ya kugusa ya Mac, bofya kulia ni bofya kwa vidole viwili (washa secondary click katika Mipangilio ya Mfumo, chini ya Trackpad). TakeoffDesk husoma kitufe cha pili pekee, kwa hiyo Control-bofya inaweza kuchukuliwa kama bofya la kawaida na kuongeza nukta. Bofya mara mbili au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E daima humaliza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye skrini ya mguso, gusa ili kuweka nukta, buruta kwa kidole kimoja kusogeza, na bana kwa vidole viwili kukuza. Maliza kwa kubonyeza kwa muda mrefu, kugusa mara mbili, au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaliza\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau chini ya karatasi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENyuma\u003C/span\u003E inarudisha nukta ya mwisho). Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/troubleshooting#touch-screens\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"touch-screens\"\u003EUtatuzi wa matatizo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mistari-ya-moja-kwa-moja-kwa-hatua-za-45\"\u003EMistari ya moja kwa moja kwa hatua za 45°\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wakati unaweka nukta. Sehemu kutoka nukta ya mwisho inanasa kwenye mwelekeo wa karibu zaidi wa 0°, 45°, 90° au 135°, ukihifadhi urefu uliouburuta kwenye mwelekeo huo. Upau wa hali unakukumbusha: &quot;Shift inanasa hadi 45°&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKatika hali ya tao, inatumika mahali tao linapoishia: chord ya tao inaenda kwa hatua za 45° kutoka mahali linapoanzia. Nukta unayobofya kwenye mkunjo hainasi kamwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"matao-na-kuta-zilizopinda\"\u003EMatao na kuta zilizopinda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWakati unachora mfululizo, weka nukta mahali mkunjo unapoanzia.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWasha hali ya tao: chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETao\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Kitufe kinabaki kimebonyezwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya nukta yoyote kwenye mkunjo, mahali fulani katikati yake. Upau wa hali unaongeza &quot;(tao: bofya mahali linapoishia)&quot; na onyesho la kukagua linainama kupitia nukta yako.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya mahali mkunjo unapoishia. Tao linaongezwa. Urefu wake ni urefu halisi wa tao, si mfuatano wa chords fupi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya nukta nyingine kwenye mkunjo unaofuata, pamoja na mwisho wake, ili uendelee kuchora matao. Au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tena kurudi kwenye sehemu za moja kwa moja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwanza hutupa nukta inayosubiri kwenye mkunjo; bonyeza tena kuondoa nukta kama kawaida.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"andika-urefu-na-viwianishi\"\u003EAndika urefu na viwianishi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaada ya nukta ya kwanza, unaweza kuandika mahali nukta inayofuata inapoenda badala ya kubofya. Andika tarakimu, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E: kisanduku cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAndika\u003C/span\u003E kinafunguka kwenye upau wa hali kikiwa na ulichoandika. Bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuweka nukta; kisanduku kinabaki wazi kwa inayofuata.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAndika\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENukta inayofuata inaenda\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; kutoka nukta ya mwisho, kuelekea kielekezi (elekeza njia, kisha andika urefu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;&lt;45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; kwa 45°, kwa kupinga saa kuanzia upande wa kulia wa skrini (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;90\u003C/code\u003E ni juu, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;-90\u003C/code\u003E ni chini)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E@6&#039;,-4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6&#039; kulia na 4&#039; chini kutoka nukta ya mwisho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E (au \u003Ccode\u003E#6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6&#039; kulia na 4&#039; juu kutoka nukta ya kwanza ya mfululizo huu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUrefu unaandikwa kama kila mahali kwenye TakeoffDesk (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EMuundo wa kuingiza\u003C/a\u003E): \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E (futi), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E. &quot;Kulia&quot; na &quot;juu&quot; ni kama unavyoona karatasi, hata PDF ikigeuzwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwenye kisanduku tupu humaliza mfululizo, kama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwenye karatasi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hufunga kisanduku na kuweka mfululizo ukiendelea. Nukta zilizoandikwa hufuata sheria zile zile za mibofyo: punguzo, matao na kufunga eneo vyote vinafanya kazi. Kisanduku kile kile kinafanya kazi kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShimo\u003C/span\u003E; baada ya katikati ya duara, kinachukua radius.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"punguza-sehemu-ya-mfululizo\"\u003EPunguza sehemu ya mfululizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuta wa mfululizo unaopita mlango au mbele ya duka unaweza kuchorwa moja kwa moja na bado kuhesabu ukuta pekee: sehemu zinazovuka fursa ni \u003Cstrong\u003Epunguzo\u003C/strong\u003E. Zinachorwa kwa mistari yenye vitone na nyembamba, na hazihesabiwi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWakati wa kuchora:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWeka nukta mahali fursa inapoanzia.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPunguza\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Kitufe kinabaki kimebonyezwa na upau wa hali unasema sehemu zinazofuata ni punguzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya mahali fursa inapoishia. Sehemu inachorwa kwa mistari yenye vitone; &quot;Urefu&quot; kwenye upau wa hali unaiacha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tena na uendelee kando ya ukuta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaada ya kuchora: chagua mfululizo. Chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E, kila sehemu ina kisanduku cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPunguza\u003C/span\u003E: weka tiki ili kupunguza sehemu hiyo, ondoa tiki ili ihesabiwe tena. Kila mabadiliko ni hatua moja ya kutendua.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMfululizo daima unabaki na angalau sehemu moja inayohesabiwa. Jopo kisha linaonyesha \u003Cstrong\u003EPunguzo\u003C/strong\u003E (urefu uliopunguzwa) na \u003Cstrong\u003EImechorwa\u003C/strong\u003E (mfululizo mzima). \u003Cstrong\u003EUrefu\u003C/strong\u003E, kiasi cha kipengee, eneo la ukuta na gharama vyote vinatumia urefu bila punguzo. Mwonekano wa 3D wa ukaguzi unaacha pengo kwenye ukuta, PDF yenye alama inachora punguzo kwa mistari yenye vitone, na karatasi ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama\u003C/strong\u003E iliyohamishwa inazorodhesha punguzo hizo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKusogeza kona kunabaki na punguzo. Kuongeza au kuondoa nukta (kwa kuchora mfululizo upya) kunaanza bila hizo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"angalia-maelezo-ya-mfululizo\"\u003EAngalia maelezo ya mfululizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) kisha bofya mfululizo. \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E upande wa kulia inaonyesha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekipengee unachomilikiwa (chagua kipengee kingine cha mstari kwenye orodha ili kuuhamisha huko),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekaratasi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUrefu\u003C/strong\u003E kwa futi na inchi na kwa LF,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eidadi ya \u003Cstrong\u003ESehemu\u003C/strong\u003E, na \u003Cstrong\u003EEneo la ukuta\u003C/strong\u003E wakati kipengee kina urefu,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eurefu wa kila sehemu, ukiwa na &quot;(tao)&quot; baada ya matao, na kisanduku chake cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPunguza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye karatasi, kila sehemu ya mfululizo uliochaguliwa ina lebo ya urefu wake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rekebisha-mfululizo\"\u003ERekebisha mfululizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESogeza nukta\u003C/strong\u003E: chagua mfululizo, kisha buruta mojawapo ya vishikio vyake vya kona vya mraba. Shikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kunasa sehemu iliyosogezwa kwenye hatua za 45°. Tao linabaki na mkunjo wake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPinda tao\u003C/strong\u003E: mfululizo uliochaguliwa unaonyesha kishikio cha duara katikati ya kila tao. Kiburute: tao linapita mahali ulipoachia, hivyo linainama zaidi, kidogo, au upande mwingine. Ukiliburuta kwenye mstari ulionyooka kati ya ncha zake, linakuwa sehemu ya moja kwa moja. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inalitendua (&quot;Pinda tao&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuta mfululizo\u003C/strong\u003E: uchague kisha bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuta\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana chini ya menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZaidi\u003C/span\u003E, au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuta alama\u003C/span\u003E kwenye jopo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETendua\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; rudia kwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBado huwezi kuingiza nukta katikati ya mfululizo. Futa mfululizo na uuchore upya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eneo-la-ukuta\"\u003EEneo la ukuta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPa kipengee cha mstari \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimo\u003C/span\u003E (kwa mfano \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E). Kipengee hicho kisha kinaripoti \u003Cstrong\u003EEneo la ukuta (A)\u003C/strong\u003E = urefu × kimo, kwa SF (au m² kwa kipengee cha metriki). Eneo la ukuta linaingia kwenye safu ya dokezo ya usafirishaji wa lahajedwali. Tumia kwenye makusanyiko kwa ubao, rangi au insulation: angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EMakusanyiko na fomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kipengee cha mstari hupima urefu. Kila mfululizo ni mnyororo wa nukta: sehemu za moja kwa moja, na matao pale unapowasha hali ya tao. Kipengee kinaweza kuwa na mfululizo wowote kwenye karatasi yoyote. Kabla ya kuanza: karatasi inahitaji skeli (Weka skeli) na unahitaji kipengee cha mstari (Unda vipengee vya ukadiriaji). Kwenye PDF ya vekta, mibofyo yako inanasa kwenye mistari yenyewe ya mchoro: ncha, katikati na makutano (Nasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro; F3 inaizima). Chora mfululizo Bofya kipengee cha mstari chini ya Vipengee. Chagua Mstari kwenye upau wa zana, au bonyeza L. Bofya mwanzo wa mfululizo. Bofya kila kona kwenye urefu wake. Upau wa hali unaonyesha \"Urefu\" (mfululizo hadi sasa, hadi kielekezi) na \"sehemu\" (sehemu unayoichora), kwa futi na inchi. Maliza mfululizo: bofya mara mbili nukta ya mwisho, bonyeza Enter, au bofya kulia. Mfululizo unachorwa kwa rangi ya kipengee na unakuwa alama iliyochaguliwa. Urefu wa kipengee kwenye orodha ya Vipengee na jedwali la Viasi unapanda. Zana inabaki kwenye Mstari, kwa hiyo unaweza kuanza mfululizo unaofuata mara moja. Bonyeza Esc kurudi kwenye Chagua. Wakati wa kuchora: Backspace (au Delete) huondoa nukta ya mwisho. Esc hutupa mfululizo ambao haujakamilika. Kuburuta husogeza karatasi na gurudumu hukuza, bila kuongeza nukta. Kwenye pedi ya kugusa ya Mac, bofya kulia ni bofya kwa vidole viwili (washa secondary click katika Mipangilio ya Mfumo, chini ya Trackpad). TakeoffDesk husoma kitufe cha pili pekee, kwa hiyo Control-bofya inaweza kuchukuliwa kama bofya la kawaida na kuongeza nukta. Bofya mara mbili au Enter daima humaliza. Kwenye skrini ya mguso, gusa ili kuweka nukta, buruta kwa kidole kimoja kusogeza, na bana kwa vidole viwili kukuza. Maliza kwa kubonyeza kwa muda mrefu, kugusa mara mbili, au Maliza kwenye upau chini ya karatasi (Nyuma inarudisha nukta ya mwisho). Angalia Utatuzi wa matatizo. Mistari ya moja kwa moja kwa hatua za 45° Shikilia Shift wakati unaweka nukta. Sehemu kutoka nukta ya mwisho inanasa kwenye mwelekeo wa karibu zaidi wa 0°, 45°, 90° au 135°, ukihifadhi urefu uliouburuta kwenye mwelekeo huo. Upau wa hali unakukumbusha: \"Shift inanasa hadi 45°\". Katika hali ya tao, inatumika mahali tao linapoishia: chord ya tao inaenda kwa hatua za 45° kutoka mahali linapoanzia. Nukta unayobofya kwenye mkunjo hainasi kamwe. Matao na kuta zilizopinda Wakati unachora mfululizo, weka nukta mahali mkunjo unapoanzia. Washa hali ya tao: chagua Tao kwenye upau wa zana au bonyeza R. Kitufe kinabaki kimebonyezwa. Bofya nukta yoyote kwenye mkunjo, mahali fulani katikati yake. Upau wa hali unaongeza \"(tao: bofya mahali linapoishia)\" na onyesho la kukagua linainama kupitia nukta yako. Bofya mahali mkunjo unapoishia. Tao linaongezwa. Urefu wake ni urefu halisi wa tao, si mfuatano wa chords fupi. Bofya nukta nyingine kwenye mkunjo unaofuata, pamoja na mwisho wake, ili uendelee kuchora matao. Au bonyeza R tena kurudi kwenye sehemu za moja kwa moja. Backspace au Esc kwanza hutupa nukta inayosubiri kwenye mkunjo; bonyeza tena kuondoa nukta kama kawaida. Andika urefu na viwianishi Baada ya nukta ya kwanza, unaweza kuandika mahali nukta inayofuata inapoenda badala ya kubofya. Andika tarakimu, @ au #: kisanduku cha Andika kinafunguka kwenye upau wa hali kikiwa na ulichoandika. Bonyeza Enter kuweka nukta; kisanduku kinabaki wazi kwa inayofuata. Andika Nukta inayofuata inaenda 12'6\" 12'-6\" kutoka nukta ya mwisho, kuelekea kielekezi (elekeza njia, kisha andika urefu) 12'6\"\u003C45 12'-6\" kwa 45°, kwa kupinga saa kuanzia upande wa kulia wa skrini (\u003C90 ni juu, \u003C-90 ni chini) @6',-4' 6' kulia na 4' chini kutoka nukta ya mwisho 6',4' (au #6',4') 6' kulia na 4' juu kutoka nukta ya kwanza ya mfululizo huu Urefu unaandikwa kama kila mahali kwenye TakeoffDesk (Muundo wa kuingiza): 12'-6 1/2\", 12.5 (futi), 30\", 3.2 m. \"Kulia\" na \"juu\" ni kama unavyoona karatasi, hata PDF ikigeuzwa. Enter kwenye kisanduku tupu humaliza mfululizo, kama Enter kwenye karatasi; Esc hufunga kisanduku na kuweka mfululizo ukiendelea. Nukta zilizoandikwa hufuata sheria zile zile za mibofyo: punguzo, matao na kufunga eneo vyote vinafanya kazi. Kisanduku kile kile kinafanya kazi kwenye Eneo na Shimo; baada ya katikati ya duara, kinachukua radius. Punguza sehemu ya mfululizo Ukuta wa mfululizo unaopita mlango au mbele ya duka unaweza kuchorwa moja kwa moja na bado kuhesabu ukuta pekee: sehemu zinazovuka fursa ni punguzo. Zinachorwa kwa mistari yenye vitone na nyembamba, na hazihesabiwi. Wakati wa kuchora: Weka nukta mahali fursa inapoanzia. Chagua Punguza kwenye upau wa zana au bonyeza E. Kitufe kinabaki kimebonyezwa na upau wa hali unasema sehemu zinazofuata ni punguzo. Bofya mahali fursa inapoishia. Sehemu inachorwa kwa mistari yenye vitone; \"Urefu\" kwenye upau wa hali unaiacha. Bonyeza E tena na uendelee kando ya ukuta. Baada ya kuchora: chagua mfululizo. Chini ya Alama iliyochaguliwa, kila sehemu ina kisanduku cha Punguza: weka tiki ili kupunguza sehemu hiyo, ondoa tiki ili ihesabiwe tena. Kila mabadiliko ni hatua moja ya kutendua. Mfululizo daima unabaki na angalau sehemu moja inayohesabiwa. Jopo kisha linaonyesha Punguzo (urefu uliopunguzwa) na Imechorwa (mfululizo mzima). Urefu, kiasi cha kipengee, eneo la ukuta na gharama vyote vinatumia urefu bila punguzo. Mwonekano wa 3D wa ukaguzi unaacha pengo kwenye ukuta, PDF yenye alama inachora punguzo kwa mistari yenye vitone, na karatasi ya Alama iliyohamishwa inazorodhesha punguzo hizo. Kusogeza kona kunabaki na punguzo. Kuongeza au kuondoa nukta (kwa kuchora mfululizo upya) kunaanza bila hizo. Angalia maelezo ya mfululizo Chagua Chagua (V) kisha bofya mfululizo. Alama iliyochaguliwa upande wa kulia inaonyesha: kipengee unachomilikiwa (chagua kipengee kingine cha mstari kwenye orodha ili kuuhamisha huko), karatasi, Urefu kwa futi na inchi na kwa LF, idadi ya Sehemu, na Eneo la ukuta wakati kipengee kina urefu, urefu wa kila sehemu, ukiwa na \"(tao)\" baada ya matao, na kisanduku chake cha Punguza. Kwenye karatasi, kila sehemu ya mfululizo uliochaguliwa ina lebo ya urefu wake. Rekebisha mfululizo Sogeza nukta: chagua mfululizo, kisha buruta mojawapo ya vishikio vyake vya kona vya mraba. Shikilia Shift kunasa sehemu iliyosogezwa kwenye hatua za 45°. Tao linabaki na mkunjo wake. Pinda tao: mfululizo uliochaguliwa unaonyesha kishikio cha duara katikati ya kila tao. Kiburute: tao linapita mahali ulipoachia, hivyo linainama zaidi, kidogo, au upande mwingine. Ukiliburuta kwenye mstari ulionyooka kati ya ncha zake, linakuwa sehemu ya moja kwa moja. Ctrl+Z inalitendua (\"Pinda tao\"). Futa mfululizo: uchague kisha bonyeza Delete, chagua Futa kwenye upau wa zana chini ya menyu ya Zaidi, au Futa alama kwenye jopo. Tendua: Ctrl+Z; rudia kwa Ctrl+Y. Bado huwezi kuingiza nukta katikati ya mfululizo. Futa mfululizo na uuchore upya. Eneo la ukuta Pa kipengee cha mstari Kimo (kwa mfano 9'-0\"). Kipengee hicho kisha kinaripoti Eneo la ukuta (A) = urefu × kimo, kwa SF (au m² kwa kipengee cha metriki). Eneo la ukuta linaingia kwenye safu ya dokezo ya usafirishaji wa lahajedwali. Tumia kwenye makusanyiko kwa ubao, rangi au insulation: angalia Makusanyiko na fomula.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"show-lengths-in-meters","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Onyesha urefu kwa mita","summary":"Soma urefu kwa mita, sentimita au milimita badala ya futi-inchi, na uone maeneo kwa m2.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["mita","sentimita","milimita","metriki","onyesha urefu kama","fuata Global","vitengo","onyesho","m2","mita za mraba","eneo la ukuta","futi-inchi","halijoto","selsiasi"],"headings":[{"id":"utakachofanya","text":"Utakachofanya","level":2},{"id":"hatua","text":"Hatua","level":2},{"id":"maelezo","text":"Maelezo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"utakachofanya\"\u003EUtakachofanya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadilisha jinsi TakeoffDesk inavyoonyesha urefu, ili mradi wa metriki usomeke kwa mita, sentimita au milimita kwenye karatasi, kwenye upau wa hali na kwenye paneli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hatua\"\u003EHatua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E kwa gia kwenye upau wa programu au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kisha ubaki kwenye kichupo cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETafuta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnyesha urefu kama\u003C/span\u003E kisha chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuti-inchi\u003C/span\u003E, m, cm au mm. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuata Global\u003C/span\u003E hutumia kitengo cha urefu wa metriki kilichowekwa nyota katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimataifa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVitengo\u003C/span\u003E, na futi-inchi pale ambapo hakuna nyota.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAngalia karatasi: urefu kwenye upau wa hali, kwenye orodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E na kwenye paneli sasa unasomeka kwa kitengo ulichochagua. Urefu, kina, unene na ngazi nazo zinafanya hivyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIli kusoma halijoto za vipengee kwa nyuzi C au F, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnyesha halijoto kama\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kichupo hicho hicho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maelezo\"\u003EMaelezo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnyesho pekee ndilo linalobadilika. Viasi, gharama na usafirishaji vinahesabiwa kutoka kwa urefu halisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENambari tupu iliyoandikwa kwenye sehemu ya urefu inasomwa kwa kitengo kinachoonyeshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChaguo la 1/16, 1/8 na 1/4 ya inchi linaonekana kwa futi-inchi pekee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEneo lililopimwa kwa kipengee cha metriki linasema m2 kwenye mchoro, kwenye paneli ya alama na kwenye jedwali. Kipengee cha mstari chenye urefu pia kinaonyesha eneo lake la ukuta. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EVitengo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Utakachofanya Badilisha jinsi TakeoffDesk inavyoonyesha urefu, ili mradi wa metriki usomeke kwa mita, sentimita au milimita kwenye karatasi, kwenye upau wa hali na kwenye paneli. Hatua Fungua Mipangilio kwa gia kwenye upau wa programu au Ctrl+,, kisha ubaki kwenye kichupo cha TakeoffDesk. Tafuta Onyesha urefu kama kisha chagua Futi-inchi, m, cm au mm. Fuata Global hutumia kitengo cha urefu wa metriki kilichowekwa nyota katika Mipangilio › Kimataifa › Vitengo, na futi-inchi pale ambapo hakuna nyota. Angalia karatasi: urefu kwenye upau wa hali, kwenye orodha ya Vipengee na kwenye paneli sasa unasomeka kwa kitengo ulichochagua. Urefu, kina, unene na ngazi nazo zinafanya hivyo. Ili kusoma halijoto za vipengee kwa nyuzi C au F, chagua Onyesha halijoto kama kwenye kichupo hicho hicho. Maelezo Onyesho pekee ndilo linalobadilika. Viasi, gharama na usafirishaji vinahesabiwa kutoka kwa urefu halisi. Nambari tupu iliyoandikwa kwenye sehemu ya urefu inasomwa kwa kitengo kinachoonyeshwa. Chaguo la 1/16, 1/8 na 1/4 ya inchi linaonekana kwa futi-inchi pekee. Eneo lililopimwa kwa kipengee cha metriki linasema m2 kwenye mchoro, kwenye paneli ya alama na kwenye jedwali. Kipengee cha mstari chenye urefu pia kinaonyesha eneo lake la ukuta. Angalia Vitengo.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"draw-arcs-ten-methods","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Chora matao kwa mbinu kumi","summary":"Chagua jinsi tao linavyochorwa: nukta tatu, au mwanzo, katikati, mwisho, pembe, urefu, mwelekeo au radius.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["tao","matao","mkunjo","ukuta uliopinda","nukta 3","radius","pembe","urefu wa chord","mwelekeo","katikati","mwanzo","mwisho","mbinu ya tao"],"headings":[{"id":"utakachofanya","text":"Utakachofanya","level":2},{"id":"hatua","text":"Hatua","level":2},{"id":"vidokezo","text":"Vidokezo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"utakachofanya\"\u003EUtakachofanya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChora ukingo uliopinda kwenye mstari, eneo au shimo, ukitumia mbinu ya tao inayolingana na vipimo ulivyonavyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hatua\"\u003EHatua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnza mstari, mpaka au shimo, kisha weka nukta ambapo mkunjo unaanzia.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWasha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETao\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMbinu ya tao\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa karatasi. Inaonekana tu wakati Tao imewashwa. Chagua Nukta 3, Mwanzo, Katikati, Mwisho, Mwanzo, Katikati, Pembe, Mwanzo, Katikati, Urefu, Mwanzo, Mwisho, Pembe, Mwanzo, Mwisho, Mwelekeo, Mwanzo, Mwisho, Radius, Katikati, Mwanzo, Mwisho, Katikati, Mwanzo, Pembe, au Katikati, Mwanzo, Urefu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuata upau wa hali. Unaonyesha kile tao kinachosubiri: katikati yake, nukta ya mwisho, pembe, urefu, mwelekeo au radius. Bofya nukta, au andika namba (pembe, urefu, radius na mwelekeo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngizo la mwisho likitolewa, tao linaongezwa kwenye mstari. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hughairi tao, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huchukua hatua yake ya mwisho nyuma, na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huzima Tao.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vidokezo\"\u003EVidokezo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETao linakataliwa, pamoja na ujumbe kwenye upau wa hali, pale nukta zake zinapofanana au kuwa kwenye mstari mmoja, au radius inaposhindwa kufikia nukta ya mwisho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUrefu wake ni urefu halisi wa tao, na faili za zamani zinafunguka vilevile. Zaidi: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003EPima mistari\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Utakachofanya Chora ukingo uliopinda kwenye mstari, eneo au shimo, ukitumia mbinu ya tao inayolingana na vipimo ulivyonavyo. Hatua Anza mstari, mpaka au shimo, kisha weka nukta ambapo mkunjo unaanzia. Washa Tao kwenye upau wa zana, au bonyeza R. Fungua Mbinu ya tao kwenye upau wa karatasi. Inaonekana tu wakati Tao imewashwa. Chagua Nukta 3, Mwanzo, Katikati, Mwisho, Mwanzo, Katikati, Pembe, Mwanzo, Katikati, Urefu, Mwanzo, Mwisho, Pembe, Mwanzo, Mwisho, Mwelekeo, Mwanzo, Mwisho, Radius, Katikati, Mwanzo, Mwisho, Katikati, Mwanzo, Pembe, au Katikati, Mwanzo, Urefu. Fuata upau wa hali. Unaonyesha kile tao kinachosubiri: katikati yake, nukta ya mwisho, pembe, urefu, mwelekeo au radius. Bofya nukta, au andika namba (pembe, urefu, radius na mwelekeo). Ingizo la mwisho likitolewa, tao linaongezwa kwenye mstari. Esc hughairi tao, Backspace huchukua hatua yake ya mwisho nyuma, na R huzima Tao. Vidokezo Tao linakataliwa, pamoja na ujumbe kwenye upau wa hali, pale nukta zake zinapofanana au kuwa kwenye mstari mmoja, au radius inaposhindwa kufikia nukta ya mwisho. Urefu wake ni urefu halisi wa tao, na faili za zamani zinafunguka vilevile. Zaidi: Pima mistari.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"sign-off-the-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Mistari bila kiwango na kuthibitisha makadirio","summary":"Ona mistari ya makadirio yenye kiasi lakini bila kiwango, thibitisha makadirio kwa jina lako ili faili irekodi nani, lini na jumla gani, na ubofye takwimu ili kuchagua alama ilikotoka.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["makadirio","thibitisha","uthibitisho","imethibitishwa","idhini","kuidhinisha","kiwango kinachokosekana","bila kiwango","bila bei","kiwango","jumla","mpima viasi","rekodi","ukaguzi","chagua alama","takwimu","kufuatilia"],"headings":[{"id":"utakachofanya","text":"Utakachofanya","level":2},{"id":"mistari-bila-kiwango","text":"Mistari bila kiwango","level":2},{"id":"thibitisha-makadirio","text":"Thibitisha makadirio","level":2},{"id":"bofya-takwimu-ili-kuona-ilikotoka","text":"Bofya takwimu ili kuona ilikotoka","level":2},{"id":"mambo-ya-kujua","text":"Mambo ya kujua","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"utakachofanya\"\u003EUtakachofanya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHakikisha kila mstari wa makadirio umewekewa bei, kisha weka jina lako juu yake. Faili ya ukadiriaji wa kiasi inarekodi nani alithibitisha, lini, na kwa jumla gani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mistari-bila-kiwango\"\u003EMistari bila kiwango\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKatika \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa kipengee\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E, mstari wenye kiasi lakini bila kiwango cha nyenzo au kazi unabeba \u003Cstrong\u003Ebila kiwango\u003C/strong\u003E, na upau juu ya jedwali unasema ni wangapi. Mstari kama huo hauongezi chochote kwenye jumla. Kipengee kisicho na kiwango chake hakiwekwi alama wakati mojawapo ya vijenzi vyake vina bei: mkusanyiko unapewa bei kupitia sehemu zake. Makadirio yaliyosafirishwa yanasema \u003Cstrong\u003EBila kiwango\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye safu ya Maelezo ya kila mstari kama huo, na yanahesabu idadi yake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thibitisha-makadirio\"\u003EThibitisha makadirio\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya \u003Cstrong\u003EThibitisha makadirio\u003C/strong\u003E juu ya jedwali la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKisanduku kinataja jumla unayothibitisha na kuorodhesha mistari bila kiwango. Andika jina lako na, ukipenda, nafasi yako.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya \u003Cstrong\u003EThibitisha\u003C/strong\u003E. Upau sasa unasema &quot;Imethibitishwa na … tarehe …&quot; pamoja na jumla. Hifadhi ukadiriaji ili ubaki kwenye faili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUthibitisho ni wa takwimu ulizothibitisha. Mabadiliko yoyote baadaye ya kiasi, kiwango au mstari yanaondoa uthibitisho, na TakeoffDesk inakujulisha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETendua\u003C/span\u003E inarudisha makadirio uliyothibitisha, pamoja na uthibitisho wake. Kubadilisha jina la mstari si mabadiliko ya takwimu. \u003Cstrong\u003EOndoa uthibitisho\u003C/strong\u003E unauondoa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaili ya ukadiriaji iliyohaririwa nje ya TakeoffDesk baada ya kuthibitishwa inafunguka bila uthibitisho, pamoja na noti inayosema hivyo. Makadirio yaliyosafirishwa (CSV na XLSX) yanataja uthibitisho chini ya jumla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMtu tu ndiye anayethibitisha. Msaidizi wa AI anaweza kusoma kama makadirio yamethibitishwa na ni viwango vipi vinavyokosekana; hana njia ya kuthibitisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bofya-takwimu-ili-kuona-ilikotoka\"\u003EBofya takwimu ili kuona ilikotoka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBofya kiasi au kiasi cha fedha cha mstari ili kuchagua alama ambazo kilipimwa kutoka. Zikiwa kwenye karatasi nyingine, karatasi hiyo inafunguka. Bofya takwimu ya mstari wa \u003Cstrong\u003EJumla ya kazi\u003C/strong\u003E ili kuchagua alama zote kwenye karatasi. Kiasi kilichoandikwa kwa mkono hakina alama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mambo-ya-kujua\"\u003EMambo ya kujua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUthibitisho unarekodi jina kama lilivyoandikwa. Ni rekodi kwenye faili, si sahihi ya kielektroniki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwa vifurushi vya zabuni vilivyotolewa kwa wakandarasi wadogo au njia mbadala katika ukadiriaji, jumla iliyothibitishwa ni zabuni ya msingi inayoonyeshwa kama \u003Cstrong\u003EJumla ya kazi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Utakachofanya Hakikisha kila mstari wa makadirio umewekewa bei, kisha weka jina lako juu yake. Faili ya ukadiriaji wa kiasi inarekodi nani alithibitisha, lini, na kwa jumla gani. Mistari bila kiwango Katika Viasi › Kwa kipengee, mstari wenye kiasi lakini bila kiwango cha nyenzo au kazi unabeba bila kiwango, na upau juu ya jedwali unasema ni wangapi. Mstari kama huo hauongezi chochote kwenye jumla. Kipengee kisicho na kiwango chake hakiwekwi alama wakati mojawapo ya vijenzi vyake vina bei: mkusanyiko unapewa bei kupitia sehemu zake. Makadirio yaliyosafirishwa yanasema Bila kiwango kwenye safu ya Maelezo ya kila mstari kama huo, na yanahesabu idadi yake. Thibitisha makadirio Bofya Thibitisha makadirio juu ya jedwali la Viasi. Kisanduku kinataja jumla unayothibitisha na kuorodhesha mistari bila kiwango. Andika jina lako na, ukipenda, nafasi yako. Bofya Thibitisha. Upau sasa unasema \"Imethibitishwa na … tarehe …\" pamoja na jumla. Hifadhi ukadiriaji ili ubaki kwenye faili. Uthibitisho ni wa takwimu ulizothibitisha. Mabadiliko yoyote baadaye ya kiasi, kiwango au mstari yanaondoa uthibitisho, na TakeoffDesk inakujulisha. Tendua inarudisha makadirio uliyothibitisha, pamoja na uthibitisho wake. Kubadilisha jina la mstari si mabadiliko ya takwimu. Ondoa uthibitisho unauondoa. Faili ya ukadiriaji iliyohaririwa nje ya TakeoffDesk baada ya kuthibitishwa inafunguka bila uthibitisho, pamoja na noti inayosema hivyo. Makadirio yaliyosafirishwa (CSV na XLSX) yanataja uthibitisho chini ya jumla. Mtu tu ndiye anayethibitisha. Msaidizi wa AI anaweza kusoma kama makadirio yamethibitishwa na ni viwango vipi vinavyokosekana; hana njia ya kuthibitisha. Bofya takwimu ili kuona ilikotoka Bofya kiasi au kiasi cha fedha cha mstari ili kuchagua alama ambazo kilipimwa kutoka. Zikiwa kwenye karatasi nyingine, karatasi hiyo inafunguka. Bofya takwimu ya mstari wa Jumla ya kazi ili kuchagua alama zote kwenye karatasi. Kiasi kilichoandikwa kwa mkono hakina alama. Mambo ya kujua Uthibitisho unarekodi jina kama lilivyoandikwa. Ni rekodi kwenye faili, si sahihi ya kielektroniki. Kwa vifurushi vya zabuni vilivyotolewa kwa wakandarasi wadogo au njia mbadala katika ukadiriaji, jumla iliyothibitishwa ni zabuni ya msingi inayoonyeshwa kama Jumla ya kazi.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"office-layout","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"The office layout: grouping, subtotals, title and headings from your Default Policies\"","summary":"Switch on the Default Policies add-on and the estimate, the quantities by sheet, the exports and what an assistant reads take your office's schedule layout, the same one BimCraft's schedules take.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["office standard","office layout","default policies","add-on","schedule layout","group by type","group by sheet","subtotal","totals","title","headings","capitals","estimate layout","export layout","settings"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-ll-do","text":"What you'll do","level":2},{"id":"steps","text":"Steps","level":2},{"id":"what-takes-the-layout","text":"What takes the layout","level":2},{"id":"what-keeps-its-own","text":"What keeps its own","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-ll-do\"\u003EWhat you&#039;ll do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHave TakeoffDesk lay its tables out the way your office issues them, without setting it up in each takeoff. The layout is set once, in Default Policies, and holds for every takeoff on this computer, and the other way round.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"steps\"\u003ESteps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings › Add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E and switch on \u003Cstrong\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/strong\u003E. It is off until you do; with it off, or with nothing set, TakeoffDesk is exactly as it was.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings › Global › Default Policies\u003C/strong\u003E and find \u003Cstrong\u003ESchedule layout (the office standard)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPolicy\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does in TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGroup schedules by\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E groups the estimate by item type (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). \u003Cstrong\u003ELevel\u003C/strong\u003E groups the quantities by sheet by their sheet. \u003Cstrong\u003ERoom\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003ENo grouping\u003C/strong\u003E leave both ungrouped\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETotals in schedules\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA subtotal under each group and a total\u003C/strong\u003E adds a subtotal under each group. The job total always stays\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESchedule title\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA line over the table, for example \u003Ccode\u003E{schedule}: office layout\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EColumn headings\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAs written, IN CAPITALS or With Capitals\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClose Settings. The tables follow at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-takes-the-layout\"\u003EWhat takes the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuantities › By item\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003EBy sheet\u003C/strong\u003E: group headings, a subtotal under each group, the title and the heading case. A line under the title says which parts your office standard set. The rows are the same rows: you still type rates and waste in them and click figures to select their marks. A component or a second condition stays under its item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe exported estimate\u003C/strong\u003E (CSV and XLSX): the same groups and subtotals. In the workbook a subtotal is a \u003Ccode\u003ESUBTOTAL\u003C/code\u003E formula over its group, and the job total is one too, so nothing is counted twice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat an assistant reads\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E (by sheet) add a \u003Ccode\u003Elayout\u003C/code\u003E block with the groups, the rows and the subtotals, and say which parts the office set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-keeps-its-own\"\u003EWhat keeps its own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuantities › By area\u003C/strong\u003E states its own grouping (by bid area) and keeps it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe \u003Cstrong\u003Ejob total\u003C/strong\u003E, the markups of the bid summary and the alternates are not regrouped.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA grouping the table has no column for is left out: the estimate has no level, the quantities by sheet have no type.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe policies are kept in this browser and travel in the Default Policies file (\u003Cstrong\u003ESave to a file\u003C/strong\u003E / \u003Cstrong\u003ELoad from a file\u003C/strong\u003E in the same place), so an office shares one file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAn estimate exported as CSV with groups in it is for reading. To bring an estimate back in as a price library, export it with no grouping set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft&#039;s side of the same standard: schedules, set-ups and exports. TakeoffDesk has no policies of its own yet, so there is no Default Policies section under Settings › TakeoffDesk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you'll do Have TakeoffDesk lay its tables out the way your office issues them, without setting it up in each takeoff. The layout is set once, in Default Policies, and holds for every takeoff on this computer, and the other way round. Steps Open Settings › Add-ons and switch on Default Policies. It is off until you do; with it off, or with nothing set, TakeoffDesk is exactly as it was. Open Settings › Global › Default Policies and find Schedule layout (the office standard): Policy What it does in TakeoffDesk Group schedules by Type groups the estimate by item type (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). Level groups the quantities by sheet by their sheet. Room and No grouping leave both ungrouped Totals in schedules A subtotal under each group and a total adds a subtotal under each group. The job total always stays Schedule title A line over the table, for example {schedule}: office layout Column headings As written, IN CAPITALS or With Capitals Close Settings. The tables follow at once. What takes the layout Quantities › By item and By sheet: group headings, a subtotal under each group, the title and the heading case. A line under the title says which parts your office standard set. The rows are the same rows: you still type rates and waste in them and click figures to select their marks. A component or a second condition stays under its item. The exported estimate (CSV and XLSX): the same groups and subtotals. In the workbook a subtotal is a SUBTOTAL formula over its group, and the job total is one too, so nothing is counted twice. What an assistant reads: takeoff_estimate and takeoff_quantities (by sheet) add a layout block with the groups, the rows and the subtotals, and say which parts the office set. What keeps its own Quantities › By area states its own grouping (by bid area) and keeps it. The job total, the markups of the bid summary and the alternates are not regrouped. A grouping the table has no column for is left out: the estimate has no level, the quantities by sheet have no type. Good to know The policies are kept in this browser and travel in the Default Policies file (Save to a file / Load from a file in the same place), so an office shares one file. An estimate exported as CSV with groups in it is for reading. To bring an estimate back in as a price library, export it with no grouping set. BimCraft's side of the same standard: schedules, set-ups and exports. TakeoffDesk has no policies of its own yet, so there is no Default Policies section under Settings › TakeoffDesk.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"measure-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Pima maeneo kwa mashimo","summary":"Chora mipaka ya sakafu, dari na bamba, kata mashimo ndani yake, ongeza kingo zilizopinda, duara na mashimo ya duara, kisha usome eneo na mzingo.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["kujaza chumba","kujaza kwa bofya","ndoo ya rangi","bofya ndani ya chumba","eneo otomatiki","back-out","backout","nguzo","shimo la wima","punguza kutoka vipengee kadhaa","eneo","poligoni","mpaka","futi za mraba","sf","shimo","punguza","duara","tao","mzingo","sakafu","dari","bamba"],"headings":[{"id":"chora-mpaka-wa-eneo","text":"Chora mpaka wa eneo","level":2},{"id":"kingo-zilizopinda","text":"Kingo zilizopinda","level":2},{"id":"duara","text":"Duara","level":2},{"id":"jaza-chumba-kwa-bofya-moja","text":"Jaza chumba kwa bofya moja","level":2},{"id":"kata-shimo-kwenye-eneo","text":"Kata shimo kwenye eneo","level":2},{"id":"back-outs-nguzo-mashimo-ya-wima-na-fursa-zilizotolewa-kutoka-vipengee-kadhaa","text":"Back-outs: nguzo, mashimo ya wima na fursa zilizotolewa kutoka vipengee kadhaa","level":2},{"id":"soma-eneo","text":"Soma eneo","level":2},{"id":"rekebisha-eneo","text":"Rekebisha eneo","level":2},{"id":"kina-kwa-ujazo","text":"Kina kwa ujazo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKipengee cha eneo hupima eneo lililofungwa. Kila mpaka unaweza kuwa na mashimo yaliyokatwa ndani yake (shimo la wima, nguzo, kipanzi), na kingo zake zinaweza kuwa za moja kwa moja au zilizopinda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKabla ya kuanza: karatasi inahitaji skeli (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EWeka skeli\u003C/a\u003E) na unahitaji kipengee cha eneo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EUnda vipengee vya ukadiriaji\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chora-mpaka-wa-eneo\"\u003EChora mpaka wa eneo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya kipengee cha eneo chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya kila kona ya chumba au bamba kwa zamu. Shikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwa kingo za 0°, 45° na 90°. Kuanzia nukta ya tatu, mpaka unajazwa, na upau wa hali unaonyesha &quot;Eneo&quot; na &quot;mzingo&quot;. Pete ndogo inaonekana kuzunguka nukta ya kwanza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunga mpaka: bofya nukta ya kwanza (ndani ya pete yake), bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bofya mara mbili, au bofya kulia. Eneo linajazwa kwa rangi nyepesi ya kipengee, lina lebo ya futi zake za mraba, na linakuwa alama iliyochaguliwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huondoa kona ya mwisho; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hutupa mpaka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMpaka unaojivuka wenyewe unakataliwa: &quot;Mpaka unajivuka wenyewe, kwa hiyo eneo lake lingekosea. Chora tena bila kujivuka.&quot; Chora umbo la namba nane kama maeneo mawili badala yake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kingo-zilizopinda\"\u003EKingo zilizopinda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWakati wa kuchora mpaka, washa hali ya tao (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETao\u003C/span\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Baada ya kona, bofya nukta moja kando ya mkunjo, kisha mahali mkunjo unapoishia. Kufunga mpaka kwa mkunjo, fanya bofya hilo la mwisho kwenye nukta ya kwanza. Eneo na mzingo vinatumia mkunjo halisi. Bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tena kwa kingo za moja kwa moja. Kubadilisha mkunjo baadaye, chagua eneo na uburute kishikio cha duara katikati ya tao. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003EPima mistari ya mfululizo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"duara\"\u003EDuara\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkiwa na kipengee cha eneo, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuara\u003C/span\u003E au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya katikati.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya nukta yoyote kwenye ukingo. Unaposogeza, upau wa hali unaonyesha radius na eneo. Duara linaongezwa kama alama ya eneo, lenye eneo halisi na mzingo halisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jaza-chumba-kwa-bofya-moja\"\u003EJaza chumba kwa bofya moja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChumba kikichorwa kama kuta zilizofungwa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChumba\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) hutoa sakafu kwa bofya moja:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua kipengee cha eneo (kwa mfano umaliziaji wa sakafu) na upe karatasi skeli yake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChumba\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kundi la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya ndani ya chumba, kwenye sakafu iliyo wazi (si kwenye mstari au lebo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk husoma mistari ya karatasi, hutafuta nafasi inayozunguka bofya, na kuiainisha kando ya nyuso za ndani za kuta, kama eneo la kipengee cha sasa. Milango yenye upana hadi \u003Cstrong\u003E4&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E huchukuliwa kama imefungwa, kwa hiyo mpaka unakwenda moja kwa moja kuvuka mlango. \u003Cstrong\u003EMipangilio › TakeoffDesk › Jaza chumba hufunga fursa hadi\u003C/strong\u003E hubadilisha upana huo (3&#039;-0&quot; hadi 8&#039;-0&quot;). Majina ya vyumba, samani na vifaa ndani ya chumba hayafanyi mashimo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInaikataa, ikisema kwa nini, wakati:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebofya iko kwenye mstari (&quot;Hiyo iko kwenye mstari&quot;);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enafasi haijafungwa: fursa ni pana kuliko mpangilio unaoruhusu, hivyo nafasi inatoka hadi ukingo wa karatasi. Ongeza mpangilio, au chora chumba hicho kwa mkono kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enafasi ni ndogo mno (ishara, si chumba).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMlango ukiwa mpana kuliko mpangilio, kujaza kunaingia chumba kinachofuata na kuainisha vyote pamoja: tendua (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ongeza mpangilio, kisha bofya tena. Kagua mpaka kama eneo lolote: buruta kona zake kuurekebisha. Karatasi iliyoskaniwa inafanya kazi vivyo hivyo, lakini mistari yake lazima iwe nyeusi vya kutosha; mistari ya kijivu nyepesi inaweza isisimamishe kujaza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kata-shimo-kwenye-eneo\"\u003EKata shimo kwenye eneo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) kisha bofya eneo. Linaonyesha vishikio vya mraba kwenye kona zake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShimo\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana (au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza tundu\u003C/span\u003E chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya kona za shimo, ndani ya eneo. Hali ya tao inafanya kazi hapa pia.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELifunge kama eneo: bofya nukta yake ya kwanza, bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bofya mara mbili au bofya kulia. Shimo linabaki bila kujazwa, na upau wa hali unasema &quot;Shimo limeongezwa. Chora jingine, au bonyeza Esc.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChora mashimo zaidi kwenye eneo hilo hilo, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwa shimo la duara, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza tundu la duara\u003C/span\u003E chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E, bofya katikati yake, kisha nukta kwenye ukingo wake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShimo lazima likae kikamilifu ndani ya eneo na lisigusane na shimo jingine. Vinginevyo TakeoffDesk inalikataa: &quot;Shimo lazima likae kikamilifu ndani ya eneo.&quot; au &quot;Mashimo hayawezi kugusana.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuondoa shimo la mwisho, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOndoa tundu la mwisho\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"back-outs-nguzo-mashimo-ya-wima-na-fursa-zilizotolewa-kutoka-vipengee-kadhaa\"\u003EBack-outs: nguzo, mashimo ya wima na fursa zilizotolewa kutoka vipengee kadhaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShimo moja linahusu alama moja ya eneo. \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-out\u003C/strong\u003E huchorwa mara moja na inatolewa kutoka kila eneo linaloingiliana nayo, kwa vipengee utakavyochagua: chora nguzo mara moja, nazo zinatolewa pamoja kutoka umaliziaji wa sakafu, dari na bamba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETengeneza kipengee cha eneo kwa ajili yake, kama &quot;Nguzo&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKatika mipangilio ya kipengee hicho, weka tiki kwenye \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-out: alama zake zinatoa eneo lao kutoka vipengee vingine\u003C/strong\u003E. Orodha ya vipengee vyako vingine vya eneo inaonekana, yote ikiwa na tiki: ondoa tiki kwenye zile ambazo back-out haipaswi kuzigusa (rangi ya kuta, kwa mfano).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChora nguzo kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuara\u003C/span\u003E, kama kawaida. Kila moja inachorwa kwa mistari yenye vitone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila alama ya eneo ya kipengee kilichowekwa tiki kwenye karatasi hiyo hiyo inapoteza sehemu ambayo back-out inafunika: back-out nzima ikiwa ndani, sehemu inayoingiliana tu ikivuka ukingo, na chochote kilicho ndani ya shimo hakipotei. Jopo la eneo lililochaguliwa linaonyesha \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-outs\u003C/strong\u003E na eneo lililobaki. Kiasi cha kipengee, fomula zake za kusanyiko, gharama, mwonekano wa 3D wa ukaguzi na hamisho zote zinatumia eneo lililobaki; maelezo ya makadirio yanasema back-outs zimetoa kiasi gani. Kipengee cha back-out chenyewe kinahesabu eneo lake (acha gharama zake sifuri usipoziwekea bei).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBack-out lazima iwe \u003Cstrong\u003Econvex\u003C/strong\u003E: mstatili, duara au mpaka wowote usio na kona inayoingia ndani. TakeoffDesk inakataa kuchora ile isiyokuwa hivyo; chora shimo la wima lenye umbo la L kama back-outs mbili. Back-outs haziwezi kuwa na mashimo, na back-outs mbili zinazoingiliana zote huhesabiwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMzingo (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) haubadiliki: back-outs hutoa eneo tu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soma-eneo\"\u003ESoma eneo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua eneo. \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E inaonyesha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMstari\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaana\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo halisi: mpaka ukitoa mashimo. Hili ndilo kipengee kinachohesabu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo la jumla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo lote ndani ya mpaka (linaonyeshwa pale kuna mashimo).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgapi mashimo, na jumla ya eneo lake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMzingo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUrefu wa ukingo wa mpaka, \u003Cstrong\u003Epamoja\u003C/strong\u003E na kingo za kila shimo (&quot;with cut-outs&quot;).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMzingo unajumuisha kingo za mashimo kwa makusudi, kwa mambo kama fomu za ukingo au msingi unaozunguka shimo pia. Ukihitaji ukingo wa nje pekee, weka mashimo nje ya kipengee hicho au pima ukingo wa nje kama mstari wa mfululizo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKitengo\u003C/span\u003E cha kipengee kinaamua jinsi jumla inavyoripotiwa: SF, SY au m². Jopo la \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E na upau wa hali huonyesha futi za mraba kila wakati.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rekebisha-eneo\"\u003ERekebisha eneo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESogeza kona\u003C/strong\u003E: chagua eneo kisha buruta kishikio cha kona (mashimo nayo yana vishikio). Umbo jipya likivuka lenyewe au kusukuma shimo nje, kona inarudishwa: &quot;Nukta imerudishwa.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHamisha kwa kipengee kingine\u003C/strong\u003E: chagua kipengee kingine cha eneo kwenye orodha ya \u003Cstrong\u003EKipengee\u003C/strong\u003E chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuta\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuta\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana, chini ya menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZaidi\u003C/span\u003E, au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuta alama\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kina-kwa-ujazo\"\u003EKina kwa ujazo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPa kipengee cha eneo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKina\u003C/span\u003E (kwa mfano \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E kwa bamba), kisha tumia \u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E kwenye sehemu ya kusanyiko ili kupata yadi za ujazo. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EMakusanyiko na fomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kipengee cha eneo hupima eneo lililofungwa. Kila mpaka unaweza kuwa na mashimo yaliyokatwa ndani yake (shimo la wima, nguzo, kipanzi), na kingo zake zinaweza kuwa za moja kwa moja au zilizopinda. Kabla ya kuanza: karatasi inahitaji skeli (Weka skeli) na unahitaji kipengee cha eneo (Unda vipengee vya ukadiriaji). Chora mpaka wa eneo Bofya kipengee cha eneo chini ya Vipengee. Chagua Eneo kwenye upau wa zana, au bonyeza A. Bofya kila kona ya chumba au bamba kwa zamu. Shikilia Shift kwa kingo za 0°, 45° na 90°. Kuanzia nukta ya tatu, mpaka unajazwa, na upau wa hali unaonyesha \"Eneo\" na \"mzingo\". Pete ndogo inaonekana kuzunguka nukta ya kwanza. Funga mpaka: bofya nukta ya kwanza (ndani ya pete yake), bonyeza Enter, bofya mara mbili, au bofya kulia. Eneo linajazwa kwa rangi nyepesi ya kipengee, lina lebo ya futi zake za mraba, na linakuwa alama iliyochaguliwa. Backspace huondoa kona ya mwisho; Esc hutupa mpaka. Mpaka unaojivuka wenyewe unakataliwa: \"Mpaka unajivuka wenyewe, kwa hiyo eneo lake lingekosea. Chora tena bila kujivuka.\" Chora umbo la namba nane kama maeneo mawili badala yake. Kingo zilizopinda Wakati wa kuchora mpaka, washa hali ya tao (Tao au R). Baada ya kona, bofya nukta moja kando ya mkunjo, kisha mahali mkunjo unapoishia. Kufunga mpaka kwa mkunjo, fanya bofya hilo la mwisho kwenye nukta ya kwanza. Eneo na mzingo vinatumia mkunjo halisi. Bonyeza R tena kwa kingo za moja kwa moja. Kubadilisha mkunjo baadaye, chagua eneo na uburute kishikio cha duara katikati ya tao. Angalia Pima mistari ya mfululizo. Duara Ukiwa na kipengee cha eneo, chagua Duara au bonyeza O. Bofya katikati. Bofya nukta yoyote kwenye ukingo. Unaposogeza, upau wa hali unaonyesha radius na eneo. Duara linaongezwa kama alama ya eneo, lenye eneo halisi na mzingo halisi. Jaza chumba kwa bofya moja Chumba kikichorwa kama kuta zilizofungwa, Chumba (B) hutoa sakafu kwa bofya moja: Chagua kipengee cha eneo (kwa mfano umaliziaji wa sakafu) na upe karatasi skeli yake. Chagua Chumba kwenye kundi la Ukadiriaji, au bonyeza B. Bofya ndani ya chumba, kwenye sakafu iliyo wazi (si kwenye mstari au lebo). TakeoffDesk husoma mistari ya karatasi, hutafuta nafasi inayozunguka bofya, na kuiainisha kando ya nyuso za ndani za kuta, kama eneo la kipengee cha sasa. Milango yenye upana hadi 4'-0\" huchukuliwa kama imefungwa, kwa hiyo mpaka unakwenda moja kwa moja kuvuka mlango. Mipangilio › TakeoffDesk › Jaza chumba hufunga fursa hadi hubadilisha upana huo (3'-0\" hadi 8'-0\"). Majina ya vyumba, samani na vifaa ndani ya chumba hayafanyi mashimo. Inaikataa, ikisema kwa nini, wakati: bofya iko kwenye mstari (\"Hiyo iko kwenye mstari\"); nafasi haijafungwa: fursa ni pana kuliko mpangilio unaoruhusu, hivyo nafasi inatoka hadi ukingo wa karatasi. Ongeza mpangilio, au chora chumba hicho kwa mkono kwa Eneo; nafasi ni ndogo mno (ishara, si chumba). Mlango ukiwa mpana kuliko mpangilio, kujaza kunaingia chumba kinachofuata na kuainisha vyote pamoja: tendua (Ctrl+Z), ongeza mpangilio, kisha bofya tena. Kagua mpaka kama eneo lolote: buruta kona zake kuurekebisha. Karatasi iliyoskaniwa inafanya kazi vivyo hivyo, lakini mistari yake lazima iwe nyeusi vya kutosha; mistari ya kijivu nyepesi inaweza isisimamishe kujaza. Kata shimo kwenye eneo Chagua Chagua (V) kisha bofya eneo. Linaonyesha vishikio vya mraba kwenye kona zake. Chagua Shimo kwenye upau wa zana (au bonyeza X), au Ongeza tundu chini ya Alama iliyochaguliwa. Bofya kona za shimo, ndani ya eneo. Hali ya tao inafanya kazi hapa pia. Lifunge kama eneo: bofya nukta yake ya kwanza, bonyeza Enter, bofya mara mbili au bofya kulia. Shimo linabaki bila kujazwa, na upau wa hali unasema \"Shimo limeongezwa. Chora jingine, au bonyeza Esc.\" Chora mashimo zaidi kwenye eneo hilo hilo, au bonyeza Esc. Kwa shimo la duara, chagua Ongeza tundu la duara chini ya Alama iliyochaguliwa, bofya katikati yake, kisha nukta kwenye ukingo wake. Shimo lazima likae kikamilifu ndani ya eneo na lisigusane na shimo jingine. Vinginevyo TakeoffDesk inalikataa: \"Shimo lazima likae kikamilifu ndani ya eneo.\" au \"Mashimo hayawezi kugusana.\" Kuondoa shimo la mwisho, chagua Ondoa tundu la mwisho. Back-outs: nguzo, mashimo ya wima na fursa zilizotolewa kutoka vipengee kadhaa Shimo moja linahusu alama moja ya eneo. Back-out huchorwa mara moja na inatolewa kutoka kila eneo linaloingiliana nayo, kwa vipengee utakavyochagua: chora nguzo mara moja, nazo zinatolewa pamoja kutoka umaliziaji wa sakafu, dari na bamba. Tengeneza kipengee cha eneo kwa ajili yake, kama \"Nguzo\". Katika mipangilio ya kipengee hicho, weka tiki kwenye Back-out: alama zake zinatoa eneo lao kutoka vipengee vingine. Orodha ya vipengee vyako vingine vya eneo inaonekana, yote ikiwa na tiki: ondoa tiki kwenye zile ambazo back-out haipaswi kuzigusa (rangi ya kuta, kwa mfano). Chora nguzo kwa Eneo au Duara, kama kawaida. Kila moja inachorwa kwa mistari yenye vitone. Kila alama ya eneo ya kipengee kilichowekwa tiki kwenye karatasi hiyo hiyo inapoteza sehemu ambayo back-out inafunika: back-out nzima ikiwa ndani, sehemu inayoingiliana tu ikivuka ukingo, na chochote kilicho ndani ya shimo hakipotei. Jopo la eneo lililochaguliwa linaonyesha Back-outs na eneo lililobaki. Kiasi cha kipengee, fomula zake za kusanyiko, gharama, mwonekano wa 3D wa ukaguzi na hamisho zote zinatumia eneo lililobaki; maelezo ya makadirio yanasema back-outs zimetoa kiasi gani. Kipengee cha back-out chenyewe kinahesabu eneo lake (acha gharama zake sifuri usipoziwekea bei). Back-out lazima iwe convex: mstatili, duara au mpaka wowote usio na kona inayoingia ndani. TakeoffDesk inakataa kuchora ile isiyokuwa hivyo; chora shimo la wima lenye umbo la L kama back-outs mbili. Back-outs haziwezi kuwa na mashimo, na back-outs mbili zinazoingiliana zote huhesabiwa. Mzingo (P) haubadiliki: back-outs hutoa eneo tu. Soma eneo Chagua eneo. Alama iliyochaguliwa inaonyesha: Mstari Maana Eneo Eneo halisi: mpaka ukitoa mashimo. Hili ndilo kipengee kinachohesabu. Eneo la jumla Eneo lote ndani ya mpaka (linaonyeshwa pale kuna mashimo). Mashimo Ngapi mashimo, na jumla ya eneo lake. Mzingo Urefu wa ukingo wa mpaka, pamoja na kingo za kila shimo (\"with cut-outs\"). Mzingo unajumuisha kingo za mashimo kwa makusudi, kwa mambo kama fomu za ukingo au msingi unaozunguka shimo pia. Ukihitaji ukingo wa nje pekee, weka mashimo nje ya kipengee hicho au pima ukingo wa nje kama mstari wa mfululizo. Kitengo cha kipengee kinaamua jinsi jumla inavyoripotiwa: SF, SY au m². Jopo la Alama iliyochaguliwa na upau wa hali huonyesha futi za mraba kila wakati. Rekebisha eneo Sogeza kona: chagua eneo kisha buruta kishikio cha kona (mashimo nayo yana vishikio). Umbo jipya likivuka lenyewe au kusukuma shimo nje, kona inarudishwa: \"Nukta imerudishwa.\" Hamisha kwa kipengee kingine: chagua kipengee kingine cha eneo kwenye orodha ya Kipengee chini ya Alama iliyochaguliwa. Futa: Delete, Futa kwenye upau wa zana, chini ya menyu ya Zaidi, au Futa alama. Kina kwa ujazo Pa kipengee cha eneo Kina (kwa mfano 0'-4\" kwa bamba), kisha tumia A * H / 27 kwenye sehemu ya kusanyiko ili kupata yadi za ujazo. Angalia Makusanyiko na fomula.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"roofs-and-slopes","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Paa na miteremko","summary":"Mpe eneo mteremko wake (pitch) ili kupima uso wa paa kutoka kwenye mpango, na kupima ubavu wa paa, kona na bonde kwa urefu wake wa mteremko.","section":"tasks","order":55,"keywords":["paa","pitch","mteremko","kipengele cha mteremko","kupanda","mlalo","6:12","ubavu wa paa","rake","kona ya paa","hip","bonde la paa","valley","gable","kuezeka","miraba","eneo la mteremko","urefu halisi","eneo la mpango"],"headings":[{"id":"kuandika-pitch","text":"Kuandika pitch","level":2},{"id":"maeneo-ya-paa","text":"Maeneo ya paa","level":2},{"id":"ubavu-kona-na-mabonde","text":"Ubavu, kona na mabonde","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMpango wa paa unaonyesha kila ndege ya paa ikiwa tambarare, kama inavyoonekana kutoka juu. Paa lenyewe ni kubwa zaidi: ndege yenye 6:12 ina uso wa takriban 12% zaidi ya mpango wake, na kingo zake za mteremko ni ndefu kuliko zinavyoonekana. Mpe kipengee chake pitch na TakeoffDesk itapima kando ya mteremko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuandika-pitch\"\u003EKuandika pitch\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPitch ni kupanda kwa kila 12 ya mlalo, kama inavyoonekana kwenye alama za pitch za mpango wa paa. Iandike kama \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E6\u003C/code\u003E tu; mlalo mwingine pia unafanya kazi (\u003Ccode\u003E4:10\u003C/code\u003E ni 4.8:12). Pembe inafanya kazi kwa alama ya digrii: \u003Ccode\u003E26.57°\u003C/code\u003E. Tupu au \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E ni tambarare.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maeneo-ya-paa\"\u003EMaeneo ya paa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETengeneza kipengee cha eneo kwa ajili ya kuezeka, au fungua kilichopo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKatika mipangilio yake, andika \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E, kama \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChora kila ndege ya paa kwenye mpango kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E, kama kawaida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila ndege inahesabu eneo lake la mpango mara kipengele cha mteremko: √(1 + (kupanda ÷ 12)²), yaani 1.118 kwa 6:12 na 1.414 kwa 12:12. Chagua ndege ili kuona \u003Cstrong\u003EEneo\u003C/strong\u003E lake (kwenye mteremko), \u003Cstrong\u003EEneo la mpango\u003C/strong\u003E na \u003Cstrong\u003EKipengele cha mteremko\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENdege zenye pitch nyingine: chagua ndege na uandike \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E yake katika paneli yake. Iache tupu ili kutumia ya kipengee. Mwonekano wa 3D, mikusanyiko (\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E ni eneo la mteremko), gharama na usafirishaji vyote hutumia eneo la mteremko. Makato kwenye ndege yenye pitch, kama madirisha ya paa, nayo hutolewa kwa mteremko huo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMzunguko wa kingo (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) unabaki mzunguko wa mpango. Pima kingo za chini ya paa, ubavu, kona na mabonde kama mistari (hapa chini).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubavu-kona-na-mabonde\"\u003EUbavu, kona na mabonde\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETengeneza kipengee cha mstari, kama &quot;Ubavu wa paa&quot; au &quot;Kona&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWeka \u003Cstrong\u003EMteremko\u003C/strong\u003E wake kuwa \u003Cstrong\u003EUbavu\u003C/strong\u003E (kingo ya mteremko, kama ya gable) au \u003Cstrong\u003EKona au bonde\u003C/strong\u003E (mstari ambapo ndege mbili zinakutana), kisha andika \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E ya ndege za paa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChora mistari kwenye mpango kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMstari\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbavu unahesabu urefu wake wa mpango mara kipengele cha mteremko. Kona au bonde linakimbia kwa 45° kwenye mpango kati ya ndege mbili za pitch sawa, kwa hiyo urefu wake halisi ni urefu wa mpango mara √(1 + (kupanda ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 1.061 kwa 6:12, 1.225 kwa 12:12.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMstari mmoja unaweza kuchanganya zote. Ichague: kila sehemu katika paneli yake ina orodha ya mteremko — \u003Cstrong\u003EYa kipengee\u003C/strong\u003E (mpangilio wa kipengee), \u003Cstrong\u003EUsawa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUbavu\u003C/strong\u003E au \u003Cstrong\u003EKona au bonde\u003C/strong\u003E — pamoja na urefu wake kando ya mteremko. Pitch ya mstari yenyewe katika paneli inachukua nafasi ya ya kipengee kwa sehemu zake zote. Paneli pia inaonyesha \u003Cstrong\u003EUrefu wa mpango\u003C/strong\u003E, na lebo kwenye karatasi zinaonyesha urefu kando ya mteremko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMakato bado yanafanya kazi: sehemu iliyokatwa haihesabu chochote, iwe ina mteremko au la.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKona na mabonde yanadhani ndege zote mbili zina pitch sawa. Kwa ndege za pitch tofauti, pima kona kwa urefu wake halisi mahali pengine, au chora kama ubavu wenye pitch sawa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Mpango wa paa unaonyesha kila ndege ya paa ikiwa tambarare, kama inavyoonekana kutoka juu. Paa lenyewe ni kubwa zaidi: ndege yenye 6:12 ina uso wa takriban 12% zaidi ya mpango wake, na kingo zake za mteremko ni ndefu kuliko zinavyoonekana. Mpe kipengee chake pitch na TakeoffDesk itapima kando ya mteremko. Kuandika pitch Pitch ni kupanda kwa kila 12 ya mlalo, kama inavyoonekana kwenye alama za pitch za mpango wa paa. Iandike kama 6:12, 6/12 au 6 tu; mlalo mwingine pia unafanya kazi (4:10 ni 4.8:12). Pembe inafanya kazi kwa alama ya digrii: 26.57°. Tupu au 0 ni tambarare. Maeneo ya paa Tengeneza kipengee cha eneo kwa ajili ya kuezeka, au fungua kilichopo. Katika mipangilio yake, andika Pitch, kama 6:12. Chora kila ndege ya paa kwenye mpango kwa Eneo, kama kawaida. Kila ndege inahesabu eneo lake la mpango mara kipengele cha mteremko: √(1 + (kupanda ÷ 12)²), yaani 1.118 kwa 6:12 na 1.414 kwa 12:12. Chagua ndege ili kuona Eneo lake (kwenye mteremko), Eneo la mpango na Kipengele cha mteremko. Ndege zenye pitch nyingine: chagua ndege na uandike Pitch yake katika paneli yake. Iache tupu ili kutumia ya kipengee. Mwonekano wa 3D, mikusanyiko (A ni eneo la mteremko), gharama na usafirishaji vyote hutumia eneo la mteremko. Makato kwenye ndege yenye pitch, kama madirisha ya paa, nayo hutolewa kwa mteremko huo. Mzunguko wa kingo (P) unabaki mzunguko wa mpango. Pima kingo za chini ya paa, ubavu, kona na mabonde kama mistari (hapa chini). Ubavu, kona na mabonde Tengeneza kipengee cha mstari, kama \"Ubavu wa paa\" au \"Kona\". Weka Mteremko wake kuwa Ubavu (kingo ya mteremko, kama ya gable) au Kona au bonde (mstari ambapo ndege mbili zinakutana), kisha andika Pitch ya ndege za paa. Chora mistari kwenye mpango kwa Mstari. Ubavu unahesabu urefu wake wa mpango mara kipengele cha mteremko. Kona au bonde linakimbia kwa 45° kwenye mpango kati ya ndege mbili za pitch sawa, kwa hiyo urefu wake halisi ni urefu wa mpango mara √(1 + (kupanda ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 1.061 kwa 6:12, 1.225 kwa 12:12. Mstari mmoja unaweza kuchanganya zote. Ichague: kila sehemu katika paneli yake ina orodha ya mteremko — Ya kipengee (mpangilio wa kipengee), Usawa, Ubavu au Kona au bonde — pamoja na urefu wake kando ya mteremko. Pitch ya mstari yenyewe katika paneli inachukua nafasi ya ya kipengee kwa sehemu zake zote. Paneli pia inaonyesha Urefu wa mpango, na lebo kwenye karatasi zinaonyesha urefu kando ya mteremko. Makato bado yanafanya kazi: sehemu iliyokatwa haihesabu chochote, iwe ina mteremko au la. Kona na mabonde yanadhani ndege zote mbili zina pitch sawa. Kwa ndege za pitch tofauti, pima kona kwa urefu wake halisi mahali pengine, au chora kama ubavu wenye pitch sawa.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"count-by-hand","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hesabu kwa mkono","summary":"Bofya kila mlango, kifaa au kifaa cha umeme ili kukihesabu, kagua hesabu zako, na urekebishe makosa.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["hesabu","kila","ea","vifaa","milango","vifaa vya umeme","alama","kuhesabu kwa kubofya","hesabu ya mkono"],"headings":[{"id":"hesabu","text":"Hesabu","level":2},{"id":"rekebisha-hesabu","text":"Rekebisha hesabu","level":2},{"id":"ukubwa-wa-nukta-kwenye-skrini-na-kwenye-pdf","text":"Ukubwa wa nukta, kwenye skrini na kwenye PDF","level":2},{"id":"alama-nyingi-zinazofanana","text":"Alama nyingi zinazofanana","level":2},{"id":"kutumia-hesabu-kwenye-fomula","text":"Kutumia hesabu kwenye fomula","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKipengee cha hesabu kinahesabu vitu: milango, taa, soketi, vifaa vya mabomba. Kila bofya kwenye karatasi huongeza alama moja ya hesabu. Kuhesabu hakuhitaji kipimo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hesabu\"\u003EHesabu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETengeneza au bofya kipengee cha hesabu chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E (aina ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya kila kitu kwenye karatasi. Kila bofya huweka nukta yenye rangi ya kipengee, na hesabu ya kipengee inaongezeka kwa moja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENenda karatasi inayofuata (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) uendelee kuhesabu. Zana inabaki kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukimaliza. TakeoffDesk inarudi kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuburuta bado kunasogeza karatasi, na gurudumu bado linakuza ukiwa unahesabu, kwa hiyo unaweza kuzunguka karatasi bila kuongeza nukta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBofya kipengee cha hesabu ili kuangazia nukta zake kwenye kila karatasi. Orodha ya karatasi kisha inaonyesha ni ngapi ziko kwenye kila karatasi, jambo linalosaidia kupata karatasi ambazo bado hujazihesabu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rekebisha-hesabu\"\u003ERekebisha hesabu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOndoa nukta\u003C/strong\u003E: chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), bofya nukta, kisha bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E. Au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mara tu baada ya bofya lisilo sahihi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESogeza nukta\u003C/strong\u003E: ichague, kisha iburute.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImehesabiwa chini ya kipengee kisicho sahihi\u003C/strong\u003E: chagua nukta kisha chagua kipengee sahihi cha hesabu kwenye orodha ya \u003Cstrong\u003EKipengee\u003C/strong\u003E chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubwa-wa-nukta-kwenye-skrini-na-kwenye-pdf\"\u003EUkubwa wa nukta, kwenye skrini na kwenye PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENukta zinabaki na ukubwa mmoja kwenye skrini, bila kujali unavyokuza. Ili kuubadilisha, fungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, kichupo cha TakeoffDesk, kisha chagua \u003Cstrong\u003ECount marker size\u003C/strong\u003E: Extra small, Small, Medium (chaguo-msingi) au Large.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHamisho la PDF (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › PDF yenye alama) linachora kila nukta kwa ukubwa uleule kwenye karatasi, bila kujali ukubwa wa karatasi: kitazamaji kinachoonyesha PDF kwa 100% kinaonyesha nukta kubwa kama zilivyo kwenye skrini. Ikiwa nukta kwenye karatasi bado zingegusana, hamisho linapunguza nukta za karatasi hiyo ili kila moja isomeke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"alama-nyingi-zinazofanana\"\u003EAlama nyingi zinazofanana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwa alama inayojirudia mara nyingi kwenye karatasi, jaribu \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/a\u003E: funga bokisi moja, kagua kile kinachopatikana, kisha uongeze zote kwa hatua moja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kutumia-hesabu-kwenye-fomula\"\u003EKutumia hesabu kwenye fomula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiasi cha kipengee cha hesabu ni \u003Cstrong\u003EN\u003C/strong\u003E. Vipengele vya mkusanyiko vinaweza kuitumia, kwa mfano bawaba \u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E kwa milango. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EMikusanyiko na fomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kipengee cha hesabu kinahesabu vitu: milango, taa, soketi, vifaa vya mabomba. Kila bofya kwenye karatasi huongeza alama moja ya hesabu. Kuhesabu hakuhitaji kipimo. Hesabu Tengeneza au bofya kipengee cha hesabu chini ya Items (aina ya Count). Chagua Count kwenye upau wa zana, au bonyeza C. Bofya kila kitu kwenye karatasi. Kila bofya huweka nukta yenye rangi ya kipengee, na hesabu ya kipengee inaongezeka kwa moja. Nenda karatasi inayofuata (Page Down) uendelee kuhesabu. Zana inabaki kwenye Count. Bonyeza Esc ukimaliza. TakeoffDesk inarudi kwenye Select. Kuburuta bado kunasogeza karatasi, na gurudumu bado linakuza ukiwa unahesabu, kwa hiyo unaweza kuzunguka karatasi bila kuongeza nukta. Bofya kipengee cha hesabu ili kuangazia nukta zake kwenye kila karatasi. Orodha ya karatasi kisha inaonyesha ni ngapi ziko kwenye kila karatasi, jambo linalosaidia kupata karatasi ambazo bado hujazihesabu. Rekebisha hesabu Ondoa nukta: chagua Select (V), bofya nukta, kisha bonyeza Delete au chagua Delete mark. Au bonyeza Ctrl+Z mara tu baada ya bofya lisilo sahihi. Sogeza nukta: ichague, kisha iburute. Imehesabiwa chini ya kipengee kisicho sahihi: chagua nukta kisha chagua kipengee sahihi cha hesabu kwenye orodha ya Kipengee chini ya Alama iliyochaguliwa. Ukubwa wa nukta, kwenye skrini na kwenye PDF Nukta zinabaki na ukubwa mmoja kwenye skrini, bila kujali unavyokuza. Ili kuubadilisha, fungua Settings, kichupo cha TakeoffDesk, kisha chagua Count marker size: Extra small, Small, Medium (chaguo-msingi) au Large. Hamisho la PDF (Export › PDF yenye alama) linachora kila nukta kwa ukubwa uleule kwenye karatasi, bila kujali ukubwa wa karatasi: kitazamaji kinachoonyesha PDF kwa 100% kinaonyesha nukta kubwa kama zilivyo kwenye skrini. Ikiwa nukta kwenye karatasi bado zingegusana, hamisho linapunguza nukta za karatasi hiyo ili kila moja isomeke. Alama nyingi zinazofanana Kwa alama inayojirudia mara nyingi kwenye karatasi, jaribu Hesabu otomatiki: funga bokisi moja, kagua kile kinachopatikana, kisha uongeze zote kwa hatua moja. Kutumia hesabu kwenye fomula Kiasi cha kipengee cha hesabu ni N. Vipengele vya mkusanyiko vinaweza kuitumia, kwa mfano bawaba N * 3 kwa milango. Angalia Mikusanyiko na fomula.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"auto-count","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hesabu alama moja kiotomatiki","summary":"Chora kisanduku kuzunguka alama moja, acha TakeoffDesk itafute nyingine kwenye karatasi hii au kila karatasi iliyofunguliwa, kagua ulinganifu kwa kitelezi, kisha uziongeze kwa hatua moja.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["pembe yoyote","kuzungushwa","kugeuzwa","kipimo kingine","kiwango tofauti","hesabu otomatiki","hesabu ya kiotomatiki","utafutaji wa alama","tafuta alama","muundo","kiolezo","ulinganifu","gundua","zana ya kuhesabu"],"headings":[{"id":"tafuta-alama","text":"Tafuta alama","level":2},{"id":"kagua-ulinganifu","text":"Kagua ulinganifu","level":2},{"id":"ziongeze","text":"Ziongeze","level":2},{"id":"inachopata-na-kisichopata","text":"Inachopata, na kisichopata","level":2},{"id":"kasi-na-vivinjari","text":"Kasi na vivinjari","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E hutafuta kila nakala ya alama baada ya wewe kuchora kisanduku kuzunguka moja. Kisha unakagua ulinganifu kwenye karatasi na kuongeza zile unazokubali kama alama za kuhesabu. Ni msaidizi, si hakikisho: kagua kila mara kabla ya kuongeza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafuta-alama\"\u003ETafuta alama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETengeneza au bofya kipengee cha kuhesabu chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua karatasi ambayo alama inaonekana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Upau unaonekana juu ya karatasi: &quot;Buruta kisanduku kuzunguka alama moja kwenye karatasi hii.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIli kutafuta karatasi zote zilizofunguliwa, si hii tu, weka tiki kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafuta karatasi zote zilizofunguliwa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuza ili alama ionekane vizuri, kisha buruta kisanduku kubana kuzunguka nakala moja yake. Jumuisha alama yote; karatasi tupu inayoizunguka hukatwa. Upau unaonyesha &quot;Inatafuta…&quot; pamoja na upau wa maendeleo na kitufe cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGhairi\u003C/span\u003E. Ukurasa unabaki ukiitikia: unaweza kukuza, kusogeza na kuhamia kati ya karatasi. Kuchagua zana nyingine, au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kunaghairi utafutaji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EItakapomaliza, ulinganifu unaonekana kwenye karatasi kama visanduku vya rangi ya kipengee, na upau unaonyesha muhtasari kama &quot;Ulinganifu 22, 19 za kuongeza (3 tayari zimehesabiwa). Bofya kisanduku ili kukikataa au kukirejesha.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKatika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E, kuburuta kwenye karatasi huchora kisanduku badala ya kusogeza. Ili kusogeza, shikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kisha buruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kati.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kagua-ulinganifu\"\u003EKagua ulinganifu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBofya kisanduku\u003C/strong\u003E ili kukikataa. Kisanduku kilichokataliwa kina mistari yenye nukta na kimevukwa. Bofya tena ili kukirejesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESogeza kitelezi cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlinganifu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E (50% hadi 95%, kinaanzia 75%). Juu zaidi huonyesha ulinganifu wa karibu tu; chini zaidi huonyesha zilizolegea zaidi. Kitelezi huchuja kilichopatikana tu; hakitafuti tena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETayari zimehesabiwa\u003C/strong\u003E: ulinganifu kwenye sehemu yenye alama tayari ya kipengee hiki huanza umekataliwa, ili usihesabu chochote mara mbili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaratasi nyingine\u003C/strong\u003E: ukitafuta karatasi zote zilizofunguliwa, hamia kati ya karatasi kwa kutumia orodha ya karatasi au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na kagua kila moja. Muhtasari unasema karatasi ngapi zina ulinganifu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ziongeze\"\u003EZiongeze\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza\u003C/span\u003E. Kitufe kinasema ni ngapi, kwa mfano &quot;Ongeza alama 19&quot;. Alama za kuhesabu huongezwa katikati ya kila kisanduku kilichokubaliwa: &quot;Imeongezwa alama 19 za kuhesabu kwa &quot;Tundu la umeme mara mbili&quot;. Ctrl+Z huziondoa zote.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKundi zima ni hatua moja ya kutendua, kwa hiyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E moja huliondoa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kuachana na ukaguzi bila kuongeza chochote, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETupa\u003C/span\u003E au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Kuchagua zana nyingine pia hutupa ukaguzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"inachopata-na-kisichopata\"\u003EInachopata, na kisichopata\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk inalinganisha mchoro, kama pikseli, na alama uliyochora kisanduku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHupata alama iliyogeuzwa 0°, 90°, 180° na 270°. Weka tiki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPembe yoyote (polepole zaidi)\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa hesabu otomatiki kabla ya kuchora kisanduku ili kuipata katika pembe yoyote pia: hujaribu kila 15°, kisha husahihisha kila kilichopatikana hadi digrii moja na nusu. Hilo huchukua takriban mara sita zaidi. Haipati alama iliyoakisiwa (isipokuwa alama inafanana hata ikiakisiwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkiwa umeweka tiki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafuta karatasi zote zilizofunguliwa\u003C/span\u003E, karatasi yenye kiwango kingine hutafutwa kwa ukubwa ambao alama inao hapo: kifaa kilichochorwa kwa kipimo kwenye mpango wa 1/8&quot; ni nusu ya ukubwa wake kwenye mpango wa 1/4&quot;, na bado kinapatikana. Karatasi kama hiyo pia hutafutwa kwa ukubwa halisi wa kisanduku, kwa lebo na alama zilizochapishwa kwa ukubwa mmoja kwenye karatasi zote. Hili linahitaji kiwango kwenye karatasi zote mbili; karatasi isiyo na kiwango hutafutwa kwa ukubwa wa kisanduku pekee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlama zinazofanana sana zinaweza kulinganishwa: tundu mara mbili na tundu nne, au lebo mbili za kifaa zinazotofautiana herufi moja. Inua kitelezi hadi zibaki sahihi tu, kisha ukatae zilizobaki kwa mkono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlama inayovukwa na mistari mingine, michoro ya kivuli au maandishi hupata alama ya chini na huenda ikahitaji mpangilio wa chini wa kitelezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVisanduku vidogo sana vinakataliwa: &quot;Kisanduku hicho ni kidogo mno. Chora kuzunguka alama nzima.&quot; Kisanduku tupu pia kinakataliwa: &quot;Kisanduku hicho karibu hakina kitu. Chora kuzunguka alama.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaratasi ambayo ingekuwa kubwa mno kwa ukubwa unaohitajika kwa alama hii inaruka, na muhtasari unasema &quot;Karatasi 1 ilikuwa kubwa mno kutafutwa kwa ukubwa wa alama hii.&quot; Chora kisanduku kwenye alama kubwa zaidi, au uhesabu karatasi hiyo kwa mkono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkiwa hakuna kilichopatikana, upau wa hali unasema &quot;Hakuna ulinganifu. Shusha kitelezi cha ulinganifu, au chora kisanduku kwa karibu zaidi kuzunguka alama.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kasi-na-vivinjari\"\u003EKasi na vivinjari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUtafutaji unaendeshwa kwenye mfanyakazi wa usuli, ukurasa unabaki ukiitikia na unaweza kughairi wakati wowote. Kila karatasi kwanza huchorwa kwa ukubwa wa kazi kwenye ukurasa wenyewe, jambo ambalo linaweza kusababisha karatasi kubwa sana kusimama kwa muda. Hufanya kazi kwenye Chrome, Edge, Firefox na Safari za sasa. Kutafuta karatasi nyingi huchukua muda mrefu; upau wa maendeleo husogea karatasi moja baada ya nyingine. Nje ya mtandao, hesabu otomatiki hufanya kazi upau wa programu unapoonyesha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E huhifadhi mfanyakazi pia. Tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EKufanya kazi nje ya mtandao\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Hesabu otomatiki hutafuta kila nakala ya alama baada ya wewe kuchora kisanduku kuzunguka moja. Kisha unakagua ulinganifu kwenye karatasi na kuongeza zile unazokubali kama alama za kuhesabu. Ni msaidizi, si hakikisho: kagua kila mara kabla ya kuongeza. Tafuta alama Tengeneza au bofya kipengee cha kuhesabu chini ya Vipengee. Fungua karatasi ambayo alama inaonekana. Chagua Hesabu otomatiki kwenye upau wa zana, au bonyeza S. Upau unaonekana juu ya karatasi: \"Buruta kisanduku kuzunguka alama moja kwenye karatasi hii.\" Ili kutafuta karatasi zote zilizofunguliwa, si hii tu, weka tiki kwenye Tafuta karatasi zote zilizofunguliwa. Kuza ili alama ionekane vizuri, kisha buruta kisanduku kubana kuzunguka nakala moja yake. Jumuisha alama yote; karatasi tupu inayoizunguka hukatwa. Upau unaonyesha \"Inatafuta…\" pamoja na upau wa maendeleo na kitufe cha Ghairi. Ukurasa unabaki ukiitikia: unaweza kukuza, kusogeza na kuhamia kati ya karatasi. Kuchagua zana nyingine, au Esc, kunaghairi utafutaji. Itakapomaliza, ulinganifu unaonekana kwenye karatasi kama visanduku vya rangi ya kipengee, na upau unaonyesha muhtasari kama \"Ulinganifu 22, 19 za kuongeza (3 tayari zimehesabiwa). Bofya kisanduku ili kukikataa au kukirejesha.\" Katika Hesabu otomatiki, kuburuta kwenye karatasi huchora kisanduku badala ya kusogeza. Ili kusogeza, shikilia Space kisha buruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kati. Kagua ulinganifu Bofya kisanduku ili kukikataa. Kisanduku kilichokataliwa kina mistari yenye nukta na kimevukwa. Bofya tena ili kukirejesha. Sogeza kitelezi cha Ulinganifu (50% hadi 95%, kinaanzia 75%). Juu zaidi huonyesha ulinganifu wa karibu tu; chini zaidi huonyesha zilizolegea zaidi. Kitelezi huchuja kilichopatikana tu; hakitafuti tena. Tayari zimehesabiwa: ulinganifu kwenye sehemu yenye alama tayari ya kipengee hiki huanza umekataliwa, ili usihesabu chochote mara mbili. Karatasi nyingine: ukitafuta karatasi zote zilizofunguliwa, hamia kati ya karatasi kwa kutumia orodha ya karatasi au Page Down na kagua kila moja. Muhtasari unasema karatasi ngapi zina ulinganifu. Ziongeze Chagua Ongeza. Kitufe kinasema ni ngapi, kwa mfano \"Ongeza alama 19\". Alama za kuhesabu huongezwa katikati ya kila kisanduku kilichokubaliwa: \"Imeongezwa alama 19 za kuhesabu kwa \"Tundu la umeme mara mbili\". Ctrl+Z huziondoa zote.\" Kundi zima ni hatua moja ya kutendua, kwa hiyo Ctrl+Z moja huliondoa. Ili kuachana na ukaguzi bila kuongeza chochote, chagua Tupa au bonyeza Esc. Kuchagua zana nyingine pia hutupa ukaguzi. Inachopata, na kisichopata TakeoffDesk inalinganisha mchoro, kama pikseli, na alama uliyochora kisanduku. Hupata alama iliyogeuzwa 0°, 90°, 180° na 270°. Weka tiki Pembe yoyote (polepole zaidi) kwenye upau wa hesabu otomatiki kabla ya kuchora kisanduku ili kuipata katika pembe yoyote pia: hujaribu kila 15°, kisha husahihisha kila kilichopatikana hadi digrii moja na nusu. Hilo huchukua takriban mara sita zaidi. Haipati alama iliyoakisiwa (isipokuwa alama inafanana hata ikiakisiwa). Ukiwa umeweka tiki Tafuta karatasi zote zilizofunguliwa, karatasi yenye kiwango kingine hutafutwa kwa ukubwa ambao alama inao hapo: kifaa kilichochorwa kwa kipimo kwenye mpango wa 1/8\" ni nusu ya ukubwa wake kwenye mpango wa 1/4\", na bado kinapatikana. Karatasi kama hiyo pia hutafutwa kwa ukubwa halisi wa kisanduku, kwa lebo na alama zilizochapishwa kwa ukubwa mmoja kwenye karatasi zote. Hili linahitaji kiwango kwenye karatasi zote mbili; karatasi isiyo na kiwango hutafutwa kwa ukubwa wa kisanduku pekee. Alama zinazofanana sana zinaweza kulinganishwa: tundu mara mbili na tundu nne, au lebo mbili za kifaa zinazotofautiana herufi moja. Inua kitelezi hadi zibaki sahihi tu, kisha ukatae zilizobaki kwa mkono. Alama inayovukwa na mistari mingine, michoro ya kivuli au maandishi hupata alama ya chini na huenda ikahitaji mpangilio wa chini wa kitelezi. Visanduku vidogo sana vinakataliwa: \"Kisanduku hicho ni kidogo mno. Chora kuzunguka alama nzima.\" Kisanduku tupu pia kinakataliwa: \"Kisanduku hicho karibu hakina kitu. Chora kuzunguka alama.\" Karatasi ambayo ingekuwa kubwa mno kwa ukubwa unaohitajika kwa alama hii inaruka, na muhtasari unasema \"Karatasi 1 ilikuwa kubwa mno kutafutwa kwa ukubwa wa alama hii.\" Chora kisanduku kwenye alama kubwa zaidi, au uhesabu karatasi hiyo kwa mkono. Ikiwa hakuna kilichopatikana, upau wa hali unasema \"Hakuna ulinganifu. Shusha kitelezi cha ulinganifu, au chora kisanduku kwa karibu zaidi kuzunguka alama.\" Kasi na vivinjari Utafutaji unaendeshwa kwenye mfanyakazi wa usuli, ukurasa unabaki ukiitikia na unaweza kughairi wakati wowote. Kila karatasi kwanza huchorwa kwa ukubwa wa kazi kwenye ukurasa wenyewe, jambo ambalo linaweza kusababisha karatasi kubwa sana kusimama kwa muda. Hufanya kazi kwenye Chrome, Edge, Firefox na Safari za sasa. Kutafuta karatasi nyingi huchukua muda mrefu; upau wa maendeleo husogea karatasi moja baada ya nyingine. Nje ya mtandao, hesabu otomatiki hufanya kazi upau wa programu unapoonyesha Tayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao: Hifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao huhifadhi mfanyakazi pia. Tazama Kufanya kazi nje ya mtandao.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"count-everything","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hesabu kila kitu kwenye seti","summary":"Chora orodha ya alama mara moja na TakeoffDesk inahesabu kila alama iliyomo kwenye kila karatasi iliyo wazi kwa mara moja. Kila hesabu ni kiungo cha karatasi yake, na unakagua kabla ya chochote kuongezwa.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["hesabu kila kitu","orodha ya alama","orodha ya alama za mchoro","seti nzima","kila karatasi","karatasi zote","kila mlango","kila kifaa","vifaa vya umeme","ratiba","alama","hesabu otomatiki","hesabu zote","seti ya mipango","karatasi 200","kiwango cha ulinganifu","zinazofanana"],"headings":[{"id":"hesabu-orodha","text":"Hesabu orodha","level":2},{"id":"kagua-hesabu","text":"Kagua hesabu","level":2},{"id":"ziongeze","text":"Ziongeze","level":2},{"id":"pamoja-na-msaidizi-wako","text":"Pamoja na msaidizi wako","level":2},{"id":"alama-katika-pembe-yoyote","text":"Alama katika pembe yoyote","level":2},{"id":"mambo-ya-kujua","text":"Mambo ya kujua","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount everything\u003C/span\u003E inasoma orodha ya alama kisha inahesabu kila alama iliyomo kwenye kila karatasi iliyo wazi. Ni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E kwa orodha nzima mara moja. Ni ulinganishaji wa kawaida wa alama kwenye karatasi zako mwenyewe, si modeli iliyofunzwa, na hakuna kinachotoka kwenye kompyuta yako. Kagua hesabu kabla ya kuziongeza: ni msaidizi, si dhamana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hesabu-orodha\"\u003EHesabu orodha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua mipango. Orodha ya alama kwenye karatasi yoyote inatosha: alama pamoja na majina yake pembeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount everything\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuruta bokisi kuzunguka orodha, alama na majina. Kichwa chenye jina bila alama pembeni (SYMBOL LEGEND) kinaachwa peke yake. Paneli inaorodhesha kila alama pamoja na picha yake na jina lililochapishwa pembeni. Jina linakuwa jina la kipengee, kwa hiyo likibadilishe hapa ukipenda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOndoa tiki kwenye alama usiyotaka kuhesabiwa. Alama isiyoweza kutafutwa (ndogo mno, au tupu) inaeleza kwa nini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu kwenye karatasi N\u003C/span\u003E. Upau unaonyesha karatasi inayotafutwa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E husimamisha zoezi. Ukurasa unabaki unaweza kutumika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlama za orodha yenyewe hazihesabiwi kwenye karatasi yake. Karatasi iliyochorwa kwa kipimo kingine inatafutwa kwa kipimo hicho, na alama zinapatikana zikigeuzwa kwa pembe yoyote ya kulia.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kagua-hesabu\"\u003EKagua hesabu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKila alama inaonyesha jumla yake na, chini yake, kiungo kwa kila karatasi yenye alama (&quot;E-103: 4&quot;). Bofya moja kuenda kwenye karatasi hiyo. Matokeo yanawekwa bokisi kwa rangi ya kipengee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBofya bokisi\u003C/strong\u003E ili kuondoa matokeo hayo. Inakuwa ya mistari-mistari na kuvukwa; bofya tena kuirudisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESogeza kiwango cha ulinganifu\u003C/strong\u003E (50% hadi 100%, kuanzia kiwango chako cha Mipangilio). Juu zaidi huacha ulinganifu wa karibu tu. Kitelezi kinachuja tu kile kilichopatikana; hakitafuti tena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlama mbili zinazofanana (soketi mbili na nne) zinaweza kulingana na sehemu ile ile. Ulinganifu bora unaichukua, na paneli inasema sehemu ngapi zilitokea hivyo, ili uweze kuzikagua.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaratasi kubwa mno kutafutwa kwa ukubwa wa alama inaachwa, na paneli inasema hivyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ziongeze\"\u003EZiongeze\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza alama N\u003C/span\u003E. Kila alama inakuwa kipengee cha hesabu chenye alama kwenye kila matokeo. Jina ambalo tayari ni kipengee chako cha hesabu linatumika tena (hakuna kinachorudiwa mahali ulipoweka alama kwa mkono). Zoezi zima ni hatua moja: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huondoa kila kipengee na alama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUlichokubali pia kinalisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearned\u003C/span\u003E: alama zinakumbukwa kwenye faili la ukadiriaji kwa ajili ya wakati ujao.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pamoja-na-msaidizi-wako\"\u003EPamoja na msaidizi wako\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkiruhusu wasaidizi kwenye Mipangilio, wanaweza kusoma orodha (legend_open), kuendesha hesabu chinichini (legend_count_start, kisha legend_count_status), kusoma hesabu (legend_count_result) na kuziongeza (legend_count_add, ambayo kwanza inaweza kuonyesha kile ingeongeza). Ni zoezi lile lile unaloliona kwenye paneli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"alama-katika-pembe-yoyote\"\u003EAlama katika pembe yoyote\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeka tiki kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESymbols at any angle\u003C/span\u003E kabla ya kuhesabu ili pia kupata alama zilizochorwa kwa pembe isiyo ya kulia (kizibo cha ukuta cha mshazari, kifaa kilichogeuzwa kufuata paa). Utafutaji kisha unageuza kila alama kila digrii 15; alama ya duara bado inahitaji utafutaji mmoja, na alama isiyo ya duara inaweza kuchukua mara sita zaidi. Iache bila tiki kwa mipango iliyochorwa mraba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mambo-ya-kujua\"\u003EMambo ya kujua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInahitaji alama zilizochorwa kwa njia ile ile kama kwenye orodha. Orodha iliyochorwa kwa ukubwa tofauti na karatasi ni sawa ikiwa vipimo vya karatasi vimewekwa; bila vipimo, alama zinatafutwa kwa ukubwa wa orodha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlama yenye ukuta au mstari mrefu uliopita juu yake inaweza kukosekana, kwa sababu haifanani tena na picha ya orodha. Kagua matokeo kwenye karatasi ya kwanza kabla ya kuamini zilizobaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkana isiyo na maandishi bado inafanya kazi: alama zinapatikana kwa safu zao, nawe unaandika majina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Count everything inasoma orodha ya alama kisha inahesabu kila alama iliyomo kwenye kila karatasi iliyo wazi. Ni Auto count kwa orodha nzima mara moja. Ni ulinganishaji wa kawaida wa alama kwenye karatasi zako mwenyewe, si modeli iliyofunzwa, na hakuna kinachotoka kwenye kompyuta yako. Kagua hesabu kabla ya kuziongeza: ni msaidizi, si dhamana. Hesabu orodha Fungua mipango. Orodha ya alama kwenye karatasi yoyote inatosha: alama pamoja na majina yake pembeni. Chagua Count everything kwenye upau wa zana. Buruta bokisi kuzunguka orodha, alama na majina. Kichwa chenye jina bila alama pembeni (SYMBOL LEGEND) kinaachwa peke yake. Paneli inaorodhesha kila alama pamoja na picha yake na jina lililochapishwa pembeni. Jina linakuwa jina la kipengee, kwa hiyo likibadilishe hapa ukipenda. Ondoa tiki kwenye alama usiyotaka kuhesabiwa. Alama isiyoweza kutafutwa (ndogo mno, au tupu) inaeleza kwa nini. Chagua Hesabu kwenye karatasi N. Upau unaonyesha karatasi inayotafutwa; Cancel husimamisha zoezi. Ukurasa unabaki unaweza kutumika. Alama za orodha yenyewe hazihesabiwi kwenye karatasi yake. Karatasi iliyochorwa kwa kipimo kingine inatafutwa kwa kipimo hicho, na alama zinapatikana zikigeuzwa kwa pembe yoyote ya kulia. Kagua hesabu Kila alama inaonyesha jumla yake na, chini yake, kiungo kwa kila karatasi yenye alama (\"E-103: 4\"). Bofya moja kuenda kwenye karatasi hiyo. Matokeo yanawekwa bokisi kwa rangi ya kipengee. Bofya bokisi ili kuondoa matokeo hayo. Inakuwa ya mistari-mistari na kuvukwa; bofya tena kuirudisha. Sogeza kiwango cha ulinganifu (50% hadi 100%, kuanzia kiwango chako cha Mipangilio). Juu zaidi huacha ulinganifu wa karibu tu. Kitelezi kinachuja tu kile kilichopatikana; hakitafuti tena. Alama mbili zinazofanana (soketi mbili na nne) zinaweza kulingana na sehemu ile ile. Ulinganifu bora unaichukua, na paneli inasema sehemu ngapi zilitokea hivyo, ili uweze kuzikagua. Karatasi kubwa mno kutafutwa kwa ukubwa wa alama inaachwa, na paneli inasema hivyo. Ziongeze Chagua Ongeza alama N. Kila alama inakuwa kipengee cha hesabu chenye alama kwenye kila matokeo. Jina ambalo tayari ni kipengee chako cha hesabu linatumika tena (hakuna kinachorudiwa mahali ulipoweka alama kwa mkono). Zoezi zima ni hatua moja: Ctrl+Z huondoa kila kipengee na alama. Ulichokubali pia kinalisha Learned: alama zinakumbukwa kwenye faili la ukadiriaji kwa ajili ya wakati ujao. Pamoja na msaidizi wako Ukiruhusu wasaidizi kwenye Mipangilio, wanaweza kusoma orodha (legend_open), kuendesha hesabu chinichini (legend_count_start, kisha legend_count_status), kusoma hesabu (legend_count_result) na kuziongeza (legend_count_add, ambayo kwanza inaweza kuonyesha kile ingeongeza). Ni zoezi lile lile unaloliona kwenye paneli. Alama katika pembe yoyote Weka tiki kwenye Symbols at any angle kabla ya kuhesabu ili pia kupata alama zilizochorwa kwa pembe isiyo ya kulia (kizibo cha ukuta cha mshazari, kifaa kilichogeuzwa kufuata paa). Utafutaji kisha unageuza kila alama kila digrii 15; alama ya duara bado inahitaji utafutaji mmoja, na alama isiyo ya duara inaweza kuchukua mara sita zaidi. Iache bila tiki kwa mipango iliyochorwa mraba. Mambo ya kujua Inahitaji alama zilizochorwa kwa njia ile ile kama kwenye orodha. Orodha iliyochorwa kwa ukubwa tofauti na karatasi ni sawa ikiwa vipimo vya karatasi vimewekwa; bila vipimo, alama zinatafutwa kwa ukubwa wa orodha. Alama yenye ukuta au mstari mrefu uliopita juu yake inaweza kukosekana, kwa sababu haifanani tena na picha ya orodha. Kagua matokeo kwenye karatasi ya kwanza kabla ya kuamini zilizobaki. Skana isiyo na maandishi bado inafanya kazi: alama zinapatikana kwa safu zao, nawe unaandika majina.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"count-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hesabu kutoka kwenye mchoro","summary":"Hesabu bloku, vitu kwenye tabaka, au maandishi moja kwa moja kutoka DWG au DXF: kwa usahihi, pamoja na bloku zilizo ndani ya bloku, tofauti za bloku zinazobadilika na safu za bloku, katika hatua moja ya kutendua.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["hesabu kutoka kwenye mchoro","hesabu ya CAD","hesabu ya bloku","hesabu bloku","ingiza","jina la bloku","bloku zilizo ndani","bloku inayobadilika","tofauti","minsert","safu","aina ya kipengele","miduara","maandishi","sifa","lebo","tabaka zilizofichwa","hesabu sahihi","jinsi ya","milango","vifaa"],"headings":[{"id":"hesabu-bloku","text":"Hesabu bloku","level":2},{"id":"kinachohesabiwa","text":"Kinachohesabiwa","level":3},{"id":"kisichohesabiwa","text":"Kisichohesabiwa","level":3},{"id":"kile-karatasi-hii-inaonyesha-au-mchoro-mzima","text":"Kile karatasi hii inaonyesha, au mchoro mzima","level":2},{"id":"hesabu-tena","text":"Hesabu tena","level":2},{"id":"kwa-tabaka-na-aina","text":"Kwa tabaka na aina","level":2},{"id":"kwa-maandishi","text":"Kwa maandishi","level":2},{"id":"lini-utumie-hesabu-otomatiki","text":"Lini utumie Hesabu otomatiki","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD count\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa karatasi (amri \u003Cstrong\u003EHesabu kutoka kwenye mchoro\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye mitindo mingine ya menyu) inahesabu kile DWG au DXF inachosema kipo. Ambapo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E inatafuta picha ya alama na inaweza kukosa moja au kupata ya uongo, hii inahesabu vitu: kila ingizo la bloku iitwayo \u003Ccode\u003EDOOR-36\u003C/code\u003E ni mlango mmoja. Fungua mchoro kwanza: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EFungua mchoro wa DWG au DXF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hesabu-bloku\"\u003EHesabu bloku\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua karatasi ya mchoro. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD count\u003C/span\u003E iko kwenye upau wa karatasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua. Dirisha linaorodhesha bloku pamoja na idadi ya kila moja. Tafuta kwa jina, kisha chagua moja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAngalia mstari chini ya orodha: &quot;22 found, 22 to add.&quot; (22 zimepatikana, 22 zitaongezwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to\u003C/span\u003E, chagua kipengee cha hesabu, au acha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA new count item\u003C/span\u003E na utoe jina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua kitufe cha kuongeza kinachotaja idadi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza alama 22\u003C/span\u003E. Alama zinaonekana kwenye sehemu za kuingiza za bloku, na kiasi cha kipengee ndicho hesabu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENi hatua moja ya kutendua: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huondoa alama (na kipengee kipya) pamoja. Makadirio, lahajedwali na PDF yenye alama vinakitendea kipengee kama kipengee kingine chochote cha hesabu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kinachohesabiwa\"\u003EKinachohesabiwa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKila ingizo la jina la bloku\u003C/strong\u003E, bila kujali kipimo na pembe yake, katika model space au paper space. Majina ya bloku hayajali herufi kubwa au ndogo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafu za bloku\u003C/strong\u003E (MINSERT): kila nakala kwenye safu ni moja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBloku zilizo ndani ya bloku.\u003C/strong\u003E Bloku iliyowekwa ndani ya bloku nyingine inahesabiwa katika kila kina. Orodha inasema &quot;6 ndani ya bloku nyingine&quot;; ondoa tiki kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount blocks inside other blocks too\u003C/span\u003E ili kuhesabu ingizo lililowekwa moja kwa moja kwenye mchoro pekee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBloku zinazobadilika.\u003C/strong\u003E Bloku inayobadilika inahesabiwa chini ya jina lake lenyewe, si chini ya nakala zisizo na jina (\u003Ccode\u003E*U12\u003C/code\u003E) ambazo faili huzihifadhi. Hali zake zinaorodheshwa kando (&quot;Single 12, Double 4&quot;): chagua hali ili kuhesabu hizo peke yake, au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery variant\u003C/span\u003E. Faili isiposema ni hali gani nakala inaonyesha, hizo zinaorodheshwa kama &quot;(hali haijulikani)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKichujio cha tabaka.\u003C/strong\u003E Bloku iliyo kwenye tabaka kadhaa: chagua moja chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOn layer\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kisichohesabiwa\"\u003EKisichohesabiwa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETabaka zilizofichwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Kitu kilicho kwenye tabaka lililozimwa au kuganda kwenye faili (au ulichokificha kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E) kinaachwa, na mstari unasema ni ngapi: &quot;3 kwenye tabaka zilizofichwa zimeachwa&quot;. Weka tiki kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu hizo pia\u003C/span\u003E ili kuvijumuisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMichoro iliyounganishwa ambayo haijafunguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E haihesabiwi; dirisha linasema hivyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVitu vilivyowekwa juu ya kitu kingine cha aina ile ile kabisa\u003C/strong\u003E vinahesabiwa kama viwili (kwa kuwa ni vitu viwili), na dirisha linasema hivyo: mara nyingi ni kosa la uchoraji linalostahili kuangaliwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kile-karatasi-hii-inaonyesha-au-mchoro-mzima\"\u003EKile karatasi hii inaonyesha, au mchoro mzima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKinachoonyeshwa na karatasi hii\u003C/strong\u003E kinahesabu vitu ambavyo karatasi inaonyesha: kwenye layout, vitu vya modeli ndani ya viewports zake (tabaka lililoganda kwenye viewport halihesabiwi hapo) pamoja na vya layout yenyewe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMchoro mzima, kila kitu mara moja\u003C/strong\u003E unahesabu model space mara moja, pamoja na alama kwenye karatasi ya Model, na haihesabu tena vitu ambavyo layout kadhaa zinaonyesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuhesabu kile layout inachoonyesha na kuhesabu kile Model inachoonyesha kunatoa namba sawa kwa vitu sawa; usiviongeze vyote kwenye kipengee kimoja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hesabu-tena\"\u003EHesabu tena\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuhesabu bloku ile ile tena kwa kipengee kile kile kunaongeza kile kipya tu: &quot;22 already counted&quot; (22 zimeshahesabiwa). Kila alama inawakilisha kitu kimoja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwa-tabaka-na-aina\"\u003EKwa tabaka na aina\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy layer and type\u003C/span\u003E, chagua tabaka na aina ya kitu (miduara, polilaini, hatch…): &quot;all circles on E-LITE&quot; (miduara yote kwenye E-LITE). Weka tiki kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso count objects inside blocks\u003C/span\u003E ili kujumuisha vilivyo ndani ya ufafanuzi wa bloku, katika kila mahali bloku inapowekwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwa-maandishi\"\u003EKwa maandishi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy text\u003C/span\u003E andika maandishi, kama \u003Ccode\u003EA3\u003C/code\u003E, kisha sema kama ni hayo hasa, yana hayo, au yana hayo kama neno zima. Vitu vya maandishi, maandishi ya multileader na \u003Cstrong\u003Ethamani za sifa\u003C/strong\u003E za bloku vyote vinahesabiwa (sifa ya lebo \u003Ccode\u003EITEM = A3\u003C/code\u003E inapatikana); chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn attribute\u003C/span\u003E ili kuhesabu sifa moja tu. Maandishi yanayojitokeza zaidi yanaorodheshwa ili kubofya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lini-utumie-hesabu-otomatiki\"\u003ELini utumie Hesabu otomatiki\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETumia \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E kwa PDF na kwa alama kwenye mchoro ambazo si bloku (zilizochorwa peke yake, au zilizovunjwa). Zikichorwa kama bloku, zihesabu hapa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"CAD count kwenye upau wa karatasi (amri Hesabu kutoka kwenye mchoro kwenye mitindo mingine ya menyu) inahesabu kile DWG au DXF inachosema kipo. Ambapo Auto count inatafuta picha ya alama na inaweza kukosa moja au kupata ya uongo, hii inahesabu vitu: kila ingizo la bloku iitwayo DOOR-36 ni mlango mmoja. Fungua mchoro kwanza: Fungua mchoro wa DWG au DXF. Hesabu bloku Fungua karatasi ya mchoro. CAD count iko kwenye upau wa karatasi. Chagua. Dirisha linaorodhesha bloku pamoja na idadi ya kila moja. Tafuta kwa jina, kisha chagua moja. Angalia mstari chini ya orodha: \"22 found, 22 to add.\" (22 zimepatikana, 22 zitaongezwa). Chini ya Add to, chagua kipengee cha hesabu, au acha A new count item na utoe jina. Chagua kitufe cha kuongeza kinachotaja idadi: Ongeza alama 22. Alama zinaonekana kwenye sehemu za kuingiza za bloku, na kiasi cha kipengee ndicho hesabu. Ni hatua moja ya kutendua: Ctrl+Z huondoa alama (na kipengee kipya) pamoja. Makadirio, lahajedwali na PDF yenye alama vinakitendea kipengee kama kipengee kingine chochote cha hesabu. Kinachohesabiwa Kila ingizo la jina la bloku, bila kujali kipimo na pembe yake, katika model space au paper space. Majina ya bloku hayajali herufi kubwa au ndogo. Safu za bloku (MINSERT): kila nakala kwenye safu ni moja. Bloku zilizo ndani ya bloku. Bloku iliyowekwa ndani ya bloku nyingine inahesabiwa katika kila kina. Orodha inasema \"6 ndani ya bloku nyingine\"; ondoa tiki kwenye Count blocks inside other blocks too ili kuhesabu ingizo lililowekwa moja kwa moja kwenye mchoro pekee. Bloku zinazobadilika. Bloku inayobadilika inahesabiwa chini ya jina lake lenyewe, si chini ya nakala zisizo na jina (*U12) ambazo faili huzihifadhi. Hali zake zinaorodheshwa kando (\"Single 12, Double 4\"): chagua hali ili kuhesabu hizo peke yake, au Every variant. Faili isiposema ni hali gani nakala inaonyesha, hizo zinaorodheshwa kama \"(hali haijulikani)\". Kichujio cha tabaka. Bloku iliyo kwenye tabaka kadhaa: chagua moja chini ya On layer. Kisichohesabiwa Tabaka zilizofichwa. Kitu kilicho kwenye tabaka lililozimwa au kuganda kwenye faili (au ulichokificha kwenye Layers) kinaachwa, na mstari unasema ni ngapi: \"3 kwenye tabaka zilizofichwa zimeachwa\". Weka tiki kwenye Hesabu hizo pia ili kuvijumuisha. Michoro iliyounganishwa ambayo haijafunguliwa haihesabiwi; dirisha linasema hivyo. Vitu vilivyowekwa juu ya kitu kingine cha aina ile ile kabisa vinahesabiwa kama viwili (kwa kuwa ni vitu viwili), na dirisha linasema hivyo: mara nyingi ni kosa la uchoraji linalostahili kuangaliwa. Kile karatasi hii inaonyesha, au mchoro mzima Kinachoonyeshwa na karatasi hii kinahesabu vitu ambavyo karatasi inaonyesha: kwenye layout, vitu vya modeli ndani ya viewports zake (tabaka lililoganda kwenye viewport halihesabiwi hapo) pamoja na vya layout yenyewe. Mchoro mzima, kila kitu mara moja unahesabu model space mara moja, pamoja na alama kwenye karatasi ya Model, na haihesabu tena vitu ambavyo layout kadhaa zinaonyesha. Kuhesabu kile layout inachoonyesha na kuhesabu kile Model inachoonyesha kunatoa namba sawa kwa vitu sawa; usiviongeze vyote kwenye kipengee kimoja. Hesabu tena Kuhesabu bloku ile ile tena kwa kipengee kile kile kunaongeza kile kipya tu: \"22 already counted\" (22 zimeshahesabiwa). Kila alama inawakilisha kitu kimoja. Kwa tabaka na aina Kwenye By layer and type, chagua tabaka na aina ya kitu (miduara, polilaini, hatch…): \"all circles on E-LITE\" (miduara yote kwenye E-LITE). Weka tiki kwenye Also count objects inside blocks ili kujumuisha vilivyo ndani ya ufafanuzi wa bloku, katika kila mahali bloku inapowekwa. Kwa maandishi Kwenye By text andika maandishi, kama A3, kisha sema kama ni hayo hasa, yana hayo, au yana hayo kama neno zima. Vitu vya maandishi, maandishi ya multileader na thamani za sifa za bloku vyote vinahesabiwa (sifa ya lebo ITEM = A3 inapatikana); chagua In attribute ili kuhesabu sifa moja tu. Maandishi yanayojitokeza zaidi yanaorodheshwa ili kubofya. Lini utumie Hesabu otomatiki Tumia Auto count kwa PDF na kwa alama kwenye mchoro ambazo si bloku (zilizochorwa peke yake, au zilizovunjwa). Zikichorwa kama bloku, zihesabu hapa.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"what-it-learned","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kilichojifunzwa kutoka kwenye ukadiriaji wako","summary":"TakeoffDesk huweka alama ulizothibitisha kwa Hesabu otomatiki, seti zako za masharti, mikusanyiko unayotumia zaidi na mifumo unayorudia kwenye kila ukurasa, yote ndani ya faili la ukadiriaji lenyewe. Ione, itumie, ifute.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["jifunze","kilichojifunzwa","kujifunza","msaidizi","kumbuka","alama","violezo","sawa na kazi iliyopita","kazi iliyopita","seti ya masharti","masharti","tumia tena","mikusanyiko","inayotumika zaidi","mapendekezo","rudia kwenye kila ukurasa","kila ukurasa","kichwa cha mchoro","mfumo","futa zote","sahau","faragha"],"headings":[{"id":"alama","text":"Alama","level":2},{"id":"seti-za-masharti","text":"Seti za masharti","level":2},{"id":"sawa-na-kazi-iliyopita","text":"Sawa na kazi iliyopita","level":2},{"id":"mikusanyiko-unayotumia-zaidi","text":"Mikusanyiko unayotumia zaidi","level":2},{"id":"rudia-kwenye-kila-ukurasa","text":"Rudia kwenye kila ukurasa","level":2},{"id":"ione-ifute","text":"Ione, ifute","level":2},{"id":"vizuri-kujua","text":"Vizuri kujua","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk inakuwa haraka zaidi kadiri unavyofanya ukadiriaji nayo. Inajifunza \u003Cstrong\u003Ekutoka kwa unachokubali pekee\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ealama ulizozungushia kisanduku kwa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/a\u003E kisha ukaziongeza,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eseti za masharti unazozihifadhi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emikusanyiko unayotumia (mara moja kwa kila kazi),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emifumo ya alama unazorudia kwenye kila ukurasa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENi ulinganishaji rahisi kwenye karatasi zako mwenyewe, utafutaji uleule ambao Hesabu otomatiki inaufanya. Si modeli iliyofunzwa. Kila kitu inachojifunza kinahifadhiwa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekwenye faili la ukadiriaji huu\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E), na hakuna kinachotumwa popote. Ili kukipeleka kwenye kazi inayofuata, tumia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/what-it-learned#same-as-last-job\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/what-it-learned\" data-hash=\"same-as-last-job\"\u003ESawa na kazi iliyopita\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImejifunza\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana (balbu ya taa, karibu na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E) ili kuona yote.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"alama\"\u003EAlama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnapozungushia alama kisanduku kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E na kuchagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza\u003C/span\u003E, alama uliyozungushia inahifadhiwa, pamoja na kiwango cha ulinganifu ulichokubali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImejifunza\u003C/span\u003E, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafuta kwenye karatasi hii\u003C/span\u003E au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafuta kwenye karatasi zote\u003C/span\u003E. Ukaguzi wa kawaida wa Hesabu otomatiki unafunguka: bofya kisanduku ili kukiacha, sogeza kitelezi, kisha uziongeze. Hakuna kinachoongezwa hadi ufanye hivyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnapofungua karatasi isiyo na alama yoyote kati ya zilizojifunzwa, upau wa juu unatoa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafuta …\u003C/span\u003E kwa ajili yake. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESi sasa\u003C/span\u003E inaificha kwa karatasi hiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkiwa ukadiriaji hauna kipengee chenye jina hilo, kuongeza alama pia kunaongeza kipengee (hatua moja ya kutendua).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuongeza tena alama ya kipengee kile kile kunahesabiwa kwenye kile kinachojulikana; alama inayoonekana tofauti inahifadhiwa kama ya pili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKama Hesabu otomatiki, inapata alama iliyogeuzwa kwa pembe za kulia na kwenye karatasi zenye kipimo tofauti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"seti-za-masharti\"\u003ESeti za masharti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESeti inahifadhi masharti ya ukadiriaji (vipengee vyenye vitengo, viwango, upotevu na mikusanyiko), bila alama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImejifunza\u003C/span\u003E, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi masharti ya ukadiriaji huu kama seti…\u003C/span\u003E kisha upe jina. Seti yenye jina lile lile inabadilishwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye ukadiriaji ulio na seti, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza\u003C/span\u003E inaweka masharti ambayo bado hayapo. Masharti yenye jina na aina ile ile yanaachwa. Ni hatua moja ya kutendua.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawa-na-kazi-iliyopita\"\u003ESawa na kazi iliyopita\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaili la kazi yako ya mwisho lina kilichojifunza. Ili kuanza kazi mpya kutoka kwake:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua mipango mipya, kisha chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImejifunza\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawa na kazi iliyopita…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E ya kazi ya mwisho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua kile cha kuleta: masharti yake (yale tu ambayo ukadiriaji huu hauna), na kilichojifunza (alama, seti, mikusanyiko, mifumo). Kisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZiingize\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMasharti yake pia yanahifadhiwa kama seti yenye jina la kazi hiyo. Alama na kiasi chake vinabaki kwenye faili lake lenyewe. Yote kwa pamoja ni hatua moja ya kutendua.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mikusanyiko-unayotumia-zaidi\"\u003EMikusanyiko unayotumia zaidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKipengee chenye mkusanyiko kinahesabiwa kuwa kimetumika mara moja kwa kila kazi, kinapokuwa na kiasi na unapohifadhi ukadiriaji. Kazi ni seti ya faili za mipango ambayo ukadiriaji unachukuliwa kutoka kwake, kwa hiyo kuhifadhi ukadiriaji huo tena hakuhesabiwi mara mbili. Orodha iliyo chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMikusanyiko unayotumia zaidi\u003C/span\u003E inaweka zile unazotumia zaidi juu. Inaacha zile ambazo ukadiriaji huu tayari unazo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza\u003C/span\u003E inaweka moja kama ulivyoitumia mara ya mwisho, pamoja na sehemu zake zote.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rudia-kwenye-kila-ukurasa\"\u003ERudia kwenye kila ukurasa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwa alama zinazofanana kwenye kila ukurasa wa seti, kama hesabu ya kichwa cha mchoro au maelezo ya kawaida:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua alama kwenye karatasi moja (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EChagua alama\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImejifunza\u003C/span\u003E, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERudia alama zilizochaguliwa kwenye kila ukurasa…\u003C/span\u003E, upe mfumo jina, kisha uthibitishe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZinawekwa kwenye kila ukurasa mwingine uliofunguliwa \u003Cstrong\u003Ewa ukubwa uleule\u003C/strong\u003E, mahali pale pale, kwa hatua moja ya kutendua. Urefu na maeneo yanawekwa kwenye kurasa zenye kipimo kile kile pekee; hesabu zinawekwa kwenye ukurasa wowote wa ukubwa huo. Ukurasa ambao tayari unazo unaruka. Mfumo unahifadhiwa, kwa hiyo kurasa utakazozifungua baadaye zitapata pendekezo kwenye upau, au unaweza kutumia \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERudia kwenye kila ukurasa\u003C/span\u003E kwenye orodha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ione-ifute\"\u003EIone, ifute\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila kitu kilichojifunzwa kimeorodheshwa kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImejifunza\u003C/span\u003E. Pipa linafuta kitu kimoja. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuta zote\u003C/span\u003E inafuta kila kilichojifunzwa na kuacha vipengee na alama zako vilivyo. Zote mbili zinaweza kutenduliwa hadi ufunge ukadiriaji, na zote mbili zinahifadhiwa pamoja na ukadiriaji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kuacha kujifunza kwenye ukadiriaji mmoja, ondoa tiki kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJifunze kutoka kwa ukadiriaji huu\u003C/span\u003E. Hakuna kinachojifunzwa kipya, na kilichoorodheshwa kinabaki hadi ukifute.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vizuri-kujua\"\u003EVizuri kujua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMatoleo ya zamani ya TakeoffDesk yanafungua faili lenye mambo yaliyojifunzwa kawaida. Yanapuuza sehemu hiyo, na yanaiondoa yakihifadhi faili tena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlama iliyojifunzwa ni picha ndogo ya ulichozungushia kisanduku, inayohifadhiwa kwenye faili (kilobaiti chache kila moja).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlama zilizojifunzwa zinatafutwa kama Hesabu otomatiki inavyotafuta, kwa hiyo mipaka ile ile inatumika: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki ya alama\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk inakuwa haraka zaidi kadiri unavyofanya ukadiriaji nayo. Inajifunza kutoka kwa unachokubali pekee: alama ulizozungushia kisanduku kwa Hesabu otomatiki kisha ukaziongeza, seti za masharti unazozihifadhi, mikusanyiko unayotumia (mara moja kwa kila kazi), mifumo ya alama unazorudia kwenye kila ukurasa. Ni ulinganishaji rahisi kwenye karatasi zako mwenyewe, utafutaji uleule ambao Hesabu otomatiki inaufanya. Si modeli iliyofunzwa. Kila kitu inachojifunza kinahifadhiwa kwenye faili la ukadiriaji huu (.takeoff.json), na hakuna kinachotumwa popote. Ili kukipeleka kwenye kazi inayofuata, tumia Sawa na kazi iliyopita. Chagua Imejifunza kwenye upau wa zana (balbu ya taa, karibu na Hesabu otomatiki) ili kuona yote. Alama Unapozungushia alama kisanduku kwa Hesabu otomatiki na kuchagua Ongeza, alama uliyozungushia inahifadhiwa, pamoja na kiwango cha ulinganifu ulichokubali. Kwenye Imejifunza, chagua Tafuta kwenye karatasi hii au Tafuta kwenye karatasi zote. Ukaguzi wa kawaida wa Hesabu otomatiki unafunguka: bofya kisanduku ili kukiacha, sogeza kitelezi, kisha uziongeze. Hakuna kinachoongezwa hadi ufanye hivyo. Unapofungua karatasi isiyo na alama yoyote kati ya zilizojifunzwa, upau wa juu unatoa Tafuta … kwa ajili yake. Si sasa inaificha kwa karatasi hiyo. Ikiwa ukadiriaji hauna kipengee chenye jina hilo, kuongeza alama pia kunaongeza kipengee (hatua moja ya kutendua). Kuongeza tena alama ya kipengee kile kile kunahesabiwa kwenye kile kinachojulikana; alama inayoonekana tofauti inahifadhiwa kama ya pili. Kama Hesabu otomatiki, inapata alama iliyogeuzwa kwa pembe za kulia na kwenye karatasi zenye kipimo tofauti. Seti za masharti Seti inahifadhi masharti ya ukadiriaji (vipengee vyenye vitengo, viwango, upotevu na mikusanyiko), bila alama. Kwenye Imejifunza, chagua Hifadhi masharti ya ukadiriaji huu kama seti… kisha upe jina. Seti yenye jina lile lile inabadilishwa. Kwenye ukadiriaji ulio na seti, Ongeza inaweka masharti ambayo bado hayapo. Masharti yenye jina na aina ile ile yanaachwa. Ni hatua moja ya kutendua. Sawa na kazi iliyopita Faili la kazi yako ya mwisho lina kilichojifunza. Ili kuanza kazi mpya kutoka kwake: Fungua mipango mipya, kisha chagua Imejifunza › Sawa na kazi iliyopita…. Chagua .takeoff.json ya kazi ya mwisho. Chagua kile cha kuleta: masharti yake (yale tu ambayo ukadiriaji huu hauna), na kilichojifunza (alama, seti, mikusanyiko, mifumo). Kisha Ziingize. Masharti yake pia yanahifadhiwa kama seti yenye jina la kazi hiyo. Alama na kiasi chake vinabaki kwenye faili lake lenyewe. Yote kwa pamoja ni hatua moja ya kutendua. Mikusanyiko unayotumia zaidi Kipengee chenye mkusanyiko kinahesabiwa kuwa kimetumika mara moja kwa kila kazi, kinapokuwa na kiasi na unapohifadhi ukadiriaji. Kazi ni seti ya faili za mipango ambayo ukadiriaji unachukuliwa kutoka kwake, kwa hiyo kuhifadhi ukadiriaji huo tena hakuhesabiwi mara mbili. Orodha iliyo chini ya Mikusanyiko unayotumia zaidi inaweka zile unazotumia zaidi juu. Inaacha zile ambazo ukadiriaji huu tayari unazo. Ongeza inaweka moja kama ulivyoitumia mara ya mwisho, pamoja na sehemu zake zote. Rudia kwenye kila ukurasa Kwa alama zinazofanana kwenye kila ukurasa wa seti, kama hesabu ya kichwa cha mchoro au maelezo ya kawaida: Chagua alama kwenye karatasi moja (Chagua alama). Kwenye Imejifunza, chagua Rudia alama zilizochaguliwa kwenye kila ukurasa…, upe mfumo jina, kisha uthibitishe. Zinawekwa kwenye kila ukurasa mwingine uliofunguliwa wa ukubwa uleule, mahali pale pale, kwa hatua moja ya kutendua. Urefu na maeneo yanawekwa kwenye kurasa zenye kipimo kile kile pekee; hesabu zinawekwa kwenye ukurasa wowote wa ukubwa huo. Ukurasa ambao tayari unazo unaruka. Mfumo unahifadhiwa, kwa hiyo kurasa utakazozifungua baadaye zitapata pendekezo kwenye upau, au unaweza kutumia Rudia kwenye kila ukurasa kwenye orodha. Ione, ifute Kila kitu kilichojifunzwa kimeorodheshwa kwenye Imejifunza. Pipa linafuta kitu kimoja. Futa zote inafuta kila kilichojifunzwa na kuacha vipengee na alama zako vilivyo. Zote mbili zinaweza kutenduliwa hadi ufunge ukadiriaji, na zote mbili zinahifadhiwa pamoja na ukadiriaji. Ili kuacha kujifunza kwenye ukadiriaji mmoja, ondoa tiki kwenye Jifunze kutoka kwa ukadiriaji huu. Hakuna kinachojifunzwa kipya, na kilichoorodheshwa kinabaki hadi ukifute. Vizuri kujua Matoleo ya zamani ya TakeoffDesk yanafungua faili lenye mambo yaliyojifunzwa kawaida. Yanapuuza sehemu hiyo, na yanaiondoa yakihifadhi faili tena. Alama iliyojifunzwa ni picha ndogo ya ulichozungushia kisanduku, inayohifadhiwa kwenye faili (kilobaiti chache kila moja). Alama zilizojifunzwa zinatafutwa kama Hesabu otomatiki inavyotafuta, kwa hiyo mipaka ile ile inatumika: Hesabu otomatiki ya alama.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"price-memory","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Price memory from your past jobs","summary":"TakeoffDesk remembers the rates you used on past takeoffs, on this computer only, so a new takeoff can start from what you paid last time. See it, use it, forget it.","section":"tasks","order":73,"keywords":["price memory","prices","remember prices","last job","past jobs","typical price","median","rates","unpriced","reprice","learn from a past takeoff","forget","library"],"headings":[{"id":"what-gets-remembered","text":"What gets remembered","level":2},{"id":"use-it-on-a-new-takeoff","text":"Use it on a new takeoff","level":2},{"id":"see-it-change-it-forget-it","text":"See it, change it, forget it","level":2},{"id":"with-your-assistant","text":"With your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrices\u003C/span\u003E on the toolbar (the dollar sign) opens what TakeoffDesk remembers about the prices you used. It is a plain list: for each item name, the rates from your last jobs. It is kept in this browser beside the price Library, never inside a takeoff file, and nothing is sent anywhere. It is not a trained model.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-gets-remembered\"\u003EWhat gets remembered\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen you save a takeoff, each item that has a price and is used (it has a mark, or a typed quantity above zero) is remembered under its name and type: material rate, labor rate, waste and unit. A job is the plan files it is taken off, so saving the same takeoff again replaces its own prices instead of adding another job. The last 12 jobs are kept for each name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo start with your older work, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn from a past takeoff…\u003C/span\u003E and pick a saved takeoff (.json). Its priced, used items are remembered the same way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENames match when their words match, whatever the case or punctuation (&quot;2x4 Stud, 8 ft&quot; and &quot;2x4 stud 8 FT&quot; are the same). The same words for another kind of item (a linear item and a count item) are not the same price.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"use-it-on-a-new-takeoff\"\u003EUse it on a new takeoff\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMake the items of the new takeoff.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrices\u003C/span\u003E. Under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis takeoff\u003C/span\u003E you see every item that has a remembered price, what you have on it now, the last job&#039;s rates, the typical rates (the middle of the remembered jobs) and the range.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse last\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse typical\u003C/span\u003E on one item, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrice N unpriced items from memory\u003C/span\u003E to fill every item that has no price yet from the last job.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach use is one step: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes it back. An item that only has a similar name (one name inside the other) says so, and the buttons use the similar name&#039;s rates. A price remembered per each is never put on an item per foot: the dialog says the units differ and leaves it alone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-it-change-it-forget-it\"\u003ESee it, change it, forget it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything remembered\u003C/span\u003E lists every name with its rates and the number of jobs. The trash button forgets one name; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear all prices\u003C/span\u003E forgets them all. Turn off \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemember my prices when I save a takeoff\u003C/span\u003E to stop remembering; what is already there stays until you forget it. Your takeoffs and the price Library are never touched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"with-your-assistant\"\u003EWith your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you allow assistants in Settings, they can read what is remembered for the takeoff&#039;s items (prices_list) and price items from it (prices_apply, which can preview first). It is the same list as the dialog.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Prices on the toolbar (the dollar sign) opens what TakeoffDesk remembers about the prices you used. It is a plain list: for each item name, the rates from your last jobs. It is kept in this browser beside the price Library, never inside a takeoff file, and nothing is sent anywhere. It is not a trained model. What gets remembered When you save a takeoff, each item that has a price and is used (it has a mark, or a typed quantity above zero) is remembered under its name and type: material rate, labor rate, waste and unit. A job is the plan files it is taken off, so saving the same takeoff again replaces its own prices instead of adding another job. The last 12 jobs are kept for each name. To start with your older work, choose Learn from a past takeoff… and pick a saved takeoff (.json). Its priced, used items are remembered the same way. Names match when their words match, whatever the case or punctuation (\"2x4 Stud, 8 ft\" and \"2x4 stud 8 FT\" are the same). The same words for another kind of item (a linear item and a count item) are not the same price. Use it on a new takeoff Make the items of the new takeoff. Choose Prices. Under This takeoff you see every item that has a remembered price, what you have on it now, the last job's rates, the typical rates (the middle of the remembered jobs) and the range. Choose Use last or Use typical on one item, or Price N unpriced items from memory to fill every item that has no price yet from the last job. Each use is one step: Ctrl+Z takes it back. An item that only has a similar name (one name inside the other) says so, and the buttons use the similar name's rates. A price remembered per each is never put on an item per foot: the dialog says the units differ and leaves it alone. See it, change it, forget it Everything remembered lists every name with its rates and the number of jobs. The trash button forgets one name; Clear all prices forgets them all. Turn off Remember my prices when I save a takeoff to stop remembering; what is already there stays until you forget it. Your takeoffs and the price Library are never touched. With your assistant If you allow assistants in Settings, they can read what is remembered for the takeoff's items (prices_list) and price items from it (prices_apply, which can preview first). It is the same list as the dialog.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"supplier-stock","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Angalia hisa ya msambazaji na muda wa kusubiri","summary":"Ongeza orodha ya hisa ya msambazaji (CSV au lahajedwali) na TakeoffDesk inakagua kile ukadiriaji unachohitaji, pamoja na upotevu, dhidi yake: kama kuna cha kutosha kwenye hisa, na muda wa kusubiri ni upi. Upungufu na masubiri marefu yanaonekana kwenye jopo la Matatizo.","section":"tasks","order":74,"keywords":["msambazaji","hisa","ipo kwenye hisa","muda wa kusubiri","upatikanaji","upungufu","oda ya nyuma","orodha ya oda","csv","sku","muuzaji","vifaa","ugavi","matatizo"],"headings":[{"id":"faili","text":"Faili","level":2},{"id":"kagua-ukadiriaji","text":"Kagua ukadiriaji","level":2},{"id":"lahajedwali-na-maktaba-ya-bei","text":"Lahajedwali na Maktaba ya bei","level":2},{"id":"kwenye-paneli-ya-matatizo","text":"Kwenye paneli ya Matatizo","level":2},{"id":"pamoja-na-msaidizi-wako","text":"Pamoja na msaidizi wako","level":2},{"id":"jambo-la-kujua","text":"Jambo la kujua","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgavi\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana (lori) hulinganisha kile ukadiriaji wako unachohitaji na orodha ya hisa ya msambazaji. Safu za msambazaji zinazohusika zinahifadhiwa kwenye faili la ukadiriaji lenyewe. Hakuna kinachotumwa popote wala hakuna anayeulizwa msambazaji: wewe unaleta faili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faili\"\u003EFaili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaili la CSV lenye safu ya vichwa. Linahitaji safu ya jina au SKU na safu ya hisa au muda wa kusubiri. Vichwa hivi vinatambuliwa (mpangilio wowote, herufi kubwa au ndogo zote): Item, Name, Description au Product; SKU, Part au Item #; In stock, On hand, Available au Quantity; Lead time au Delivery days; Unit au UOM; Price au Cost; Supplier au Vendor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHisa inaweza kuwa namba (1,200), &quot;In stock&quot; au &quot;Out of stock&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuda wa kusubiri unaweza kuwa &quot;5 days&quot;, &quot;2 weeks&quot;, &quot;2-3 weeks&quot; (ile ndefu zaidi inatumika), &quot;3 months&quot;, &quot;same day&quot; au &quot;backorder&quot;. Namba tupu iko katika kitengo cha kichwa (siku, isipokuwa kichwa kisema wiki au miezi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaili za Excel hazisomwi: hifadhi laha kama CSV kwanza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kagua-ukadiriaji\"\u003EKagua ukadiriaji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgavi\u003C/span\u003E, kisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza faili la msambazaji…\u003C/span\u003E na uchague CSV. Unaweza kuongeza zaidi ya moja: hadi faili tano, safu 2,000 zinazohifadhiwa kwa jumla, zile zinazolingana na vipengee vyako kwanza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKila kipengee, sharti la pili na sehemu ya mkusanyiko yenye kiasi hulinganishwa na safu moja kwa jina, au kwa SKU iliyo kwenye jina lake. Jina linalofanana (moja ndani ya jingine) hutumika pale ambapo halipo linalofanana kabisa, na hilo linasemwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkadiriaji huu unahitaji nini\u003C/span\u003E, vitu vichache vinakuja kwanza: &quot;Short by 120 EA&quot;, &quot;Lead time 21 days&quot;, &quot;On backorder&quot;, &quot;Unit differs&quot;, &quot;No stock figure&quot; au &quot;In stock&quot;. Hitaji linajumuisha upotevu. Kitengo cha msambazaji ambacho si cha makadirio (tani dhidi ya futi) kinaripotiwa na hakilinganishwi kamwe. Kila safu ina \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua kipengee\u003C/span\u003E, kinachokupeleka kwenye kipengee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWeka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuda mrefu zaidi unaokubalika (siku)\u003C/span\u003E (chaguo-msingi 14). Kipengee ambacho hakipo kwenye hisa na kinasubiri zaidi ya hapo kinaalamishwa, na muhtasari unataja muda mrefu zaidi wa kusubiri unaojali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrodha ya kuagiza (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E inapakua vipengee vilivyo pungufu, pamoja na kiasi kinachokosekana, msambazaji na muda wa kusubiri. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAcha nje\u003C/span\u003E inaondoa hitaji kutoka kwenye ukaguzi (ni hatua ya kutendua).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lahajedwali-na-maktaba-ya-bei\"\u003ELahajedwali na Maktaba ya bei\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOrodha ya msambazaji inaweza kuwa kitabu cha Excel (.xlsx) pamoja na CSV: laha ya kwanza inasomwa, kwa majina ya safu yale yale. Fomula hazitekelezwi kamwe; thamani iliyo kwenye faili ndiyo inayosomwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaili lenye bei likishaongezwa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBei kwenye Maktaba\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kisanduku cha mazungumzo huweka bei ya nyenzo ya kila ingizo la \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003EMaktaba\u003C/a\u003E ambalo faili linaweka bei: jina lile lile, na kitengo kinacholingana (au kisichosemwa). Kazi, upotevu, urefu na mikusanyiko vinabaki kama vilivyo, na dokezo la ingizo linasema faili lilikotoka bei hiyo. Ingizo lenye mita halipewi bei kutoka orodha ya futi, na lisilo na jina linalofanana linaachwa; mstari wa hali unasema ni wangapi waliruka kwa sababu ya kitengo. Panga bei upya kutoka kwenye Maktaba ili kuleta bei mpya kwenye ukadiriaji huu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwenye-paneli-ya-matatizo\"\u003EKwenye paneli ya Matatizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUpungufu ni onyo na muda mrefu wa kusubiri ni kidokezo, kwenye paneli ya pamoja ya Matatizo (&quot;Hisa ya msambazaji&quot;), zikiwa pamoja na ukaguzi mwingine wote. Unaweza kukubali moja kwa sababu, na ukubali huo unahifadhiwa kwenye ukadiriaji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pamoja-na-msaidizi-wako\"\u003EPamoja na msaidizi wako\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkiruhusu wasaidizi kwenye Mipangilio, wanaweza kusoma ukaguzi (supply_check). Kuongeza faili la msambazaji ni kazi yako.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jambo-la-kujua\"\u003EJambo la kujua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakwimu za hisa ni za kisasa kama faili unalloongeza tu. Ongeza faili tena ili kulisasisha: faili lenye jina lile lile linachukua nafasi ya lile la awali.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ugavi kwenye upau wa zana (lori) hulinganisha kile ukadiriaji wako unachohitaji na orodha ya hisa ya msambazaji. Safu za msambazaji zinazohusika zinahifadhiwa kwenye faili la ukadiriaji lenyewe. Hakuna kinachotumwa popote wala hakuna anayeulizwa msambazaji: wewe unaleta faili. Faili Faili la CSV lenye safu ya vichwa. Linahitaji safu ya jina au SKU na safu ya hisa au muda wa kusubiri. Vichwa hivi vinatambuliwa (mpangilio wowote, herufi kubwa au ndogo zote): Item, Name, Description au Product; SKU, Part au Item #; In stock, On hand, Available au Quantity; Lead time au Delivery days; Unit au UOM; Price au Cost; Supplier au Vendor. Hisa inaweza kuwa namba (1,200), \"In stock\" au \"Out of stock\". Muda wa kusubiri unaweza kuwa \"5 days\", \"2 weeks\", \"2-3 weeks\" (ile ndefu zaidi inatumika), \"3 months\", \"same day\" au \"backorder\". Namba tupu iko katika kitengo cha kichwa (siku, isipokuwa kichwa kisema wiki au miezi). Faili za Excel hazisomwi: hifadhi laha kama CSV kwanza. Kagua ukadiriaji Chagua Ugavi, kisha Ongeza faili la msambazaji… na uchague CSV. Unaweza kuongeza zaidi ya moja: hadi faili tano, safu 2,000 zinazohifadhiwa kwa jumla, zile zinazolingana na vipengee vyako kwanza. Kila kipengee, sharti la pili na sehemu ya mkusanyiko yenye kiasi hulinganishwa na safu moja kwa jina, au kwa SKU iliyo kwenye jina lake. Jina linalofanana (moja ndani ya jingine) hutumika pale ambapo halipo linalofanana kabisa, na hilo linasemwa. Chini ya Ukadiriaji huu unahitaji nini, vitu vichache vinakuja kwanza: \"Short by 120 EA\", \"Lead time 21 days\", \"On backorder\", \"Unit differs\", \"No stock figure\" au \"In stock\". Hitaji linajumuisha upotevu. Kitengo cha msambazaji ambacho si cha makadirio (tani dhidi ya futi) kinaripotiwa na hakilinganishwi kamwe. Kila safu ina Chagua kipengee, kinachokupeleka kwenye kipengee. Weka Muda mrefu zaidi unaokubalika (siku) (chaguo-msingi 14). Kipengee ambacho hakipo kwenye hisa na kinasubiri zaidi ya hapo kinaalamishwa, na muhtasari unataja muda mrefu zaidi wa kusubiri unaojali. Orodha ya kuagiza (CSV) inapakua vipengee vilivyo pungufu, pamoja na kiasi kinachokosekana, msambazaji na muda wa kusubiri. Acha nje inaondoa hitaji kutoka kwenye ukaguzi (ni hatua ya kutendua). Lahajedwali na Maktaba ya bei Orodha ya msambazaji inaweza kuwa kitabu cha Excel (.xlsx) pamoja na CSV: laha ya kwanza inasomwa, kwa majina ya safu yale yale. Fomula hazitekelezwi kamwe; thamani iliyo kwenye faili ndiyo inayosomwa. Faili lenye bei likishaongezwa, Bei kwenye Maktaba kwenye kisanduku cha mazungumzo huweka bei ya nyenzo ya kila ingizo la Maktaba ambalo faili linaweka bei: jina lile lile, na kitengo kinacholingana (au kisichosemwa). Kazi, upotevu, urefu na mikusanyiko vinabaki kama vilivyo, na dokezo la ingizo linasema faili lilikotoka bei hiyo. Ingizo lenye mita halipewi bei kutoka orodha ya futi, na lisilo na jina linalofanana linaachwa; mstari wa hali unasema ni wangapi waliruka kwa sababu ya kitengo. Panga bei upya kutoka kwenye Maktaba ili kuleta bei mpya kwenye ukadiriaji huu. Kwenye paneli ya Matatizo Upungufu ni onyo na muda mrefu wa kusubiri ni kidokezo, kwenye paneli ya pamoja ya Matatizo (\"Hisa ya msambazaji\"), zikiwa pamoja na ukaguzi mwingine wote. Unaweza kukubali moja kwa sababu, na ukubali huo unahifadhiwa kwenye ukadiriaji. Pamoja na msaidizi wako Ukiruhusu wasaidizi kwenye Mipangilio, wanaweza kusoma ukaguzi (supply_check). Kuongeza faili la msambazaji ni kazi yako. Jambo la kujua Takwimu za hisa ni za kisasa kama faili unalloongeza tu. Ongeza faili tena ili kulisasisha: faili lenye jina lile lile linachukua nafasi ya lile la awali.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"copy-paste","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Nakili, bandika na rudufu alama","summary":"Nakili alama pamoja na vipengee vyake, bandika mahali unapobofya au mahali pale pale kwenye karatasi nyingine, rudufu, kata, futa na chagua zote, kila moja ikiwa hatua moja ya kutendua.","section":"tasks","order":75,"keywords":["nakili","bandika","kata","rudufu","bandika mahali pale","ubao wa kunakili","chagua zote","ondoa uteuzi","alama nyingi","sakafu ya kawaida","rudia","mpango ule ule","karatasi nyingine","nakili kipengee","rudufu kipengee"],"headings":[{"id":"chagua-alama","text":"Chagua alama","level":2},{"id":"nakili-na-bandika-unapobofya","text":"Nakili na bandika unapobofya","level":2},{"id":"bandika-mahali-pale","text":"Bandika mahali pale","level":2},{"id":"kipimo-lazima-kilingane","text":"Kipimo lazima kilingane","level":2},{"id":"rudufu","text":"Rudufu","level":2},{"id":"kata-na-futa","text":"Kata na futa","level":2},{"id":"nakili-kipengee","text":"Nakili kipengee","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKikundi cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana kina \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E. Menyu yake ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ina zilizobaki, kila moja na kitufe chake: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste in place\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect all\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect none\u003C/span\u003E. Kila moja kati yake ni hatua moja ya kutendua kwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chagua-alama\"\u003EChagua alama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) kisha ubofye alama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na ubofye alama zaidi ili kuziongeza. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bofya kwenye alama iliyochaguliwa huiondoa tena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAu bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect all\u003C/span\u003E) kuchukua alama zote kwenye karatasi iliyo wazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlama kadhaa zikiwa zimechaguliwa, paneli ya kulia inaonyesha \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama zilizochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E: idadi ya kila kipengee, pamoja na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete marks\u003C/span\u003E. Vishikio vya kona vinaonekana tu alama moja inapochaguliwa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect none\u003C/span\u003E) hufuta uteuzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nakili-na-bandika-unapobofya\"\u003ENakili na bandika unapobofya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua alama kisha bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E). Alama zinanakiliwa pamoja na vipengee vyake, ikiwemo mkusanyiko, upotevu na gharama za kila kipengee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENenda kwenye karatasi unayotaka ziwepo (inaweza kuwa karatasi ile ile).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E). Nakala yenye mistari-mistari inafuata kielekezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya mahali inapokwenda. Katikati ya alama zilizonakiliwa inatua kwenye kielekezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inaghairi na haiongezi chochote. Alama zilizobandikwa zinachaguliwa baadaye, hivyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huziondoa tena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENdani ya ukadiriaji ule ule, alama zilizobandikwa zinaenda kwenye \u003Cstrong\u003Evipengee vile vile\u003C/strong\u003E, hivyo kiasi chake kinaongezwa kwenye vipengee hivyo. Kwenye ukadiriaji mwingine (kichupo kingine, au baada ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E), kipengee chenye jina na aina ile ile kinatumika; vinginevyo kipengee kinaongezwa pamoja na mkusanyiko wake. Jina likichukuliwa na kipengee cha aina nyingine, kipengee kilichoongezwa kinaitwa &quot;(jina) (nakala)&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlama zilizobandikwa zinaingia kwenye eneo la zabuni lililochaguliwa juu ya paneli ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E (au bila eneo lolote). Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EMaeneo ya zabuni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bandika-mahali-pale\"\u003EBandika mahali pale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste in place\u003C/span\u003E) huweka nakala mahali pale pale kabisa kwenye karatasi iliyo wazi, kwa nafasi yake kwenye ukurasa. Itumie kwa sakafu ya kawaida: pima ghorofa ya 2, nakili, fungua ghorofa ya 3, kisha bandika mahali pale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBandika mahali pale linahitaji karatasi ya \u003Cstrong\u003Eukubwa uleule\u003C/strong\u003E kama ile uliyonakili. Kwenye karatasi ya ukubwa mwingine TakeoffDesk inasema hivyo na haibandiki chochote; tumia \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E na ubofye badala yake. Kwenye karatasi uliyonakili, nakala inatua juu ya asili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kipimo-lazima-kilingane\"\u003EKipimo lazima kilingane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUrefu na maeneo hutegemea kipimo cha karatasi. Mstari unaopima 10&#039; kwa 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; ungepima 20&#039; kwenye karatasi ya 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;. Kwa hiyo TakeoffDesk inabandika mistari na maeneo tu kwenye karatasi yenye \u003Cstrong\u003Ekipimo kilekile\u003C/strong\u003E kama karatasi ilikotoka, na inasema wazi haifanyi hivyo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaratasi iliyo wazi bado haina kipimo: ipe kwanza (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EWeka kipimo\u003C/a\u003E), kisha bandika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaratasi iliyo wazi ina kipimo kingine: ujumbe unataja vipimo vyote viwili. Bandika kwenye karatasi yenye kipimo sawa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHesabu hazihitaji kipimo: hesabu zilizonakiliwa zinabandikwa popote.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rudufu\"\u003ERudufu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E) hunakili alama zilizochaguliwa na kuweka nakala kwenye kielekezi mara moja; bofya mahali inapokwenda. Hakuna kinachoongezwa hadi ubofye, na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E haiachi chochote. Kurudufu hakubadilishi kile \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E inachobandika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kata-na-futa\"\u003EKata na futa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E) hunakili alama zilizochaguliwa kisha kuzifuta. Zibandike mahali zinapostahili, au tendua kukata.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E) hufuta alama zilizochaguliwa bila kuzinakili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nakili-kipengee\"\u003ENakili kipengee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMhariri wa kipengee (chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EVipengee\u003C/strong\u003E) unaishia na:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy item\u003C/span\u003E: hunakili kipengee pamoja na mkusanyiko wake, upotevu na gharama, bila alama. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E kisha huongeza nakala yake kwenye ukadiriaji huu, au kwenye mwingine.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate item\u003C/span\u003E: huongeza nakala mara moja, ikiitwa &quot;(jina) (nakala)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENakala inabaki kwenye kompyuta hii: inahifadhiwa kwenye kichupo hiki na kwenye hifadhi ya kivinjari, hivyo kichupo kingine cha TakeoffDesk kinaweza kuibandika. Hakuna kinachopakiwa, na ubao wa kunakili wa mfumo hautumiki, kwa hiyo huwezi kubandika alama kwenye programu nyingine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENakala inatoka karatasi moja kwa wakati mmoja. Alama zinabandikwa jinsi zilivyo: bado hakuna kuzungusha wala kuakisi nakala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Kikundi cha Edit kwenye upau wa zana kina Undo, Redo, Copy na Paste. Menyu yake ya More ina zilizobaki, kila moja na kitufe chake: Cut, Copy, Paste, Paste in place, Duplicate, Delete, Select all na Select none. Kila moja kati yake ni hatua moja ya kutendua kwa Ctrl+Z. Chagua alama Chagua Select (V) kisha ubofye alama. Shikilia Shift na ubofye alama zaidi ili kuziongeza. Shift + bofya kwenye alama iliyochaguliwa huiondoa tena. Au bonyeza Ctrl+A (Select all) kuchukua alama zote kwenye karatasi iliyo wazi. Alama kadhaa zikiwa zimechaguliwa, paneli ya kulia inaonyesha Alama zilizochaguliwa: idadi ya kila kipengee, pamoja na Copy, Duplicate, Cut na Delete marks. Vishikio vya kona vinaonekana tu alama moja inapochaguliwa. Esc (Select none) hufuta uteuzi. Nakili na bandika unapobofya Chagua alama kisha bonyeza Ctrl+C (Copy). Alama zinanakiliwa pamoja na vipengee vyake, ikiwemo mkusanyiko, upotevu na gharama za kila kipengee. Nenda kwenye karatasi unayotaka ziwepo (inaweza kuwa karatasi ile ile). Bonyeza Ctrl+V (Paste). Nakala yenye mistari-mistari inafuata kielekezi. Bofya mahali inapokwenda. Katikati ya alama zilizonakiliwa inatua kwenye kielekezi. Esc inaghairi na haiongezi chochote. Alama zilizobandikwa zinachaguliwa baadaye, hivyo Delete au Ctrl+Z huziondoa tena. Ndani ya ukadiriaji ule ule, alama zilizobandikwa zinaenda kwenye vipengee vile vile, hivyo kiasi chake kinaongezwa kwenye vipengee hivyo. Kwenye ukadiriaji mwingine (kichupo kingine, au baada ya New), kipengee chenye jina na aina ile ile kinatumika; vinginevyo kipengee kinaongezwa pamoja na mkusanyiko wake. Jina likichukuliwa na kipengee cha aina nyingine, kipengee kilichoongezwa kinaitwa \"(jina) (nakala)\". Alama zilizobandikwa zinaingia kwenye eneo la zabuni lililochaguliwa juu ya paneli ya Items (au bila eneo lolote). Angalia Maeneo ya zabuni. Bandika mahali pale Ctrl+Shift+V (Paste in place) huweka nakala mahali pale pale kabisa kwenye karatasi iliyo wazi, kwa nafasi yake kwenye ukurasa. Itumie kwa sakafu ya kawaida: pima ghorofa ya 2, nakili, fungua ghorofa ya 3, kisha bandika mahali pale. Bandika mahali pale linahitaji karatasi ya ukubwa uleule kama ile uliyonakili. Kwenye karatasi ya ukubwa mwingine TakeoffDesk inasema hivyo na haibandiki chochote; tumia Paste na ubofye badala yake. Kwenye karatasi uliyonakili, nakala inatua juu ya asili. Kipimo lazima kilingane Urefu na maeneo hutegemea kipimo cha karatasi. Mstari unaopima 10' kwa 1/4\" = 1'-0\" ungepima 20' kwenye karatasi ya 1/8\" = 1'-0\". Kwa hiyo TakeoffDesk inabandika mistari na maeneo tu kwenye karatasi yenye kipimo kilekile kama karatasi ilikotoka, na inasema wazi haifanyi hivyo: Karatasi iliyo wazi bado haina kipimo: ipe kwanza (Weka kipimo), kisha bandika. Karatasi iliyo wazi ina kipimo kingine: ujumbe unataja vipimo vyote viwili. Bandika kwenye karatasi yenye kipimo sawa. Hesabu hazihitaji kipimo: hesabu zilizonakiliwa zinabandikwa popote. Rudufu Ctrl+D (Duplicate) hunakili alama zilizochaguliwa na kuweka nakala kwenye kielekezi mara moja; bofya mahali inapokwenda. Hakuna kinachoongezwa hadi ubofye, na Esc haiachi chochote. Kurudufu hakubadilishi kile Paste inachobandika. Kata na futa Ctrl+X (Cut) hunakili alama zilizochaguliwa kisha kuzifuta. Zibandike mahali zinapostahili, au tendua kukata. Delete au Backspace (Delete) hufuta alama zilizochaguliwa bila kuzinakili. Nakili kipengee Mhariri wa kipengee (chini ya Vipengee) unaishia na: Copy item: hunakili kipengee pamoja na mkusanyiko wake, upotevu na gharama, bila alama. Paste kisha huongeza nakala yake kwenye ukadiriaji huu, au kwenye mwingine. Duplicate item: huongeza nakala mara moja, ikiitwa \"(jina) (nakala)\". Nakala inabaki kwenye kompyuta hii: inahifadhiwa kwenye kichupo hiki na kwenye hifadhi ya kivinjari, hivyo kichupo kingine cha TakeoffDesk kinaweza kuibandika. Hakuna kinachopakiwa, na ubao wa kunakili wa mfumo hautumiki, kwa hiyo huwezi kubandika alama kwenye programu nyingine. Nakala inatoka karatasi moja kwa wakati mmoja. Alama zinabandikwa jinsi zilivyo: bado hakuna kuzungusha wala kuakisi nakala.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"carbon-and-5d-prices","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kaboni iliyomo ndani na jedwali la bei la 5D","summary":"Kaboni hujumlisha kaboni iliyomo ndani ya ukadiriaji kutoka kwa kiasi cha kila kipengee na jedwali wazi la vigezo, kisha hutuma viwango vya ukadiriaji kwa BimCraft kama jedwali la bei kwa gharama za 5D.","section":"tasks","order":76,"keywords":["kaboni","kaboni iliyomo ndani","kgco2e","co2","vigezo","A1-A3","usafirishaji","upotevu","5d","jedwali la bei","gharama","bimcraft","EPD"],"headings":[{"id":"kaboni-iliyomo-ndani","text":"Kaboni iliyomo ndani","level":2},{"id":"jedwali-la-bei-kwa-gharama-za-5d","text":"Jedwali la bei kwa gharama za 5D","level":2},{"id":"pamoja-na-msaidizi-wako","text":"Pamoja na msaidizi wako","level":2},{"id":"jambo-la-kujua","text":"Jambo la kujua","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaboni\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana huongeza kaboni iliyomo ndani ya kile ulichopima, na kugeuza viwango vyako kuwa jedwali la bei ambalo modeli ya jengo inaweza kutumia. Ni makadirio, si tathmini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaboni-iliyomo-ndani\"\u003EKaboni iliyomo ndani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiasi cha kila kipengee, pamoja na upotevu wake, kinazidishwa kwa safu ya jedwali la vigezo. Safu inalinganishwa kwa maneno ya jina la kipengee (&quot;concrete slab&quot; hupata safu yenye neno kuu concrete). Jedwali ni lile lile wazi linalotumiwa na BimCraft, kwa hivyo faili unalopakia hapa hufanya kazi huko pia. \u003Cstrong\u003ESafu zinazokuja na programu ni thamani za kuanzia: za jumla, hazijakaguliwa na si kutoka hifadhidata yoyote.\u003C/strong\u003E Kisanduku cha mazungumzo kinasema hivyo kando ya takwimu; zibadilishe kwa chanzo chako mwenyewe kabla ya kutegemea namba yoyote.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaboni\u003C/span\u003E. Vipengee vilivyohesabiwa vinaorodheshwa pamoja na kilo zao za CO2e; jumla iko juu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWeka alama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA4 usafirishaji\u003C/span\u003E au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA5 taka za eneo la kazi\u003C/span\u003E ili kuhesabu hatua hizo pia, kwa safu zinazotoa takwimu zake. Hatua ya uzalishaji daima huhesabiwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIli kutumia safu nyingine kwa kipengee, au hakuna, tumia orodha iliyo kwenye mstari wake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVigezo kutoka faili…\u003C/span\u003E hupakia jedwali la vigezo (JSON au CSV) lililotengenezwa kutoka chanzo chako mwenyewe; safu zake zinachukua nafasi ya safu za kuanzia zenye kitambulisho kilekile. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVigezo (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E huhifadhi lako.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKigezo ni kwa mita, mita ya mraba, mita ya ujazo, kipengee au kilo. Mstari uliopimwa kwa futi au futi za mraba unabadilishwa. Kigezo cha kilo kinahitaji ujazo (yadi za ujazo au mita) na msongamano wa safu. Kipengee ambacho kigezo chake kinahitaji kiasi ambacho hakipimi kinaorodheshwa chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImeachwa\u003C/span\u003E pamoja na sababu, na hakikadiriwi kamwe. Jumla inayoendelea kwenye upau wa hali inaonyesha takwimu hiyo hiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafu zako za vigezo, chaguo zako na hatua unazohesabu zinahifadhiwa kwenye faili la ukadiriaji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jedwali-la-bei-kwa-gharama-za-5d\"\u003EJedwali la bei kwa gharama za 5D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBei 5D (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBei 5D (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E huhifadhi viwango vya ukadiriaji kama jedwali la bei: safu moja kwa kila kipengee chenye bei, pamoja na kiwango chake cha nyenzo na kazi kwa kila kitengo na upotevu wake. Lipakie kwenye paneli ya gharama ya BimCraft (Kaboni iliyomo ndani na gharama ya 5D) ili kupanga bei ya kazi za modeli ya jengo kwa viwango vilevile vilivyotengeneza zabuni. Vipengee vilivyopimwa kwa kitengo ambacho jedwali halina, na vipengee visivyo na kiwango, vinaachwa nje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pamoja-na-msaidizi-wako\"\u003EPamoja na msaidizi wako\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkiruhusu wasaidizi kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E, wanaweza kusoma kaboni (carbon_check). Kupakia vigezo ni kazi yako mwenyewe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jambo-la-kujua\"\u003EJambo la kujua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHakuna kinachotumwa popote. Takwimu ni nzuri tu kama vigezo unavyopakia.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kaboni kwenye upau wa zana huongeza kaboni iliyomo ndani ya kile ulichopima, na kugeuza viwango vyako kuwa jedwali la bei ambalo modeli ya jengo inaweza kutumia. Ni makadirio, si tathmini. Kaboni iliyomo ndani Kiasi cha kila kipengee, pamoja na upotevu wake, kinazidishwa kwa safu ya jedwali la vigezo. Safu inalinganishwa kwa maneno ya jina la kipengee (\"concrete slab\" hupata safu yenye neno kuu concrete). Jedwali ni lile lile wazi linalotumiwa na BimCraft, kwa hivyo faili unalopakia hapa hufanya kazi huko pia. Safu zinazokuja na programu ni thamani za kuanzia: za jumla, hazijakaguliwa na si kutoka hifadhidata yoyote. Kisanduku cha mazungumzo kinasema hivyo kando ya takwimu; zibadilishe kwa chanzo chako mwenyewe kabla ya kutegemea namba yoyote. Chagua Kaboni. Vipengee vilivyohesabiwa vinaorodheshwa pamoja na kilo zao za CO2e; jumla iko juu. Weka alama A4 usafirishaji au A5 taka za eneo la kazi ili kuhesabu hatua hizo pia, kwa safu zinazotoa takwimu zake. Hatua ya uzalishaji daima huhesabiwa. Ili kutumia safu nyingine kwa kipengee, au hakuna, tumia orodha iliyo kwenye mstari wake. Vigezo kutoka faili… hupakia jedwali la vigezo (JSON au CSV) lililotengenezwa kutoka chanzo chako mwenyewe; safu zake zinachukua nafasi ya safu za kuanzia zenye kitambulisho kilekile. Vigezo (JSON) huhifadhi lako. Kigezo ni kwa mita, mita ya mraba, mita ya ujazo, kipengee au kilo. Mstari uliopimwa kwa futi au futi za mraba unabadilishwa. Kigezo cha kilo kinahitaji ujazo (yadi za ujazo au mita) na msongamano wa safu. Kipengee ambacho kigezo chake kinahitaji kiasi ambacho hakipimi kinaorodheshwa chini ya Imeachwa pamoja na sababu, na hakikadiriwi kamwe. Jumla inayoendelea kwenye upau wa hali inaonyesha takwimu hiyo hiyo. Safu zako za vigezo, chaguo zako na hatua unazohesabu zinahifadhiwa kwenye faili la ukadiriaji. Jedwali la bei kwa gharama za 5D Bei 5D (JSON) na Bei 5D (CSV) huhifadhi viwango vya ukadiriaji kama jedwali la bei: safu moja kwa kila kipengee chenye bei, pamoja na kiwango chake cha nyenzo na kazi kwa kila kitengo na upotevu wake. Lipakie kwenye paneli ya gharama ya BimCraft (Kaboni iliyomo ndani na gharama ya 5D) ili kupanga bei ya kazi za modeli ya jengo kwa viwango vilevile vilivyotengeneza zabuni. Vipengee vilivyopimwa kwa kitengo ambacho jedwali halina, na vipengee visivyo na kiwango, vinaachwa nje. Pamoja na msaidizi wako Ukiruhusu wasaidizi kwenye Mipangilio, wanaweza kusoma kaboni (carbon_check). Kupakia vigezo ni kazi yako mwenyewe. Jambo la kujua Hakuna kinachotumwa popote. Takwimu ni nzuri tu kama vigezo unavyopakia.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"tag-schedule","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Leta jedwali la lebo kama viwango","summary":"Jedwali la lebo lililotolewa kutoka kwenye modeli ya jengo (CSV) linakuwa viwango vyenye aina katika ukadiriaji, kimoja kwa kila lebo, ili hesabu na maeneo ya modeli yakae pembeni ya ulichopima.","section":"tasks","order":77,"keywords":["lebo","jedwali la lebo","modeli ya jengo","bimcraft","ifc","viwango","csv","jedwali","kuleta","kiasi chenye aina"],"headings":[{"id":"jambo-la-kujua","text":"Jambo la kujua","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELebo\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana huleta jedwali la lebo ambalo BimCraft ilihifadhi kama faili la CSV. Kila lebo tofauti inakuwa kiasi chenye aina, aina ile ile ambayo kukata na kujaza vya CivilCraft vinakuwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye BimCraft, tengeneza jedwali la lebo unalotaka na uhifadhi kama CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELebo\u003C/span\u003E kisha uchague faili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESema ni safu ipi inataja mstari (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaja mstari kwa\u003C/span\u003E, kwa kawaida lebo) na ipi inashikilia namba (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKiwango kutoka\u003C/span\u003E). Kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu safu\u003C/span\u003E, kila safu inahesabiwa kama moja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua kitengo. Urefu wa milimita unakuwa mita kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZidisha kwa\u003C/span\u003E 0.001.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza viwango\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafu zenye lebo sawa zinaongezwa pamoja. Kisanduku ambacho si namba kinaachwa na kuhesabiwa kwenye muhtasari. Kuleta jedwali lile lile tena kunasasisha viwango ulivyonavyo tayari badala ya kuongeza zaidi; majina, viwango na upotevu wake vinabaki vyako.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jambo-la-kujua\"\u003EJambo la kujua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiasi chenye aina hakipimwi kwenye karatasi, kwa hivyo hakina alama. Hakuna kinachotumwa popote; faili linasomwa hapa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lebo kwenye upau wa zana huleta jedwali la lebo ambalo BimCraft ilihifadhi kama faili la CSV. Kila lebo tofauti inakuwa kiasi chenye aina, aina ile ile ambayo kukata na kujaza vya CivilCraft vinakuwa. Kwenye BimCraft, tengeneza jedwali la lebo unalotaka na uhifadhi kama CSV. Chagua Lebo kisha uchague faili. Sema ni safu ipi inataja mstari (Taja mstari kwa, kwa kawaida lebo) na ipi inashikilia namba (Kiwango kutoka). Kwa Hesabu safu, kila safu inahesabiwa kama moja. Chagua kitengo. Urefu wa milimita unakuwa mita kwa Zidisha kwa 0.001. Ongeza viwango. Safu zenye lebo sawa zinaongezwa pamoja. Kisanduku ambacho si namba kinaachwa na kuhesabiwa kwenye muhtasari. Kuleta jedwali lile lile tena kunasasisha viwango ulivyonavyo tayari badala ya kuongeza zaidi; majina, viwango na upotevu wake vinabaki vyako. Jambo la kujua Kiasi chenye aina hakipimwi kwenye karatasi, kwa hivyo hakina alama. Hakuna kinachotumwa popote; faili linasomwa hapa.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"assemblies","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Mikusanyiko na fomula","summary":"Ongeza sehemu kwenye kipengee na acha fomula zibadilishe urefu, eneo au idadi yake kuwa vijiti, bamba, karatasi za bodi, zege na vifaa, pamoja na mfano wa ukuta uliokamilika.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["mkusanyiko","sehemu","fomula","vijiti","ukuta wa bodi","karatasi","bamba","zege","yadi za ujazo","vifaa vya kufungia","mapishi","kawaida","sehemu za kipengee"],"headings":[{"id":"vigezo-unavyoweza-kutumia","text":"Vigezo unavyoweza kutumia","level":2},{"id":"mfano-uliokamilika-ukuta-wa-ndani","text":"Mfano uliokamilika: ukuta wa ndani","level":2},{"id":"fomula-zaidi","text":"Fomula zaidi","level":2},{"id":"fomula-inapokuwa-si-sahihi","text":"Fomula inapokuwa si sahihi","level":2},{"id":"mipaka","text":"Mipaka","level":2},{"id":"ondoa-sehemu","text":"Ondoa sehemu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMkusanyiko\u003C/strong\u003E wa kipengee ni orodha ya sehemu, kila moja ikiwa na fomula yake ya kiasi pamoja na upotevu na viwango vyake. Fomula hutumia jumla zilizopimwa za kipengee, kwa hiyo ukadiriaji mmoja wa ukuta hukupa vijiti, bamba na bodi kwa wakati mmoja, na hujisasisha unapopima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vigezo-unavyoweza-kutumia\"\u003EVigezo unavyoweza kutumia\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAina ya kipengee\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVigezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E urefu, \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E kimo, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E eneo la ukuta (L × H), \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E idadi ya mistari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E eneo, \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E mzingo (mpaka + matundu yaliyokatwa), \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E kina au unene, \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E idadi ya maeneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHesabu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E hesabu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThamani ziko katika vitengo vya kipengee chenyewe: futi na futi za mraba kwa vipengee vya LF na SF, mita na mita za mraba kwa vipengee vya m na m². Kwa kipengee cha SY, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E iko katika yadi za mraba huku \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E na \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E zikibaki katika futi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFomula hutumia \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E (au × ÷), mabano, nambari, na vitendakazi \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emax\u003C/code\u003E na \u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E. Kanuni kamili ziko katika \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003ELugha ya fomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mfano-uliokamilika-ukuta-wa-ndani\"\u003EMfano uliokamilika: ukuta wa ndani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChukulia umepima \u003Cstrong\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/strong\u003E kama kipengee cha mstari: mistari 4 yenye jumla ya LF 120, na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimo\u003C/span\u003E imewekwa \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Thamani zake za \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E zinasomeka L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF ya ukuta, uso mmoja).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua kipengee chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKatika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMkusanyiko\u003C/span\u003E, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza sehemu\u003C/span\u003E. Sehemu inayoitwa &quot;Kijenzi&quot; inaonekana, yenye fomula \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E na matokeo yake chini yake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAndika \u003Ccode\u003EStuds 16 in o.c.\u003C/code\u003E katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJina\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKitengo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKatika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFomula ya kiasi\u003C/span\u003E, andika \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E. Matokeo yanajisasisha unapoandika: &quot;= 94 EA&quot;. Hiyo ni kijiti kimoja kila inchi 16 kwenye urefu wa futi 120 (90), pamoja na kimoja cha ziada cha kufunga kila mstari kati ya 4.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza sehemu\u003C/span\u003E tena kwa bamba: taja \u003Ccode\u003EPlates, top and bottom\u003C/code\u003E, kitengo \u003Ccode\u003ELF\u003C/code\u003E, fomula \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2\u003C/code\u003E. Matokeo: 240 LF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOngeza bodi: jina \u003Ccode\u003EGypsum board 4x8, both sides\u003C/code\u003E, kitengo \u003Ccode\u003Esheets\u003C/code\u003E, fomula \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32)\u003C/code\u003E. Matokeo: karatasi 68 (SF 2,160 za bodi ÷ SF 32 kwa karatasi = 67.5, ikazungushwa juu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJaza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpotevu %\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENyenzo $\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKazi $\u003C/span\u003E ya kila sehemu. Kila sehemu hupata safu yake chini ya kipengee katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E, inawekwa bei kama kipengee, na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJumla ya kazi\u003C/span\u003E inaijumuisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkiwa gharama yote ya ukuta iko kwenye sehemu, acha viwango vya nyenzo na kazi vya kipengee chenyewe kuwa 0, la sivyo itahesabiwa mara mbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUpotevu hutumika baada ya fomula na haukuzungushwa: karatasi 68 zenye upotevu wa 10% ni karatasi 74.8. Ili kuagiza karatasi nzima, weka upotevu ndani ya fomula, kama \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1)\u003C/code\u003E, na acha upotevu wa sehemu uwe 0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fomula-zaidi\"\u003EFomula zaidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKipengee\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFomula\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVijiti vya inchi 24 katikati\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 2) + N\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBlanketi za insulation, SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari wenye kimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERangi, pande zote mbili, galoni kwa SF 350\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari wenye kimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 350)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKatoni za vigae kwa SF 15, ziada 10%\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 1.1 / 15)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkingo wa msingi au pembezoni, LF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZege, yadi za ujazo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo lenye kina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZege iliyozungushwa juu hadi robo yadi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo lenye kina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBawaba, tatu kwa mlango\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHesabu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAngalau kisanduku kimoja, kimoja kwa kila 12\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHesabu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fomula-inapokuwa-si-sahihi\"\u003EFomula inapokuwa si sahihi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMstari chini ya fomula hugeuka kuwa ujumbe wa hitilafu, kwa mfano \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;X&quot; is not a measured value here. Use L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003EA &quot;)&quot; is missing.\u003C/code\u003E Sehemu hiyo basi haina kiasi, safu yake katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E inaonyesha &quot;Hitilafu ya fomula: …&quot;, na kichwa kinasema &quot;Haijakamilika: hitilafu 1 ya fomula (haimo kwenye jumla)&quot;. Rekebisha fomula na jumla zitasasishwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFomula inayogawanya kwa sifuri nayo ni hitilafu (&quot;Fomula inagawanya kwa sifuri.&quot;), kwa mfano \u003Ccode\u003EA / H\u003C/code\u003E kwenye kipengee kisicho na kina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mipaka\"\u003EMipaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFomula hufanya kazi kwenye \u003Cstrong\u003Ejumla\u003C/strong\u003E za kipengee, si mstari kwa mstari. \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E huongeza kijiti kimoja kwa kila mstari; bado hakuna kuzungusha kwa kila mstari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFomula inaweza kutumia vigezo vya kipengee chake yenyewe tu, si vya kipengee kingine.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHadi sehemu 50 kwa kipengee, herufi 500 kwa fomula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ondoa-sehemu\"\u003EOndoa sehemu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOndoa kijenzi\u003C/span\u003E chini yake. Unaweza kuitendua kwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Mkusanyiko wa kipengee ni orodha ya sehemu, kila moja ikiwa na fomula yake ya kiasi pamoja na upotevu na viwango vyake. Fomula hutumia jumla zilizopimwa za kipengee, kwa hiyo ukadiriaji mmoja wa ukuta hukupa vijiti, bamba na bodi kwa wakati mmoja, na hujisasisha unapopima. Vigezo unavyoweza kutumia Aina ya kipengee Vigezo Mstari L urefu, H kimo, A eneo la ukuta (L × H), N idadi ya mistari Eneo A eneo, P mzingo (mpaka + matundu yaliyokatwa), H kina au unene, N idadi ya maeneo Hesabu N hesabu Thamani ziko katika vitengo vya kipengee chenyewe: futi na futi za mraba kwa vipengee vya LF na SF, mita na mita za mraba kwa vipengee vya m na m². Kwa kipengee cha SY, A iko katika yadi za mraba huku P na H zikibaki katika futi. Fomula hutumia + - * / (au × ÷), mabano, nambari, na vitendakazi ceil, floor, round, min, max na abs. Kanuni kamili ziko katika Lugha ya fomula. Mfano uliokamilika: ukuta wa ndani Chukulia umepima Interior wall type A kama kipengee cha mstari: mistari 4 yenye jumla ya LF 120, na Kimo imewekwa 9'-0\". Thamani zake za Measured zinasomeka L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF ya ukuta, uso mmoja). Chagua kipengee chini ya Vipengee. Katika Mkusanyiko, chagua Ongeza sehemu. Sehemu inayoitwa \"Kijenzi\" inaonekana, yenye fomula L na matokeo yake chini yake. Andika Studs 16 in o.c. katika Jina na EA katika Kitengo. Katika Fomula ya kiasi, andika ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N. Matokeo yanajisasisha unapoandika: \"= 94 EA\". Hiyo ni kijiti kimoja kila inchi 16 kwenye urefu wa futi 120 (90), pamoja na kimoja cha ziada cha kufunga kila mstari kati ya 4. Chagua Ongeza sehemu tena kwa bamba: taja Plates, top and bottom, kitengo LF, fomula L * 2. Matokeo: 240 LF. Ongeza bodi: jina Gypsum board 4x8, both sides, kitengo sheets, fomula ceil(A * 2 / 32). Matokeo: karatasi 68 (SF 2,160 za bodi ÷ SF 32 kwa karatasi = 67.5, ikazungushwa juu). Jaza Upotevu %, Nyenzo $ na Kazi $ ya kila sehemu. Kila sehemu hupata safu yake chini ya kipengee katika Viasi, inawekwa bei kama kipengee, na Jumla ya kazi inaijumuisha. Ikiwa gharama yote ya ukuta iko kwenye sehemu, acha viwango vya nyenzo na kazi vya kipengee chenyewe kuwa 0, la sivyo itahesabiwa mara mbili. Upotevu hutumika baada ya fomula na haukuzungushwa: karatasi 68 zenye upotevu wa 10% ni karatasi 74.8. Ili kuagiza karatasi nzima, weka upotevu ndani ya fomula, kama ceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1), na acha upotevu wa sehemu uwe 0. Fomula zaidi Nini Kipengee Fomula Vijiti vya inchi 24 katikati Mstari ceil(L / 2) + N Blanketi za insulation, SF Mstari wenye kimo A Rangi, pande zote mbili, galoni kwa SF 350 Mstari wenye kimo ceil(A * 2 / 350) Katoni za vigae kwa SF 15, ziada 10% Eneo ceil(A * 1.1 / 15) Ukingo wa msingi au pembezoni, LF Eneo P Zege, yadi za ujazo Eneo lenye kina A * H / 27 Zege iliyozungushwa juu hadi robo yadi Eneo lenye kina ceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4 Bawaba, tatu kwa mlango Hesabu N * 3 Angalau kisanduku kimoja, kimoja kwa kila 12 Hesabu max(1, ceil(N / 12)) Fomula inapokuwa si sahihi Mstari chini ya fomula hugeuka kuwa ujumbe wa hitilafu, kwa mfano \"X\" is not a measured value here. Use L, H, A, N. au A \")\" is missing. Sehemu hiyo basi haina kiasi, safu yake katika Viasi inaonyesha \"Hitilafu ya fomula: …\", na kichwa kinasema \"Haijakamilika: hitilafu 1 ya fomula (haimo kwenye jumla)\". Rekebisha fomula na jumla zitasasishwa. Fomula inayogawanya kwa sifuri nayo ni hitilafu (\"Fomula inagawanya kwa sifuri.\"), kwa mfano A / H kwenye kipengee kisicho na kina. Mipaka Fomula hufanya kazi kwenye jumla za kipengee, si mstari kwa mstari. ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N huongeza kijiti kimoja kwa kila mstari; bado hakuna kuzungusha kwa kila mstari. Fomula inaweza kutumia vigezo vya kipengee chake yenyewe tu, si vya kipengee kingine. Hadi sehemu 50 kwa kipengee, herufi 500 kwa fomula. Ondoa sehemu Chagua Ondoa kijenzi chini yake. Unaweza kuitendua kwa Ctrl+Z.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"price-library","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Maktaba ya bei","summary":"Weka vipengee, viwango na mikusanyiko yako kwenye maktaba, ingiza kutoka CSV au makadirio ya zamani, ongeza vipengee kutoka kwake kwenye ukadiriaji wowote, na usasishe bei za ukadiriaji kutoka kwake.","section":"tasks","order":82,"keywords":["maktaba","vifurushi vya biashara","orodha ya bei","kitabu cha bei","hifadhidata ya gharama","ingiza csv","viwango","mikusanyiko","matumizi upya","vipengee vya kiolezo","sasisha bei","bei upya"],"headings":[{"id":"jaza-maktaba","text":"Jaza maktaba","level":2},{"id":"itumie-kwenye-ukadiriaji","text":"Itumie kwenye ukadiriaji","level":2},{"id":"safu-za-csv","text":"Safu za CSV","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaktaba ya bei\u003C/strong\u003E inashikilia vipengee unavyotumia kazi baada ya kazi: aina yake, kitengo, urefu, upotevu, viwango vya nyenzo na kazi, na mkusanyiko wake. Huhifadhiwa kwenye kivinjari hiki, tofauti na ukadiriaji wowote, kwa hivyo kila ukadiriaji unaoufungua hapa unaweza kuitumia.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfungue kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E juu ya paneli ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jaza-maktaba\"\u003EJaza maktaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport CSV…\u003C/span\u003E husoma lahajedwali iliyohifadhiwa kama CSV (angalia safu hapa chini). Vipengee ambavyo jina na aina yake tayari viko kwenye maktaba vinabadilishwa; vingine vinaongezwa. Safu zisizoweza kusomwa zinaruka, na inasema zipi na kwa nini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd this takeoff&#039;s items\u003C/span\u003E hunakili kila kipengee cha ukadiriaji ulio wazi kwenye maktaba, pamoja na viwango vyake na mkusanyiko wake (si alama zake).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMakadirio ya CSV ambayo TakeoffDesk inahamisha (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EHamisha makadirio\u003C/a\u003E) huingizwa kama yalivyo: bei za kazi iliyopita huwa mwanzo wa kazi inayofuata.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrade packs…\u003C/span\u003E huongeza mikusanyiko ya bure kwa biashara, kama drywall, umeme au zege, bila bei. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003EVifurushi vya biashara\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport CSV\u003C/span\u003E huhifadhi maktaba kama CSV, ili kuweka nakala, kuihariri kwenye lahajedwali au kumpa mwenzako. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear\u003C/span\u003E huifuta yote (bofya mara mbili).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaktaba iko kwenye hifadhi ya kivinjari hiki. Kivinjari kingine, kompyuta nyingine au dirisha la faragha lina yake (au hakuna). Ihamishe ili kuisogeza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"itumie-kwenye-ukadiriaji\"\u003EItumie kwenye ukadiriaji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua vipengee (andika kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind in the library\u003C/span\u003E kupunguza orodha) kisha chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to takeoff\u003C/span\u003E. Vinaongezwa pamoja na mikusanyiko yao kwa hatua moja ambayo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huirudisha. Jina ambalo tayari liko kwenye ukadiriaji hupewa namba, kama \u003Ccode\u003EZulia (2)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdate prices\u003C/span\u003E huwapa vipengee vya ukadiriaji upotevu na viwango vya maktaba, kwa kila kipengee chenye jina na aina inayolingana na kipengee cha maktaba, na vivyo hivyo kwa vipengele vya mkusanyiko vyenye jina sawa. Urefu, vitengo na fomula zinabaki kama zilivyo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E moja inarudisha bei zote za zamani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"safu-za-csv\"\u003ESafu za CSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafu ya kwanza hutaja safu, kwa mpangilio wowote; safu nyingine hazitumiki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESafu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachowekwa ndani yake\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem (au Name)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJina la kipengee. Lazima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EType\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area au Count (LF, SF na EA pia zinafanya kazi). Ikiwa tupu, kitengo ndicho huamua.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF au m; SF, SY au m²; EA. Tupu: kitengo cha kawaida cha aina hiyo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E10%\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial per unit, Labor per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EViwango kama \u003Ccode\u003E2.10\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeight (au Depth)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E, au \u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E kwa vitengo vya metriki.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EComponent, Formula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafu yenye jina la Component (au aina \u003Ccode\u003EComponent\u003C/code\u003E) ni sehemu ya mkusanyiko wa kipengee kilicho juu yake. Kitengo chake, upotevu na viwango ni vyake; fomula yake hutumia herufi za kipengee, angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EMikusanyiko na fomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EItem,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula\nKizigio aina A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9&#039;-0&quot;,,\n,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Vijiti 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N\nSakafu ya VCT,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,,\nSoketi za duplex,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,,\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoma, nukta-koma au tab kati ya safu zote hufanya kazi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Maktaba ya bei inashikilia vipengee unavyotumia kazi baada ya kazi: aina yake, kitengo, urefu, upotevu, viwango vya nyenzo na kazi, na mkusanyiko wake. Huhifadhiwa kwenye kivinjari hiki, tofauti na ukadiriaji wowote, kwa hivyo kila ukadiriaji unaoufungua hapa unaweza kuitumia. Ifungue kwa Library juu ya paneli ya Items. Jaza maktaba Import CSV… husoma lahajedwali iliyohifadhiwa kama CSV (angalia safu hapa chini). Vipengee ambavyo jina na aina yake tayari viko kwenye maktaba vinabadilishwa; vingine vinaongezwa. Safu zisizoweza kusomwa zinaruka, na inasema zipi na kwa nini. Add this takeoff's items hunakili kila kipengee cha ukadiriaji ulio wazi kwenye maktaba, pamoja na viwango vyake na mkusanyiko wake (si alama zake). Makadirio ya CSV ambayo TakeoffDesk inahamisha (Hamisha makadirio) huingizwa kama yalivyo: bei za kazi iliyopita huwa mwanzo wa kazi inayofuata. Trade packs… huongeza mikusanyiko ya bure kwa biashara, kama drywall, umeme au zege, bila bei. Angalia Vifurushi vya biashara. Export CSV huhifadhi maktaba kama CSV, ili kuweka nakala, kuihariri kwenye lahajedwali au kumpa mwenzako. Clear huifuta yote (bofya mara mbili). Maktaba iko kwenye hifadhi ya kivinjari hiki. Kivinjari kingine, kompyuta nyingine au dirisha la faragha lina yake (au hakuna). Ihamishe ili kuisogeza. Itumie kwenye ukadiriaji Chagua vipengee (andika kwenye Find in the library kupunguza orodha) kisha chagua Add to takeoff. Vinaongezwa pamoja na mikusanyiko yao kwa hatua moja ambayo Ctrl+Z huirudisha. Jina ambalo tayari liko kwenye ukadiriaji hupewa namba, kama Zulia (2). Update prices huwapa vipengee vya ukadiriaji upotevu na viwango vya maktaba, kwa kila kipengee chenye jina na aina inayolingana na kipengee cha maktaba, na vivyo hivyo kwa vipengele vya mkusanyiko vyenye jina sawa. Urefu, vitengo na fomula zinabaki kama zilivyo. Ctrl+Z moja inarudisha bei zote za zamani. Safu za CSV Safu ya kwanza hutaja safu, kwa mpangilio wowote; safu nyingine hazitumiki. Safu Kinachowekwa ndani yake Item (au Name) Jina la kipengee. Lazima. Type Linear, Area au Count (LF, SF na EA pia zinafanya kazi). Ikiwa tupu, kitengo ndicho huamua. Unit LF au m; SF, SY au m²; EA. Tupu: kitengo cha kawaida cha aina hiyo. Waste % 10 au 10%. Material per unit, Labor per unit Viwango kama 2.10 au $1,250. Height (au Depth) 9'-0\", 9, au 2.7 kwa vitengo vya metriki. Component, Formula Safu yenye jina la Component (au aina Component) ni sehemu ya mkusanyiko wa kipengee kilicho juu yake. Kitengo chake, upotevu na viwango ni vyake; fomula yake hutumia herufi za kipengee, angalia Mikusanyiko na fomula. Item,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula Kizigio aina A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9'-0\",, ,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Vijiti 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N Sakafu ya VCT,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,, Soketi za duplex,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,, Koma, nukta-koma au tab kati ya safu zote hufanya kazi.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"trade-packs","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Vifurushi vya biashara","summary":"Ongeza mikusanyiko isiyolipishwa ya biashara kwenye maktaba yako ya bei, iondoe kwa hatua moja, na ushiriki maktaba yako mwenyewe kama kifurushi.","section":"tasks","order":83,"keywords":["kifurushi cha biashara","kifurushi","mikusanyiko","violezo","vipengee vya kuanzia","umeme","drywall","fremu","kupaka rangi","zege","sakafu","uashi","paa","siding","useremala","mabomba","hvac","insulation","mandhari","decking","mkandarasi mkuu","csi","masterformat","cc0","ongeza","ondoa","shiriki"],"headings":[{"id":"ongeza-kifurushi","text":"Ongeza kifurushi","level":2},{"id":"ondoa-kifurushi","text":"Ondoa kifurushi","level":2},{"id":"kilicho-ndani-ya-kifurushi","text":"Kilicho ndani ya kifurushi","level":2},{"id":"shiriki-maktaba-yako-kama-kifurushi","text":"Shiriki maktaba yako kama kifurushi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKifurushi cha biashara\u003C/strong\u003E ni seti ya vipengee vilivyotengenezwa tayari kwa biashara moja: kila kimoja kikiwa na kitengo chake, urefu au kina chake, upotevu wake na \u003Cstrong\u003Emkusanyiko\u003C/strong\u003E wake, yaani sehemu na fomula zinazogeuza mstari, eneo au hesabu iliyopimwa kuwa vifaa. Kizigawanyo cha drywall, kwa mfano, kinaleta reli yake, vijiti vya fremu, karatasi, skrubu, mkanda na kiunganishi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVifurushi vinaongezwa kwenye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Emaktaba yako ya bei\u003C/a\u003E, na kutoka hapo unaongeza vipengee vyake kwenye ukadiriaji wowote.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ongeza-kifurushi\"\u003EOngeza kifurushi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktaba\u003C/span\u003E juu ya paneli ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E, kisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVifurushi vya biashara…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVitengo\u003C/span\u003E: imperial (LF, SF), metriki (m, m²) au vyote. Kila mkusanyiko unakuja katika mifumo yote miwili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza\u003C/span\u003E kando ya kifurushi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVipengee vya kifurushi vinaonekana kwenye maktaba, vikiwa na lebo ya jina la kifurushi. Ili kuvitumia, weka tiki kwenye maktaba kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza kwenye ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKifurushi hakileti bei zozote.\u003C/strong\u003E Vipengee vyake vinaonyesha &quot;weka kiwango chako&quot; kwenye maktaba. Viwango ni vyako: viandike kwenye maktaba au kwenye kihariri cha kipengee, au ingiza orodha yako ya bei kama CSV kisha utumie \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESasisha bei\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKama tayari una kipengee chenye jina na aina ile ile kwenye maktaba yako, kifurushi kinaacha chako kama kilivyo. Kuongeza kifurushi tena kunabadilisha vipengee vyake vyenyewe kwa toleo jipya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ondoa-kifurushi\"\u003EOndoa kifurushi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVifurushi vya biashara…\u003C/span\u003E, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOndoa\u003C/span\u003E kando ya kifurushi ulichoongeza, kisha tena mara moja kuthibitisha. Kila kipengee kilichotoka kwake kinaondoka kwenye maktaba kwa hatua moja. Vipengee ulivyoviongeza kwenye ukadiriaji vinabaki kwenye ukadiriaji huo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kilicho-ndani-ya-kifurushi\"\u003EKilicho ndani ya kifurushi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVyanzo na maelezo\u003C/span\u003E chini ya kifurushi ili kuona kila mkusanyiko ulivyoandikwa kutoka: kanuni za ujenzi, viwango, na miongozo ya usakinishaji ya vyama vya biashara. Kwenye maktaba, elekeza kielekezi kwenye kipengee ili kusoma vyanzo vyake na dhana zake, kama nafasi ya vijiti au kiwango cha kusambaa kwa rangi. Zikague dhidi ya kazi yako na karatasi za data za bidhaa zako, na badilisha fomula pale zinapotofautiana (tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EMikusanyiko na fomula\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila kifurushi kimewekwa alama \u003Cstrong\u003EKuanzia: bado hakijakaguliwa na mkadiriaji\u003C/strong\u003E hadi wakadiriaji wanaofanya kazi wakiukagua.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila kipengee pia hubeba nambari yake ya CSI MasterFormat, kama \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shiriki-maktaba-yako-kama-kifurushi\"\u003EShiriki maktaba yako kama kifurushi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha kama kifurushi…\u003C/span\u003E kwenye maktaba huihifadhi kama faili la kifurushi (\u003Ccode\u003E.ccpack.json\u003C/code\u003E) ambalo mtu yeyote anaweza kuliongeza kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua faili la kifurushi…\u003C/span\u003E. Kwa chaguo-msingi huacha vipengee vilivyotoka kwenye vifurushi ulivyoongeza, na havibebi viwango. Weka tiki kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJumuisha viwango vyangu kama viwango vya mfano\u003C/span\u003E ili kutuma viwango vyako pia: vinatumwa vikiwa na lebo ya eneo na tarehe utakayoweka, na yeyote anayeongeza kifurushi anachagua kama atavitumia.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaili za kifurushi ni data tupu tu, si programu. TakeoffDesk inakagua kila sehemu yake kabla ya kuitumia, na inaacha kile isichoweza kusoma.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kifurushi cha biashara ni seti ya vipengee vilivyotengenezwa tayari kwa biashara moja: kila kimoja kikiwa na kitengo chake, urefu au kina chake, upotevu wake na mkusanyiko wake, yaani sehemu na fomula zinazogeuza mstari, eneo au hesabu iliyopimwa kuwa vifaa. Kizigawanyo cha drywall, kwa mfano, kinaleta reli yake, vijiti vya fremu, karatasi, skrubu, mkanda na kiunganishi. Vifurushi vinaongezwa kwenye maktaba yako ya bei, na kutoka hapo unaongeza vipengee vyake kwenye ukadiriaji wowote. Ongeza kifurushi Fungua Maktaba juu ya paneli ya Vipengee, kisha Vifurushi vya biashara…. Chagua Vitengo: imperial (LF, SF), metriki (m, m²) au vyote. Kila mkusanyiko unakuja katika mifumo yote miwili. Chagua Ongeza kando ya kifurushi. Vipengee vya kifurushi vinaonekana kwenye maktaba, vikiwa na lebo ya jina la kifurushi. Ili kuvitumia, weka tiki kwenye maktaba kisha uchague Ongeza kwenye ukadiriaji. Kifurushi hakileti bei zozote. Vipengee vyake vinaonyesha \"weka kiwango chako\" kwenye maktaba. Viwango ni vyako: viandike kwenye maktaba au kwenye kihariri cha kipengee, au ingiza orodha yako ya bei kama CSV kisha utumie Sasisha bei. Kama tayari una kipengee chenye jina na aina ile ile kwenye maktaba yako, kifurushi kinaacha chako kama kilivyo. Kuongeza kifurushi tena kunabadilisha vipengee vyake vyenyewe kwa toleo jipya. Ondoa kifurushi Kwenye Vifurushi vya biashara…, chagua Ondoa kando ya kifurushi ulichoongeza, kisha tena mara moja kuthibitisha. Kila kipengee kilichotoka kwake kinaondoka kwenye maktaba kwa hatua moja. Vipengee ulivyoviongeza kwenye ukadiriaji vinabaki kwenye ukadiriaji huo. Kilicho ndani ya kifurushi Chagua Vyanzo na maelezo chini ya kifurushi ili kuona kila mkusanyiko ulivyoandikwa kutoka: kanuni za ujenzi, viwango, na miongozo ya usakinishaji ya vyama vya biashara. Kwenye maktaba, elekeza kielekezi kwenye kipengee ili kusoma vyanzo vyake na dhana zake, kama nafasi ya vijiti au kiwango cha kusambaa kwa rangi. Zikague dhidi ya kazi yako na karatasi za data za bidhaa zako, na badilisha fomula pale zinapotofautiana (tazama Mikusanyiko na fomula). Kila kifurushi kimewekwa alama Kuanzia: bado hakijakaguliwa na mkadiriaji hadi wakadiriaji wanaofanya kazi wakiukagua. Kila kipengee pia hubeba nambari yake ya CSI MasterFormat, kama 09 21 16. Shiriki maktaba yako kama kifurushi Hamisha kama kifurushi… kwenye maktaba huihifadhi kama faili la kifurushi (.ccpack.json) ambalo mtu yeyote anaweza kuliongeza kwa Fungua faili la kifurushi…. Kwa chaguo-msingi huacha vipengee vilivyotoka kwenye vifurushi ulivyoongeza, na havibebi viwango. Weka tiki kwenye Jumuisha viwango vyangu kama viwango vya mfano ili kutuma viwango vyako pia: vinatumwa vikiwa na lebo ya eneo na tarehe utakayoweka, na yeyote anayeongeza kifurushi anachagua kama atavitumia. Faili za kifurushi ni data tupu tu, si programu. TakeoffDesk inakagua kila sehemu yake kabla ya kuitumia, na inaacha kile isichoweza kusoma.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"earthwork","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kazi za ardhi na miinuko ya nukta","summary":"Weka alama za miinuko ya nukta kwenye mpango wa eneo, zipeleke CivilCraft kwa uso na ukataji na ujazaji, na chukua viasi rahisi vya uchimbaji hapa.","section":"tasks","order":84,"keywords":["kazi za ardhi","uchimbaji","ukataji","ujazaji","ukataji na ujazaji","usawazishaji","miinuko ya nukta","miinuko","topo","uso","utriangulishaji","civilcraft","nukta","pnezd","mfereji"],"headings":[{"id":"uchimbaji-rahisi-hapa","text":"Uchimbaji rahisi hapa","level":2},{"id":"miinuko-ya-nukta-kwa-civilcraft","text":"Miinuko ya nukta kwa CivilCraft","level":2},{"id":"ukataji-na-ujazaji-kutoka-civilcraft","text":"Ukataji na ujazaji kutoka CivilCraft","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk hupima kile kilichochorwa kwenye karatasi. Kazi za ardhi zinahitaji uso wa ardhi, kwa hiyo zinashirikiwa na CivilCraft, ambayo hujenga nyuso kutoka kwa nukta, huzisawazisha na kukokotoa ukataji na ujazaji pamoja na usafirishaji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uchimbaji-rahisi-hapa\"\u003EUchimbaji rahisi hapa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwa eneo la msingi lililochimbwa kwa kina kimoja, kipengee cha eneo chenye \u003Cstrong\u003Ekina\u003C/strong\u003E kinatosha: ujazo ni eneo × kina. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003EKifurushi cha mkandarasi mkuu\u003C/a\u003E kina kipengee cha uchimbaji wa wingi (ujazo wa ardhi asilia, ujazo uliolegea na idadi ya malori) na kipengee cha mfereji wa huduma (uchimbaji, kitanda na kujaza nyuma kwa urefu na kina).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miinuko-ya-nukta-kwa-civilcraft\"\u003EMiinuko ya nukta kwa CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWeka skeli ya karatasi ya eneo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETengeneza kipengee cha \u003Cstrong\u003EHesabu\u003C/strong\u003E, kwa mfano &quot;Ardhi iliyopo&quot;, kisha ubofye kila miinuko ya nukta kwenye karatasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua alama na uandike \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMwinuko\u003C/span\u003E yake kwenye paneli ya Alama Zilizochaguliwa: \u003Ccode\u003E102.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E102&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E31.24 m\u003C/code\u003E. Miinuko hasi na sifuri ni sawa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha\u003C/span\u003E na uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiinuko ya nukta\u003C/span\u003E. Utapata faili la nukta (\u003Ccode\u003E.csv\u003C/code\u003E) lenye Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation na Description, safu moja kwa kila nukta iliyowekewa alama kwenye karatasi iliyofunguliwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua faili hilo kwenye CivilCraft (tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003EIngiza nukta\u003C/a\u003E). Kisha hujenga uso kutoka kwa nukta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EJenga uso\u003C/a\u003E); kutoka hapo inalinganisha nyuso na kutoa ukataji na ujazaji (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EUjazo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENorthing na easting ni viratibu vya karatasi yenyewe katika futi, vinavyopimwa kutoka kona ya ukurasa kwa skeli yake: umbali na ujazo kati ya nukta ni sahihi, lakini si viratibu vya upimaji wa eneo lako. Hamishia kwenye viratibu vya eneo katika CivilCraft unapovihitaji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENukta kutoka karatasi tofauti hazishiriki viratibu, kwa hiyo hamisha huchukua karatasi iliyofunguliwa pekee. Miinuko huhifadhiwa pamoja na ukadiriaji na hubebwa kwa kunakili na kubandika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukataji-na-ujazaji-kutoka-civilcraft\"\u003EUkataji na ujazaji kutoka CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKazi za ardhi za CivilCraft hurudi kama vipengee viwili unavyoweza kupangia bei:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKatika CivilCraft, sawazisha pedi na korido zako, kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuma kwa TakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EKazi za ardhi\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EUjazo wa kazi za ardhi\u003C/a\u003E). Hii huhifadhi faili la viasi (\u003Ccode\u003E.quantities.json\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKatika TakeoffDesk, lifungue kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E, au liangushe kwenye programu. Ukadiriaji wako unabaki wazi: faili huongeza \u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork: cut\u003C/strong\u003E na \u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork: fill\u003C/strong\u003E kama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#typed-quantities-no-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"typed-quantities-no-drawing\"\u003Eviasi vilivyoandikwa\u003C/a\u003E katika yadi za ujazo (CY) kwa mradi wa futi, au mita za ujazo (m³) kwa mradi wa mita. Ni hatua moja: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inairudisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZipe majina, weka upotevu, viwango na mikusanyiko upendavyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuundo ukibadilika, tuma tena kutoka CivilCraft na ufungue faili jipya: vipengee viwili vilevile vitapata viasi vipya. Majina, viwango, upotevu na mikusanyiko yao vinabaki kama ulivyoweka. Kitengo cha mradi kikibadilika, upau wa hali unaonyesha hivyo: kagua viwango. Faili kutoka mradi mwingine wa CivilCraft huongeza vipengee vyake viwili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EViasi ni ujazo wa ardhi asilia, kama CivilCraft ulivyopima (mbinu ya gridi): hakuna kupungua wala kuvimba. Viongeze kama upotevu, au kwa fomula kama \u003Ccode\u003EQ * 1.25\u003C/code\u003E kwa ujazo uliolegea. Mhariri wa kipengee unaonyesha kila kimoja kilitoka wapi na lini; safu ya maelezo ya makadirio pia inasema hivyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaili la viasi ni JSON tupu (\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;format&quot;: &quot;cadcraft-quantities&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), kwa hiyo hati au programu nyingine pia inaweza kuandika moja: jina la programu, mradi, na vipengee vyenye ufunguo, jina, kitengo na kiasi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk hupima kile kilichochorwa kwenye karatasi. Kazi za ardhi zinahitaji uso wa ardhi, kwa hiyo zinashirikiwa na CivilCraft, ambayo hujenga nyuso kutoka kwa nukta, huzisawazisha na kukokotoa ukataji na ujazaji pamoja na usafirishaji. Uchimbaji rahisi hapa Kwa eneo la msingi lililochimbwa kwa kina kimoja, kipengee cha eneo chenye kina kinatosha: ujazo ni eneo × kina. Kifurushi cha mkandarasi mkuu kina kipengee cha uchimbaji wa wingi (ujazo wa ardhi asilia, ujazo uliolegea na idadi ya malori) na kipengee cha mfereji wa huduma (uchimbaji, kitanda na kujaza nyuma kwa urefu na kina). Miinuko ya nukta kwa CivilCraft Weka skeli ya karatasi ya eneo. Tengeneza kipengee cha Hesabu, kwa mfano \"Ardhi iliyopo\", kisha ubofye kila miinuko ya nukta kwenye karatasi. Chagua alama na uandike Mwinuko yake kwenye paneli ya Alama Zilizochaguliwa: 102.5, 102'-6\" au 31.24 m. Miinuko hasi na sifuri ni sawa. Fungua menyu ya Hamisha na uchague Miinuko ya nukta. Utapata faili la nukta (.csv) lenye Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation na Description, safu moja kwa kila nukta iliyowekewa alama kwenye karatasi iliyofunguliwa. Fungua faili hilo kwenye CivilCraft (tazama Ingiza nukta). Kisha hujenga uso kutoka kwa nukta (Jenga uso); kutoka hapo inalinganisha nyuso na kutoa ukataji na ujazaji (Ujazo). Northing na easting ni viratibu vya karatasi yenyewe katika futi, vinavyopimwa kutoka kona ya ukurasa kwa skeli yake: umbali na ujazo kati ya nukta ni sahihi, lakini si viratibu vya upimaji wa eneo lako. Hamishia kwenye viratibu vya eneo katika CivilCraft unapovihitaji. Nukta kutoka karatasi tofauti hazishiriki viratibu, kwa hiyo hamisha huchukua karatasi iliyofunguliwa pekee. Miinuko huhifadhiwa pamoja na ukadiriaji na hubebwa kwa kunakili na kubandika. Ukataji na ujazaji kutoka CivilCraft Kazi za ardhi za CivilCraft hurudi kama vipengee viwili unavyoweza kupangia bei: Katika CivilCraft, sawazisha pedi na korido zako, kisha uchague Tuma kwa TakeoffDesk chini ya Kazi za ardhi (Ujazo wa kazi za ardhi). Hii huhifadhi faili la viasi (.quantities.json). Katika TakeoffDesk, lifungue kwa Fungua ukadiriaji, au liangushe kwenye programu. Ukadiriaji wako unabaki wazi: faili huongeza Earthwork: cut na Earthwork: fill kama viasi vilivyoandikwa katika yadi za ujazo (CY) kwa mradi wa futi, au mita za ujazo (m³) kwa mradi wa mita. Ni hatua moja: Ctrl+Z inairudisha. Zipe majina, weka upotevu, viwango na mikusanyiko upendavyo. Muundo ukibadilika, tuma tena kutoka CivilCraft na ufungue faili jipya: vipengee viwili vilevile vitapata viasi vipya. Majina, viwango, upotevu na mikusanyiko yao vinabaki kama ulivyoweka. Kitengo cha mradi kikibadilika, upau wa hali unaonyesha hivyo: kagua viwango. Faili kutoka mradi mwingine wa CivilCraft huongeza vipengee vyake viwili. Viasi ni ujazo wa ardhi asilia, kama CivilCraft ulivyopima (mbinu ya gridi): hakuna kupungua wala kuvimba. Viongeze kama upotevu, au kwa fomula kama Q * 1.25 kwa ujazo uliolegea. Mhariri wa kipengee unaonyesha kila kimoja kilitoka wapi na lini; safu ya maelezo ya makadirio pia inasema hivyo. Faili la viasi ni JSON tupu (\"format\": \"cadcraft-quantities\"), kwa hiyo hati au programu nyingine pia inaweza kuandika moja: jina la programu, mradi, na vipengee vyenye ufunguo, jina, kitengo na kiasi.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"bid-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Maeneo ya zabuni","summary":"Weka alama kwa jengo, ghorofa au awamu, pima kwa eneo moja kwa wakati, na usome viasi na gharama kwa kila eneo.","section":"tasks","order":85,"keywords":["ongeza mbadala","punguza mbadala","zabuni ya msingi","mbadala","eneo la zabuni","eneo","jengo","ghorofa","kiwango","awamu","ukanda","mgawanyo","ghorofa ya kawaida","jumla ndogo","kwa eneo"],"headings":[{"id":"tengeneza-eneo-la-zabuni","text":"Tengeneza eneo la zabuni","level":2},{"id":"pima-kwenye-eneo","text":"Pima kwenye eneo","level":2},{"id":"hamisha-alama-kwenda-eneo-jingine","text":"Hamisha alama kwenda eneo jingine","level":2},{"id":"badili-jina-panga-upya-au-futa","text":"Badili jina, panga upya au futa","level":2},{"id":"soma-viasi-kwa-eneo","text":"Soma viasi kwa eneo","level":2},{"id":"mbadala-zabuni-ya-msingi-pamoja-na-nyongeza-na-punguzo","text":"Mbadala: zabuni ya msingi pamoja na nyongeza na punguzo","level":2},{"id":"katika-mauzo-nje","text":"Katika mauzo nje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEneo la zabuni ni sehemu ya kazi unayoweka bei yake peke yake: jengo, ghorofa, awamu, bawa. Kila alama inaweza kuwa katika eneo moja la zabuni. Viasi na makadirio vinaweza kisha kusomwa kwa kila eneo, pamoja na jumla ndogo kwa kila moja, huku jumla ya kazi ikibaki ni jumla ya kila kitu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tengeneza-eneo-la-zabuni\"\u003ETengeneza eneo la zabuni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJuu ya paneli ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E, fungua orodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo la zabuni\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cstrong\u003EEneo jipya la zabuni…\u003C/strong\u003E, andika jina kama &quot;Jengo A&quot; au &quot;Ghorofa 2&quot;, kisha chagua \u003Cstrong\u003ETengeneza\u003C/strong\u003E. Eneo jipya linakuwa la sasa. Upau wa hali unasema &quot;Alama mpya zitaingia katika (jina). Alama zilizo katika maeneo mengine ya zabuni zinafifishwa.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pima-kwenye-eneo\"\u003EPima kwenye eneo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWakati eneo la zabuni limechaguliwa kwenye orodha, kila alama mpya huingia ndani yake: mistari, maeneo, duara, hesabu, alama ambazo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E huongeza, na kile unachobandika. Alama zilizo katika maeneo mengine ya zabuni, na zisizo katika eneo lolote, zinafifishwa kwenye karatasi ili uone kipi ni cha wapi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cstrong\u003EHakuna eneo la zabuni\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye orodha ili kupima bila eneo; hakuna kinachofifishwa wakati huo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGhorofa za kawaida: pima Ghorofa 2, chagua alama zake (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwenye karatasi), zinakili, chagua Ghorofa 3 kwenye orodha na ubandike. Nakala zinaingia Ghorofa 3. Ghorofa zikifanana na hauhitaji kuzitenganisha, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/typical-groups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/typical-groups\"\u003Ekikundi cha kawaida\u003C/a\u003E hukokotoa ghorofa moja mara kadhaa badala yake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamisha-alama-kwenda-eneo-jingine\"\u003EHamisha alama kwenda eneo jingine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua alama moja au kadhaa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bofya, au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E (au \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama zilizochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E), chagua eneo kwenye uwanja wa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo la zabuni\u003C/span\u003E. Upau wa hali unasema &quot;Alama 3 zimehamishiwa Ghorofa 2.&quot; Ni hatua moja ya kutendua.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badili-jina-panga-upya-au-futa\"\u003EBadili jina, panga upya au futa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cstrong\u003ESimamia maeneo ya zabuni…\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye orodha. Andika juu ya jina ili ulibadilishe, tumia mishale kubadili mpangilio (majedwali na kitabu cha kazi hufuata), au futa moja kwa pipa. Kufuta eneo la zabuni kunahifadhi alama zake: sasa ziko bila eneo la zabuni. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inatendua kila badiliko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soma-viasi-kwa-eneo\"\u003ESoma viasi kwa eneo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKatika jedwali la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa eneo\u003C/span\u003E (linaonekana mara ukadiriaji unapokuwa na eneo la zabuni). Kila eneo linaorodhesha vipengee ilivyo navyo, pamoja na kiasi chake, kitengo na jumla, kisha safu ya jumla ndogo. Alama zisizo katika eneo lolote la zabuni huja mwishoni, kama \u003Cstrong\u003EHakuna eneo la zabuni\u003C/strong\u003E. Bofya safu ya kipengee ili kukiangazia na kufanya eneo hilo kuwa la sasa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMikusanyiko hukokotolewa kwa kila eneo kutoka kwa jumla za eneo hilo lenyewe. Fomula inayozungusha juu, kama \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 4)\u003C/code\u003E, inaweza kisha kutoa kidogo zaidi kwenye maeneo kwa pamoja kuliko kwa kazi nzima, kama ingetokea kwenye zabuni iliyopangiwa bei eneo kwa eneo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mbadala-zabuni-ya-msingi-pamoja-na-nyongeza-na-punguzo\"\u003EMbadala: zabuni ya msingi pamoja na nyongeza na punguzo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEneo la zabuni linaweza kuwa \u003Cstrong\u003Embadala\u003C/strong\u003E: kazi ambayo mmiliki anaweza kuongeza kwenye zabuni, au kuiondoa. Katika \u003Cstrong\u003ESimamia maeneo ya zabuni…\u003C/strong\u003E, kila eneo lina orodha karibu na jina lake:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EChaguo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZabuni ya msingi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwenye zabuni, kama kawaida.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza mbadala\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInawekwa bei yake peke yake na \u003Cstrong\u003Eimeachwa nje ya zabuni ya msingi\u003C/strong\u003E: uboreshaji wa zulia, dari ya ziada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPunguza mbadala\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwenye zabuni ya msingi, na inatolewa kama punguzo: &quot;ondoa dari&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPima kazi ya mbadala kwenye eneo lake la zabuni kama eneo lingine lolote. Mara ukadiriaji ukiwa na mbadala:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKichwa cha jedwali la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E kinasema \u003Cstrong\u003EZabuni ya msingi\u003C/strong\u003E badala ya Jumla ya kazi: kazi nzima bila nyongeza za mbadala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa eneo\u003C/span\u003E huishia na zabuni ya msingi na safu moja kwa kila mbadala: \u003Cstrong\u003E+$300.00\u003C/strong\u003E kwa nyongeza, \u003Cstrong\u003E−$1,050.00\u003C/strong\u003E kwa punguzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMbadala huweka bei ya vipengee vyenye alama ndani yake pekee, pamoja na mikusanyiko yake, kwa hivyo sehemu ya mkusanyiko wa kipengee kingine haingii kwa bahati.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKatika mauzo nje, CSV huishia na zabuni ya msingi na mbadala, na kitabu cha kazi kinapata karatasi ya \u003Cstrong\u003EMbadala\u003C/strong\u003E: zabuni ya msingi, vipengee vya kila mbadala na mabadiliko yake, pamoja na zabuni ya msingi ikiwa imeondolewa nyongeza zote za mbadala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"katika-mauzo-nje\"\u003EKatika mauzo nje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E huongeza karatasi ya \u003Cstrong\u003EKwa eneo la zabuni\u003C/strong\u003E: vipengee na sehemu za kila eneo pamoja na kiasi, kiasi chenye upotevu, nyenzo, kazi na jumla, jumla ndogo kwa kila eneo (fomula ya \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E) na \u003Cstrong\u003EMaeneo yote ya zabuni\u003C/strong\u003E mwishoni. Karatasi ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama\u003C/strong\u003E inapata safu ya \u003Cstrong\u003EEneo la zabuni\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukadiriaji usio na maeneo ya zabuni husafirishwa kama hapo awali. Tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003ESafu za mauzo nje\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaeneo ya zabuni yanahifadhiwa kwenye faili la mradi pamoja na alama.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Eneo la zabuni ni sehemu ya kazi unayoweka bei yake peke yake: jengo, ghorofa, awamu, bawa. Kila alama inaweza kuwa katika eneo moja la zabuni. Viasi na makadirio vinaweza kisha kusomwa kwa kila eneo, pamoja na jumla ndogo kwa kila moja, huku jumla ya kazi ikibaki ni jumla ya kila kitu. Tengeneza eneo la zabuni Juu ya paneli ya Vipengee, fungua orodha ya Eneo la zabuni. Chagua Eneo jipya la zabuni…, andika jina kama \"Jengo A\" au \"Ghorofa 2\", kisha chagua Tengeneza. Eneo jipya linakuwa la sasa. Upau wa hali unasema \"Alama mpya zitaingia katika (jina). Alama zilizo katika maeneo mengine ya zabuni zinafifishwa.\" Pima kwenye eneo Wakati eneo la zabuni limechaguliwa kwenye orodha, kila alama mpya huingia ndani yake: mistari, maeneo, duara, hesabu, alama ambazo Hesabu otomatiki huongeza, na kile unachobandika. Alama zilizo katika maeneo mengine ya zabuni, na zisizo katika eneo lolote, zinafifishwa kwenye karatasi ili uone kipi ni cha wapi. Chagua Hakuna eneo la zabuni kwenye orodha ili kupima bila eneo; hakuna kinachofifishwa wakati huo. Ghorofa za kawaida: pima Ghorofa 2, chagua alama zake (Ctrl+A kwenye karatasi), zinakili, chagua Ghorofa 3 kwenye orodha na ubandike. Nakala zinaingia Ghorofa 3. Ghorofa zikifanana na hauhitaji kuzitenganisha, kikundi cha kawaida hukokotoa ghorofa moja mara kadhaa badala yake. Hamisha alama kwenda eneo jingine Chagua alama moja au kadhaa (Shift + bofya, au Ctrl+A). Chini ya Alama iliyochaguliwa (au Alama zilizochaguliwa), chagua eneo kwenye uwanja wa Eneo la zabuni. Upau wa hali unasema \"Alama 3 zimehamishiwa Ghorofa 2.\" Ni hatua moja ya kutendua. Badili jina, panga upya au futa Chagua Simamia maeneo ya zabuni… kwenye orodha. Andika juu ya jina ili ulibadilishe, tumia mishale kubadili mpangilio (majedwali na kitabu cha kazi hufuata), au futa moja kwa pipa. Kufuta eneo la zabuni kunahifadhi alama zake: sasa ziko bila eneo la zabuni. Ctrl+Z inatendua kila badiliko. Soma viasi kwa eneo Katika jedwali la Viasi, chagua Kwa eneo (linaonekana mara ukadiriaji unapokuwa na eneo la zabuni). Kila eneo linaorodhesha vipengee ilivyo navyo, pamoja na kiasi chake, kitengo na jumla, kisha safu ya jumla ndogo. Alama zisizo katika eneo lolote la zabuni huja mwishoni, kama Hakuna eneo la zabuni. Bofya safu ya kipengee ili kukiangazia na kufanya eneo hilo kuwa la sasa. Mikusanyiko hukokotolewa kwa kila eneo kutoka kwa jumla za eneo hilo lenyewe. Fomula inayozungusha juu, kama ceil(L / 4), inaweza kisha kutoa kidogo zaidi kwenye maeneo kwa pamoja kuliko kwa kazi nzima, kama ingetokea kwenye zabuni iliyopangiwa bei eneo kwa eneo. Mbadala: zabuni ya msingi pamoja na nyongeza na punguzo Eneo la zabuni linaweza kuwa mbadala: kazi ambayo mmiliki anaweza kuongeza kwenye zabuni, au kuiondoa. Katika Simamia maeneo ya zabuni…, kila eneo lina orodha karibu na jina lake: Chaguo Inachofanya Zabuni ya msingi Kwenye zabuni, kama kawaida. Ongeza mbadala Inawekwa bei yake peke yake na imeachwa nje ya zabuni ya msingi: uboreshaji wa zulia, dari ya ziada. Punguza mbadala Kwenye zabuni ya msingi, na inatolewa kama punguzo: \"ondoa dari\". Pima kazi ya mbadala kwenye eneo lake la zabuni kama eneo lingine lolote. Mara ukadiriaji ukiwa na mbadala: Kichwa cha jedwali la Viasi kinasema Zabuni ya msingi badala ya Jumla ya kazi: kazi nzima bila nyongeza za mbadala. Kwa eneo huishia na zabuni ya msingi na safu moja kwa kila mbadala: +$300.00 kwa nyongeza, −$1,050.00 kwa punguzo. Mbadala huweka bei ya vipengee vyenye alama ndani yake pekee, pamoja na mikusanyiko yake, kwa hivyo sehemu ya mkusanyiko wa kipengee kingine haingii kwa bahati. Katika mauzo nje, CSV huishia na zabuni ya msingi na mbadala, na kitabu cha kazi kinapata karatasi ya Mbadala: zabuni ya msingi, vipengee vya kila mbadala na mabadiliko yake, pamoja na zabuni ya msingi ikiwa imeondolewa nyongeza zote za mbadala. Katika mauzo nje XLSX huongeza karatasi ya Kwa eneo la zabuni: vipengee na sehemu za kila eneo pamoja na kiasi, kiasi chenye upotevu, nyenzo, kazi na jumla, jumla ndogo kwa kila eneo (fomula ya SUM) na Maeneo yote ya zabuni mwishoni. Karatasi ya Alama inapata safu ya Eneo la zabuni. Ukadiriaji usio na maeneo ya zabuni husafirishwa kama hapo awali. Tazama Safu za mauzo nje. Maeneo ya zabuni yanahifadhiwa kwenye faili la mradi pamoja na alama.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"issues-and-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Masuala, marekebisho na kumbukumbu ya mabadiliko ya mchoro","summary":"Weka historia moja ya masuala pamoja na modeli ya mbunifu. Soma masuala, rekodi maagizo ya eneo la kazi, michoro ya warsha na modeli zilizounganishwa dhidi ya suala, kisha usome kumbukumbu ya mabadiliko ya mchoro.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["suala","marekebisho","masahihisho","kumbukumbu ya mabadiliko","kumbukumbu ya mchoro","rejista ya mchoro","maagizo ya eneo","mchoro wa warsha","modeli iliyounganishwa","zabuni","ujenzi","historia ya masuala","orodha ya kiasi","ukadiriaji"],"headings":[{"id":"utakachofanya","text":"Utakachofanya","level":2},{"id":"hatua","text":"Hatua","level":2},{"id":"vidokezo-muhimu","text":"Vidokezo muhimu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"utakachofanya\"\u003EUtakachofanya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFanya kazi kwa historia ile ile ya masuala kama timu nzima. Ona karatasi zipi zilitoka katika marekebisho gani, na weka kile kinachotokea eneo la kazi dhidi ya suala linalohusika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hatua\"\u003EHatua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua \u003Cstrong\u003EMasuala na marekebisho\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cstrong\u003ESoma historia ya masuala\u003C/strong\u003E kisha uchague faili la \u003Ccode\u003E.issues.json\u003C/code\u003E lililohifadhiwa kutoka BimCraft au programu nyingine. Masuala na rekodi zake zinaongezwa kwenye yako. Hakuna kitu kinachobadilishwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cstrong\u003EOngeza rekodi\u003C/strong\u003E kwa maagizo ya eneo, mchoro wa warsha, seti ya alama, modeli iliyounganishwa au dokezo. Chagua suala linalohusika na hali yake. Faili unalochagua linarekodiwa kwa jina lake, ukubwa wake na SHA-256; faili linabaki pale lilipo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKumbukumbu ya mabadiliko ya mchoro\u003C/strong\u003E inaonyesha safu moja kwa kila karatasi na safuwima moja kwa kila suala. Marekebisho yaliyo kwenye mabano yalitolewa tena bila mabadiliko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPakua kumbukumbu ya mabadiliko (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E inahifadhi masuala, jedwali la karatasi na rekodi. \u003Cstrong\u003EHifadhi historia ya masuala\u003C/strong\u003E inaandika faili ambalo programu nyingine husoma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vidokezo-muhimu\"\u003EVidokezo muhimu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERekodi suala\u003C/strong\u003E inatoa suala karatasi zako zilizopimwa, kwa mfano kwa orodha ya kiasi. \u003Cstrong\u003EMabadiliko tangu\u003C/strong\u003E kisha inaonyesha karatasi zipi zilipimwa tena baada ya suala hilo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHistoria imehifadhiwa kwenye faili la ukadiriaji. Kila mabadiliko ni Tendua moja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKusoma faili lilelile mara mbili hakuongezi chochote mara mbili. Nakala mbili zikiwa na rekodi ile ile, mpya zaidi ndiyo inayobaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Utakachofanya Fanya kazi kwa historia ile ile ya masuala kama timu nzima. Ona karatasi zipi zilitoka katika marekebisho gani, na weka kile kinachotokea eneo la kazi dhidi ya suala linalohusika. Hatua Fungua Masuala na marekebisho. Chagua Soma historia ya masuala kisha uchague faili la .issues.json lililohifadhiwa kutoka BimCraft au programu nyingine. Masuala na rekodi zake zinaongezwa kwenye yako. Hakuna kitu kinachobadilishwa. Chagua Ongeza rekodi kwa maagizo ya eneo, mchoro wa warsha, seti ya alama, modeli iliyounganishwa au dokezo. Chagua suala linalohusika na hali yake. Faili unalochagua linarekodiwa kwa jina lake, ukubwa wake na SHA-256; faili linabaki pale lilipo. Kumbukumbu ya mabadiliko ya mchoro inaonyesha safu moja kwa kila karatasi na safuwima moja kwa kila suala. Marekebisho yaliyo kwenye mabano yalitolewa tena bila mabadiliko. Pakua kumbukumbu ya mabadiliko (CSV) inahifadhi masuala, jedwali la karatasi na rekodi. Hifadhi historia ya masuala inaandika faili ambalo programu nyingine husoma. Vidokezo muhimu Rekodi suala inatoa suala karatasi zako zilizopimwa, kwa mfano kwa orodha ya kiasi. Mabadiliko tangu kisha inaonyesha karatasi zipi zilipimwa tena baada ya suala hilo. Historia imehifadhiwa kwenye faili la ukadiriaji. Kila mabadiliko ni Tendua moja. Kusoma faili lilelile mara mbili hakuongezi chochote mara mbili. Nakala mbili zikiwa na rekodi ile ile, mpya zaidi ndiyo inayobaki.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"typical-groups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Vikundi vya kawaida","summary":"Pima kitengo, chumba au ghorofa ya kawaida mara moja, uhesabu mara ngapi kinajirudia, badilisha hesabu baadaye, na uone alama zipi ni za kawaida.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["kawaida","kikundi cha kawaida","rudia","idadi ya marudio","zidisha","mara","kitengo","chumba cha hoteli","ghorofa","ghorofa ya kawaida","x24","nakala"],"headings":[{"id":"tengeneza-kikundi-cha-kawaida","text":"Tengeneza kikundi cha kawaida","level":2},{"id":"badilisha-baadaye","text":"Badilisha baadaye","level":2},{"id":"jambo-la-kujua","text":"Jambo la kujua","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EJengo mara nyingi hujirudia: vyumba 24 vinavyofanana vya hoteli, ghorofa 6 za kawaida, sehemu 40 za kuegesha zenye mistari sawa. \u003Cstrong\u003EKikundi cha kawaida\u003C/strong\u003E hukuruhusu kupima mmoja wao na kuuhesabu mara ngapi unajirudia, bila kuchora nakala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tengeneza-kikundi-cha-kawaida\"\u003ETengeneza kikundi cha kawaida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPima kitengo kimoja: kuta zake, sakafu yake, soketi zake, vipengee vyovyote.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua alama zake kwa zana ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E: bofya moja, kisha \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bofya nyingine (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EChagua alama\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E, fungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKawaida\u003C/span\u003E kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKikundi kipya cha kawaida…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKipe jina (\u003Ccode\u003EUnit A\u003C/code\u003E) na idadi ya marudio (\u003Ccode\u003E24\u003C/code\u003E), kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETengeneza kundi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila kiasi cha alama hizo sasa kinahesabiwa mara 24: mstari wa ukuta wa futi 10 unatoa futi 240, sakafu ya SF 80 inatoa SF 1,920, soketi mbili zinatoa 48. Gharama zinafuata, na fomula za mkusanyiko zinaona jumla zilizorudiwa (\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E inahesabu kila mstari mara 24 pia).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye karatasi, kisanduku chenye mistari ya nukta kinazunguka alama za kikundi, chenye jina lake na hesabu yake, kama \u003Cstrong\u003EUnit A ×24\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badilisha-baadaye\"\u003EBadilisha baadaye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVikundi vimeorodheshwa chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EVikundi vya kawaida\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye paneli ya kulia:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadilisha namba iliyo baada ya \u003Cstrong\u003E×\u003C/strong\u003E ili kubadilisha mara inavyohesabiwa (1 hadi 10,000). Kila kiasi kinasasishwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpe jina jipya kwenye kisanduku chake cha jina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAikoni ya kisanduku inachagua alama zake (na kuonyesha karatasi yake).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPipa linafuta kikundi. Alama zake zinabaki, zikihesabiwa mara moja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kuongeza alama kwenye kikundi au kuziondoa, zichague kisha uchague kikundi (au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESi cha kawaida (×1)\u003C/span\u003E) chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKawaida\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jambo-la-kujua\"\u003EJambo la kujua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlama za kikundi zinaweza kuwa kwenye karatasi kadhaa, na za vipengee vyovyote. Kila alama iko kwenye kikundi kimoja au hakuna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENakala unazobandika hazimo kwenye kikundi: nakala iliyobandikwa ya kitengo cha kawaida ingehesabiwa mara 24 tena. Tumia kikundi kwa &quot;kitu kile kile mara N&quot;, na nakili na ubandike kwa nakala unazochora.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlama zinachorwa mara moja, kwa hivyo mwonekano wa 3D na PDF yenye alama vinaonyesha kitengo kimoja; viwango, mauzo na jedwali la kila karatasi vinakihesabu ×N. Karatasi ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama\u003C/strong\u003E ya usafirishaji wa Excel inasema alama zipi ni za kawaida na zinahesabiwa mara ngapi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPamoja na maeneo ya zabuni, alama za kikundi zinahesabiwa ×N ndani ya eneo lao la zabuni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Jengo mara nyingi hujirudia: vyumba 24 vinavyofanana vya hoteli, ghorofa 6 za kawaida, sehemu 40 za kuegesha zenye mistari sawa. Kikundi cha kawaida hukuruhusu kupima mmoja wao na kuuhesabu mara ngapi unajirudia, bila kuchora nakala. Tengeneza kikundi cha kawaida Pima kitengo kimoja: kuta zake, sakafu yake, soketi zake, vipengee vyovyote. Chagua alama zake kwa zana ya Chagua: bofya moja, kisha Shift + bofya nyingine (Chagua alama). Chini ya Alama iliyochaguliwa, fungua Kawaida kisha uchague Kikundi kipya cha kawaida…. Kipe jina (Unit A) na idadi ya marudio (24), kisha uchague Tengeneza kundi. Kila kiasi cha alama hizo sasa kinahesabiwa mara 24: mstari wa ukuta wa futi 10 unatoa futi 240, sakafu ya SF 80 inatoa SF 1,920, soketi mbili zinatoa 48. Gharama zinafuata, na fomula za mkusanyiko zinaona jumla zilizorudiwa (N inahesabu kila mstari mara 24 pia). Kwenye karatasi, kisanduku chenye mistari ya nukta kinazunguka alama za kikundi, chenye jina lake na hesabu yake, kama Unit A ×24. Badilisha baadaye Vikundi vimeorodheshwa chini ya Vikundi vya kawaida kwenye paneli ya kulia: Badilisha namba iliyo baada ya × ili kubadilisha mara inavyohesabiwa (1 hadi 10,000). Kila kiasi kinasasishwa. Ipe jina jipya kwenye kisanduku chake cha jina. Aikoni ya kisanduku inachagua alama zake (na kuonyesha karatasi yake). Pipa linafuta kikundi. Alama zake zinabaki, zikihesabiwa mara moja. Ili kuongeza alama kwenye kikundi au kuziondoa, zichague kisha uchague kikundi (au Si cha kawaida (×1)) chini ya Kawaida. Jambo la kujua Alama za kikundi zinaweza kuwa kwenye karatasi kadhaa, na za vipengee vyovyote. Kila alama iko kwenye kikundi kimoja au hakuna. Nakala unazobandika hazimo kwenye kikundi: nakala iliyobandikwa ya kitengo cha kawaida ingehesabiwa mara 24 tena. Tumia kikundi kwa \"kitu kile kile mara N\", na nakili na ubandike kwa nakala unazochora. Alama zinachorwa mara moja, kwa hivyo mwonekano wa 3D na PDF yenye alama vinaonyesha kitengo kimoja; viwango, mauzo na jedwali la kila karatasi vinakihesabu ×N. Karatasi ya Alama ya usafirishaji wa Excel inasema alama zipi ni za kawaida na zinahesabiwa mara ngapi. Pamoja na maeneo ya zabuni, alama za kikundi zinahesabiwa ×N ndani ya eneo lao la zabuni.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"read-quantities","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kusoma viasi na makadirio","summary":"Tumia jedwali la {{ui:Viasi}} kwa kipengee na kwa karatasi, jumla ya kazi, kuangazia, na onyo la Haijakamilika.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["viasi","jumla","kwa kipengee","kwa karatasi","jumla ya kazi","makadirio","muhtasari","ripoti","kuangazia","haijakamilika","gharama"],"headings":[{"id":"kwa-kipengee","text":"Kwa kipengee","level":2},{"id":"kwa-karatasi","text":"Kwa karatasi","level":2},{"id":"kwa-eneo","text":"Kwa eneo","level":2},{"id":"onyo-la-haijakamilika","text":"Onyo la Haijakamilika","level":2},{"id":"angazia-kipengee","text":"Angazia kipengee","level":2},{"id":"jumla-za-vipengee-kwenye-paneli-ya-kando","text":"Jumla za vipengee kwenye paneli ya kando","level":2},{"id":"alama-kwenye-pdf-ambazo-hazijafunguliwa","text":"Alama kwenye PDF ambazo hazijafunguliwa","level":2},{"id":"nafasi-zaidi","text":"Nafasi zaidi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EJedwali la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E chini ya dirisha ndilo makadirio yako ya moja kwa moja. Hubadilika mara tu unapochora, kufuta, kubadilisha skeli au kuhariri kiwango. Viasi havihifadhiwi kamwe; hupimwa upya kutoka kwa alama kila wakati, kwa hiyo haviwezi kupitwa na wakati.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwa-kipengee\"\u003EKwa kipengee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa kipengee\u003C/span\u003E (chaguo-msingi). Kila kipengee kina safu yake, na kila kijenzi cha mkusanyiko kina safu chini yake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESafu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaana\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKipengee\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJina, pamoja na rangi ya kipengee. &quot;+(n) bila skeli&quot; inamaanisha baadhi ya alama ziko kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiasi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJumla iliyopimwa katika kitengo cha kipengee (vijenzi: matokeo ya fomula).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKitengo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, au kitengo cha kijenzi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaka %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAndika hapa au kwenye kihariri cha kipengee.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPamoja na taka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiasi × (1 + taka).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENyenzo/kitengo, Kazi/kitengo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EViwango; unaweza kuviandika hapa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENyenzo, Kazi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPamoja na taka × kiwango, kimezungushwa hadi senti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJumla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENyenzo + kazi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafu ya mwisho, \u003Cstrong\u003EJumla ya kazi\u003C/strong\u003E, inajumlisha safu za nyenzo, kazi na jumla. Jumla hiyo hiyo inaonekana upande wa kulia wa kichwa cha jedwali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAndika kwenye kisanduku cha taka au kiwango kisha bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au bofya pembeni ili kutumia. Thamani ambayo TakeoffDesk haiwezi kuisoma imezungushwa kwa mstari mwekundu, na upau wa hali unaeleza sababu, kwa mfano &quot;Andika kiasi kama 12.50.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBofya safu ya kipengee ili kuangazia alama zake kwenye kila karatasi na kuruka hadi karatasi yenye alama hizo (sawa na kubofya chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwa-karatasi\"\u003EKwa karatasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa karatasi\u003C/span\u003E ili kuona kiasi cha kila kipengee kwenye kila karatasi, pamoja na idadi ya alama. Bofya safu ili kufungua karatasi hiyo na kipengee kikiwa kimeangaziwa. Itumie kukagua kama kila karatasi ilipimwa, au kugawanya viasi kwa ghorofa au eneo la kazi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwa-eneo\"\u003EKwa eneo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMakadirio yakiwa na maeneo ya zabuni, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa eneo\u003C/span\u003E huorodhesha vipengee vya kila eneo pamoja na jumla ndogo. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EMaeneo ya zabuni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"onyo-la-haijakamilika\"\u003EOnyo la Haijakamilika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKitu kikiachwa nje ya jumla, kichwa cha jedwali kinaonyesha onyo, kwa mfano:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Haijakamilika: hitilafu 1 ya fomula, alama 6 kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli (hazimo kwenye jumla)&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHitilafu za fomula\u003C/strong\u003E: fomula ya kijenzi cha mkusanyiko haiwezi kuhesabiwa. Safu yake inasema &quot;Hitilafu ya fomula: …&quot;. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies#when-a-formula-is-wrong\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-hash=\"when-a-formula-is-wrong\"\u003EMikusanyiko na fomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlama kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli\u003C/strong\u003E: wape karatasi hizo skeli. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003EWeka skeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaelezo haya haya huingia kwenye jedwali lililohamishwa, ili makadirio yasiyokamilika yasionekane kamili kamwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"angazia-kipengee\"\u003EAngazia kipengee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBofya kipengee chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E au kwenye jedwali. Alama zake zinabaki na nguvu kamili kwenye kila karatasi, na nyingine zinafifia. Orodha ya karatasi inaonyesha &quot;(n) imeangaziwa&quot; kwenye kila karatasi yenye alama zake. Bofya kipengee tena ili kuacha kuangazia.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jumla-za-vipengee-kwenye-paneli-ya-kando\"\u003EJumla za vipengee kwenye paneli ya kando\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila kipengee kwenye orodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E pia kinaonyesha kiasi chake. Sehemu ya \u003Cstrong\u003EImepimwa\u003C/strong\u003E ya kihariri cha kipengee inaonyesha thamani ambazo fomula zake zinatumia: urefu, mistari na eneo la ukuta; eneo, mzunguko na idadi ya maeneo; au hesabu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"alama-kwenye-pdf-ambazo-hazijafunguliwa\"\u003EAlama kwenye PDF ambazo hazijafunguliwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkadiriaji wa kiasi unaweza kujumuisha alama kwenye PDF ambazo hujazifungua safari hii. Bado zinahesabiwa katika kila jumla; orodha ya karatasi inataja PDF hizo. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EHifadhi na ufungue tena ukadiriaji wa kiasi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nafasi-zaidi\"\u003ENafasi zaidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKitufe cha mshale upande wa kulia wa kichwa cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E kinaficha jedwali ili karatasi ipate nafasi zaidi. Bonyeza tena ili kurudisha jedwali.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Jedwali la Viasi chini ya dirisha ndilo makadirio yako ya moja kwa moja. Hubadilika mara tu unapochora, kufuta, kubadilisha skeli au kuhariri kiwango. Viasi havihifadhiwi kamwe; hupimwa upya kutoka kwa alama kila wakati, kwa hiyo haviwezi kupitwa na wakati. Kwa kipengee Chagua Kwa kipengee (chaguo-msingi). Kila kipengee kina safu yake, na kila kijenzi cha mkusanyiko kina safu chini yake. Safu Maana Kipengee Jina, pamoja na rangi ya kipengee. \"+(n) bila skeli\" inamaanisha baadhi ya alama ziko kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli. Kiasi Jumla iliyopimwa katika kitengo cha kipengee (vijenzi: matokeo ya fomula). Kitengo LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, au kitengo cha kijenzi. Taka % Andika hapa au kwenye kihariri cha kipengee. Pamoja na taka Kiasi × (1 + taka). Nyenzo/kitengo, Kazi/kitengo Viwango; unaweza kuviandika hapa. Nyenzo, Kazi Pamoja na taka × kiwango, kimezungushwa hadi senti. Jumla Nyenzo + kazi. Safu ya mwisho, Jumla ya kazi, inajumlisha safu za nyenzo, kazi na jumla. Jumla hiyo hiyo inaonekana upande wa kulia wa kichwa cha jedwali. Andika kwenye kisanduku cha taka au kiwango kisha bonyeza Enter au bofya pembeni ili kutumia. Thamani ambayo TakeoffDesk haiwezi kuisoma imezungushwa kwa mstari mwekundu, na upau wa hali unaeleza sababu, kwa mfano \"Andika kiasi kama 12.50.\" Bofya safu ya kipengee ili kuangazia alama zake kwenye kila karatasi na kuruka hadi karatasi yenye alama hizo (sawa na kubofya chini ya Vipengee). Kwa karatasi Chagua Kwa karatasi ili kuona kiasi cha kila kipengee kwenye kila karatasi, pamoja na idadi ya alama. Bofya safu ili kufungua karatasi hiyo na kipengee kikiwa kimeangaziwa. Itumie kukagua kama kila karatasi ilipimwa, au kugawanya viasi kwa ghorofa au eneo la kazi. Kwa eneo Makadirio yakiwa na maeneo ya zabuni, Kwa eneo huorodhesha vipengee vya kila eneo pamoja na jumla ndogo. Angalia Maeneo ya zabuni. Onyo la Haijakamilika Kitu kikiachwa nje ya jumla, kichwa cha jedwali kinaonyesha onyo, kwa mfano: \"Haijakamilika: hitilafu 1 ya fomula, alama 6 kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli (hazimo kwenye jumla)\" Hitilafu za fomula: fomula ya kijenzi cha mkusanyiko haiwezi kuhesabiwa. Safu yake inasema \"Hitilafu ya fomula: …\". Angalia Mikusanyiko na fomula. Alama kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli: wape karatasi hizo skeli. Angalia Weka skeli. Maelezo haya haya huingia kwenye jedwali lililohamishwa, ili makadirio yasiyokamilika yasionekane kamili kamwe. Angazia kipengee Bofya kipengee chini ya Vipengee au kwenye jedwali. Alama zake zinabaki na nguvu kamili kwenye kila karatasi, na nyingine zinafifia. Orodha ya karatasi inaonyesha \"(n) imeangaziwa\" kwenye kila karatasi yenye alama zake. Bofya kipengee tena ili kuacha kuangazia. Jumla za vipengee kwenye paneli ya kando Kila kipengee kwenye orodha ya Vipengee pia kinaonyesha kiasi chake. Sehemu ya Imepimwa ya kihariri cha kipengee inaonyesha thamani ambazo fomula zake zinatumia: urefu, mistari na eneo la ukuta; eneo, mzunguko na idadi ya maeneo; au hesabu. Alama kwenye PDF ambazo hazijafunguliwa Ukadiriaji wa kiasi unaweza kujumuisha alama kwenye PDF ambazo hujazifungua safari hii. Bado zinahesabiwa katika kila jumla; orodha ya karatasi inataja PDF hizo. Angalia Hifadhi na ufungue tena ukadiriaji wa kiasi. Nafasi zaidi Kitufe cha mshale upande wa kulia wa kichwa cha Viasi kinaficha jedwali ili karatasi ipate nafasi zaidi. Bonyeza tena ili kurudisha jedwali.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"markups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Dokezo, mawingu na vionyeshi","summary":"Weka alama maswali na mabadiliko kwenye karatasi kwa dokezo, mawingu ya marekebisho na vionyeshi. Fuatilia kila moja kama Wazi, Imejibiwa au Imefungwa, kisha uyatume kwenye PDF yenye alama.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["alama","orodha ya alama","dokezo","maoni","swali","rfi","wingu","wingu la marekebisho","angazia","hali","wazi","imejibiwa","imefungwa","mapitio"],"headings":[{"id":"ongeza-moja","text":"Ongeza moja","level":2},{"id":"hali-na-kuhariri","text":"Hali na kuhariri","level":2},{"id":"orodha","text":"Orodha","level":2},{"id":"zishiriki","text":"Zishiriki","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAlama ni za kile unachohitaji kukumbuka au kuuliza wakati wa kufanya ukadiriaji: &quot;thibitisha aina ya msingi&quot;, wingu la marekebisho kuzunguka ukuta uliobadilishwa, au dokezo lililoangaziwa kwenye mpango. Zinakaa kwenye karatasi zikiwa na hali, zimeorodheshwa mahali pamoja, na zinaonekana kwenye PDF yenye alama. Hazihesabiwi kamwe: hakuna kiasi, hakuna gharama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ongeza-moja\"\u003EOngeza moja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlama\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau ulio juu ya karatasi kisha chagua:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAlama\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJinsi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDokezo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya pale inapokwenda, andika dokezo, kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza\u003C/span\u003E. Linaonekana kama pini ya duara pamoja na mstari wake wa kwanza kando yake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWingu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya kona moja, kisha kona iliyo kinyume, kisha andika dokezo (au acha tupu). Wingu la marekebisho lenye mikunjo linazunguka kisanduku.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngazia\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya kona mbili: kisanduku cha manjano cha uwazi, chenye dokezo ukipenda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E baada ya kona ya kwanza hughairi. Zana inabaki imewashwa kwa inayofuata; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inarudi kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hali-na-kuhariri\"\u003EHali na kuhariri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBofya alama kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E ili uichague. Jopo la kulia linaonyesha \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama\u003C/strong\u003E: aina yake na karatasi yake, \u003Cstrong\u003EHali\u003C/strong\u003E yake (Wazi, Imejibiwa au Imefungwa), na maandishi yake, ambayo unaweza kuyabadilisha. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuta\u003C/span\u003E) inaiondoa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inairudisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPini ya dokezo ni ya chungwa ikiwa wazi, bluu ikishajibiwa na kijivu ikifungwa; wingu lililofungwa linageuka kijivu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"orodha\"\u003EOrodha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlama\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye jopo la kulia inaorodhesha kila alama ya ukadiriaji pamoja na hali yake, na inaonyesha ni ngapi bado ziko wazi. Weka tiki kwenye \u003Cstrong\u003EWazi pekee\u003C/strong\u003E ili uone zilizobaki kutatuliwa. Bofya safu ili uende kwenye karatasi yake na kuichagua.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zishiriki\"\u003EZishiriki\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF yenye alama\u003C/span\u003E inazichora kwenye kurasa: vionyeshi, mawingu na pini, kila moja ikiwa na kisanduku kinachotoa hali yake kwa herufi kubwa (WAZI, IMEJIBIWA, IMEFUNGWA) na maandishi yake. Ukurasa wenye alama lakini bila alama za ukadiriaji nao unajumuishwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E inaongeza karatasi ya kazi ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama\u003C/strong\u003E: karatasi, aina, hali na maandishi, safu moja kwa kila alama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZinahifadhiwa kwenye \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E na kwenye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EPDF yenye ukadiriaji ndani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Alama ni za kile unachohitaji kukumbuka au kuuliza wakati wa kufanya ukadiriaji: \"thibitisha aina ya msingi\", wingu la marekebisho kuzunguka ukuta uliobadilishwa, au dokezo lililoangaziwa kwenye mpango. Zinakaa kwenye karatasi zikiwa na hali, zimeorodheshwa mahali pamoja, na zinaonekana kwenye PDF yenye alama. Hazihesabiwi kamwe: hakuna kiasi, hakuna gharama. Ongeza moja Fungua Alama kwenye upau ulio juu ya karatasi kisha chagua: Alama Jinsi Dokezo Bofya pale inapokwenda, andika dokezo, kisha uchague Ongeza. Linaonekana kama pini ya duara pamoja na mstari wake wa kwanza kando yake. Wingu Bofya kona moja, kisha kona iliyo kinyume, kisha andika dokezo (au acha tupu). Wingu la marekebisho lenye mikunjo linazunguka kisanduku. Angazia Bofya kona mbili: kisanduku cha manjano cha uwazi, chenye dokezo ukipenda. Esc baada ya kona ya kwanza hughairi. Zana inabaki imewashwa kwa inayofuata; V inarudi kwenye Chagua. Hali na kuhariri Bofya alama kwa Chagua ili uichague. Jopo la kulia linaonyesha Alama: aina yake na karatasi yake, Hali yake (Wazi, Imejibiwa au Imefungwa), na maandishi yake, ambayo unaweza kuyabadilisha. Delete (au Futa) inaiondoa; Ctrl+Z inairudisha. Pini ya dokezo ni ya chungwa ikiwa wazi, bluu ikishajibiwa na kijivu ikifungwa; wingu lililofungwa linageuka kijivu. Orodha Alama kwenye jopo la kulia inaorodhesha kila alama ya ukadiriaji pamoja na hali yake, na inaonyesha ni ngapi bado ziko wazi. Weka tiki kwenye Wazi pekee ili uone zilizobaki kutatuliwa. Bofya safu ili uende kwenye karatasi yake na kuichagua. Zishiriki PDF yenye alama inazichora kwenye kurasa: vionyeshi, mawingu na pini, kila moja ikiwa na kisanduku kinachotoa hali yake kwa herufi kubwa (WAZI, IMEJIBIWA, IMEFUNGWA) na maandishi yake. Ukurasa wenye alama lakini bila alama za ukadiriaji nao unajumuishwa. XLSX inaongeza karatasi ya kazi ya Alama: karatasi, aina, hali na maandishi, safu moja kwa kila alama. Zinahifadhiwa kwenye .takeoff.json na kwenye PDF yenye ukadiriaji ndani.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"check-in-3d","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kagua ukadiriaji kwa 3D","summary":"Ona kuta, bamba na hesabu za karatasi iliyo wazi zikisimama juu ya mchoro, zunguka, na bofya moja kuchagua alama yake.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["png","picha","kionyesho","panga","ghorofa","viwango","mwinuko","glb","gltf","hamisha 3D","unene wa ukuta","urefu wa msingi","tundu","juu ya mlango","3D","D tatu","kagua","mwonekano","kuta","urefu wa ukuta","bamba","kina","ujazo","zungusha","modeli","kuchagua","isometriki","mtazamo wa kina"],"headings":[{"id":"fungua-mwonekano-wa-3d","text":"Fungua mwonekano wa 3D","level":2},{"id":"unachokiona","text":"Unachokiona","level":2},{"id":"zunguka","text":"Zunguka","level":2},{"id":"kuta-zenye-unene-msingi-na-matundu","text":"Kuta zenye unene, msingi na matundu","level":2},{"id":"panga-ghorofa","text":"Panga ghorofa","level":2},{"id":"hifadhi-mwonekano-wa-3d-kama-picha","text":"Hifadhi mwonekano wa 3D kama picha","level":2},{"id":"hifadhi-mwonekano-wa-3d-kama-modeli","text":"Hifadhi mwonekano wa 3D kama modeli","level":2},{"id":"chagua-alama-kutoka-3d","text":"Chagua alama kutoka 3D","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMwonekano wa 3D ni ukaguzi, si mchoro wa pili: unasimamisha ukadiriaji wa karatasi iliyo wazi juu yake kwenye skrini, ili ukuta unaokosekana, bamba lililorudiwa au hesabu iliyopotea yaonekane mara moja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKabla ya kuanza: karatasi inahitaji skeli (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EWeka skeli\u003C/a\u003E). Vimo na kina vinahitaji futi halisi, kwa hiyo kwenye karatasi isiyo na skeli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E inasema hivyo na inabaki kwenye karatasi bapa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fungua-mwonekano-wa-3d\"\u003EFungua mwonekano wa 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnyesha karatasi unayotaka kukagua.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau unaoonyesha jina la karatasi na skeli, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Mara ya kwanza, mwonekano wa 3D huchukua muda kupakia. Karatasi huchorwa chini, na ukadiriaji unasimama juu yake kwa rangi ya kila kipengee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKurudi, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E tena, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERudi kwenye karatasi\u003C/span\u003E, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Kuchagua zana ya kuchora (Mstari, Eneo, Hesabu na kadhalika) pia hurudisha, kwa sababu alama huchorwa kwenye karatasi bapa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMwonekano unaonyesha karatasi kwenye skrini; badilisha karatasi kwenye orodha ya karatasi, au kwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, na mwonekano wa 3D unafuata. Ili kuona ghorofa kadhaa kwa pamoja, zipange (hapa chini).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"unachokiona\"\u003EUnachokiona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAlama\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKwenye 3D\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari wa kukimbia, kipengee chenye kimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuta wa kimo hicho kando ya mstari. Mistari iliyopinda hufuata mkunjo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari wa kukimbia, kipengee bila kimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari kwenye karatasi. Mpe kipengee kimo chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EKipengee\u003C/strong\u003E ili kisimame.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo, kipengee chenye kina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBamba la kina hicho, na matundu yake yakiwa wazi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo, kipengee bila kina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBamba nyembamba ya inchi 2 ili bado ionekane.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHesabu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENguzo ndogo juu ya kila nukta iliyohesabiwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKimo ni sehemu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimo\u003C/span\u003E ya kipengee cha mstari, na kina ni sehemu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKina\u003C/span\u003E ya kipengee cha eneo, chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EKipengee\u003C/strong\u003E (tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EUnda vipengee vya ukadiriaji\u003C/a\u003E). Ukibadilisha, mwonekano wa 3D unasasishwa mara moja. Maelezo chini ya jina la karatasi yanasema karatasi inashikilia nini, kwa mfano &quot;Karatasi hii kwa 3D: kuta 2, bamba 1, hesabu 3&quot;, na ni mistari au maeneo mangapi hayana kimo au kina. Mibofyo hupita kupitia maelezo hayo hadi kwenye mwonekano.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENambari hazibadiliki kwenye 3D: eneo la ukuta ni urefu wake halisi mara kimo chake, na ujazo wa bamba ni eneo lake halisi (mpaka ukitoa matundu, mikunjo ikiwa sahihi) mara kina chake. Mikunjo huchorwa kama vipande vifupi vya mstari ulionyooka kwenye skrini pekee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zunguka\"\u003EZunguka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitendo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kati\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZunguka ukadiriaji.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + buruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kulia\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESogeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGurudumu la kipanya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuza ndani na nje kwenye kielekezi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETelezesha vidole viwili kwenye pedi ya kugusa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZunguka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E husogeza). Kubana kunakuza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJuu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMbele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENyuma\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKushoto\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKulia\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChini\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMionekano ya kawaida, iliyopangwa kwenye ukadiriaji. Mwonekano wa 3D unafunguka kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMtazamo wa kina\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMtazamo wa kina umewashwa au umezimwa (sambamba ukiwa umezimwa).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuza mipaka yote\u003C/span\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaratasi nzima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaratasi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnyesha au ficha mchoro ardhini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKisanduku cha mwonekano, juu kulia\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya uso, ukingo au kona ili kutazama kutoka hapo; buruta ili kuzunguka; buruta pete ya dira ili kugeuza; kitufe cha nyumba kinarudi kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKona inaonyesha kisanduku cha mwonekano, ishara ndogo ya mhimili X, Y, Z, au hakuna chochote: chagua kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E, kichupo cha TakeoffDesk, chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EKiashiria cha kona\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EMipangilio ya TakeoffDesk\u003C/a\u003E). Karatasi bapa haina kiashiria cha kona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKidole kimoja huzunguka; vidole viwili hubana kukuza na kusogea kusogeza. Mguso mmoja huchagua.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuta-zenye-unene-msingi-na-matundu\"\u003EKuta zenye unene, msingi na matundu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKipengee cha mstari chenye kimo husimama kama ukanda mwembamba. Ili kuione kama ukuta halisi, mpe kipengee umbo lake chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EKwenye 3D\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye mipangilio yake:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnene wa ukuta\u003C/strong\u003E (inchi 8, 0.2 m): ukuta unakuwa kigumu, kilichowekwa katikati ya mstari uliochora, kwa kona zilizokatwa kwa mshazari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUrefu wa msingi\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuta unaanza umbali huo juu ya sakafu (dari ya chini, safu ya kabati ya juu). Vipengee vya eneo navyo vina hilo: dari kwa 9&#039;-0&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJuu ya tundu\u003C/strong\u003E: sehemu iliyokatwa (mlango, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#deduct-a-part-of-a-run\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"deduct-a-part-of-a-run\"\u003EOndoa sehemu ya mstari\u003C/a\u003E) inabaki na ukuta juu ya kimo hicho, kwa hiyo mlango unaonekana kama mlango. Bila hilo, sehemu iliyokatwa huacha pengo hadi juu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHizi zinaunda tu mwonekano wa 3D: viasi (urefu, eneo la ukuta, gharama) vinabaki kama vilivyokuwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panga-ghorofa\"\u003EPanga ghorofa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua PDF za kila ghorofa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye mwonekano wa 3D, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViwango…\u003C/span\u003E na andika mwinuko wa kila ghorofa, kama \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E kwa ghorofa ya chini na \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E kwa inayofuata. Kisicho na kitu hakitumiki kwenye karatasi hiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanga\u003C/span\u003E. Kila karatasi yenye kiwango inaonyesha ukadiriaji wake kwa kimo chake; karatasi iliyo kwenye skrini inakaa chini ya ghorofa yake, nyingine zimeonyeshwa kwa mistari ya nje. Maelezo yanasema ghorofa ngapi zimepangwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaratasi zinalingana kwa mahali zilipo kwenye ukurasa, kwa hiyo hii inafanya kazi kwa michoro ya mipango ya ghorofa iliyochorwa kwa njia moja (ukubwa na nafasi sawa ya karatasi). Karatasi yenye kiwango lakini bila skeli haijumuishwi, na maelezo yanasema hivyo. Chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanga\u003C/span\u003E tena kwa karatasi moja kwa wakati. Viwango vinahifadhiwa pamoja na ukadiriaji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hifadhi-mwonekano-wa-3d-kama-picha\"\u003EHifadhi mwonekano wa 3D kama picha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa 3D kwa picha ya mwonekano kama ulivyo kwenye skrini (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D.png\u003C/code\u003E); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bofya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E huifanya mara mbili ya ukubwa (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D@2x.png\u003C/code\u003E), kwa uchapishaji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hifadhi-mwonekano-wa-3d-kama-modeli\"\u003EHifadhi mwonekano wa 3D kama modeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa 3D. Unapata faili \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E (glTF, binary) la kile mwonekano unachoonyesha: ghorofa iliyo kwenye skrini, au kila ghorofa iliyopangwa. Programu nyingine za 3D zinaweza kulifungua: kitu kimoja kwa kila alama, kikiitwa kwa jina la kipengee chake, kwa rangi ya kipengee, kwa mita na Y juu. Karatasi yenyewe na mistari ya nje hazimo ndani yake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chagua-alama-kutoka-3d\"\u003EChagua alama kutoka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBofya ukuta, bamba, bamba nyembamba au nguzo ndogo. Alama yake inakuwa alama iliyochaguliwa, kama ungeibofya kwenye karatasi: inaonekana chini ya \u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E, kipengee chake kinakuwa cha sasa, na upau wa hali unatoa urefu na kimo chake, au eneo, kina na yadi za ujazo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bofya huongeza alama kwenye uteuzi au kuziondoa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hufuta alama zilizochaguliwa na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inazirudisha; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E haichagui chochote. Ukirudi kwenye karatasi, alama zilezile zinabaki zimechaguliwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMchoro unafuata mandhari: katika Model, karatasi iliyo chini inakuwa nyeusi kama mwonekano bapa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Mwonekano wa 3D ni ukaguzi, si mchoro wa pili: unasimamisha ukadiriaji wa karatasi iliyo wazi juu yake kwenye skrini, ili ukuta unaokosekana, bamba lililorudiwa au hesabu iliyopotea yaonekane mara moja. Kabla ya kuanza: karatasi inahitaji skeli (Weka skeli). Vimo na kina vinahitaji futi halisi, kwa hiyo kwenye karatasi isiyo na skeli 3D inasema hivyo na inabaki kwenye karatasi bapa. Fungua mwonekano wa 3D Onyesha karatasi unayotaka kukagua. Chagua 3D kwenye upau unaoonyesha jina la karatasi na skeli, au bonyeza 3. Mara ya kwanza, mwonekano wa 3D huchukua muda kupakia. Karatasi huchorwa chini, na ukadiriaji unasimama juu yake kwa rangi ya kila kipengee. Kurudi, chagua 3D tena, Rudi kwenye karatasi, au bonyeza 3. Kuchagua zana ya kuchora (Mstari, Eneo, Hesabu na kadhalika) pia hurudisha, kwa sababu alama huchorwa kwenye karatasi bapa. Mwonekano unaonyesha karatasi kwenye skrini; badilisha karatasi kwenye orodha ya karatasi, au kwa Page Down na Page Up, na mwonekano wa 3D unafuata. Ili kuona ghorofa kadhaa kwa pamoja, zipange (hapa chini). Unachokiona Alama Kwenye 3D Mstari wa kukimbia, kipengee chenye kimo Ukuta wa kimo hicho kando ya mstari. Mistari iliyopinda hufuata mkunjo. Mstari wa kukimbia, kipengee bila kimo Mstari kwenye karatasi. Mpe kipengee kimo chini ya Kipengee ili kisimame. Eneo, kipengee chenye kina Bamba la kina hicho, na matundu yake yakiwa wazi. Eneo, kipengee bila kina Bamba nyembamba ya inchi 2 ili bado ionekane. Hesabu Nguzo ndogo juu ya kila nukta iliyohesabiwa. Kimo ni sehemu ya Kimo ya kipengee cha mstari, na kina ni sehemu ya Kina ya kipengee cha eneo, chini ya Kipengee (tazama Unda vipengee vya ukadiriaji). Ukibadilisha, mwonekano wa 3D unasasishwa mara moja. Maelezo chini ya jina la karatasi yanasema karatasi inashikilia nini, kwa mfano \"Karatasi hii kwa 3D: kuta 2, bamba 1, hesabu 3\", na ni mistari au maeneo mangapi hayana kimo au kina. Mibofyo hupita kupitia maelezo hayo hadi kwenye mwonekano. Nambari hazibadiliki kwenye 3D: eneo la ukuta ni urefu wake halisi mara kimo chake, na ujazo wa bamba ni eneo lake halisi (mpaka ukitoa matundu, mikunjo ikiwa sahihi) mara kina chake. Mikunjo huchorwa kama vipande vifupi vya mstari ulionyooka kwenye skrini pekee. Zunguka Kitendo Kinachofanya Buruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kati Zunguka ukadiriaji. Shift + buruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kulia Sogeza. Gurudumu la kipanya Kuza ndani na nje kwenye kielekezi. Telezesha vidole viwili kwenye pedi ya kugusa Zunguka (Shift husogeza). Kubana kunakuza. Iso, Juu, Mbele, Nyuma, Kushoto, Kulia, Chini Mionekano ya kawaida, iliyopangwa kwenye ukadiriaji. Mwonekano wa 3D unafunguka kwenye Iso. Mtazamo wa kina Mtazamo wa kina umewashwa au umezimwa (sambamba ukiwa umezimwa). Kuza mipaka yote au F Karatasi nzima. Karatasi Onyesha au ficha mchoro ardhini. Kisanduku cha mwonekano, juu kulia Bofya uso, ukingo au kona ili kutazama kutoka hapo; buruta ili kuzunguka; buruta pete ya dira ili kugeuza; kitufe cha nyumba kinarudi kwenye Iso. Kona inaonyesha kisanduku cha mwonekano, ishara ndogo ya mhimili X, Y, Z, au hakuna chochote: chagua kwenye Mipangilio, kichupo cha TakeoffDesk, chini ya Kiashiria cha kona (Mipangilio ya TakeoffDesk). Karatasi bapa haina kiashiria cha kona. Kidole kimoja huzunguka; vidole viwili hubana kukuza na kusogea kusogeza. Mguso mmoja huchagua. Kuta zenye unene, msingi na matundu Kipengee cha mstari chenye kimo husimama kama ukanda mwembamba. Ili kuione kama ukuta halisi, mpe kipengee umbo lake chini ya Kwenye 3D kwenye mipangilio yake: Unene wa ukuta (inchi 8, 0.2 m): ukuta unakuwa kigumu, kilichowekwa katikati ya mstari uliochora, kwa kona zilizokatwa kwa mshazari. Urefu wa msingi: ukuta unaanza umbali huo juu ya sakafu (dari ya chini, safu ya kabati ya juu). Vipengee vya eneo navyo vina hilo: dari kwa 9'-0\". Juu ya tundu: sehemu iliyokatwa (mlango, Ondoa sehemu ya mstari) inabaki na ukuta juu ya kimo hicho, kwa hiyo mlango unaonekana kama mlango. Bila hilo, sehemu iliyokatwa huacha pengo hadi juu. Hizi zinaunda tu mwonekano wa 3D: viasi (urefu, eneo la ukuta, gharama) vinabaki kama vilivyokuwa. Panga ghorofa Fungua PDF za kila ghorofa. Kwenye mwonekano wa 3D, chagua Viwango… na andika mwinuko wa kila ghorofa, kama 0 kwa ghorofa ya chini na 12' kwa inayofuata. Kisicho na kitu hakitumiki kwenye karatasi hiyo. Chagua Panga. Kila karatasi yenye kiwango inaonyesha ukadiriaji wake kwa kimo chake; karatasi iliyo kwenye skrini inakaa chini ya ghorofa yake, nyingine zimeonyeshwa kwa mistari ya nje. Maelezo yanasema ghorofa ngapi zimepangwa. Karatasi zinalingana kwa mahali zilipo kwenye ukurasa, kwa hiyo hii inafanya kazi kwa michoro ya mipango ya ghorofa iliyochorwa kwa njia moja (ukubwa na nafasi sawa ya karatasi). Karatasi yenye kiwango lakini bila skeli haijumuishwi, na maelezo yanasema hivyo. Chagua Panga tena kwa karatasi moja kwa wakati. Viwango vinahifadhiwa pamoja na ukadiriaji. Hifadhi mwonekano wa 3D kama picha Chagua PNG kwenye upau wa 3D kwa picha ya mwonekano kama ulivyo kwenye skrini (… 3D.png); Shift + bofya PNG huifanya mara mbili ya ukubwa (… 3D@2x.png), kwa uchapishaji. Hifadhi mwonekano wa 3D kama modeli Chagua GLB kwenye upau wa 3D. Unapata faili .glb (glTF, binary) la kile mwonekano unachoonyesha: ghorofa iliyo kwenye skrini, au kila ghorofa iliyopangwa. Programu nyingine za 3D zinaweza kulifungua: kitu kimoja kwa kila alama, kikiitwa kwa jina la kipengee chake, kwa rangi ya kipengee, kwa mita na Y juu. Karatasi yenyewe na mistari ya nje hazimo ndani yake. Chagua alama kutoka 3D Bofya ukuta, bamba, bamba nyembamba au nguzo ndogo. Alama yake inakuwa alama iliyochaguliwa, kama ungeibofya kwenye karatasi: inaonekana chini ya Alama iliyochaguliwa, kipengee chake kinakuwa cha sasa, na upau wa hali unatoa urefu na kimo chake, au eneo, kina na yadi za ujazo. Shift + bofya huongeza alama kwenye uteuzi au kuziondoa. Delete hufuta alama zilizochaguliwa na Ctrl+Z inazirudisha; Esc haichagui chochote. Ukirudi kwenye karatasi, alama zilezile zinabaki zimechaguliwa. Mchoro unafuata mandhari: katika Model, karatasi iliyo chini inakuwa nyeusi kama mwonekano bapa.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"export-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hamisha makadirio na PDF yenye alama","summary":"Pakua makadirio kama kitabu cha XLSX chenye fomula hai au kama CSV, na nakala za PDF zako zikiwa na ukadiriaji umechorwa juu yake.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["pendekezo","muhtasari wa zabuni","hamisha","xlsx","lahajedwali","kitabu cha kazi","csv","pdf yenye alama","chapisha ukadiriaji","ripoti","shiriki","tuma","ufunguo wa alama"],"headings":[{"id":"makadirio-kama-lahajedwali-xlsx","text":"Makadirio kama lahajedwali (XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"makadirio-kama-csv","text":"Makadirio kama CSV","level":2},{"id":"makadirio-kwenye-google-sheets","text":"Makadirio kwenye Google Sheets","level":2},{"id":"viwango-vinavyokosekana-na-kutia-sahihi","text":"Viwango vinavyokosekana na kutia sahihi","level":2},{"id":"pdf-yenye-alama","text":"PDF yenye alama","level":2},{"id":"hakuna-cha-kuhamisha","text":"Hakuna cha kuhamisha?","level":2},{"id":"hifadhi-ukadiriaji-pia","text":"Hifadhi ukadiriaji pia","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHamisha ni upakuaji. Zinatengenezwa kwenye kompyuta yako kutoka kwenye ukadiriaji na PDF zilizofunguliwa; hakuna kinachotumwa popote.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"makadirio-kama-lahajedwali-xlsx\"\u003EMakadirio kama lahajedwali (XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa zana na uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E. Kivinjari chako kinapakua \u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E. Upau wa hali unasema &quot;Imehamishwa (name).xlsx (makadirio yenye fomula hai, kwa karatasi, alama, skeli).&quot; na unaongeza onyo wakati makadirio hayajakamilika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfungue kwenye programu yako ya lahajedwali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKitabu kina karatasi nne za kazi, pamoja na ripoti zilizo hapa chini zinapohusika:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKaratasi ya kazi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInashikilia nini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEstimate\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafu moja kwa kila kipengee na kwa kila kipengele: kiasi, upotevu, kiasi chenye upotevu, viwango, nyenzo, kazi, jumla na maelezo. Jumla ya kazi chini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBy sheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiasi cha kila kipengee kwenye kila karatasi, pamoja na idadi ya alama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKila alama: karatasi, kipengee, aina, kiasi, na maelezo (urefu wa sehemu, maeneo ya jumla na yaliyokatwa, mzunguko).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScales\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKila karatasi yenye skeli au alama: skeli yake, jinsi ilivyowekwa (preset, au kurekebishwa kwa umbali uliouandika), na futi kwa kila kitengo cha PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff summary\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiasi cha kila kipengee, nambari ya CSI, alama na karatasi, bila bei.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKila sehemu ya mkusanyiko iliyojumlishwa katika ukadiriaji wote (sehemu ile ile inayotumiwa na vipengee kadhaa ni mstari mmoja), pamoja na upotevu na gharama ya nyenzo, na vipengee vinavyoitumia.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuote request\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOrodha ya nyenzo ya kutuma kwa msambazaji: viasi vyenye upotevu, safu tupu ya bei kwa kitengo, na kiasi na jumla vinavyojaa bei zinapoandikwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBy division\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENyenzo, kazi na jumla kwa mgawanyo wa CSI MasterFormat, vipengee vinapokuwa na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENambari ya CSI\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkiwa na \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003Emuhtasari wa zabuni\u003C/a\u003E, karatasi ya Estimate pia inamalizika na nyongeza zake za bei (mzigo wa kazi, kodi ya mauzo, gharama za juu, faida, dhamana na zabuni), kama fomula hai.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaratasi ya Estimate inabaki na \u003Cstrong\u003Efomula hai\u003C/strong\u003E: kiasi chenye upotevu, kiasi cha nyenzo na kazi kilichopigwa mviringo, jumla ya kila safu na jumla ya kazi. Programu za lahajedwali zinahesabu upya, kwa hiyo unaweza kubadilisha kiwango au upotevu kwenye lahajedwali na jumla zitafuata. Nambari ambazo TakeoffDesk ilikokotoa pia zimehifadhiwa kwenye seli, na zinalingana hadi senti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafu ya maelezo inaorodhesha fomula ya kila kipengele, hitilafu za fomula, alama kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli, eneo la ukuta na mzunguko. Kitu kikiachwa, safu ya jumla ya kazi inasema &quot;Incomplete: see the notes above&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKitabu kimekaguliwa kwenye LibreOffice Calc, ambacho kilihesabu upya hadi jumla zilezile. Bado hakijafunguliwa kwenye Excel. Maelezo ya safu kwa safu yako kwenye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003ESafu za hamisha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"makadirio-kama-csv\"\u003EMakadirio kama CSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFungua menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha\u003C/span\u003E na uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E. Unapata \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E: safu na nguzo zilezile za karatasi ya Estimate, kama thamani tupu (bila fomula), pamoja na jumla ya kazi. Itumie kubandika kwenye mfumo mwingine wa makadirio au uhasibu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV ina makadirio pekee; kwa viasi kwa karatasi na orodha ya alama, tumia XLSX. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrodha ya vifaa\u003C/span\u003E kwenye menyu hiyo hiyo huhifadhi orodha ya vifaa peke yake kama CSV, kwa ajili ya kuagiza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"makadirio-kwenye-google-sheets\"\u003EMakadirio kwenye Google Sheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJuu ya jedwali la Viasi, \u003Cstrong\u003ENakili kwa Google Sheets\u003C/strong\u003E huweka makadirio kwenye ubao wako wa kunakili kama maandishi yaliyotenganishwa kwa tabo, yenye mistari ile ile ya CSV. Kwenye Google Sheet, bofya seli A1 kisha ubandike. TakeoffDesk haiingii kwenye Google wala haituma chochote huko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"viwango-vinavyokosekana-na-kutia-sahihi\"\u003EViwango vinavyokosekana na kutia sahihi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMstari wenye kiasi bila kiwango unasema \u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;No rate&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye Maelezo yake, na hamisha huyahesabu chini ya jumla. Makadirio yalipotiwa sahihi, hamisha hutaja aliyetia sahihi, lini na kwa jumla ipi. Tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\"\u003EViwango vinavyokosekana na kutia sahihi makadirio\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-yenye-alama\"\u003EPDF yenye alama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua PDF ambazo alama zake unataka zichorwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha\u003C/span\u003E na uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF yenye alama\u003C/span\u003E. &quot;Kuandika PDF yenye alama…&quot; inaonekana, kisha kivinjari chako kinapakua faili moja kwa kila PDF yenye alama, lililopewa jina \u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKatika nakala:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emistari huchorwa kama mistari yenye rangi ya kipengee chake,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emaeneo hujazwa kidogo kwa mstari thabiti wa nje, na mikato iliyoachwa wazi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehesabu ni vitone,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekila ukurasa wenye alama hupata maelezo madogo kwenye kona yake ya chini kushoto: rangi ya kila kipengee, jina lake na kiasi chake kwenye ukurasa huo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF zako za awali hazibadilishwi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVidokezo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPDF zilizofunguliwa pekee ndizo zinaandikwa. Alama kwenye PDF zisizofunguliwa zinabaki kwenye jumla lakini hazichorwi; zifungue PDF hizo kwanza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMajina kwenye maelezo hutumia fonti ya kawaida ya PDF. Herufi isiyoweza kuonyeshwa huchapishwa kama &quot;?&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPDF iliyosimbwa haiwezi kunakiliwa na alama: &quot;Hii PDF imelindwa kwa nenosiri au imesimbwa, kwa hiyo nakala yenye alama haiwezi kuandikwa. Ukadiriaji wenyewe uko sawa; hamisha lahajedwali badala yake.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF yenye alama\u003C/span\u003E ya kwanza kwenye kichupo hupakia kiandishi cha PDF. Nje ya mtandao, kipo tu ikiwa upau wa programu unaonyesha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E; tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EKufanya kazi nje ya mtandao\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkiwa na PDF nyingi zenye alama, Chrome na Edge zinaweza kuuliza mara moja kama tovuti hii inaruhusiwa kupakua faili nyingi. Chagua Ruhusu, la sivyo utapata faili la kwanza tu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hakuna-cha-kuhamisha\"\u003EHakuna cha kuhamisha?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E zinahitaji angalau kipengee kimoja: &quot;Hakuna cha kuhamisha bado: tengeneza kipengee na ukipime.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF yenye alama\u003C/span\u003E inahitaji alama kwenye PDF iliyofunguliwa: &quot;Hakuna alama kwenye PDF zilizofunguliwa bado.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hifadhi-ukadiriaji-pia\"\u003EHifadhi ukadiriaji pia\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHamisha ni ripoti. Ili kuendelea kufanya kazi kwenye ukadiriaji baadaye, chagua pia \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E: tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EHifadhi na ufungue tena ukadiriaji\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kuongeza gharama za juu, faida, kodi na dhamana na kutuma pendekezo, tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003EMuhtasari wa zabuni na pendekezo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Hamisha ni upakuaji. Zinatengenezwa kwenye kompyuta yako kutoka kwenye ukadiriaji na PDF zilizofunguliwa; hakuna kinachotumwa popote. Makadirio kama lahajedwali (XLSX) Fungua menyu ya Hamisha kwenye upau wa zana na uchague XLSX. Kivinjari chako kinapakua (name).xlsx. Upau wa hali unasema \"Imehamishwa (name).xlsx (makadirio yenye fomula hai, kwa karatasi, alama, skeli).\" na unaongeza onyo wakati makadirio hayajakamilika. Ifungue kwenye programu yako ya lahajedwali. Kitabu kina karatasi nne za kazi, pamoja na ripoti zilizo hapa chini zinapohusika: Karatasi ya kazi Inashikilia nini Estimate Safu moja kwa kila kipengee na kwa kila kipengele: kiasi, upotevu, kiasi chenye upotevu, viwango, nyenzo, kazi, jumla na maelezo. Jumla ya kazi chini. By sheet Kiasi cha kila kipengee kwenye kila karatasi, pamoja na idadi ya alama. Marks Kila alama: karatasi, kipengee, aina, kiasi, na maelezo (urefu wa sehemu, maeneo ya jumla na yaliyokatwa, mzunguko). Scales Kila karatasi yenye skeli au alama: skeli yake, jinsi ilivyowekwa (preset, au kurekebishwa kwa umbali uliouandika), na futi kwa kila kitengo cha PDF. Takeoff summary Kiasi cha kila kipengee, nambari ya CSI, alama na karatasi, bila bei. Material list Kila sehemu ya mkusanyiko iliyojumlishwa katika ukadiriaji wote (sehemu ile ile inayotumiwa na vipengee kadhaa ni mstari mmoja), pamoja na upotevu na gharama ya nyenzo, na vipengee vinavyoitumia. Quote request Orodha ya nyenzo ya kutuma kwa msambazaji: viasi vyenye upotevu, safu tupu ya bei kwa kitengo, na kiasi na jumla vinavyojaa bei zinapoandikwa. By division Nyenzo, kazi na jumla kwa mgawanyo wa CSI MasterFormat, vipengee vinapokuwa na Nambari ya CSI. Ukiwa na muhtasari wa zabuni, karatasi ya Estimate pia inamalizika na nyongeza zake za bei (mzigo wa kazi, kodi ya mauzo, gharama za juu, faida, dhamana na zabuni), kama fomula hai. Karatasi ya Estimate inabaki na fomula hai: kiasi chenye upotevu, kiasi cha nyenzo na kazi kilichopigwa mviringo, jumla ya kila safu na jumla ya kazi. Programu za lahajedwali zinahesabu upya, kwa hiyo unaweza kubadilisha kiwango au upotevu kwenye lahajedwali na jumla zitafuata. Nambari ambazo TakeoffDesk ilikokotoa pia zimehifadhiwa kwenye seli, na zinalingana hadi senti. Safu ya maelezo inaorodhesha fomula ya kila kipengele, hitilafu za fomula, alama kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli, eneo la ukuta na mzunguko. Kitu kikiachwa, safu ya jumla ya kazi inasema \"Incomplete: see the notes above\". Kitabu kimekaguliwa kwenye LibreOffice Calc, ambacho kilihesabu upya hadi jumla zilezile. Bado hakijafunguliwa kwenye Excel. Maelezo ya safu kwa safu yako kwenye Safu za hamisha. Makadirio kama CSV Fungua menyu ya Hamisha na uchague CSV. Unapata (name).csv: safu na nguzo zilezile za karatasi ya Estimate, kama thamani tupu (bila fomula), pamoja na jumla ya kazi. Itumie kubandika kwenye mfumo mwingine wa makadirio au uhasibu. CSV ina makadirio pekee; kwa viasi kwa karatasi na orodha ya alama, tumia XLSX. Orodha ya vifaa kwenye menyu hiyo hiyo huhifadhi orodha ya vifaa peke yake kama CSV, kwa ajili ya kuagiza. Makadirio kwenye Google Sheets Juu ya jedwali la Viasi, Nakili kwa Google Sheets huweka makadirio kwenye ubao wako wa kunakili kama maandishi yaliyotenganishwa kwa tabo, yenye mistari ile ile ya CSV. Kwenye Google Sheet, bofya seli A1 kisha ubandike. TakeoffDesk haiingii kwenye Google wala haituma chochote huko. Viwango vinavyokosekana na kutia sahihi Mstari wenye kiasi bila kiwango unasema \"No rate\" kwenye Maelezo yake, na hamisha huyahesabu chini ya jumla. Makadirio yalipotiwa sahihi, hamisha hutaja aliyetia sahihi, lini na kwa jumla ipi. Tazama Viwango vinavyokosekana na kutia sahihi makadirio. PDF yenye alama Fungua PDF ambazo alama zake unataka zichorwe. Fungua menyu ya Hamisha na uchague PDF yenye alama. \"Kuandika PDF yenye alama…\" inaonekana, kisha kivinjari chako kinapakua faili moja kwa kila PDF yenye alama, lililopewa jina (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf. Katika nakala: mistari huchorwa kama mistari yenye rangi ya kipengee chake, maeneo hujazwa kidogo kwa mstari thabiti wa nje, na mikato iliyoachwa wazi, hesabu ni vitone, kila ukurasa wenye alama hupata maelezo madogo kwenye kona yake ya chini kushoto: rangi ya kila kipengee, jina lake na kiasi chake kwenye ukurasa huo. PDF zako za awali hazibadilishwi. Vidokezo: PDF zilizofunguliwa pekee ndizo zinaandikwa. Alama kwenye PDF zisizofunguliwa zinabaki kwenye jumla lakini hazichorwi; zifungue PDF hizo kwanza. Majina kwenye maelezo hutumia fonti ya kawaida ya PDF. Herufi isiyoweza kuonyeshwa huchapishwa kama \"?\". PDF iliyosimbwa haiwezi kunakiliwa na alama: \"Hii PDF imelindwa kwa nenosiri au imesimbwa, kwa hiyo nakala yenye alama haiwezi kuandikwa. Ukadiriaji wenyewe uko sawa; hamisha lahajedwali badala yake.\" PDF yenye alama ya kwanza kwenye kichupo hupakia kiandishi cha PDF. Nje ya mtandao, kipo tu ikiwa upau wa programu unaonyesha Tayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao; tazama Kufanya kazi nje ya mtandao. Ukiwa na PDF nyingi zenye alama, Chrome na Edge zinaweza kuuliza mara moja kama tovuti hii inaruhusiwa kupakua faili nyingi. Chagua Ruhusu, la sivyo utapata faili la kwanza tu. Hakuna cha kuhamisha? XLSX na CSV zinahitaji angalau kipengee kimoja: \"Hakuna cha kuhamisha bado: tengeneza kipengee na ukipime.\" PDF yenye alama inahitaji alama kwenye PDF iliyofunguliwa: \"Hakuna alama kwenye PDF zilizofunguliwa bado.\" Hifadhi ukadiriaji pia Hamisha ni ripoti. Ili kuendelea kufanya kazi kwenye ukadiriaji baadaye, chagua pia Hifadhi ukadiriaji: tazama Hifadhi na ufungue tena ukadiriaji. Ili kuongeza gharama za juu, faida, kodi na dhamana na kutuma pendekezo, tazama Muhtasari wa zabuni na pendekezo.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"bid-summary","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Muhtasari wa zabuni na pendekezo","summary":"Ongeza mzigo wa kazi, kodi ya mauzo, gharama za uendeshaji, faida na dhamana kwenye makadirio, andika yaliyojumuishwa na yasiyojumuishwa, kisha pakua PDF ya pendekezo la kutuma.","section":"tasks","order":101,"keywords":["zabuni","mzigo wa kazi","mzigo","malipo","pendekezo","nukuu","gharama za uendeshaji","faida","nyongeza","kiwango cha faida","kodi ya mauzo","dhamana","yaliyojumuishwa","yasiyojumuishwa","masharti","sahihi","mteja","bei"],"headings":[{"id":"nyongeza","text":"Nyongeza","level":2},{"id":"pendekezo","text":"Pendekezo","level":2},{"id":"katika-mauzo-nje","text":"Katika mauzo nje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMakadirio yanapanga bei ya kile ulichopima. \u003Cstrong\u003EMuhtasari wa zabuni\u003C/strong\u003E unaigeuza kuwa bei: unaongeza kodi ya mauzo, gharama za uendeshaji, faida na dhamana, na unatengeneza \u003Cstrong\u003EPDF ya pendekezo\u003C/strong\u003E yenye yaliyojumuishwa na yasiyojumuishwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFungua kutoka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuhtasari wa zabuni na pendekezo…\u003C/span\u003E. Kila kitu kilichomo kinahifadhiwa pamoja na ukadiriaji, na kila badiliko linaweza kutenduliwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nyongeza\"\u003ENyongeza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAndika asilimia kwenye yoyote kati ya tano (acha nyingine kwa 0). Zinakokotolewa kwa mpangilio huu, kila moja kwenye kilicho juu yake:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMstari\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInakokotolewa kama\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENyenzo, Kazi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJumla za makadirio (zabuni ya msingi ukadiriaji unapokuwa na \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas#alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-hash=\"alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\"\u003Embadala\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMzigo wa kazi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAsilimia ya mzigo × kazi: kodi za malipo, bima na manufaa kwenye mishahara ya timu zako.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGharama\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENyenzo + kazi + mzigo wa kazi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKodi ya mauzo kwenye nyenzo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKodi % × nyenzo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGharama za uendeshaji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGharama za uendeshaji % × (gharama + kodi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaida\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaida % × (gharama + kodi + gharama za uendeshaji).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhamana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhamana % × kila kilicho juu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZabuni\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJumla ya mistari.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila mstari unazungushwa hadi senti. Kitabu cha kazi kinaonyesha mistari hiyo hiyo chini ya jumla ya karatasi ya Makadirio, kwa fomula hai. Muhtasari unasasishwa unapoandika: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inakubali asilimia. Kila mbadala unaonyeshwa kwa nyongeza zilezile kwenye gharama yake, ili mmiliki aone kile kinachobadilika kwa kweli kwa kuuchagua.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pendekezo\"\u003EPendekezo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJaza kile pendekezo linapaswa kusema:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMradi\u003C/strong\u003E (jina la ukadiriaji ikiwa tupu), \u003Cstrong\u003EKwa\u003C/strong\u003E (mteja) na \u003Cstrong\u003EKutoka\u003C/strong\u003E (kampuni yako).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYaliyojumuishwa\u003C/strong\u003E na \u003Cstrong\u003EYasiyojumuishwa\u003C/strong\u003E: moja kwa kila mstari; mstari unaoanza kwa dashi au kitone unakubalika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMasharti\u003C/strong\u003E: maandishi huru, kama &quot;Halali kwa siku 30.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOrodhesha vipengee na viasi\u003C/strong\u003E: wigo, kipengee kwa kipengee, pamoja na viasi na bila bei. Ondoa alama kwa pendekezo la bei moja ya jumla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF ya pendekezo\u003C/span\u003E. PDF (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;takeoff&gt; - proposal.pdf\u003C/code\u003E) ina tarehe, kizuizi cha bei chenye kila nyongeza na zabuni, mbadala, wigo, yaliyojumuishwa na yasiyojumuishwa, masharti, na mistari ya kutia sahihi na tarehe. Ikiwa baadhi ya viasi havikuweza kupimwa (karatasi isiyo na skeli), inasema hivyo chini ya bei.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"katika-mauzo-nje\"\u003EKatika mauzo nje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMara ukadiriaji ukiwa na muhtasari wa zabuni, CSV inaishia nao, na kitabu cha kazi kinapata karatasi ya \u003Cstrong\u003EMuhtasari wa zabuni\u003C/strong\u003E, pamoja na kila mstari, asilimia yake na kiasi chake. Tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EHamisha makadirio\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Makadirio yanapanga bei ya kile ulichopima. Muhtasari wa zabuni unaigeuza kuwa bei: unaongeza kodi ya mauzo, gharama za uendeshaji, faida na dhamana, na unatengeneza PDF ya pendekezo yenye yaliyojumuishwa na yasiyojumuishwa. Fungua kutoka Hamisha › Muhtasari wa zabuni na pendekezo…. Kila kitu kilichomo kinahifadhiwa pamoja na ukadiriaji, na kila badiliko linaweza kutenduliwa. Nyongeza Andika asilimia kwenye yoyote kati ya tano (acha nyingine kwa 0). Zinakokotolewa kwa mpangilio huu, kila moja kwenye kilicho juu yake: Mstari Inakokotolewa kama Nyenzo, Kazi Jumla za makadirio (zabuni ya msingi ukadiriaji unapokuwa na mbadala). Mzigo wa kazi Asilimia ya mzigo × kazi: kodi za malipo, bima na manufaa kwenye mishahara ya timu zako. Gharama Nyenzo + kazi + mzigo wa kazi. Kodi ya mauzo kwenye nyenzo Kodi % × nyenzo. Gharama za uendeshaji Gharama za uendeshaji % × (gharama + kodi). Faida Faida % × (gharama + kodi + gharama za uendeshaji). Dhamana Dhamana % × kila kilicho juu. Zabuni Jumla ya mistari. Kila mstari unazungushwa hadi senti. Kitabu cha kazi kinaonyesha mistari hiyo hiyo chini ya jumla ya karatasi ya Makadirio, kwa fomula hai. Muhtasari unasasishwa unapoandika: Enter inakubali asilimia. Kila mbadala unaonyeshwa kwa nyongeza zilezile kwenye gharama yake, ili mmiliki aone kile kinachobadilika kwa kweli kwa kuuchagua. Pendekezo Jaza kile pendekezo linapaswa kusema: Mradi (jina la ukadiriaji ikiwa tupu), Kwa (mteja) na Kutoka (kampuni yako). Yaliyojumuishwa na Yasiyojumuishwa: moja kwa kila mstari; mstari unaoanza kwa dashi au kitone unakubalika. Masharti: maandishi huru, kama \"Halali kwa siku 30.\" Orodhesha vipengee na viasi: wigo, kipengee kwa kipengee, pamoja na viasi na bila bei. Ondoa alama kwa pendekezo la bei moja ya jumla. Chagua PDF ya pendekezo. PDF (\u003Ctakeoff\u003E - proposal.pdf) ina tarehe, kizuizi cha bei chenye kila nyongeza na zabuni, mbadala, wigo, yaliyojumuishwa na yasiyojumuishwa, masharti, na mistari ya kutia sahihi na tarehe. Ikiwa baadhi ya viasi havikuweza kupimwa (karatasi isiyo na skeli), inasema hivyo chini ya bei. Katika mauzo nje Mara ukadiriaji ukiwa na muhtasari wa zabuni, CSV inaishia nao, na kitabu cha kazi kinapata karatasi ya Muhtasari wa zabuni, pamoja na kila mstari, asilimia yake na kiasi chake. Tazama Hamisha makadirio.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"bid-leveling","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bid packages and bid leveling","summary":"Split the estimate into packages by trade, send each package's scope to subcontractors, compare the bids that come back on the same scope, and use the chosen bid as the package's price.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["bid leveling","leveling","bid package","subcontractor","sub bid","scope","plug","trade","csi division","compare bids","low bid","bid tab","bidder","award","chosen bid","use a bid","subcontract price"],"headings":[{"id":"packages","text":"Packages","level":2},{"id":"enter-the-bids","text":"Enter the bids","level":2},{"id":"how-the-bids-are-leveled","text":"How the bids are leveled","level":2},{"id":"use-a-bid-as-the-package-s-price","text":"Use a bid as the package's price","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EA general contractor sends each trade&#039;s scope to subcontractors and compares what comes back. TakeoffDesk does both from the takeoff: open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid packages and leveling…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"packages\"\u003EPackages\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere is one package for each CSI division your items use (the first two digits of an item&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E). Items without a number make a package of their own. Each package shows its items, how many sheets their marks are on, and our own cost of it (material and labor before markups, from the base bid).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScope CSV\u003C/span\u003E to download what to send a subcontractor: each item with its CSI number, quantity, unit and the sheets it is on. It has no prices. For material suppliers, the workbook&#039;s quote request has the parts list (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EExport the estimate\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"enter-the-bids\"\u003EEnter the bids\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the empty row under the package, type the bidder&#039;s name and the amount of the bid, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the bid\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf a bid leaves part of the scope out, open its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft out\u003C/span\u003E list and tick those items.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo correct a name or an amount, type over it in the table; the × button removes a bid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach change is one step that \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes back, and the bids are saved with the takeoff.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-the-bids-are-leveled\"\u003EHow the bids are leveled\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBids rarely cover the same scope. Leveling fills each left-out item with a \u003Cstrong\u003Eplug\u003C/strong\u003E at our own cost of it, so every bid is compared on the whole package:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELeveled = the bid + the plugs\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe lowest leveled bid is marked \u003Cstrong\u003ELow\u003C/strong\u003E; on a tie, the one entered first. \u003Cstrong\u003EAgainst our cost\u003C/strong\u003E is the leveled bid minus our own cost of the package: negative means under it. A bid that looks lowest can lose once its missing scope is counted.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe workbook gets a \u003Cstrong\u003EBid leveling\u003C/strong\u003E sheet with every package that has bids: our estimate, each bid, its plugs, the leveled total and the difference, as live formulas, and what each bid left out.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"use-a-bid-as-the-package-s-price\"\u003EUse a bid as the package&#039;s price\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse\u003C/span\u003E on a bid and it becomes the price of the whole package in your estimate: the package&#039;s own pricing (the items, their second conditions and assembly parts) drops out of the job total, the items stay as quantities with your own rates for reference, and one line, \u003Cstrong\u003EChosen bid\u003C/strong\u003E, carries the bid&#039;s amount. Items the bid leaves out stay at your own cost, which is what leveling already counted as the plug. Choose another bid, or choose the same one again to take it back; each is one step that \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E undoes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn the bid summary the sub bids are one line inside the cost: overhead, profit and bond are added on top of them like any other cost; sales tax (on material only) and labor burden (on labor) are not. The workbook&#039;s Estimate sheet carries the chosen bid as its own row and the markups block adds it, with live formulas. The material list leaves out an awarded package&#039;s material, because the subcontractor supplies it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA package inside an alternate&#039;s bid area is not repriced: alternates and bid-area subtotals still use your own prices.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"A general contractor sends each trade's scope to subcontractors and compares what comes back. TakeoffDesk does both from the takeoff: open Export › Bid packages and leveling…. Packages There is one package for each CSI division your items use (the first two digits of an item's CSI number, see Create takeoff items). Items without a number make a package of their own. Each package shows its items, how many sheets their marks are on, and our own cost of it (material and labor before markups, from the base bid). Choose Scope CSV to download what to send a subcontractor: each item with its CSI number, quantity, unit and the sheets it is on. It has no prices. For material suppliers, the workbook's quote request has the parts list (see Export the estimate). Enter the bids In the empty row under the package, type the bidder's name and the amount of the bid, then choose Add the bid. If a bid leaves part of the scope out, open its Left out list and tick those items. To correct a name or an amount, type over it in the table; the × button removes a bid. Each change is one step that Ctrl+Z takes back, and the bids are saved with the takeoff. How the bids are leveled Bids rarely cover the same scope. Leveling fills each left-out item with a plug at our own cost of it, so every bid is compared on the whole package: Leveled = the bid + the plugs The lowest leveled bid is marked Low; on a tie, the one entered first. Against our cost is the leveled bid minus our own cost of the package: negative means under it. A bid that looks lowest can lose once its missing scope is counted. The workbook gets a Bid leveling sheet with every package that has bids: our estimate, each bid, its plugs, the leveled total and the difference, as live formulas, and what each bid left out. Use a bid as the package's price Choose Use on a bid and it becomes the price of the whole package in your estimate: the package's own pricing (the items, their second conditions and assembly parts) drops out of the job total, the items stay as quantities with your own rates for reference, and one line, Chosen bid, carries the bid's amount. Items the bid leaves out stay at your own cost, which is what leveling already counted as the plug. Choose another bid, or choose the same one again to take it back; each is one step that Ctrl+Z undoes. In the bid summary the sub bids are one line inside the cost: overhead, profit and bond are added on top of them like any other cost; sales tax (on material only) and labor burden (on labor) are not. The workbook's Estimate sheet carries the chosen bid as its own row and the markups block adds it, with live formulas. The material list leaves out an awarded package's material, because the subcontractor supplies it. A package inside an alternate's bid area is not repriced: alternates and bid-area subtotals still use your own prices.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"save-and-reopen","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hifadhi na ufungue tena ukadiriaji wa kiasi","summary":"Hifadhi ukadiriaji wa kiasi kama faili ya mradi .takeoff.json, ufungue tena pamoja na PDF zilezile, na uone kinachotokea PDF ikikosekana au ikibadilika.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["ukadiriaji ndani ya PDF","kuingiza","kiambatisho","hifadhi","fungua","fungua tena","mradi","takeoff.json","endelea","PDF iliyorekebishwa","PDF iliyobadilika","PDF inayokosekana","nakala ya akiba","hifadhi kiotomatiki","rejesha","kuanguka"],"headings":[{"id":"hifadhi","text":"Hifadhi","level":2},{"id":"weka-ukadiriaji-ndani-ya-pdf","text":"Weka ukadiriaji ndani ya PDF","level":2},{"id":"kichupo-au-kivinjari-kikisimama","text":"Kichupo au kivinjari kikisimama","level":2},{"id":"fungua-tena","text":"Fungua tena","level":2},{"id":"pdf-ikikosekana","text":"PDF ikikosekana","level":2},{"id":"pdf-ikibadilika","text":"PDF ikibadilika","level":2},{"id":"faili-iliyoharibika-au-ya-kigeni","text":"Faili iliyoharibika au ya kigeni","level":2},{"id":"historia-ya-kutendua","text":"Historia ya kutendua","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUkadiriaji wa kiasi unahifadhiwa kama faili ndogo ya mradi, \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Ina vipengee vyako, mikusanyiko, viwango, skeli ya kila karatasi na kila alama. \u003Cstrong\u003EHaina\u003C/strong\u003E PDF; inazipata tena kwa maudhui yake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hifadhi\"\u003EHifadhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E katika kikundi cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaili\u003C/span\u003E, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Kivinjari chako kinapakua \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Upau wa hali unasema &quot;Imehifadhiwa (name).takeoff.json. Itafunguka juu ya PDF zilezile (zinalinganishwa kwa maudhui yake).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamisha faili hadi karibu na PDF za mradi, ili zote mbili zibaki pamoja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila uhifadhi unapakua faili mpya. Kivinjari chako kinaweza kuipa ya pili jina \u003Ccode\u003E(name) (1).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E; weka ile mpya zaidi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJina linatoka kwenye PDF ya kwanza uliyofungua katika ukadiriaji huu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E bado ndiyo njia pekee ya kuweka ukadiriaji kama faili. Unapofanya kazi, TakeoffDesk pia huweka nakala ya kurejesha kwenye kivinjari hiki (angalia hapa chini), na uhifadhi wa wingu bado haupatikani. Ukijaribu kufunga kichupo chenye mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa, kivinjari kinauliza kama unataka kuondoka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weka-ukadiriaji-ndani-ya-pdf\"\u003EWeka ukadiriaji ndani ya PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF yenye ukadiriaji wa kiasi ndani\u003C/span\u003E inapakua nakala ya kila PDF iliyo wazi, yenye jina kama \u003Ccode\u003EPlans (with takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E, ambayo inabeba ukadiriaji wote kama kiambatisho: vipengee, alama, skeli, maeneo ya zabuni, kila kitu kinachomo kwenye \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Kurasa zake hazibadilishwi, kwa hiyo inaonekana na kuchapishwa kama ya awali, na visomaji vingine vya PDF huorodhesha ukadiriaji chini ya viambatisho vyao.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFungua PDF hiyo katika TakeoffDesk (njia yoyote unayotumia kufungua PDF) nayo inauliza \u003Cstrong\u003EHii PDF ina ukadiriaji ndani\u003C/strong\u003E: chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua ukadiriaji wa kiasi\u003C/span\u003E ili kuurejesha, au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF tu\u003C/span\u003E ili kufungua mchoro tu. Nakala inawakilisha PDF iliyotengenezwa kutoka kwake, kwa hiyo \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E iliyohifadhiwa kutoka kwa yoyote kati ya hizo inafunguka kwenye zote mbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwa PDF kadhaa, kila nakala inabeba ukadiriaji wote; zifungue pamoja. Kuhifadhi tena kutoka kwenye nakala kunabadilisha ukadiriaji ndani yake, hakuongezi wa pili. \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E bado ndiyo faili ya kuweka: ni ndogo, na ndiyo inayoandikwa na uhifadhi wa kiotomatiki na programu ya eneo-kazi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kichupo-au-kivinjari-kikisimama\"\u003EKichupo au kivinjari kikisimama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESekunde chache baada ya kila mabadiliko, TakeoffDesk huweka nakala ya ukadiriaji kwenye hifadhi ya kivinjari hiki, pamoja na PDF zake zikiwa na jumla ya 64 MB au chini. Hakuna kinachopakiwa. Ukihifadhi ukadiriaji, ukianza mpya au ukifungua mradi mwingine, nakala hiyo inaondolewa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKichupo kikianguka, kivinjari au kompyuta ikisimama, au ukiondoka ukiwa na mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa, mara nyingine utakapofungua TakeoffDesk itauliza \u003Cstrong\u003ERejesha kazi yako?\u003C/strong\u003E na kuorodhesha ukadiriaji kwa jina. Chagua \u003Cstrong\u003ERejesha\u003C/strong\u003E ili kuurejesha: vipengee, alama na skeli vinarudi, na PDF zake zinafunguka tena kama zilihifadhiwa. Upau wa hali unasema &quot;Imerejeshwa (name). Bado haijahifadhiwa kwenye faili: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E inaihifadhi.&quot; PDF zikiwa kubwa mno kuhifadhiwa, zifungue tena; alama zitaonekana kwenye karatasi zao. Zaidi: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003ERejesha kazi yako\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fungua-tena\"\u003EFungua tena\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua TakeoffDesk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDondosha faili ya \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E na PDF zake pamoja kwenye ukurasa. Au chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua mipango\u003C/span\u003E kwa PDF na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E kwa mradi, kwa mpangilio wowote. Upau wa hali unasema &quot;Imefunguliwa (name): vipengee 12, alama 340.&quot; Kila karatasi inapata skeli yake tena, na alama zinaonekana kwenye karatasi zao.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMpangilio wa PDF hauna maana, wala majina au folda zake. TakeoffDesk inatambua kila PDF kwa alama ya kidole ya maudhui yake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkifungua mradi huku ukadiriaji wa sasa una mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa, TakeoffDesk inauliza kwanza: \u003Cstrong\u003EGhairi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ETupa mabadiliko\u003C/strong\u003E, au \u003Cstrong\u003EHifadhi ukadiriaji kwanza\u003C/strong\u003E. Kufungua mradi kunabadilisha vipengee na alama za sasa; PDF ambazo tayari zimefunguliwa zinabaki wazi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-ikikosekana\"\u003EPDF ikikosekana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkifungua mradi bila PDF zake zote, upau wa hali unaongeza &quot;Fungua PDF zake ili kuona alama (zimeorodheshwa chini ya Karatasi).&quot; Chini ya orodha ya karatasi, ujumbe unasema:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Ukadiriaji huu pia unahusu PDF ambazo hazijafunguliwa. Viasi vyake vinahesabiwa; zifungue ili kuona na kuhariri alama zake:&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003Ekisha majina ya faili na ukubwa wake. Alama zao bado zinahesabiwa katika kila jumla na usafirishaji, kwa skeli walizopimiwa nazo. Fungua PDF hizo ili kuona na kuhariri alama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-ikibadilika\"\u003EPDF ikibadilika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF iliyorekebishwa, au iliyohifadhiwa upya na programu nyingine, ina maudhui tofauti, kwa hiyo ni \u003Cstrong\u003Efaili tofauti\u003C/strong\u003E kwa TakeoffDesk, hata kama jina ni lilelile. Kwenye noti chini ya orodha ya karatasi, faili kama hiyo inasema &quot;faili yenye jina hili imefunguliwa, lakini maudhui yake yanatofautiana&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlama zinabaki zimeunganishwa na toleo la zamani. Zinaendelea kuhesabiwa, kwenye nafasi na skeli zake za zamani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPDF iliyorekebishwa inafunguka kama karatasi mpya bila skeli wala alama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kuhamisha ukadiriaji kwenye marekebisho, fungua PDF zote mbili kisha utumie \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisha\u003C/span\u003E kwenye karatasi mpya: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003ELinganisha karatasi iliyorekebishwa na uhamishe ukadiriaji\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faili-iliyoharibika-au-ya-kigeni\"\u003EFaili iliyoharibika au ya kigeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk inakagua kila faili ya mradi kabla ya kuitumia. Ujumbe unaoweza kuona:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;(file) si mradi wa TakeoffDesk (si JSON halali).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Hii si faili ya mradi wa TakeoffDesk.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Mradi huu ulihifadhiwa na TakeoffDesk mpya zaidi. Ufungue huko.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Alama 3 ziliharibika na zimeachwa.&quot; (zilizobaki zinafunguka)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"historia-ya-kutendua\"\u003EHistoria ya kutendua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHistoria ya kutendua huanza upya unapofungua mradi. Kuhifadhi hakuifuti.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ukadiriaji wa kiasi unahifadhiwa kama faili ndogo ya mradi, (name).takeoff.json. Ina vipengee vyako, mikusanyiko, viwango, skeli ya kila karatasi na kila alama. Haina PDF; inazipata tena kwa maudhui yake. Hifadhi Chagua Hifadhi ukadiriaji katika kikundi cha Faili, au bonyeza Ctrl+S. Kivinjari chako kinapakua (name).takeoff.json. Upau wa hali unasema \"Imehifadhiwa (name).takeoff.json. Itafunguka juu ya PDF zilezile (zinalinganishwa kwa maudhui yake).\" Hamisha faili hadi karibu na PDF za mradi, ili zote mbili zibaki pamoja. Kila uhifadhi unapakua faili mpya. Kivinjari chako kinaweza kuipa ya pili jina (name) (1).takeoff.json; weka ile mpya zaidi. Jina linatoka kwenye PDF ya kwanza uliyofungua katika ukadiriaji huu. Hifadhi ukadiriaji bado ndiyo njia pekee ya kuweka ukadiriaji kama faili. Unapofanya kazi, TakeoffDesk pia huweka nakala ya kurejesha kwenye kivinjari hiki (angalia hapa chini), na uhifadhi wa wingu bado haupatikani. Ukijaribu kufunga kichupo chenye mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa, kivinjari kinauliza kama unataka kuondoka. Weka ukadiriaji ndani ya PDF Hamisha › PDF yenye ukadiriaji wa kiasi ndani inapakua nakala ya kila PDF iliyo wazi, yenye jina kama Plans (with takeoff).pdf, ambayo inabeba ukadiriaji wote kama kiambatisho: vipengee, alama, skeli, maeneo ya zabuni, kila kitu kinachomo kwenye .takeoff.json. Kurasa zake hazibadilishwi, kwa hiyo inaonekana na kuchapishwa kama ya awali, na visomaji vingine vya PDF huorodhesha ukadiriaji chini ya viambatisho vyao. Fungua PDF hiyo katika TakeoffDesk (njia yoyote unayotumia kufungua PDF) nayo inauliza Hii PDF ina ukadiriaji ndani: chagua Fungua ukadiriaji wa kiasi ili kuurejesha, au PDF tu ili kufungua mchoro tu. Nakala inawakilisha PDF iliyotengenezwa kutoka kwake, kwa hiyo .takeoff.json iliyohifadhiwa kutoka kwa yoyote kati ya hizo inafunguka kwenye zote mbili. Kwa PDF kadhaa, kila nakala inabeba ukadiriaji wote; zifungue pamoja. Kuhifadhi tena kutoka kwenye nakala kunabadilisha ukadiriaji ndani yake, hakuongezi wa pili. .takeoff.json bado ndiyo faili ya kuweka: ni ndogo, na ndiyo inayoandikwa na uhifadhi wa kiotomatiki na programu ya eneo-kazi. Kichupo au kivinjari kikisimama Sekunde chache baada ya kila mabadiliko, TakeoffDesk huweka nakala ya ukadiriaji kwenye hifadhi ya kivinjari hiki, pamoja na PDF zake zikiwa na jumla ya 64 MB au chini. Hakuna kinachopakiwa. Ukihifadhi ukadiriaji, ukianza mpya au ukifungua mradi mwingine, nakala hiyo inaondolewa. Kichupo kikianguka, kivinjari au kompyuta ikisimama, au ukiondoka ukiwa na mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa, mara nyingine utakapofungua TakeoffDesk itauliza Rejesha kazi yako? na kuorodhesha ukadiriaji kwa jina. Chagua Rejesha ili kuurejesha: vipengee, alama na skeli vinarudi, na PDF zake zinafunguka tena kama zilihifadhiwa. Upau wa hali unasema \"Imerejeshwa (name). Bado haijahifadhiwa kwenye faili: Hifadhi ukadiriaji inaihifadhi.\" PDF zikiwa kubwa mno kuhifadhiwa, zifungue tena; alama zitaonekana kwenye karatasi zao. Zaidi: Rejesha kazi yako. Fungua tena Fungua TakeoffDesk. Dondosha faili ya .takeoff.json na PDF zake pamoja kwenye ukurasa. Au chagua Fungua mipango kwa PDF na Fungua ukadiriaji kwa mradi, kwa mpangilio wowote. Upau wa hali unasema \"Imefunguliwa (name): vipengee 12, alama 340.\" Kila karatasi inapata skeli yake tena, na alama zinaonekana kwenye karatasi zao. Mpangilio wa PDF hauna maana, wala majina au folda zake. TakeoffDesk inatambua kila PDF kwa alama ya kidole ya maudhui yake. Ukifungua mradi huku ukadiriaji wa sasa una mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa, TakeoffDesk inauliza kwanza: Ghairi, Tupa mabadiliko, au Hifadhi ukadiriaji kwanza. Kufungua mradi kunabadilisha vipengee na alama za sasa; PDF ambazo tayari zimefunguliwa zinabaki wazi. PDF ikikosekana Ukifungua mradi bila PDF zake zote, upau wa hali unaongeza \"Fungua PDF zake ili kuona alama (zimeorodheshwa chini ya Karatasi).\" Chini ya orodha ya karatasi, ujumbe unasema: \"Ukadiriaji huu pia unahusu PDF ambazo hazijafunguliwa. Viasi vyake vinahesabiwa; zifungue ili kuona na kuhariri alama zake:\" kisha majina ya faili na ukubwa wake. Alama zao bado zinahesabiwa katika kila jumla na usafirishaji, kwa skeli walizopimiwa nazo. Fungua PDF hizo ili kuona na kuhariri alama. PDF ikibadilika PDF iliyorekebishwa, au iliyohifadhiwa upya na programu nyingine, ina maudhui tofauti, kwa hiyo ni faili tofauti kwa TakeoffDesk, hata kama jina ni lilelile. Kwenye noti chini ya orodha ya karatasi, faili kama hiyo inasema \"faili yenye jina hili imefunguliwa, lakini maudhui yake yanatofautiana\". Alama zinabaki zimeunganishwa na toleo la zamani. Zinaendelea kuhesabiwa, kwenye nafasi na skeli zake za zamani. PDF iliyorekebishwa inafunguka kama karatasi mpya bila skeli wala alama. Ili kuhamisha ukadiriaji kwenye marekebisho, fungua PDF zote mbili kisha utumie Linganisha kwenye karatasi mpya: Linganisha karatasi iliyorekebishwa na uhamishe ukadiriaji. Faili iliyoharibika au ya kigeni TakeoffDesk inakagua kila faili ya mradi kabla ya kuitumia. Ujumbe unaoweza kuona: \"(file) si mradi wa TakeoffDesk (si JSON halali).\" \"Hii si faili ya mradi wa TakeoffDesk.\" \"Mradi huu ulihifadhiwa na TakeoffDesk mpya zaidi. Ufungue huko.\" \"Alama 3 ziliharibika na zimeachwa.\" (zilizobaki zinafunguka) Historia ya kutendua Historia ya kutendua huanza upya unapofungua mradi. Kuhifadhi hakuifuti.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"compare-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Linganisha karatasi iliyorekebishwa na uhamishe ukadiriaji","summary":"Weka karatasi ya zamani juu ya marekebisho yake, zipange sawa, ona kilichobadilika, na uhamishe ukadiriaji kwenye karatasi mpya pamoja na alama za kukaguliwa zilizowekwa alama.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["marekebisho","kurekebishwa","linganisha","mwingiliano","zamani","mpya","mabadiliko","nyongeza","bulletin","kutoa tena","hamisha ukadiriaji","peleka","beba","pangilia","zilizowekwa alama","kagua"],"headings":[{"id":"linganisha","text":"Linganisha","level":2},{"id":"zipange-sawa","text":"Zipange sawa","level":2},{"id":"tafuta-kilichobadilika","text":"Tafuta kilichobadilika","level":2},{"id":"hamishia-ukadiriaji","text":"Hamishia ukadiriaji","level":2},{"id":"kagua-alama-zilizowekwa-alama","text":"Kagua alama zilizowekwa alama","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKaratasi inapotolewa upya, huhitaji kuipima tena. Fungua PDF ya zamani na mpya, linganisha karatasi hizo mbili, kisha uhamishe ukadiriaji. TakeoffDesk inaweka alama kila alama ambapo mchoro ulibadilika, hivyo unakagua hizo na kuacha zilizobaki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisha\"\u003ELinganisha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua PDF zote mbili: seti ya zamani na iliyorekebishwa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E; zinaweza kuwa faili moja au nyingi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnyesha karatasi \u003Cstrong\u003Empya\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompare\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa karatasi chini ya mchoro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua karatasi ya zamani kwenye orodha. TakeoffDesk inapendekeza karatasi yenye nambari ile ile kwenye PDF nyingine, au ukurasa uleule. Chagua \u003Cstrong\u003ELinganisha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMchoro wa zamani sasa unalala juu ya ule mpya kwa rangi nyekundu. Mahali yanapokubaliana, mistari nyekundu iko juu ya nyeusi; mahali yanapotofautiana, unaona mistari nyekundu peke yake (iliyoondolewa) na mistari nyeusi peke yake (iliyoongezwa). Upau chini ya karatasi unashikilia hatua zilizo hapa chini; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E humaliza ulinganisho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zipange-sawa\"\u003EZipange sawa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaratasi zilizotolewa upya mara nyingi huchorwa kidogo nje ya mahali: zimehamishwa kwenye ukurasa, au zina ukubwa tofauti kidogo. Ikiwa mchoro mwekundu hauko juu ya ule mweusi, chagua \u003Cstrong\u003EPangilia kwa nukta mbili\u003C/strong\u003E na ubofye mara nne:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enukta kwenye mchoro wa zamani (nyekundu), kama katikati ya nguzo au kona ya jengo,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enukta ile ile kwenye mchoro mpya (mweusi),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enukta ya pili kwenye mchoro mwekundu, mbali na ya kwanza,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enukta ile ile kwenye mchoro mweusi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMchoro mwekundu unasogea, unageuka na kubadilishwa ukubwa ili uingie kwenye mweusi. Upau wa hali unaonyesha mchoro mpya ulivyo mkubwa zaidi (&quot;ukubwa × 1.000&quot; unapokuwa sawa). Kuza ndani unapochagua nukta: karibu unapobofya, ndivyo mpangilio unavyokuwa mzuri zaidi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafuta-kilichobadilika\"\u003ETafuta kilichobadilika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cstrong\u003ETafuta mabadiliko\u003C/strong\u003E. TakeoffDesk inalinganisha wino wa michoro miwili: wino ulio kwenye karatasi ya zamani peke yake unageuka nyekundu, wino ulio kwenye karatasi mpya peke yake unageuka bluu, na upau wa hali unahesabu hizo. Mistari iliyosogea kidogo sana (chapisho upya) haihesabiwi kama mabadiliko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPia inaangalia kila alama kwenye karatasi ya zamani na kuhesabu zile zilizo mahali mchoro ulipobadilika:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekipimo au eneo wakati mchoro ulibadilika mwishoni mwake au kwenye kona zake, au kando yake kwa angalau takriban sehemu moja ya sita ya urefu wake;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehesabu wakati kitu kimebadilika karibu nayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamishia-ukadiriaji\"\u003EHamishia ukadiriaji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChagua \u003Cstrong\u003EHamishia ukadiriaji hapa\u003C/strong\u003E. Kila alama kwenye karatasi ya zamani inahamia kwenye mpya, kupitia mpangilio, kwa hatua moja ya kutendua. Zile zilizo karibu na mabadiliko zimewekwa alama: zinachorwa kwa mng&#039;ao wa chungwa, na upau wa karatasi unaonyesha &quot;(n) za kukaguliwa&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkiwa karatasi mpya haikuwa na kipimo, inachukua kipimo cha karatasi ya zamani (kilichorekebishwa ikiwa michoro ilipaswa kupimwa ili kupangwa sawa). Ikiwa tayari ina kipimo tofauti, TakeoffDesk inauliza kwanza: alama zilizohamishwa zinapimwa kwa kipimo cha karatasi mpya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kagua-alama-zilizowekwa-alama\"\u003EKagua alama zilizowekwa alama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua &quot;(n) za kukaguliwa&quot; kwenye upau wa karatasi. Inakuza hadi alama iliyowekwa alama inayofuata na kuichagua; paneli yake inaeleza kwa nini imewekwa alama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERekebisha alama ikiwa mchoro ulibadilika chini yake (buruta kona zake, ongeza au futa alama, au iondoe tena).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cstrong\u003EImekaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E kwenye paneli yake. Alama inaondoka, na hesabu kwenye upau wa karatasi inashuka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlama zimehifadhiwa pamoja na ukadiriaji, kwa hiyo unaweza kuzikagua baadaye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUlinganisho unafanya kazi kwenye PDF za vekta na pia kwenye skana, kwa sababu unalinganisha kile kilichochorwa. Skana iliyopinda au kunyooshwa inaweza kupangwa kwa takriban tu kwa nukta mbili; kisha kagua alama zaidi kwa macho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Karatasi inapotolewa upya, huhitaji kuipima tena. Fungua PDF ya zamani na mpya, linganisha karatasi hizo mbili, kisha uhamishe ukadiriaji. TakeoffDesk inaweka alama kila alama ambapo mchoro ulibadilika, hivyo unakagua hizo na kuacha zilizobaki. Linganisha Fungua PDF zote mbili: seti ya zamani na iliyorekebishwa (Open plans; zinaweza kuwa faili moja au nyingi). Onyesha karatasi mpya. Chagua Compare kwenye upau wa karatasi chini ya mchoro. Chagua karatasi ya zamani kwenye orodha. TakeoffDesk inapendekeza karatasi yenye nambari ile ile kwenye PDF nyingine, au ukurasa uleule. Chagua Linganisha. Mchoro wa zamani sasa unalala juu ya ule mpya kwa rangi nyekundu. Mahali yanapokubaliana, mistari nyekundu iko juu ya nyeusi; mahali yanapotofautiana, unaona mistari nyekundu peke yake (iliyoondolewa) na mistari nyeusi peke yake (iliyoongezwa). Upau chini ya karatasi unashikilia hatua zilizo hapa chini; Esc au Close humaliza ulinganisho. Zipange sawa Karatasi zilizotolewa upya mara nyingi huchorwa kidogo nje ya mahali: zimehamishwa kwenye ukurasa, au zina ukubwa tofauti kidogo. Ikiwa mchoro mwekundu hauko juu ya ule mweusi, chagua Pangilia kwa nukta mbili na ubofye mara nne: nukta kwenye mchoro wa zamani (nyekundu), kama katikati ya nguzo au kona ya jengo, nukta ile ile kwenye mchoro mpya (mweusi), nukta ya pili kwenye mchoro mwekundu, mbali na ya kwanza, nukta ile ile kwenye mchoro mweusi. Mchoro mwekundu unasogea, unageuka na kubadilishwa ukubwa ili uingie kwenye mweusi. Upau wa hali unaonyesha mchoro mpya ulivyo mkubwa zaidi (\"ukubwa × 1.000\" unapokuwa sawa). Kuza ndani unapochagua nukta: karibu unapobofya, ndivyo mpangilio unavyokuwa mzuri zaidi. Tafuta kilichobadilika Chagua Tafuta mabadiliko. TakeoffDesk inalinganisha wino wa michoro miwili: wino ulio kwenye karatasi ya zamani peke yake unageuka nyekundu, wino ulio kwenye karatasi mpya peke yake unageuka bluu, na upau wa hali unahesabu hizo. Mistari iliyosogea kidogo sana (chapisho upya) haihesabiwi kama mabadiliko. Pia inaangalia kila alama kwenye karatasi ya zamani na kuhesabu zile zilizo mahali mchoro ulipobadilika: kipimo au eneo wakati mchoro ulibadilika mwishoni mwake au kwenye kona zake, au kando yake kwa angalau takriban sehemu moja ya sita ya urefu wake; hesabu wakati kitu kimebadilika karibu nayo. Hamishia ukadiriaji Chagua Hamishia ukadiriaji hapa. Kila alama kwenye karatasi ya zamani inahamia kwenye mpya, kupitia mpangilio, kwa hatua moja ya kutendua. Zile zilizo karibu na mabadiliko zimewekwa alama: zinachorwa kwa mng'ao wa chungwa, na upau wa karatasi unaonyesha \"(n) za kukaguliwa\". Ikiwa karatasi mpya haikuwa na kipimo, inachukua kipimo cha karatasi ya zamani (kilichorekebishwa ikiwa michoro ilipaswa kupimwa ili kupangwa sawa). Ikiwa tayari ina kipimo tofauti, TakeoffDesk inauliza kwanza: alama zilizohamishwa zinapimwa kwa kipimo cha karatasi mpya. Kagua alama zilizowekwa alama Chagua \"(n) za kukaguliwa\" kwenye upau wa karatasi. Inakuza hadi alama iliyowekwa alama inayofuata na kuichagua; paneli yake inaeleza kwa nini imewekwa alama. Rekebisha alama ikiwa mchoro ulibadilika chini yake (buruta kona zake, ongeza au futa alama, au iondoe tena). Chagua Imekaguliwa kwenye paneli yake. Alama inaondoka, na hesabu kwenye upau wa karatasi inashuka. Alama zimehifadhiwa pamoja na ukadiriaji, kwa hiyo unaweza kuzikagua baadaye. Ulinganisho unafanya kazi kwenye PDF za vekta na pia kwenye skana, kwa sababu unalinganisha kile kilichochorwa. Skana iliyopinda au kunyooshwa inaweza kupangwa kwa takriban tu kwa nukta mbili; kisha kagua alama zaidi kwa macho.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"use-with-ai-assistants","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Use TakeoffDesk with an AI assistant","summary":"Let your own AI assistant or script read the takeoff's quantities and estimate, add items and marks, count and measure on a DWG or DXF, and export: permissions, connecting through the dev server, and the activity log.","section":"tasks","order":118,"keywords":["ai","assistant","agent","mcp","model context protocol","script","automation","quantities","estimate","permissions","disconnect","activity"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"connect-your-assistant","text":"Connect your assistant","level":2},{"id":"you-stay-in-charge","text":"You stay in charge","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-can-ask-for","text":"What an assistant can ask for","level":2},{"id":"if-something-doesn-t-work","text":"If something doesn't work","level":2},{"id":"see-also","text":"See also","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let an AI assistant (or a script you wrote) work with TakeoffDesk, and how to decide what it is allowed to touch.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk has \u003Cstrong\u003Eno AI of its own\u003C/strong\u003E and sends nothing anywhere. You bring the assistant: any program that speaks the Model Context Protocol (MCP). TakeoffDesk only gives it tools, and you choose which.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and go to the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, tick \u003Cstrong\u003ELet AI assistants and scripts use TakeoffDesk\u003C/strong\u003E. It is off until you do.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose what it may do: \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E is ticked to start with; tick \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESave\u003C/strong\u003E or \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E only when you need them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETools outside the permissions you ticked are not offered to the assistant, and if it asks for one anyway, TakeoffDesk refuses and writes it in the activity log. Turning the switch off ends every connection at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset TakeoffDesk settings\u003C/span\u003E turns it off too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"connect-your-assistant\"\u003EConnect your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants connect through the dev server on your computer. Start TakeoffDesk with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm run mcp\u003C/code\u003E instead of \u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E: the server then also answers assistants at \u003Ccode\u003Ehttp://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp\u003C/code\u003E, only from this computer, with the token it keeps in \u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/.mcp-token\u003C/code\u003E. Keep the TakeoffDesk tab open: the assistant works through it. \u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/MCP.md\u003C/code\u003E has the exact settings for Claude Code and Claude Desktop. Never share the token.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStarted with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E, the server takes no assistants, and the switch has no effect.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"you-stay-in-charge\"\u003EYou stay in charge\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEvery change is one undo step\u003C/strong\u003E, labelled with the assistant&#039;s name for it (for example &quot;Assistant: …&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes back the assistant&#039;s last change as a whole.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYou know when one is connected.\u003C/strong\u003E A button in the app bar names the assistant while it is connected; click it to see what it may do, or to \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EActivity.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E lists every call: when, which tool, done or refused. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the log\u003C/span\u003E keeps a copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-can-ask-for\"\u003EWhat an assistant can ask for\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETool\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPermission\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eapp_info\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheets_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe takeoff open, its PDFs and sheets, each sheet&#039;s scale and marks\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esheet_image\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA picture of a sheet, or a zoomed-in part of it, with a grid in the numbers \u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E takes and the marks already there, so the assistant can see where to measure on a PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe items with their units, rates and assembly formulas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities per item or per sheet; marks on sheets with no scale are listed, never counted as zero\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe priced estimate as TakeoffDesk computes it, with its totals\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk&#039;s own CSV or XLSX export\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdds items with their units, rates and waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasures runs, areas and counts on a sheet. Lengths and areas only on a sheet with a scale, never on an unscaled one\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_sheets\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_catalog\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOn a DWG or DXF you opened: its sheets and their scales, what can be counted (blocks, layers and types, texts), and exact counts, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD count\u003C/span\u003E makes them (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003ECount from a drawing\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECounts in the drawing and puts a count mark on each object found, in one step; counting again adds only what is new\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_measure\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasures a linear or an area item from the drawing&#039;s own lines, arcs, polylines and hatches, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E does (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003EMeasure from a drawing\u003C/a\u003E); only on a sheet with a scale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA scaled sheet&#039;s measured runs, areas and counts as a 3D check model in USD (\u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E), as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD package (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E in the 3D check view writes it (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/usd\"\u003EExport the 3D check view as USD\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E ticked, an assistant adds items and marks (each call one undo step); it cannot move, change or delete marks that are already there.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-something-doesn-t-work\"\u003EIf something doesn&#039;t work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe assistant sees no TakeoffDesk tools:\u003C/strong\u003E check that the switch is on in this window, and that the server was started with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm run mcp\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;needs the export permission&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E tick \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, then ask again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;401&quot; or &quot;token&quot; errors:\u003C/strong\u003E the token changed (\u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/.mcp-token\u003C/code\u003E was deleted and made again). Copy the new one into the assistant&#039;s settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-also\"\u003ESee also\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ERecipes for AI assistants\u003C/a\u003E: worked examples, each with the tools it calls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let an AI assistant (or a script you wrote) work with TakeoffDesk, and how to decide what it is allowed to touch. TakeoffDesk has no AI of its own and sends nothing anywhere. You bring the assistant: any program that speaks the Model Context Protocol (MCP). TakeoffDesk only gives it tools, and you choose which. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,) and go to the TakeoffDesk tab. Under Assistants, tick Let AI assistants and scripts use TakeoffDesk. It is off until you do. Choose what it may do: Read is ticked to start with; tick Edit, Save or Export only when you need them. Tools outside the permissions you ticked are not offered to the assistant, and if it asks for one anyway, TakeoffDesk refuses and writes it in the activity log. Turning the switch off ends every connection at once; Reset TakeoffDesk settings turns it off too. Connect your assistant Assistants connect through the dev server on your computer. Start TakeoffDesk with npm run mcp instead of npm start: the server then also answers assistants at http://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp, only from this computer, with the token it keeps in devshell/.mcp-token. Keep the TakeoffDesk tab open: the assistant works through it. devshell/MCP.md has the exact settings for Claude Code and Claude Desktop. Never share the token. Started with npm start, the server takes no assistants, and the switch has no effect. You stay in charge Every change is one undo step, labelled with the assistant's name for it (for example \"Assistant: …\"). Ctrl+Z takes back the assistant's last change as a whole. You know when one is connected. A button in the app bar names the assistant while it is connected; click it to see what it may do, or to Disconnect it. Activity. Settings › TakeoffDesk › Assistants › Activity lists every call: when, which tool, done or refused. Save the log keeps a copy. What an assistant can ask for Tool Permission What it does app_info, sheets_list Read The takeoff open, its PDFs and sheets, each sheet's scale and marks sheet_image Read A picture of a sheet, or a zoomed-in part of it, with a grid in the numbers marks_add takes and the marks already there, so the assistant can see where to measure on a PDF items_list Read The items with their units, rates and assembly formulas takeoff_quantities Read Quantities per item or per sheet; marks on sheets with no scale are listed, never counted as zero takeoff_estimate Read The priced estimate as TakeoffDesk computes it, with its totals takeoff_export Export TakeoffDesk's own CSV or XLSX export items_add Edit Adds items with their units, rates and waste marks_add Edit Measures runs, areas and counts on a sheet. Lengths and areas only on a sheet with a scale, never on an unscaled one cad_sheets, cad_catalog, cad_count Read On a DWG or DXF you opened: its sheets and their scales, what can be counted (blocks, layers and types, texts), and exact counts, as CAD count makes them (Count from a drawing) cad_count_add Edit Counts in the drawing and puts a count mark on each object found, in one step; counting again adds only what is new cad_measure Edit Measures a linear or an area item from the drawing's own lines, arcs, polylines and hatches, as Measure drawing does (Measure from a drawing); only on a sheet with a scale usd_export Export A scaled sheet's measured runs, areas and counts as a 3D check model in USD (.usdz, .usda or .usdc), as USD package (.usdz) in the 3D check view writes it (Export the 3D check view as USD) With Edit ticked, an assistant adds items and marks (each call one undo step); it cannot move, change or delete marks that are already there. If something doesn't work The assistant sees no TakeoffDesk tools: check that the switch is on in this window, and that the server was started with npm run mcp. \"needs the export permission\": tick Export under Assistants, then ask again. \"401\" or \"token\" errors: the token changed (devshell/.mcp-token was deleted and made again). Copy the new one into the assistant's settings. See also Recipes for AI assistants: worked examples, each with the tools it calls.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"new-takeoff","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Anza ukadiriaji mpya","summary":"Futa kila kitu na uanze ukadiriaji mtupu bila kupakia upya ukurasa, na uhifadhi kazi yako kwanza.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["mpya","ukadiriaji mpya","futa","weka upya","anza upya","tupu","funga PDF","kazi inayofuata"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMpya\u003C/span\u003E inafunga kila PDF na kuanzisha ukadiriaji mtupu kwenye ukurasa uleule.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHifadhi ukadiriaji wa sasa kama unataka kuuweka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMpya\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kundi la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaili\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkiwa kuna mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa, TakeoffDesk inauliza \u003Cstrong\u003EUkadiriaji usiohifadhiwa\u003C/strong\u003E: chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi hesabu kwanza\u003C/span\u003E (inapakua mradi, kisha inafuta), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETupa mabadiliko\u003C/span\u003E, au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGhairi\u003C/span\u003E. Dirisha linarudi kwenye hali yake tupu: hakuna PDF, hakuna vipengee, hakuna alama, hakuna skeli. Upau wa hali unasema &quot;Ukadiriaji mpya. Fungua PDF ili kuanza.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKinachofutwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekila PDF iliyofunguliwa, karatasi zake na picha ndogo zake,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Evipengee, makusanyiko, alama na skeli,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekukuza na nafasi ya kila karatasi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehistoria ya kutendua (huwezi kutendua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMpya\u003C/span\u003E),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehali ya tao, na utafutaji au mapitio yoyote ya hesabu otomatiki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaili zako kwenye diski haziguswi. Ili kurudi kwenye ukadiriaji wa zamani, fungua \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E yake na PDF zake: angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EHifadhi na fungua tena ukadiriaji\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila ukadiriaji mpya unaanza bila vipengee. Ili kuleta vipengee, vinakili kwanza: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENakili kipengee\u003C/span\u003E chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E (au nakili alama, ambazo zinabeba vipengee vyake), kisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBandika\u003C/span\u003E kwenye ukadiriaji mpya. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ENakili, bandika na rudufu alama\u003C/a\u003E. Kwa vipengee unavyotumia kila kazi, vihifadhi kwenye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Emaktaba ya bei\u003C/a\u003E yako na uviongeze kutoka hapo, au ongeza \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Ekifurushi cha biashara\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Mpya inafunga kila PDF na kuanzisha ukadiriaji mtupu kwenye ukurasa uleule. Hifadhi ukadiriaji wa sasa kama unataka kuuweka: Hifadhi ukadiriaji au Ctrl+S. Chagua Mpya kwenye kundi la Faili. Ikiwa kuna mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa, TakeoffDesk inauliza Ukadiriaji usiohifadhiwa: chagua Hifadhi hesabu kwanza (inapakua mradi, kisha inafuta), Tupa mabadiliko, au Ghairi. Dirisha linarudi kwenye hali yake tupu: hakuna PDF, hakuna vipengee, hakuna alama, hakuna skeli. Upau wa hali unasema \"Ukadiriaji mpya. Fungua PDF ili kuanza.\" Kinachofutwa: kila PDF iliyofunguliwa, karatasi zake na picha ndogo zake, vipengee, makusanyiko, alama na skeli, kukuza na nafasi ya kila karatasi, historia ya kutendua (huwezi kutendua Mpya), hali ya tao, na utafutaji au mapitio yoyote ya hesabu otomatiki. Faili zako kwenye diski haziguswi. Ili kurudi kwenye ukadiriaji wa zamani, fungua .takeoff.json yake na PDF zake: angalia Hifadhi na fungua tena ukadiriaji. Kila ukadiriaji mpya unaanza bila vipengee. Ili kuleta vipengee, vinakili kwanza: Nakili kipengee chini ya Vipengee (au nakili alama, ambazo zinabeba vipengee vyake), kisha Bandika kwenye ukadiriaji mpya. Angalia Nakili, bandika na rudufu alama. Kwa vipengee unavyotumia kila kazi, vihifadhi kwenye maktaba ya bei yako na uviongeze kutoka hapo, au ongeza kifurushi cha biashara.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hamisha mwonekano wa ukaguzi wa 3D kama USD","summary":"Andika kuta, bamba, sahani, nguzo za kuhesabu na mistari ya mwonekano wa ukaguzi wa 3D kama kifurushi cha USD, kila kimoja na kipengee chake na kiasi chake.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usdz","openusd","hamisha","3d","mwonekano wa ukaguzi","kuta","bamba","uwasilishaji"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKatika mwonekano wa ukaguzi wa 3D, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKifurushi cha USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E kando ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila kitu (ukuta, bamba, sahani, nguzo ya kuhesabu au mstari) ni kitu kimoja kwenye faili, kikipewa jina la kipengee chake, kikibeba jina la kipengee na kiasi kilichopimwa na mwonekano. Bamba na sahani ni za uwazi kama zilivyo kwenye mwonekano. Faili liko kwenye mita, na mhimili wa Z ukielekea juu.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Katika mwonekano wa ukaguzi wa 3D, chagua Kifurushi cha USD (.usdz) kando ya GLB. Kila kitu (ukuta, bamba, sahani, nguzo ya kuhesabu au mstari) ni kitu kimoja kwenye faili, kikipewa jina la kipengee chake, kikibeba jina la kipengee na kiasi kilichopimwa na mwonekano. Bamba na sahani ni za uwazi kama zilivyo kwenye mwonekano. Faili liko kwenye mita, na mhimili wa Z ukielekea juu.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Coming from other takeoff software","summary":"How the habits of dedicated takeoff programs and PDF markup tools map to TakeoffDesk, and the differences that trip people up.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["switching","migrate","conditions","parts","measurement tools","markups list","quantity link","takeoff habits","differences","compare"],"headings":[{"id":"habits-mapped","text":"Habits mapped","level":2},{"id":"differences-that-trip-people-up","text":"Differences that trip people up","level":2},{"id":"not-here-yet","text":"Not here yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIf you have done takeoff in PlanSwift or with the measurement tools in Bluebeam Revu, most of TakeoffDesk will feel familiar: a plan set, a scale per sheet, things you measure, and a priced total. The way the pieces fit together is different in places, and those places are below.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you know PlanSwift or On-Screen Takeoff, pick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff desk\u003C/span\u003E menu style in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E: a menu bar with File, Edit, View, Scale, Takeoff, Items, Markup and Export over a row of the takeoff tools, with the scale presets on the sheet bar. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habits-mapped\"\u003EHabits mapped\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou are used to\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIn TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpening a job or project that stores the plans (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the PDFs and the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E project side by side. The project stores only the takeoff; the PDFs stay your own files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA markups list with notes, clouds and highlights (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E on the sheet bar: notes, clouds and highlights with a status (Open, Answered, Closed), listed under \u003Cstrong\u003EMarkups\u003C/strong\u003E, drawn in the marked PDF. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/markups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/markups\"\u003ENotes, clouds and highlights\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasurements saved as markups inside the PDF (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe takeoff lives in the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E writes a copy with the takeoff drawn in, for sharing; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E writes a copy that carries the takeoff, to reopen in TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff items (PlanSwift), custom measurement tools saved in the Tool Chest (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EItems\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, rates.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EParts and assemblies with formulas (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe item&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E: components with a formula using \u003Ccode\u003EL H A N P\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESetting the page scale, or calibrating (both)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E group, per sheet. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E measures a known dimension.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApplying one scale to a page range\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot yet: set each sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EViewports with different scales on one sheet (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot yet: one scale per sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolylength and area tools (Bluebeam), linear and area takeoff (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHolding Shift for straight lines\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E snaps to 45° steps, the same idea.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESnapping to the drawing&#039;s lines\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOn by default: ends, midpoints, intersections and the nearest point on a line, with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to turn it off, as in CAD programs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount tool (both)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVisual search for symbols (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): box one symbol, review, add.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECut-outs or deductions in areas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) on a selected area, and round cut-outs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDeductions on linear runs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDraw the run straight through and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E) for the opening. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EMeasure linear runs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArc segments in a polyline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): click a point on the curve, then its end.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe Markups list with quantity columns (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEstimating grid with pricing (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe same table: waste, material and labor per unit, extended totals, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExporting to Excel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E with live formulas, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEscape to stop a tool\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E cancels and returns to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click to finish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click finishes a run or closes an area here too. There is no right-click menu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"differences-that-trip-people-up\"\u003EDifferences that trip people up\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe takeoff is not inside your PDF.\u003C/strong\u003E Nothing you do changes your PDFs. Save the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file and keep it with the drawings. Sending someone the marked PDF does not send them an editable takeoff: send the project file and the original PDFs, or a \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDFs are matched by contents, not by name.\u003C/strong\u003E A revised sheet saved over the old file name is a new file to TakeoffDesk, with no scale and no marks. Your old marks stay on the old version and keep counting. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnscaled marks are left out, not counted as zero.\u003C/strong\u003E If a sheet has no scale, its runs and areas do not count, and the table says &quot;Incomplete&quot;. In many programs you would just see 0. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThere is no page-size guessing.\u003C/strong\u003E Presets assume the PDF is printed at full size. A half-size or &quot;fit to page&quot; PDF needs \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E. Always use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOne item, one main type, more if you ask.\u003C/strong\u003E An item is linear, area or count, and its type locks once it has marks. A condition that gives you both an area and its perimeter is an area item: its perimeter is the \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E variable. A wall with both length and area is a linear item with a height. For a multi-condition item, such as a room with a floor, a base and doors, tick the other kinds under \u003Cstrong\u003EAlso measure\u003C/strong\u003E: each is priced on its own row. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EOne item, several kinds of marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFormulas run on totals.\u003C/strong\u003E Assembly formulas use the item&#039;s totals across every sheet, not each run separately. \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E (the number of runs or areas) is there for per-run extras, like one extra stud per wall.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPerimeter includes cut-outs.\u003C/strong\u003E An area&#039;s \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E adds the edges of its holes. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#read-the-area\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"read-the-area\"\u003EMeasure areas with cut-outs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDragging pans.\u003C/strong\u003E A left-button drag on the sheet pans, in every tool except \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E. You never need to switch to a pan tool. The wheel zooms; it does not scroll.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA recovery copy, not a cloud.\u003C/strong\u003E TakeoffDesk keeps a copy of your work in this browser and offers it back after a crash (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\"\u003EIf the tab or the browser stops\u003C/a\u003E), but the takeoff is yours to save: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Cloud saving is not available yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEverything is in the browser.\u003C/strong\u003E There is nothing to install, and the plans are never uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-here-yet\"\u003ENot here yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPer-sheet scale regions are not built yet. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWhat is not built yet\u003C/a\u003E for the full list and what to do instead.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"If you have done takeoff in PlanSwift or with the measurement tools in Bluebeam Revu, most of TakeoffDesk will feel familiar: a plan set, a scale per sheet, things you measure, and a priced total. The way the pieces fit together is different in places, and those places are below. If you know PlanSwift or On-Screen Takeoff, pick the Takeoff desk menu style in Settings › TakeoffDesk › Menus, keys and mouse: a menu bar with File, Edit, View, Scale, Takeoff, Items, Markup and Export over a row of the takeoff tools, with the scale presets on the sheet bar. See Menus, keys and mouse. Habits mapped You are used to In TakeoffDesk Opening a job or project that stores the plans (PlanSwift) Open the PDFs and the .takeoff.json project side by side. The project stores only the takeoff; the PDFs stay your own files. A markups list with notes, clouds and highlights (Bluebeam) Markup on the sheet bar: notes, clouds and highlights with a status (Open, Answered, Closed), listed under Markups, drawn in the marked PDF. See Notes, clouds and highlights. Measurements saved as markups inside the PDF (Bluebeam) The takeoff lives in the .takeoff.json file. Marked PDF writes a copy with the takeoff drawn in, for sharing; PDF with the takeoff inside writes a copy that carries the takeoff, to reopen in TakeoffDesk. Takeoff items (PlanSwift), custom measurement tools saved in the Tool Chest (Bluebeam) Items under Items: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, rates. Parts and assemblies with formulas (PlanSwift) The item's Assembly: components with a formula using L H A N P. Setting the page scale, or calibrating (both) Preset list or Calibrate in the Scale group, per sheet. Check measures a known dimension. Applying one scale to a page range Not yet: set each sheet. Viewports with different scales on one sheet (Bluebeam) Not yet: one scale per sheet. Polylength and area tools (Bluebeam), linear and area takeoff (PlanSwift) Linear (L) and Area (A). Holding Shift for straight lines Shift snaps to 45° steps, the same idea. Snapping to the drawing's lines On by default: ends, midpoints, intersections and the nearest point on a line, with F3 to turn it off, as in CAD programs. Count tool (both) Count (C). Visual search for symbols (Bluebeam) Auto count (S): box one symbol, review, add. Cut-outs or deductions in areas Cut-out (X) on a selected area, and round cut-outs. Deductions on linear runs Draw the run straight through and press E (Deduct) for the opening. See Measure linear runs. Arc segments in a polyline Arc (R): click a point on the curve, then its end. The Markups list with quantity columns (Bluebeam) The Quantities table, By item or By sheet. Estimating grid with pricing (PlanSwift) The same table: waste, material and labor per unit, extended totals, Job total. Exporting to Excel XLSX with live formulas, or CSV. Escape to stop a tool Esc cancels and returns to Select. Right-click to finish Right-click finishes a run or closes an area here too. There is no right-click menu. Differences that trip people up The takeoff is not inside your PDF. Nothing you do changes your PDFs. Save the .takeoff.json file and keep it with the drawings. Sending someone the marked PDF does not send them an editable takeoff: send the project file and the original PDFs, or a PDF with the takeoff inside. PDFs are matched by contents, not by name. A revised sheet saved over the old file name is a new file to TakeoffDesk, with no scale and no marks. Your old marks stay on the old version and keep counting. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Unscaled marks are left out, not counted as zero. If a sheet has no scale, its runs and areas do not count, and the table says \"Incomplete\". In many programs you would just see 0. See Set the scale. There is no page-size guessing. Presets assume the PDF is printed at full size. A half-size or \"fit to page\" PDF needs Calibrate. Always use Check. One item, one main type, more if you ask. An item is linear, area or count, and its type locks once it has marks. A condition that gives you both an area and its perimeter is an area item: its perimeter is the P variable. A wall with both length and area is a linear item with a height. For a multi-condition item, such as a room with a floor, a base and doors, tick the other kinds under Also measure: each is priced on its own row. See One item, several kinds of marks. Formulas run on totals. Assembly formulas use the item's totals across every sheet, not each run separately. N (the number of runs or areas) is there for per-run extras, like one extra stud per wall. Perimeter includes cut-outs. An area's P adds the edges of its holes. See Measure areas with cut-outs. Dragging pans. A left-button drag on the sheet pans, in every tool except Auto count. You never need to switch to a pan tool. The wheel zooms; it does not scroll. A recovery copy, not a cloud. TakeoffDesk keeps a copy of your work in this browser and offers it back after a crash (If the tab or the browser stops), but the takeoff is yours to save: Ctrl+S. Cloud saving is not available yet. Everything is in the browser. There is nothing to install, and the plans are never uploaded. Not here yet Per-sheet scale regions are not built yet. See What is not built yet for the full list and what to do instead.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"TakeoffDesk settings","summary":"Show inches to 1/16, 1/8 or 1/4, start new items with a waste percentage, choose where the Auto count slider starts, snap to the drawing's lines or to 45° without holding Shift, set how wide a door Room fill closes, and pick the 3D view's corner indicator.","section":"reference","order":5,"keywords":["settings","preferences","options","precision","fractions","inches","rounding","waste","default waste","auto count","threshold","match","slider","snap","45","angle","shift","view cube","axis icon","corner indicator","3d"],"headings":[{"id":"feet-and-inches","text":"Feet and inches","level":2},{"id":"waste-to-start-with","text":"Waste to start with","level":2},{"id":"auto-count-where-the-match-slider-starts","text":"Auto count: where the match slider starts","level":2},{"id":"snap-to-the-drawing-s-own-lines","text":"Snap to the drawing's own lines","level":2},{"id":"room-fill-how-wide-an-opening-it-closes","text":"Room fill: how wide an opening it closes","level":2},{"id":"snap-to-45-without-holding-shift","text":"Snap to 45° without holding Shift","level":2},{"id":"count-marker-size","text":"Count marker size","level":2},{"id":"corner-indicator","text":"Corner indicator","level":2},{"id":"path-tool-the-largest-gap-it-joins","text":"Path tool: the largest gap it joins","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear in the app bar or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. The first tab, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E, holds the settings that belong to this app; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E holds the general ones (theme, panels, toolbar). TakeoffDesk&#039;s settings exist only in the app: you change them here, and this browser remembers them. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset TakeoffDesk settings\u003C/span\u003E puts them back to the start.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"feet-and-inches\"\u003EFeet and inches\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShow lengths to the nearest \u003Cstrong\u003E1/16&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E (the start), \u003Cstrong\u003E1/8&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E or \u003Cstrong\u003E1/4&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E. This changes how lengths read on the sheet, in the panels, in the quantities and in the status bar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly the display is rounded. Quantities, costs and the exports are worked out from the exact lengths, and the exports always show 1/16&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waste-to-start-with\"\u003EWaste to start with\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe waste percentage every new item starts with: 0% (the start), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% or 20%. You can still type another waste for each item, in the item editor or straight in the quantities table. Items you already have keep their own waste.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count-where-the-match-slider-starts\"\u003EAuto count: where the match slider starts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatch\u003C/span\u003E slider sits when an \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/a\u003E search finishes, from 50% to 95%; 75% is the start. Lower offers more look-alikes for you to reject; higher offers fewer. You can still move the slider during each review.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"snap-to-the-drawing-s-own-lines\"\u003ESnap to the drawing&#039;s own lines\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn at the start. While you measure or calibrate, a point near a line of the PDF jumps to its end, its midpoint, a crossing or the nearest point on it. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E in the status bar turn it on and off too. More: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003ESnap to the drawing&#039;s lines\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"room-fill-how-wide-an-opening-it-closes\"\u003ERoom fill: how wide an opening it closes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom fill closes openings up to\u003C/span\u003E sets how wide a door opening or gap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E tool treats as closed: 3&#039;-0&quot; to 8&#039;-0&quot;, 4&#039;-0&quot; at the start. Wider than your widest door lets a room run into the next one; narrower than a door leaves the room open. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#fill-a-room-with-one-click\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"fill-a-room-with-one-click\"\u003EFill a room with one click\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"snap-to-45-without-holding-shift\"\u003ESnap to 45° without holding Shift\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOff at the start. When it is on, runs, outlines, cut-outs and dragged corners go at 0°, 45°, 90° or 135° from the last point without holding \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; hold \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to click at any angle. The status bar then reads &quot;Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle&quot;. The point you click on an arc&#039;s curve and circles are never snapped; an arc&#039;s end is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"count-marker-size\"\u003ECount marker size\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow big the count dots are: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtra small\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmall\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMedium\u003C/span\u003E (the start: the size the dots always had) or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELarge\u003C/span\u003E. The size holds on screen at every zoom, and the marked PDF draws each dot at the same size on paper, whatever the sheet size, so the PDF at 100% looks as the screen does. More: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand#dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-hash=\"dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\"\u003ECount by hand\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"corner-indicator\"\u003ECorner indicator\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E only: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView cube\u003C/span\u003E (the start: a cube at the top right to click, drag and turn), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis icon\u003C/span\u003E (a small X, Y, Z marker at the bottom right) or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENone\u003C/span\u003E. It changes at once and is kept in this browser. The flat sheet never shows one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"path-tool-the-largest-gap-it-joins\"\u003EPath tool: the largest gap it joins\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath tool: largest gap to join\u003C/span\u003E is how far apart two line ends can be and still count as one path, in PDF points (0.05 to 60; 1.5 at the start). A drawing&#039;s lines often stop a hair short of each other. Larger joins more; smaller keeps lines apart. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E change it while you pick, and this field follows. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EPick the lines\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Open Settings with the gear in the app bar or Ctrl+,. The first tab, TakeoffDesk, holds the settings that belong to this app; General holds the general ones (theme, panels, toolbar). TakeoffDesk's settings exist only in the app: you change them here, and this browser remembers them. Reset TakeoffDesk settings puts them back to the start. Feet and inches Show lengths to the nearest 1/16\" (the start), 1/8\" or 1/4\". This changes how lengths read on the sheet, in the panels, in the quantities and in the status bar. Only the display is rounded. Quantities, costs and the exports are worked out from the exact lengths, and the exports always show 1/16\". Waste to start with The waste percentage every new item starts with: 0% (the start), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% or 20%. You can still type another waste for each item, in the item editor or straight in the quantities table. Items you already have keep their own waste. Auto count: where the match slider starts Where the Match slider sits when an Auto count search finishes, from 50% to 95%; 75% is the start. Lower offers more look-alikes for you to reject; higher offers fewer. You can still move the slider during each review. Snap to the drawing's own lines On at the start. While you measure or calibrate, a point near a line of the PDF jumps to its end, its midpoint, a crossing or the nearest point on it. F3 and Snap in the status bar turn it on and off too. More: Snap to the drawing's lines. Room fill: how wide an opening it closes Room fill closes openings up to sets how wide a door opening or gap the Room tool treats as closed: 3'-0\" to 8'-0\", 4'-0\" at the start. Wider than your widest door lets a room run into the next one; narrower than a door leaves the room open. See Fill a room with one click. Snap to 45° without holding Shift Off at the start. When it is on, runs, outlines, cut-outs and dragged corners go at 0°, 45°, 90° or 135° from the last point without holding Shift; hold Shift to click at any angle. The status bar then reads \"Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle\". The point you click on an arc's curve and circles are never snapped; an arc's end is. Count marker size How big the count dots are: Extra small, Small, Medium (the start: the size the dots always had) or Large. The size holds on screen at every zoom, and the marked PDF draws each dot at the same size on paper, whatever the sheet size, so the PDF at 100% looks as the screen does. More: Count by hand. Corner indicator For the 3D check view only: View cube (the start: a cube at the top right to click, drag and turn), Axis icon (a small X, Y, Z marker at the bottom right) or None. It changes at once and is kept in this browser. The flat sheet never shows one. Path tool: the largest gap it joins Path tool: largest gap to join is how far apart two line ends can be and still count as one path, in PDF points (0.05 to 60; 1.5 at the start). A drawing's lines often stop a hair short of each other. Larger joins more; smaller keeps lines apart. [ and ] change it while you pick, and this field follows. See Pick the lines.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Menyu, vitufe na panya","summary":"Chagua mtindo wa menyu unaolingana na jinsi unavyofanya kazi tayari, mpe amri yoyote kitufe chako mwenyewe, sogeza amri kati ya menyu, na uweke kinachofanya gurudumu na vitufe vya panya.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["mtindo wa menyu","menyu","upau wa menyu","utepe","vichupo vya utepe","upau wa zana","njia za mkato","vitufe vya haraka","vitufe","binafsisha","badilisha","panya","gurudumu","geuza","mwelekeo wa kuza","kitufe cha kati","kitufe cha kulia","sogeza","hamisha","ingiza","dawati la ukadiriaji","ukadiriaji","masharti"],"headings":[{"id":"mitindo-mitatu","text":"Mitindo mitatu","level":2},{"id":"fanya-iwe-yako","text":"Fanya iwe yako","level":2},{"id":"panya","text":"Panya","level":2},{"id":"ichukue-nawe","text":"Ichukue nawe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmri za TakeoffDesk ni zile zile bila kujali unazifikiaje. \u003Cstrong\u003EMtindo wa menyu\u003C/strong\u003E huamua tu zinakaa wapi kwenye skrini, zinaitwaje hapo na ni vitufe vipi vinazifanya ziendeshe. Chagua moja kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenyu, vitufe na panya\u003C/span\u003E. Mabadiliko yanaanza mara moja, na kivinjari hiki kinayakumbuka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mitindo-mitatu\"\u003EMitindo mitatu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMtindo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnachopata\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpau wa zana wa TakeoffDesk wenyewe: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipimo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHariri\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMwonekano\u003C/span\u003E, pamoja na vitufe vya zana vya herufi moja. Mwanzo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDawati la ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpau wa menyu (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHariri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMwonekano\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipimo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha\u003C/span\u003E) juu ya safu moja ya zana za ukadiriaji, kama vile programu za ukadiriaji za skrini zinavyopanga zao. Vipengee vinaitwa masharti kwenye safu. Vitufe ni vile vile, pamoja na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwa kipengee kipya. Vitufe vya kipimo vinahamia kwenye upau wa karatasi, karibu na skeli ya karatasi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUtepe wa ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVichupo vya utepe vilivyopewa majina ya kazi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E (pima, unda umbo, weka kipimo, kutoka kwenye mchoro, masharti), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHariri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMwonekano\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlama\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMakadirio\u003C/span\u003E (kitabu cha kazi, PDF zenye alama, zabuni). Pia kuna menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaili\u003C/span\u003E na safu ya haraka ya kufungua, kuhifadhi, kutendua na kurudia. Zana unazotumia kila siku ni kubwa, na jirani zake ni ndogo na zimepangwa juu ya nyingine. Vitufe ni vile vile; vitufe vya kipimo vinahamia kwenye upau wa karatasi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMitindo yote mitatu inabaki na vitufe vya TakeoffDesk: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E chagua, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mstari, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E eneo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E duara, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E chumba, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E njia (chagua mistari ya PDF), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E shimo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hesabu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hesabu otomatiki, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E rekebisha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kagua, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hali ya tao, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hali ya punguza, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kutosha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mwonekano wa ukaguzi wa 3D, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nasa, na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZana za upau wa karatasi (dokezo, mawingu, vionyeshi, Linganisha, 3D) zinasubiri hadi PDF ifunguliwe. Ukizichagua kabla ya hapo, mstari wa hali unasema hivyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKitufe ambacho ni cha mpangilio wa TakeoffDesk lakini mtindo wako umekipa amri nyingine hakifanyi kitu, na mstari wa hali unasema amri yake ilipohamia (kwa mfano &quot;Katika Vitufe vyangu, Hesabu ni Ctrl+Alt+C&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na vishale daima vinabaki na maana yake. Unapochora mfululizo au mpaka, kubandika au kukagua hesabu otomatiki, herufi na nambari za urefu uliondikwa vinabaki kwa mchoro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fanya-iwe-yako\"\u003EFanya iwe yako\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua mtindo unaokaribia zaidi unavyotaka, kisha bofya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBinafsisha…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVitufe na menyu\u003C/span\u003E, tafuta amri (kisanduku cha kutafuta kinasaidia). Bofya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza ufunguo\u003C/span\u003E kisha bonyeza kitufe, au vitufe viwili mfululizo kwa kitufe cha herufi mbili. Bofya kitufe ili kukiondoa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwa upau wa menyu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMahali ilipo\u003C/span\u003E inahamisha amri kwenda menyu nyingine, au kwenda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVitufe pekee\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanya\u003C/span\u003E, weka gurudumu na vitufe vinavyosogeza karatasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpe jina kisha bofya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuhifadhi mtindo uliojengwa ndani kunafanya nakala yako mwenyewe (&quot;Dawati langu la ukadiriaji&quot;); mtindo uliojengwa ndani haubadiliki kamwe. Kitufe kimoja kilichopewa amri mbili kinaonyeshwa kwa nyekundu, na lazima kirekebishwe kabla ya kuhifadhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panya\"\u003EPanya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGurudumu la panya\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScroll up zooms in\u003C/span\u003E (mwanzo) au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScroll up zooms out\u003C/span\u003E, na kasi yake. Kubana kwa pedi ya kugusa daima hukuza kulingana na jinsi vidole vyako vinavyosogea.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESogeza karatasi kwa\u003C/strong\u003E: kitufe cha kati, kitufe cha kulia, au vyote viwili. Kuburuta kwa kushoto kwenye karatasi tupu na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukiburuta daima husogeza. Bofya kulia bila kuburuta daima humaliza mfululizo au mpaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuruta kwenye mionekano ya 3D\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKila mwonekano wenyewe\u003C/span\u003E huweka vitufe vya mwonekano wa ukaguzi wa 3D (kushoto na kati zinazunguka, kulia zinasogeza). Au weka vitufe vya kati na kulia vizunguke, visogeze, vikuze au visifanye kitu. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pamoja na kitufe hubadilisha kuzunguka na kusogeza. Kitufe cha kushoto daima huzunguka na kuchagua.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ichukue-nawe\"\u003EIchukue nawe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha\u003C/span\u003E inahifadhi mtindo unaotumika kama faili dogo la \u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngiza…\u003C/span\u003E inaongeza moja, kutoka kompyuta nyingine au kutoka kwa mwenzako. Faili lililoingizwa linaweza kuelekeza tu kwenye amri za TakeoffDesk zenyewe: kitu kingine chochote ndani yake kinaachwa, na kuhesabiwa kwenye mstari wa hali. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuta mtindo huu\u003C/span\u003E inaondoa mojawapo ya yako.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMipangilio hii inabaki kwenye kivinjari hiki. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETumia mtindo huu katika kila programu\u003C/span\u003E chini ya kadi za mitindo inafanya kila programu ifunguke kwenye mtindo wake unaolingana (upau wake wa zana, upau wa menyu au utepe), pamoja na mabadiliko uliyofanya katika kila programu. TakeoffDesk haina mtindo wenye mstari wa amri: ukichaguliwa kwa kila programu, TakeoffDesk inabaki na upau wake wa zana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUtepe wa ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E pia ndio utepe wa mpangilio wa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUtepe na kivinjari cha mradi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimataifa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMpangilio\u003C/span\u003E): angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003ESkrini ya TakeoffDesk\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInayohusiana: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKibodi na panya\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EMipangilio ya TakeoffDesk\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EKuhamia kutoka programu nyingine za ukadiriaji\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amri za TakeoffDesk ni zile zile bila kujali unazifikiaje. Mtindo wa menyu huamua tu zinakaa wapi kwenye skrini, zinaitwaje hapo na ni vitufe vipi vinazifanya ziendeshe. Chagua moja kwenye Mipangilio (Ctrl+,) › TakeoffDesk › Menyu, vitufe na panya. Mabadiliko yanaanza mara moja, na kivinjari hiki kinayakumbuka. Mitindo mitatu Mtindo Unachopata TakeoffDesk Upau wa zana wa TakeoffDesk wenyewe: Faili, Hamisha, Kipimo, Ukadiriaji, Hariri na Mwonekano, pamoja na vitufe vya zana vya herufi moja. Mwanzo. Dawati la ukadiriaji Upau wa menyu (Faili, Hariri, Mwonekano, Kipimo, Ukadiriaji, Vipengee, Alama, Hamisha) juu ya safu moja ya zana za ukadiriaji, kama vile programu za ukadiriaji za skrini zinavyopanga zao. Vipengee vinaitwa masharti kwenye safu. Vitufe ni vile vile, pamoja na N kwa kipengee kipya. Vitufe vya kipimo vinahamia kwenye upau wa karatasi, karibu na skeli ya karatasi. Utepe wa ukadiriaji Vichupo vya utepe vilivyopewa majina ya kazi: Ukadiriaji (pima, unda umbo, weka kipimo, kutoka kwenye mchoro, masharti), Hariri, Mwonekano, Alama na Makadirio (kitabu cha kazi, PDF zenye alama, zabuni). Pia kuna menyu ya Faili na safu ya haraka ya kufungua, kuhifadhi, kutendua na kurudia. Zana unazotumia kila siku ni kubwa, na jirani zake ni ndogo na zimepangwa juu ya nyingine. Vitufe ni vile vile; vitufe vya kipimo vinahamia kwenye upau wa karatasi. Mitindo yote mitatu inabaki na vitufe vya TakeoffDesk: V chagua, L mstari, A eneo, O duara, B chumba, P njia (chagua mistari ya PDF), X shimo, C hesabu, S hesabu otomatiki, K rekebisha, D kagua, R hali ya tao, E hali ya punguza, F na W kutosha, 3 mwonekano wa ukaguzi wa 3D, F3 nasa, na Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D, Ctrl+A. Zana za upau wa karatasi (dokezo, mawingu, vionyeshi, Linganisha, 3D) zinasubiri hadi PDF ifunguliwe. Ukizichagua kabla ya hapo, mstari wa hali unasema hivyo. Kitufe ambacho ni cha mpangilio wa TakeoffDesk lakini mtindo wako umekipa amri nyingine hakifanyi kitu, na mstari wa hali unasema amri yake ilipohamia (kwa mfano \"Katika Vitufe vyangu, Hesabu ni Ctrl+Alt+C\"). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space na vishale daima vinabaki na maana yake. Unapochora mfululizo au mpaka, kubandika au kukagua hesabu otomatiki, herufi na nambari za urefu uliondikwa vinabaki kwa mchoro. Fanya iwe yako Chagua mtindo unaokaribia zaidi unavyotaka, kisha bofya Binafsisha…. Kwenye Vitufe na menyu, tafuta amri (kisanduku cha kutafuta kinasaidia). Bofya Ongeza ufunguo kisha bonyeza kitufe, au vitufe viwili mfululizo kwa kitufe cha herufi mbili. Bofya kitufe ili kukiondoa. Kwa upau wa menyu, Mahali ilipo inahamisha amri kwenda menyu nyingine, au kwenda Vitufe pekee. Kwenye Panya, weka gurudumu na vitufe vinavyosogeza karatasi. Ipe jina kisha bofya Hifadhi. Kuhifadhi mtindo uliojengwa ndani kunafanya nakala yako mwenyewe (\"Dawati langu la ukadiriaji\"); mtindo uliojengwa ndani haubadiliki kamwe. Kitufe kimoja kilichopewa amri mbili kinaonyeshwa kwa nyekundu, na lazima kirekebishwe kabla ya kuhifadhi. Panya Gurudumu la panya: Scroll up zooms in (mwanzo) au Scroll up zooms out, na kasi yake. Kubana kwa pedi ya kugusa daima hukuza kulingana na jinsi vidole vyako vinavyosogea. Sogeza karatasi kwa: kitufe cha kati, kitufe cha kulia, au vyote viwili. Kuburuta kwa kushoto kwenye karatasi tupu na Space ukiburuta daima husogeza. Bofya kulia bila kuburuta daima humaliza mfululizo au mpaka. Buruta kwenye mionekano ya 3D: Kila mwonekano wenyewe huweka vitufe vya mwonekano wa ukaguzi wa 3D (kushoto na kati zinazunguka, kulia zinasogeza). Au weka vitufe vya kati na kulia vizunguke, visogeze, vikuze au visifanye kitu. Shift pamoja na kitufe hubadilisha kuzunguka na kusogeza. Kitufe cha kushoto daima huzunguka na kuchagua. Ichukue nawe Hamisha inahifadhi mtindo unaotumika kama faili dogo la .ccinput.json. Ingiza… inaongeza moja, kutoka kompyuta nyingine au kutoka kwa mwenzako. Faili lililoingizwa linaweza kuelekeza tu kwenye amri za TakeoffDesk zenyewe: kitu kingine chochote ndani yake kinaachwa, na kuhesabiwa kwenye mstari wa hali. Futa mtindo huu inaondoa mojawapo ya yako. Mipangilio hii inabaki kwenye kivinjari hiki. Tumia mtindo huu katika kila programu chini ya kadi za mitindo inafanya kila programu ifunguke kwenye mtindo wake unaolingana (upau wake wa zana, upau wa menyu au utepe), pamoja na mabadiliko uliyofanya katika kila programu. TakeoffDesk haina mtindo wenye mstari wa amri: ukichaguliwa kwa kila programu, TakeoffDesk inabaki na upau wake wa zana. Utepe wa ukadiriaji pia ndio utepe wa mpangilio wa Utepe na kivinjari cha mradi (Mipangilio › Kimataifa › Mpangilio): angalia Skrini ya TakeoffDesk. Inayohusiana: Kibodi na panya · Mipangilio ya TakeoffDesk · Kuhamia kutoka programu nyingine za ukadiriaji","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kibodi na panya","summary":"Kila kitufe, kitendo cha panya, pedi ya kugusa na mguso katika TakeoffDesk, vimepangwa, pamoja na tofauti za mifumo.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["vitufe","njia za mkato","vitufe vya haraka","kibodi","panya","pedi ya kugusa","mguso","sogeza","kuza","gurudumu","bofya kulia","bofya mara mbili","nafasi","shift","nakili","bandika","kata","rudufu","chagua zote"],"headings":[{"id":"zana","text":"Zana","level":2},{"id":"wakati-wa-kuchora","text":"Wakati wa kuchora","level":2},{"id":"kuchagua-na-kuhariri","text":"Kuchagua na kuhariri","level":2},{"id":"nakili-na-bandika","text":"Nakili na bandika","level":2},{"id":"faili","text":"Faili","level":2},{"id":"mwonekano-na-karatasi","text":"Mwonekano na karatasi","level":2},{"id":"mwonekano-wa-3d","text":"Mwonekano wa 3D","level":2},{"id":"hesabu-otomatiki","text":"Hesabu otomatiki","level":2},{"id":"msaada","text":"Msaada","level":2},{"id":"madirisha-na-sehemu","text":"Madirisha na sehemu","level":2},{"id":"vidokezo-vya-mifumo","text":"Vidokezo vya mifumo","level":2},{"id":"vitufe-ambavyo-kivinjari-huvihifadhi","text":"Vitufe ambavyo kivinjari huvihifadhi","level":2},{"id":"mahali-ambapo-hamisha-ipo","text":"Mahali ambapo Hamisha ipo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVitufe vya herufi hufanya kazi pale kielekezi kilipo popote kwenye ukurasa na hauandiki kwenye sehemu. Dirisha likiwa wazi, vitufe vyake vyenyewe vinatumika. Herufi zinafanya kazi kwa au bila \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zana\"\u003EZana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZana\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMstari\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuara\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChumba\u003C/span\u003E (jaza chumba kwa bofya moja)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETao\u003C/span\u003E imewashwa au imezimwa (katika Mstari, Eneo na Shimo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPunguza\u003C/span\u003E imewashwa au imezimwa: sehemu zinazofuata za mfululizo zinachorwa lakini hazihesabiwi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETarakimu, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E wakati wa kuchora\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFungua kisanduku cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAndika\u003C/span\u003E: andika urefu au viwianishi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huweka nukta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#type-lengths-and-coordinates\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"type-lengths-and-coordinates\"\u003EPima mistari ya mfululizo\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShimo\u003C/span\u003E (chagua eneo kwanza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERekebisha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKagua\u003C/span\u003E skeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wakati-wa-kuchora\"\u003EWakati wa kuchora\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe au kitendo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeka nukta (nukta, pamoja na Hesabu).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjia: chagua mstari wote uliounganika wa PDF, au mstari wa nje wa bofya (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EChagua mistari ya PDF\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWasha au zima kunasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003ENasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukiwa umeshikwa wakati wa kubofya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENasa sehemu hadi 0°, 45°, 90° au 135° kutoka nukta ya mwisho. Haitumiki kwa nukta za tao au duara.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya mara mbili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaliza mfululizo, au funga eneo au shimo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaliza mfululizo, au funga eneo au shimo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya kulia (bila kusogeza)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaliza mfululizo, au funga eneo au shimo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya nukta ya kwanza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunga eneo au shimo (kuanzia nukta ya tatu).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOndoa nukta ya mwisho (kwanza nukta ya tao inayosubiri).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETupa nukta ya tao inayosubiri; kisha ghairi alama isiyokamilika; kisha rudi kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuchagua-na-kuhariri\"\u003EKuchagua na kuhariri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe au kitendo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya alama (zana ya Chagua)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIchague na kufanya kipengee chake kiwe cha sasa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bofya alama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIongeze kwenye uteuzi, au iondoe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChagua alama zote kwenye karatasi iliyofunguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuruta kishikio cha kona\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESogeza nukta hiyo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hunasa hadi 45°). Hufanya kazi alama moja ikiwa imechaguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFuta alama zilizochaguliwa (usipochora).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsichague chochote: futa uteuzi na mstari wa kukagua.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETendua\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERudia\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nakili-na-bandika\"\u003ENakili na bandika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENakili alama zilizochaguliwa, pamoja na vipengee vyake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKata: nakili alama zilizochaguliwa, kisha uzifute.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBandika: nakala inafuata kielekezi; bofya pale inapokwenda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBandika mahali pale pale: sehemu ile ile kwenye karatasi iliyofunguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETengeneza rudufu ya alama zilizochaguliwa: nakala inafuata kielekezi; bofya pale inapokwenda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsiweke chochote: ghairi kubandika au kurudufu kilicho kwenye kielekezi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHerufi zenyewe bado huchagua zana (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKagua\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShimo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEneo\u003C/span\u003E). Ni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pamoja nazo tu ndizo zinanakili na kubandika. Kwenye sehemu ya maandishi, vitufe hivi hunakili na kubandika maandishi kama kawaida. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ENakili, bandika na rudufu alama\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hufuta alama iliyochaguliwa usipochora. Ikitokea kwa bahati mbaya, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inairudisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faili\"\u003EFaili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua mipango\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi ukadiriaji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENjia hizi mbili zinafanya kazi hata ukiwa unaandika kwenye sehemu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mwonekano-na-karatasi\"\u003EMwonekano na karatasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe au kitendo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGurudumu la panya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuza ndani na nje kwenye kielekezi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuruta (kitufe cha kushoto, cha kati au cha kulia)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESogeza. Katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E, buruta kwa kushoto huchora kisanduku cha kutafuta badala yake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukiwa umeshikwa + buruta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESogeza, katika zana yoyote.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETosha ukurasa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETosha upana\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuza ndani katikati ya mwonekano.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuza nje katikati ya mwonekano.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaratasi inayofuata au iliyotangulia kwenye orodha ya karatasi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZunguka kati ya hali za skrini nzima (Control kwenye kila mfumo, pia kwenye Mac).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFungua au funga msaada huu, jopo lililo upande.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMwonekano wa ukaguzi wa 3D wa karatasi, washa au zima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mwonekano-wa-3d\"\u003EMwonekano wa 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe au kitendo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kati\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZunguka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + buruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kulia\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESogeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGurudumu la panya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuza kwenye kielekezi. Kwenye pedi ya kugusa, kutelezesha vidole viwili huzunguka na kubana hukuza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChagua alama iliyo chini ya kielekezi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bofya huongeza au kuondoa).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuza hadi mipaka ya yote.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERudi kwenye karatasi bapa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAngalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003EKagua ukadiriaji kwa 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hesabu-otomatiki\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe au kitendo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuruta kisanduku\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeka kisanduku kuzunguka alama ya kutafuta (inaanza utafutaji).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya kisanduku cha mechi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkatae, au irejeshe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGhairi utafutaji unaoendelea, au tupa ukaguzi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"msaada\"\u003EMsaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFungua au funga jopo la msaada (pia kitufe cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMsaada\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau wa programu). Hufanya kazi katika zana zote, hata ukiwa unaandika kwenye sehemu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunga jopo la msaada. Kwenye kisanduku chake cha kutafuta, Esc ya kwanza hufuta utafutaji. Jopo likiwa wazi, Esc inayobonyezwa baada ya kubofya karatasi hufunga jopo kwanza; bonyeza tena kughairi katika TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye kibodi nyingi za Mac, safu ya juu hudhibiti mwangaza na sauti. Bonyeza fn pamoja na F1, au washa &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot; katika Mipangilio ya Mfumo, chini ya Kibodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"madirisha-na-sehemu\"\u003EMadirisha na sehemu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKinachofanya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKwenye sehemu: weka thamani. Kwenye dirisha la kurekebisha: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka skeli\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunga dirisha (kama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGhairi\u003C/span\u003E); funga fomu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipengee kipya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENenda kwenye sehemu inayofuata.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vidokezo-vya-mifumo\"\u003EVidokezo vya mifumo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni kitufe cha Command: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Skrini nzima ni ubaguzi: Control+Shift+F.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya kulia ni kubofya kwa vidole viwili kwenye pedi ya kugusa, mara tu bofya ya pili imewashwa katika Mipangilio ya Mfumo, chini ya Trackpad. TakeoffDesk husoma kitufe cha pili pekee; Control-bofya inaweza kuhesabiwa kama bofya la kawaida na kuongeza nukta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKutelezesha vidole viwili kwenye pedi ya kugusa hukuza karatasi (hakuisogezi). Ili kusogeza, bonyeza na buruta, au shikilia Space na buruta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPage Up na Page Down ni fn pamoja na vishale vya juu na chini kwenye kibodi zisizo nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBackspace ni kitufe kilichoandikwa delete.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni Ctrl: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye pedi ya kugusa ya kompyuta ndogo, kutelezesha vidole viwili hukuza karatasi. Ili kusogeza, bonyeza na buruta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ELinux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni Ctrl. Baadhi ya madawati yana njia zao za mkato za Ctrl+Alt au Super; TakeoffDesk haitumii hata moja kati ya hizo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye pedi ya kugusa, kutelezesha vidole viwili hukuza karatasi. Ili kusogeza, bonyeza na buruta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk husoma mguso kama kielekezi kimoja:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGusa huweka nukta, huchagua alama au huongeza nukta ya hesabu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuruta kwa kidole kimoja husogeza karatasi (katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E huchora kisanduku cha kutafuta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKubana ili kukuza bado hakutumiki. Tumia \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETosha ukurasa\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETosha upana\u003C/span\u003E, au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwenye kibodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIli kufunga eneo, gusa nukta yake ya kwanza. Ili kumaliza mfululizo, gusa mara mbili pale kivinjari chako kinapogeuza mguso mara mbili kuwa bofya mara mbili, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwenye kibodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHakuna usomaji wa urefu hai hadi ugusa, kwa sababu hakuna kuelea kwa kielekezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKutumia kibodi na panya au pedi ya kugusa ndiyo njia bora ya kufanya ukadiriaji kwa sasa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vitufe-ambavyo-kivinjari-huvihifadhi\"\u003EVitufe ambavyo kivinjari huvihifadhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVivinjari huhifadhi baadhi ya njia za mkato kwa ajili yake, na ukurasa hauwezi kuzitumia: kufunga kichupo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), kichupo au dirisha jipya (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), na kukuza kwa kivinjari (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Ndiyo maana TakeoffDesk hukuza karatasi kwa gurudumu na vitufe vya \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pekee. Ukibonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwa makosa, ukurasa mzima unakua; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E unauweka sawa. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EVitufe, panya na pedi za kugusa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mahali-ambapo-hamisha-ipo\"\u003EMahali ambapo Hamisha ipo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHakuna amri ya Hamisha: chagua nukta ya hesabu na uiburute, au chagua eneo au mstari na uburute vishikio vyake vya kona.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vitufe vya herufi hufanya kazi pale kielekezi kilipo popote kwenye ukurasa na hauandiki kwenye sehemu. Dirisha likiwa wazi, vitufe vyake vyenyewe vinatumika. Herufi zinafanya kazi kwa au bila Shift. Zana Kitufe Zana V Chagua L Mstari A Eneo O Duara B Chumba (jaza chumba kwa bofya moja) R Tao imewashwa au imezimwa (katika Mstari, Eneo na Shimo) E Punguza imewashwa au imezimwa: sehemu zinazofuata za mfululizo zinachorwa lakini hazihesabiwi Tarakimu, @ au # wakati wa kuchora Fungua kisanduku cha Andika: andika urefu au viwianishi, Enter huweka nukta (Pima mistari ya mfululizo) X Shimo (chagua eneo kwanza) C Hesabu S Hesabu otomatiki K Rekebisha D Kagua skeli Wakati wa kuchora Kitufe au kitendo Kinachofanya Bofya Weka nukta (nukta, pamoja na Hesabu). P Njia: chagua mstari wote uliounganika wa PDF, au mstari wa nje wa bofya (Chagua mistari ya PDF). F3 Washa au zima kunasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro (Nasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro). Shift ukiwa umeshikwa wakati wa kubofya Nasa sehemu hadi 0°, 45°, 90° au 135° kutoka nukta ya mwisho. Haitumiki kwa nukta za tao au duara. Bofya mara mbili Maliza mfululizo, au funga eneo au shimo. Enter Maliza mfululizo, au funga eneo au shimo. Bofya kulia (bila kusogeza) Maliza mfululizo, au funga eneo au shimo. Bofya nukta ya kwanza Funga eneo au shimo (kuanzia nukta ya tatu). Backspace au Delete Ondoa nukta ya mwisho (kwanza nukta ya tao inayosubiri). Esc Tupa nukta ya tao inayosubiri; kisha ghairi alama isiyokamilika; kisha rudi kwenye Chagua. Kuchagua na kuhariri Kitufe au kitendo Kinachofanya Bofya alama (zana ya Chagua) Ichague na kufanya kipengee chake kiwe cha sasa. Shift + bofya alama Iongeze kwenye uteuzi, au iondoe. Ctrl+A Chagua alama zote kwenye karatasi iliyofunguliwa. Buruta kishikio cha kona Sogeza nukta hiyo (Shift hunasa hadi 45°). Hufanya kazi alama moja ikiwa imechaguliwa. Delete au Backspace Futa alama zilizochaguliwa (usipochora). Esc Usichague chochote: futa uteuzi na mstari wa kukagua. Ctrl+Z Tendua. Ctrl+Y au Ctrl+Shift+Z Rudia. Nakili na bandika Kitufe Kinachofanya Ctrl+C Nakili alama zilizochaguliwa, pamoja na vipengee vyake. Ctrl+X Kata: nakili alama zilizochaguliwa, kisha uzifute. Ctrl+V Bandika: nakala inafuata kielekezi; bofya pale inapokwenda. Ctrl+Shift+V Bandika mahali pale pale: sehemu ile ile kwenye karatasi iliyofunguliwa. Ctrl+D Tengeneza rudufu ya alama zilizochaguliwa: nakala inafuata kielekezi; bofya pale inapokwenda. Esc Usiweke chochote: ghairi kubandika au kurudufu kilicho kwenye kielekezi. Herufi zenyewe bado huchagua zana (C ni Hesabu, D ni Kagua, X ni Shimo, V ni Chagua, A ni Eneo). Ni Ctrl pamoja nazo tu ndizo zinanakili na kubandika. Kwenye sehemu ya maandishi, vitufe hivi hunakili na kubandika maandishi kama kawaida. Angalia Nakili, bandika na rudufu alama. Backspace hufuta alama iliyochaguliwa usipochora. Ikitokea kwa bahati mbaya, Ctrl+Z inairudisha. Faili Kitufe Kinachofanya Ctrl+O Fungua mipango Ctrl+S Hifadhi ukadiriaji Njia hizi mbili zinafanya kazi hata ukiwa unaandika kwenye sehemu. Mwonekano na karatasi Kitufe au kitendo Kinachofanya Gurudumu la panya Kuza ndani na nje kwenye kielekezi. Buruta (kitufe cha kushoto, cha kati au cha kulia) Sogeza. Katika Hesabu otomatiki, buruta kwa kushoto huchora kisanduku cha kutafuta badala yake. Space ukiwa umeshikwa + buruta Sogeza, katika zana yoyote. F Tosha ukurasa W Tosha upana + au = Kuza ndani katikati ya mwonekano. − Kuza nje katikati ya mwonekano. Page Down / Page Up Karatasi inayofuata au iliyotangulia kwenye orodha ya karatasi. Ctrl+Shift+F Zunguka kati ya hali za skrini nzima (Control kwenye kila mfumo, pia kwenye Mac). F1 Fungua au funga msaada huu, jopo lililo upande. 3 Mwonekano wa ukaguzi wa 3D wa karatasi, washa au zima. Mwonekano wa 3D Kitufe au kitendo Kinachofanya Buruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kati Zunguka. Shift + buruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kulia Sogeza. Gurudumu la panya Kuza kwenye kielekezi. Kwenye pedi ya kugusa, kutelezesha vidole viwili huzunguka na kubana hukuza. Bofya Chagua alama iliyo chini ya kielekezi (Shift + bofya huongeza au kuondoa). F au W Kuza hadi mipaka ya yote. 3 Rudi kwenye karatasi bapa. Angalia Kagua ukadiriaji kwa 3D. Hesabu otomatiki Kitufe au kitendo Kinachofanya Buruta kisanduku Weka kisanduku kuzunguka alama ya kutafuta (inaanza utafutaji). Bofya kisanduku cha mechi Ikatae, au irejeshe. Esc Ghairi utafutaji unaoendelea, au tupa ukaguzi. Msaada Kitufe Kinachofanya F1 Fungua au funga jopo la msaada (pia kitufe cha Msaada kwenye upau wa programu). Hufanya kazi katika zana zote, hata ukiwa unaandika kwenye sehemu. Esc Funga jopo la msaada. Kwenye kisanduku chake cha kutafuta, Esc ya kwanza hufuta utafutaji. Jopo likiwa wazi, Esc inayobonyezwa baada ya kubofya karatasi hufunga jopo kwanza; bonyeza tena kughairi katika TakeoffDesk. Kwenye kibodi nyingi za Mac, safu ya juu hudhibiti mwangaza na sauti. Bonyeza fn pamoja na F1, au washa \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\" katika Mipangilio ya Mfumo, chini ya Kibodi. Madirisha na sehemu Kitufe Kinachofanya Enter Kwenye sehemu: weka thamani. Kwenye dirisha la kurekebisha: Weka skeli. Esc Funga dirisha (kama Ghairi); funga fomu ya Kipengee kipya. Tab Nenda kwenye sehemu inayofuata. Vidokezo vya mifumo Ctrl ni kitufe cha Command: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Skrini nzima ni ubaguzi: Control+Shift+F. Bofya kulia ni kubofya kwa vidole viwili kwenye pedi ya kugusa, mara tu bofya ya pili imewashwa katika Mipangilio ya Mfumo, chini ya Trackpad. TakeoffDesk husoma kitufe cha pili pekee; Control-bofya inaweza kuhesabiwa kama bofya la kawaida na kuongeza nukta. Kutelezesha vidole viwili kwenye pedi ya kugusa hukuza karatasi (hakuisogezi). Ili kusogeza, bonyeza na buruta, au shikilia Space na buruta. Page Up na Page Down ni fn pamoja na vishale vya juu na chini kwenye kibodi zisizo nazo. Backspace ni kitufe kilichoandikwa delete. Ctrl ni Ctrl: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Kwenye pedi ya kugusa ya kompyuta ndogo, kutelezesha vidole viwili hukuza karatasi. Ili kusogeza, bonyeza na buruta. Ctrl ni Ctrl. Baadhi ya madawati yana njia zao za mkato za Ctrl+Alt au Super; TakeoffDesk haitumii hata moja kati ya hizo. Kwenye pedi ya kugusa, kutelezesha vidole viwili hukuza karatasi. Ili kusogeza, bonyeza na buruta. TakeoffDesk husoma mguso kama kielekezi kimoja: Gusa huweka nukta, huchagua alama au huongeza nukta ya hesabu. Buruta kwa kidole kimoja husogeza karatasi (katika Hesabu otomatiki huchora kisanduku cha kutafuta). Kubana ili kukuza bado hakutumiki. Tumia Tosha ukurasa na Tosha upana, au + na − kwenye kibodi. Ili kufunga eneo, gusa nukta yake ya kwanza. Ili kumaliza mfululizo, gusa mara mbili pale kivinjari chako kinapogeuza mguso mara mbili kuwa bofya mara mbili, au bonyeza Enter kwenye kibodi. Hakuna usomaji wa urefu hai hadi ugusa, kwa sababu hakuna kuelea kwa kielekezi. Kutumia kibodi na panya au pedi ya kugusa ndiyo njia bora ya kufanya ukadiriaji kwa sasa. Vitufe ambavyo kivinjari huvihifadhi Vivinjari huhifadhi baadhi ya njia za mkato kwa ajili yake, na ukurasa hauwezi kuzitumia: kufunga kichupo (Ctrl+W), kichupo au dirisha jipya (Ctrl+T, Ctrl+N), na kukuza kwa kivinjari (Ctrl++, Ctrl+−). Ndiyo maana TakeoffDesk hukuza karatasi kwa gurudumu na vitufe vya + na − pekee. Ukibonyeza Ctrl++ kwa makosa, ukurasa mzima unakua; Ctrl+0 unauweka sawa. Angalia Vitufe, panya na pedi za kugusa. Mahali ambapo Hamisha ipo Hakuna amri ya Hamisha: chagua nukta ya hesabu na uiburute, au chagua eneo au mstari na uburute vishikio vyake vya kona.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"entry-formats","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Uingizaji wa urefu, viwango na asilimia","summary":"Unachoweza kuandika kwa umbali, vimo, viwango vya fedha na asilimia za upotevu, pamoja na mifano na ujumbe wa ingizo ambalo TakeoffDesk haliwezi kulisoma.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["ingizo","muundo","futi inchi","sehemu","futi za desimali","metriki","mita","milimita","kiwango","fedha","dola","asilimia","upotevu","kuandika"],"headings":[{"id":"urefu","text":"Urefu","level":2},{"id":"hesabu","text":"Hesabu","level":3},{"id":"jinsi-urefu-unavyoonyeshwa","text":"Jinsi urefu unavyoonyeshwa","level":2},{"id":"viwango-vya-nyenzo-na-kazi-kwa-kila-kitengo","text":"Viwango (vya nyenzo na kazi kwa kila kitengo)","level":2},{"id":"asilimia-ya-upotevu","text":"Asilimia ya upotevu","level":2},{"id":"majina-na-vitengo","text":"Majina na vitengo","level":2},{"id":"fomula","text":"Fomula","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"urefu\"\u003EUrefu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHutumiwa na \u003Cstrong\u003EUmbali halisi\u003C/strong\u003E katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERekebisha\u003C/span\u003E, na na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimo\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKina\u003C/span\u003E katika mhariri wa kipengee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnaandika\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaana yake\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti 24\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti 24 na inchi 6½\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti 12 na inchi 6½ (nafasi badala ya kistari)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6-1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti 12 na inchi 6½ (vistari kati ya sehemu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti 24\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Einchi 30\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Einchi 6½\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Einchi ¾\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti 24 na inchi 6 (pia \u003Ccode\u003Efoot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeet\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einches\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24.5 katika kitengo chaguo-msingi (tazama hapa chini)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti 24.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emita 7.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E750 cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esentimita 750\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emilimita 7,500\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENambari tupu inamaanisha \u003Cstrong\u003Efuti\u003C/strong\u003E kwa urekebishaji na kwa vipengee katika LF, SF au SY, na \u003Cstrong\u003Emita\u003C/strong\u003E kwa vipengee katika m au m².\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENukuu zilizopinda na alama za prime kutoka kwa programu za kuchapa (′ ″ ’ ”) hufanya kazi kama \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E na \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Apostrofi mbili \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;&#039;\u003C/code\u003E zinahesabiwa kama \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoma hazizingatiwi: \u003Ccode\u003E1,200 mm\u003C/code\u003E ni 1200 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESehemu zinahitaji nambari nzima pande zote mbili: \u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E inafanya kazi, \u003Ccode\u003E6.5 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E haifanyi kazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmbali wa sifuri na hasi unakataliwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUjumbe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Andika umbali, kama 24&#039;-0&quot; au 7.5 m.&quot; (sehemu ni tupu)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Andika umbali mkubwa kuliko sifuri.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Tumia futi na inchi (24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;), futi za desimali, m, cm au mm.&quot; (kitengo kisichojulikana)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Umbali huo haukuweza kusomwa. Jaribu 24&#039;-6 1/2&quot; au 24.5.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kufuta urefu au kina cha kipengee, futa sehemu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"hesabu\"\u003EHesabu\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila sehemu ya urefu, pamoja na kisanduku cha kuandika wakati unachora, pia hukubali hesabu kwa \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E na mabano: \u003Ccode\u003E4+7/16\u003C/code\u003E (4.4375 katika kitengo chaguo-msingi), \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E (futi 8), \u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKistari kilichoandikwa ndani ya urefu bado ni sehemu yake: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ni futi 24 na inchi 6, na \u003Ccode\u003E6-1/2\u003C/code\u003E ni 6½. Weka nafasi kuzunguka kistari ili kutoa: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039; - 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ni 23&#039;-6&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENambari tupu huzidisha au kugawanya urefu kama nambari; ikiongezwa kwa urefu, iko katika kitengo chaguo-msingi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E na \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E pia zinafanya kazi. Hesabu isiyoweza kusomwa inakataliwa, pamoja na mahali ilipokosea.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jinsi-urefu-unavyoonyeshwa\"\u003EJinsi urefu unavyoonyeshwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUrefu huonyeshwa kama futi, inchi na sehemu za kumi na sita: \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-0 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Thamani hupigwa mviringo hadi 1/16 ya inchi iliyo karibu zaidi kwa kuonyesha; viasi vyenyewe havipigwi mviringo. Thamani za desimali huonyeshwa kwa desimali mbili na vitenganishi vya maelfu, kama \u003Ccode\u003E1,234.50 LF\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"viwango-vya-nyenzo-na-kazi-kwa-kila-kitengo\"\u003EViwango (vya nyenzo na kazi kwa kila kitengo)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnaandika\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaana yake\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E$12.50\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$1,250.00\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E0.385\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0.385 (hadi desimali nne; zaidi zinapigwa mviringo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(tupu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUjumbe: &quot;Andika kiasi kama 12.50.&quot; au &quot;Kiasi hicho ni kikubwa mno.&quot; Viwango hasi havikubaliwi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiasi kilichopanuliwa (nyenzo, kazi, jumla) kinakokotolewa hadi senti: kiasi chenye upotevu × kiwango, kikipigwa mviringo nusu mbali na sifuri, kama \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(x, 2)\u003C/code\u003E ya lahajedwali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"asilimia-ya-upotevu\"\u003EAsilimia ya upotevu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnaandika\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaana yake\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5%\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7.5%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(tupu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadi desimali mbili, kutoka 0% hadi 1000%. Ujumbe: &quot;Andika asilimia kama 10 au 7.5.&quot; au &quot;Upotevu zaidi ya 1000% hauruhusiwi.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"majina-na-vitengo\"\u003EMajina na vitengo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMajina ya vipengee na vipengele: hadi herufi 200.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKitengo\u003C/span\u003E cha kipengele: maandishi yoyote hadi herufi 20, kama \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ekaratasi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECY\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Egal\u003C/code\u003E. Ni lebo tu; TakeoffDesk haibadilishi kitengo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fomula\"\u003EFomula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFomula za mkusanyiko zina kanuni zake: tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003ELugha ya fomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Urefu Hutumiwa na Umbali halisi katika Rekebisha, na na Kimo na Kina katika mhariri wa kipengee. Unaandika Maana yake 24'-0\" futi 24 24'-6 1/2\" futi 24 na inchi 6½ 12' 6 1/2\" futi 12 na inchi 6½ (nafasi badala ya kistari) 12'-6-1/2\" futi 12 na inchi 6½ (vistari kati ya sehemu) 24' futi 24 30\" inchi 30 6 1/2\" inchi 6½ 3/4\" inchi ¾ 24 ft 6 in futi 24 na inchi 6 (pia foot, feet, inch, inches) 24.5 24.5 katika kitengo chaguo-msingi (tazama hapa chini) 24.5' futi 24.5 7.5 m mita 7.5 750 cm sentimita 750 7500 mm milimita 7,500 Nambari tupu inamaanisha futi kwa urekebishaji na kwa vipengee katika LF, SF au SY, na mita kwa vipengee katika m au m². Nukuu zilizopinda na alama za prime kutoka kwa programu za kuchapa (′ ″ ’ ”) hufanya kazi kama ' na \". Apostrofi mbili '' zinahesabiwa kama \". Koma hazizingatiwi: 1,200 mm ni 1200 mm. Sehemu zinahitaji nambari nzima pande zote mbili: 6 1/2\" inafanya kazi, 6.5 1/2\" haifanyi kazi. Umbali wa sifuri na hasi unakataliwa. Ujumbe: \"Andika umbali, kama 24'-0\" au 7.5 m.\" (sehemu ni tupu) \"Andika umbali mkubwa kuliko sifuri.\" \"Tumia futi na inchi (24'-6 1/2\"), futi za desimali, m, cm au mm.\" (kitengo kisichojulikana) \"Umbali huo haukuweza kusomwa. Jaribu 24'-6 1/2\" au 24.5.\" Ili kufuta urefu au kina cha kipengee, futa sehemu. Hesabu Kila sehemu ya urefu, pamoja na kisanduku cha kuandika wakati unachora, pia hukubali hesabu kwa +, -, *, / na mabano: 4+7/16 (4.4375 katika kitengo chaguo-msingi), 12'6\" + 3/4\", (24'-0\")/3 (futi 8), 2*450mm. Kistari kilichoandikwa ndani ya urefu bado ni sehemu yake: 24'-6\" ni futi 24 na inchi 6, na 6-1/2 ni 6½. Weka nafasi kuzunguka kistari ili kutoa: 24' - 6\" ni 23'-6\". Nambari tupu huzidisha au kugawanya urefu kama nambari; ikiongezwa kwa urefu, iko katika kitengo chaguo-msingi. abs, round, ceil na floor pia zinafanya kazi. Hesabu isiyoweza kusomwa inakataliwa, pamoja na mahali ilipokosea. Jinsi urefu unavyoonyeshwa Urefu huonyeshwa kama futi, inchi na sehemu za kumi na sita: 12'-6 1/2\", 0'-0 3/4\". Thamani hupigwa mviringo hadi 1/16 ya inchi iliyo karibu zaidi kwa kuonyesha; viasi vyenyewe havipigwi mviringo. Thamani za desimali huonyeshwa kwa desimali mbili na vitenganishi vya maelfu, kama 1,234.50 LF. Viwango (vya nyenzo na kazi kwa kila kitengo) Unaandika Maana yake 12.5 $12.50 $12.50 $12.50 1,250 $1,250.00 0.385 $0.385 (hadi desimali nne; zaidi zinapigwa mviringo) (tupu) $0 Ujumbe: \"Andika kiasi kama 12.50.\" au \"Kiasi hicho ni kikubwa mno.\" Viwango hasi havikubaliwi. Kiasi kilichopanuliwa (nyenzo, kazi, jumla) kinakokotolewa hadi senti: kiasi chenye upotevu × kiwango, kikipigwa mviringo nusu mbali na sifuri, kama ROUND(x, 2) ya lahajedwali. Asilimia ya upotevu Unaandika Maana yake 10 10% 7.5% 7.5% (tupu) 0% Hadi desimali mbili, kutoka 0% hadi 1000%. Ujumbe: \"Andika asilimia kama 10 au 7.5.\" au \"Upotevu zaidi ya 1000% hauruhusiwi.\" Majina na vitengo Majina ya vipengee na vipengele: hadi herufi 200. Kitengo cha kipengele: maandishi yoyote hadi herufi 20, kama EA, karatasi, CY, gal. Ni lebo tu; TakeoffDesk haibadilishi kitengo. Fomula Fomula za mkusanyiko zina kanuni zake: tazama Lugha ya fomula.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"scale-presets","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Vipimo vilivyowekwa vya skeli","summary":"Kila kipimo kilichowekwa kwenye orodha ya {{ui:Kipimo kilichowekwa}} — cha usanifu, uhandisi na metriki — na kile kila kimoja kinachodhani kuhusu PDF.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["skeli","vipimo vilivyowekwa","skeli ya usanifu","skeli ya uhandisi","skeli ya metriki","uwiano","inchi 1/4","inchi 1/8","1:100","ukubwa kamili"],"headings":[{"id":"usanifu","text":"Usanifu","level":2},{"id":"uhandisi","text":"Uhandisi","level":2},{"id":"metriki","text":"Metriki","level":2},{"id":"skeli-zilizorekebishwa","text":"Skeli zilizorekebishwa","level":2},{"id":"pdf-zisizo-za-kawaida","text":"PDF zisizo za kawaida","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EOrodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipimo kilichowekwa\u003C/span\u003E katika kikundi cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipimo\u003C/span\u003E ina skeli 32 katika makundi matatu. Kipimo kilichowekwa huweka skeli ya karatasi iliyo wazi hasa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila kipimo kilichowekwa kinadhani ukurasa wa PDF ni ukubwa halisi wa karatasi ya mchoro: inchi moja kwenye ukurasa wa PDF ni inchi moja ya karatasi (kurasa za PDF hupima pointi 72 kwa inchi). Ikiwa PDF ilibadilishwa ukubwa, tumia \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERekebisha\u003C/span\u003E. Tumia \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKagua\u003C/span\u003E baada ya kuweka skeli yoyote. Angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EWeka skeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usanifu\"\u003EUsanifu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKipimo kilichowekwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInchi moja ya karatasi ni\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/32&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft 8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5 ft 4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft 8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ft 4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhandisi\"\u003EUhandisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKipimo kilichowekwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInchi moja ya karatasi ni\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 30&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 40&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E40 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 50&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E50 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 60&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E60 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 100&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E100 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"metriki\"\u003EMetriki\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1:1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:20\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:25\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:75\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:150\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:200\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:250\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:500\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:1000\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUwiano wa metriki unamaanisha kwamba kipimo kimoja kwenye karatasi ni vipimo vingi hivyo katika uhalisia: kwa \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, 10 mm kwenye ukurasa ni 1 m.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skeli-zilizorekebishwa\"\u003ESkeli zilizorekebishwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESkeli iliyorekebishwa inaonekana kama &quot;Imerekebishwa 1&quot; = 4.002&#039; kwenye 24&#039;-6&quot;&quot; katika upau chini ya karatasi: futi halisi kwa kila inchi ya karatasi, na umbali uliouandika. Ikiwa iko ndani ya 0.5% ya kipimo kilichowekwa, upau unaongeza &quot;(inalingana na 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;)&quot; na orodha ya karatasi inaonyesha jina la kipimo hicho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-zisizo-za-kawaida\"\u003EPDF zisizo za kawaida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaadhi ya PDF zinatangaza kitengo kikubwa zaidi cha ukurasa (kitengo cha mtumiaji, &quot;user unit&quot;); TakeoffDesk inakizingatia kwa vipimo vilivyowekwa na kwa skeli inayoonyeshwa. Kurasa zilizozungushwa ndani ya PDF zinapimwa kwa njia ile ile kama zilizo wima.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Orodha ya Kipimo kilichowekwa katika kikundi cha Kipimo ina skeli 32 katika makundi matatu. Kipimo kilichowekwa huweka skeli ya karatasi iliyo wazi hasa. Kila kipimo kilichowekwa kinadhani ukurasa wa PDF ni ukubwa halisi wa karatasi ya mchoro: inchi moja kwenye ukurasa wa PDF ni inchi moja ya karatasi (kurasa za PDF hupima pointi 72 kwa inchi). Ikiwa PDF ilibadilishwa ukubwa, tumia Rekebisha. Tumia Kagua baada ya kuweka skeli yoyote. Angalia Weka skeli. Usanifu Kipimo kilichowekwa Inchi moja ya karatasi ni 1/16\" = 1'-0\" 16 ft 3/32\" = 1'-0\" 10 ft 8 in 1/8\" = 1'-0\" 8 ft 3/16\" = 1'-0\" 5 ft 4 in 1/4\" = 1'-0\" 4 ft 3/8\" = 1'-0\" 2 ft 8 in 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 2 ft 3/4\" = 1'-0\" 1 ft 4 in 1\" = 1'-0\" 1 ft 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 8 in 3\" = 1'-0\" 4 in Uhandisi Kipimo kilichowekwa Inchi moja ya karatasi ni 1\" = 10' 10 ft 1\" = 20' 20 ft 1\" = 30' 30 ft 1\" = 40' 40 ft 1\" = 50' 50 ft 1\" = 60' 60 ft 1\" = 100' 100 ft Metriki 1:1, 1:2, 1:5, 1:10, 1:20, 1:25, 1:50, 1:75, 1:100, 1:150, 1:200, 1:250, 1:500, 1:1000. Uwiano wa metriki unamaanisha kwamba kipimo kimoja kwenye karatasi ni vipimo vingi hivyo katika uhalisia: kwa 1:100, 10 mm kwenye ukurasa ni 1 m. Skeli zilizorekebishwa Skeli iliyorekebishwa inaonekana kama \"Imerekebishwa 1\" = 4.002' kwenye 24'-6\"\" katika upau chini ya karatasi: futi halisi kwa kila inchi ya karatasi, na umbali uliouandika. Ikiwa iko ndani ya 0.5% ya kipimo kilichowekwa, upau unaongeza \"(inalingana na 1/4\" = 1'-0\")\" na orodha ya karatasi inaonyesha jina la kipimo hicho. PDF zisizo za kawaida Baadhi ya PDF zinatangaza kitengo kikubwa zaidi cha ukurasa (kitengo cha mtumiaji, \"user unit\"); TakeoffDesk inakizingatia kwa vipimo vilivyowekwa na kwa skeli inayoonyeshwa. Kurasa zilizozungushwa ndani ya PDF zinapimwa kwa njia ile ile kama zilizo wima.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"formulas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Lugha ya fomula","summary":"Kanuni za fomula za viasi vya mkusanyiko - vigeu, waendeshaji, kazi, upigaji mviringo na kila ujumbe wa hitilafu.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["fomula","usemi","sintaksia","kazi","ceil","floor","round","min","max","abs","vigeu","waendeshaji","hesabu"],"headings":[{"id":"vigeu","text":"Vigeu","level":2},{"id":"waendeshaji","text":"Waendeshaji","level":2},{"id":"kazi","text":"Kazi","level":2},{"id":"hitilafu","text":"Hitilafu","level":2},{"id":"salama-kwa-muundo","text":"Salama kwa muundo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVipengele vya mkusanyiko hupata kiasi chao kutoka kwenye fomula. Fomula ni usemi mdogo wa hesabu juu ya thamani zilizopimwa za kipengee. Tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EMikusanyiko na fomula\u003C/a\u003E kwa mifano iliyofanyiwa kazi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vigeu\"\u003EVigeu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAina ya kipengee\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKigeu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaana\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUrefu wote\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKimo cha kipengee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo la ukuta, L × H, likitoa matundu ya sehemu zinazoyabeba (ukadiriaji kutoka BimCraft). Ukadiriaji huo ukitaja mbinu ya kupima, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E hupimwa kwa mbinu hiyo: matundu yasiyozidi ukubwa mdogo wa mbinu hubaki ndani, na kile mbinu inachokiondoa pale kuta zinapokutana kinaachwa nje. Dokezo chini ya kipengee linataja mbinu hiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdadi ya sehemu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo wavu wote (mipaka ukitoa mikato)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMzunguko wote, pamoja na kingo za mikato\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKina au unene wa kipengee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdadi ya maeneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHesabu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVigeu viko kwenye vitengo vya kipengee: tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EVitengo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHerufi kubwa na ndogo ni sawa: \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E ni \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVigeu vya aina ya kipengee chenyewe pekee ndivyo vinavyofanya kazi. \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E kwenye kipengee cha linear inatoa \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;P&quot; si thamani iliyopimwa hapa. Tumia L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKimo au kina tupu ni 0.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waendeshaji\"\u003EWaendeshaji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAndika\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaana\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJumlisha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E−\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToa, au thamani hasi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E×\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZidisha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E÷\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGawanya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E( )\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPanga kwa kundi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuzidisha na kugawanya hutangulia kujumlisha na kutoa: \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2 + 4\u003C/code\u003E ni (L × 2) + 4. Tumia mabano usipokuwa na uhakika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENamba zinaweza kuwa na desimali (\u003Ccode\u003E1.333\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.5\u003C/code\u003E) na vielelezo (\u003Ccode\u003E1e3\u003C/code\u003E = 1000). Nafasi hazizingatiwi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kazi\"\u003EKazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKazi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMatokeo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMfano\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPiga mviringo juu hadi nambari nzima\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 68\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPiga mviringo chini hadi nambari nzima\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 67\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPiga mviringo hadi nambari nzima iliyo karibu, nusu hupelekwa mbali na sifuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(2.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x, d)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPiga mviringo hadi desimali d (0 hadi 10)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(3.14159, 2)\u003C/code\u003E = 3.14\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThamani ndogo zaidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(N, 10)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThamani kubwa zaidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThamani bila ishara yake\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(-3)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E na \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E zinapuuza kelele ndogo za upigaji mviringo wa kompyuta, kwa hiyo thamani inayopaswa kuwa 1 kabisa haipigwi mviringo hadi 2 kamwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hitilafu\"\u003EHitilafu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFomula isiyoweza kusomwa au kukokotolewa inaonyesha hitilafu yake chini ya sehemu, na kipengele kinaachwa nje ya jumla (kichwa cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E kinasema &quot;Haijakamilika&quot;). Ujumbe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUjumbe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERekebisha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAndika fomula, kama L au ceil(L / 1.333) + 1.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula ni tupu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;X&quot; si thamani iliyopimwa hapa. Tumia …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETumia mojawapo ya vigeu vilivyoorodheshwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;X&quot; si kazi hapa. Tumia ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETumia mojawapo ya kazi hizo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;#&quot; hairuhusiwi kwenye fomula.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOndoa herufi hiyo (vitengo, \u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E$\u003C/code\u003E na \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E haviruhusiwi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;)&quot; inakosekana. / Kuna &quot;)&quot; bila &quot;(&quot; yake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawazisha mabano.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThamani inakosekana kabla ya &quot;)&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKama \u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, )\u003C/code\u003E: weka thamani.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula inaishia mapema mno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKama \u003Ccode\u003EL *\u003C/code\u003E: ikamilishe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiyotarajiwa &quot;…&quot;. Je, operesheni inakosekana?\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThamani mbili kando kwa kando, kama \u003Ccode\u003E2L\u003C/code\u003E: andika \u003Ccode\u003E2 * L\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eceil() inachukua thamani 1.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMpe kazi idadi sahihi ya thamani.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eround(x, digits) inahitaji desimali nzima kutoka 0 hadi 10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETumia idadi nzima ya desimali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula inagawanya kwa sifuri.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMara nyingi H ni 0: weka kimo au kina cha kipengee.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula haitoi nambari.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMatokeo ni makubwa mno kuwa nambari.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula hii ni ndefu mno (herufi 500 zaidi hazikubaliwi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfupishe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"salama-kwa-muundo\"\u003ESalama kwa muundo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFomula inaweza tu kufanya hesabu kwa vigeu na kazi zilizo hapo juu. Haiwezi kuendesha msimbo wala kusoma kitu kingine, kwa hiyo fomula iliyo kwenye faili la mradi ambalo mtu anakutumia haina madhara.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vipengele vya mkusanyiko hupata kiasi chao kutoka kwenye fomula. Fomula ni usemi mdogo wa hesabu juu ya thamani zilizopimwa za kipengee. Tazama Mikusanyiko na fomula kwa mifano iliyofanyiwa kazi. Vigeu Aina ya kipengee Kigeu Maana Linear L Urefu wote Linear H Kimo cha kipengee Linear A Eneo la ukuta, L × H, likitoa matundu ya sehemu zinazoyabeba (ukadiriaji kutoka BimCraft). Ukadiriaji huo ukitaja mbinu ya kupima, A hupimwa kwa mbinu hiyo: matundu yasiyozidi ukubwa mdogo wa mbinu hubaki ndani, na kile mbinu inachokiondoa pale kuta zinapokutana kinaachwa nje. Dokezo chini ya kipengee linataja mbinu hiyo Linear N Idadi ya sehemu Area A Eneo wavu wote (mipaka ukitoa mikato) Area P Mzunguko wote, pamoja na kingo za mikato Area H Kina au unene wa kipengee Area N Idadi ya maeneo Count N Hesabu Vigeu viko kwenye vitengo vya kipengee: tazama Vitengo. Herufi kubwa na ndogo ni sawa: l ni L. Vigeu vya aina ya kipengee chenyewe pekee ndivyo vinavyofanya kazi. P kwenye kipengee cha linear inatoa \"P\" si thamani iliyopimwa hapa. Tumia L, H, A, N. Kimo au kina tupu ni 0. Waendeshaji Andika Maana + Jumlisha - au − Toa, au thamani hasi * au × Zidisha / au ÷ Gawanya ( ) Panga kwa kundi Kuzidisha na kugawanya hutangulia kujumlisha na kutoa: L * 2 + 4 ni (L × 2) + 4. Tumia mabano usipokuwa na uhakika. Namba zinaweza kuwa na desimali (1.333, .5) na vielelezo (1e3 = 1000). Nafasi hazizingatiwi. Kazi Kazi Matokeo Mfano ceil(x) Piga mviringo juu hadi nambari nzima ceil(67.5) = 68 floor(x) Piga mviringo chini hadi nambari nzima floor(67.5) = 67 round(x) Piga mviringo hadi nambari nzima iliyo karibu, nusu hupelekwa mbali na sifuri round(2.5) = 3 round(x, d) Piga mviringo hadi desimali d (0 hadi 10) round(3.14159, 2) = 3.14 min(a, b, …) Thamani ndogo zaidi min(N, 10) max(a, b, …) Thamani kubwa zaidi max(1, ceil(N / 12)) abs(x) Thamani bila ishara yake abs(-3) = 3 ceil na floor zinapuuza kelele ndogo za upigaji mviringo wa kompyuta, kwa hiyo thamani inayopaswa kuwa 1 kabisa haipigwi mviringo hadi 2 kamwe. Hitilafu Fomula isiyoweza kusomwa au kukokotolewa inaonyesha hitilafu yake chini ya sehemu, na kipengele kinaachwa nje ya jumla (kichwa cha Viasi kinasema \"Haijakamilika\"). Ujumbe: Ujumbe Rekebisha Andika fomula, kama L au ceil(L / 1.333) + 1. Fomula ni tupu. \"X\" si thamani iliyopimwa hapa. Tumia … Tumia mojawapo ya vigeu vilivyoorodheshwa. \"X\" si kazi hapa. Tumia ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs. Tumia mojawapo ya kazi hizo. \"#\" hairuhusiwi kwenye fomula. Ondoa herufi hiyo (vitengo, %, $ na = haviruhusiwi). \")\" inakosekana. / Kuna \")\" bila \"(\" yake. Sawazisha mabano. Thamani inakosekana kabla ya \")\". Kama max(1, ): weka thamani. Fomula inaishia mapema mno. Kama L *: ikamilishe. Isiyotarajiwa \"…\". Je, operesheni inakosekana? Thamani mbili kando kwa kando, kama 2L: andika 2 * L. ceil() inachukua thamani 1. Mpe kazi idadi sahihi ya thamani. round(x, digits) inahitaji desimali nzima kutoka 0 hadi 10. Tumia idadi nzima ya desimali. Fomula inagawanya kwa sifuri. Mara nyingi H ni 0: weka kimo au kina cha kipengee. Fomula haitoi nambari. Matokeo ni makubwa mno kuwa nambari. Fomula hii ni ndefu mno (herufi 500 zaidi hazikubaliwi). Ifupishe. Salama kwa muundo Fomula inaweza tu kufanya hesabu kwa vigeu na kazi zilizo hapo juu. Haiwezi kuendesha msimbo wala kusoma kitu kingine, kwa hiyo fomula iliyo kwenye faili la mradi ambalo mtu anakutumia haina madhara.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"units","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Vitengo","summary":"Vitengo ambavyo kipengee kinaweza kuripoti, vitengo ambavyo vigeu vya fomula vinatumia, na jinsi imperial na metriki zinavyochanganyika.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["vitengo","lf","sf","sy","sq","yadi za mraba","mraba wa kuezeka","ekari","hekta","mita","mita za mraba","ea","kila moja","metriki","imperial","ubadilishaji","kitengo chaguo-msingi"],"headings":[{"id":"vitengo-vya-vipengee","text":"Vitengo vya vipengee","level":2},{"id":"vitengo-vya-vigeu-vya-fomula","text":"Vitengo vya vigeu vya fomula","level":2},{"id":"mahali-vitengo-vimewekwa","text":"Mahali vitengo vimewekwa","level":2},{"id":"kipimo-na-vitengo-ni-tofauti","text":"Kipimo na vitengo ni tofauti","level":2},{"id":"usahihi","text":"Usahihi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"vitengo-vya-vipengee\"\u003EVitengo vya vipengee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAina ya kipengee\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitengo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJina\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti za mstari (chaguo-msingi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emita\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti za mraba (chaguo-msingi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyadi za mraba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emraba wa kuezeka (futi 100 za mraba)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eekari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emita za mraba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehekta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHesabu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekila moja\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadilisha kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKitengo\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kihariri cha kipengee wakati wowote, hata baada ya kupima; kiasi kinabadilishwa papo hapo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOrodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKitengo\u003C/span\u003E inaonyesha vitengo vilivyowashwa katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa ujumla\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVitengo\u003C/span\u003E, na daima kitengo cha kipengee chenyewe. Kipengee kipya kinaanza kwenye kitengo cha urefu au eneo kilichowekwa nyota hapo, kikiwa miongoni mwa vitengo vya kipengee; vinginevyo huanza kwa LF au SF. Tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EVitengo, thamani zilizoandikwa na orodha za vitengo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vitengo-vya-vigeu-vya-fomula\"\u003EVitengo vya vigeu vya fomula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitengo cha kipengee\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EL, P, H\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EA\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti za mraba (eneo la ukuta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emita\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emita za mraba (eneo la ukuta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti za mraba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyadi za mraba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emraba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eekari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emita\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emita za mraba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emita\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehekta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwa vipengee vya SY, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E iko kwenye yadi za mraba huku \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E na \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E zikibaki kwenye futi. Ujazo kutoka kipengee cha SY ni \u003Ccode\u003EA * 9 * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E yadi za ujazo; kutumia SF kwa bamba ni rahisi zaidi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mahali-vitengo-vimewekwa\"\u003EMahali vitengo vimewekwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaadhi ya usomaji daima hutumia futi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekionyesho cha moja kwa moja kwenye upau wa hali wakati wa kuchora (futi-inchi, SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlama iliyochaguliwa\u003C/strong\u003E (futi-inchi, LF na SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ematokeo ya ukaguzi (futi-inchi, pamoja na futi za desimali na mita),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eurefu wa sehemu na mizunguko kwenye karatasi ya Alama ya lahajedwali (futi-inchi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJumla za vipengee, jedwali la \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViasi\u003C/span\u003E, fomula na karatasi ya Makadirio zinatumia kitengo cha kipengee chenyewe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kipimo-na-vitengo-ni-tofauti\"\u003EKipimo na vitengo ni tofauti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKipimo cha karatasi kinasema mchoro ulivyo mkubwa; kitengo cha kipengee kinasema jinsi ya kuuripoti. Mchoro wa metriki wa \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E unaweza kupimwa kwa LF, na mchoro wa imperial kwa m². Kurekebisha kunakubali kitengo chochote: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usahihi\"\u003EUsahihi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk inapima kwa usahihi kamili kutoka kwenye pointi unazobofya, ikijumuisha urefu halisi wa tao na maeneo, na haizungushi viasi. Onyesho linazungusha urefu hadi 1/16 ya inchi na desimali hadi nafasi mbili. Pesa inazungushwa tu kwenye kiasi kilichopanuliwa, hadi senti.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vitengo vya vipengee Aina ya kipengee Kitengo Jina Mstari LF futi za mstari (chaguo-msingi) Mstari m mita Eneo SF futi za mraba (chaguo-msingi) Eneo SY yadi za mraba Eneo SQ mraba wa kuezeka (futi 100 za mraba) Eneo ac ekari Eneo m² mita za mraba Eneo ha hekta Hesabu EA kila moja Badilisha kwa Kitengo kwenye kihariri cha kipengee wakati wowote, hata baada ya kupima; kiasi kinabadilishwa papo hapo. Orodha ya Kitengo inaonyesha vitengo vilivyowashwa katika Mipangilio › Kwa ujumla › Vitengo, na daima kitengo cha kipengee chenyewe. Kipengee kipya kinaanza kwenye kitengo cha urefu au eneo kilichowekwa nyota hapo, kikiwa miongoni mwa vitengo vya kipengee; vinginevyo huanza kwa LF au SF. Tazama Vitengo, thamani zilizoandikwa na orodha za vitengo. Vitengo vya vigeu vya fomula Kitengo cha kipengee L, P, H A LF futi futi za mraba (eneo la ukuta) m mita mita za mraba (eneo la ukuta) SF futi futi za mraba SY futi yadi za mraba SQ futi mraba ac futi ekari m² mita mita za mraba ha mita hekta Kwa vipengee vya SY, A iko kwenye yadi za mraba huku P na H zikibaki kwenye futi. Ujazo kutoka kipengee cha SY ni A * 9 * H / 27 yadi za ujazo; kutumia SF kwa bamba ni rahisi zaidi. Mahali vitengo vimewekwa Baadhi ya usomaji daima hutumia futi: kionyesho cha moja kwa moja kwenye upau wa hali wakati wa kuchora (futi-inchi, SF), Alama iliyochaguliwa (futi-inchi, LF na SF), matokeo ya ukaguzi (futi-inchi, pamoja na futi za desimali na mita), urefu wa sehemu na mizunguko kwenye karatasi ya Alama ya lahajedwali (futi-inchi). Jumla za vipengee, jedwali la Viasi, fomula na karatasi ya Makadirio zinatumia kitengo cha kipengee chenyewe. Kipimo na vitengo ni tofauti Kipimo cha karatasi kinasema mchoro ulivyo mkubwa; kitengo cha kipengee kinasema jinsi ya kuuripoti. Mchoro wa metriki wa 1:100 unaweza kupimwa kwa LF, na mchoro wa imperial kwa m². Kurekebisha kunakubali kitengo chochote: 24'-6\", 7.5 m, 7500 mm. Usahihi TakeoffDesk inapima kwa usahihi kamili kutoka kwenye pointi unazobofya, ikijumuisha urefu halisi wa tao na maeneo, na haizungushi viasi. Onyesho linazungusha urefu hadi 1/16 ya inchi na desimali hadi nafasi mbili. Pesa inazungushwa tu kwenye kiasi kilichopanuliwa, hadi senti.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"export-columns","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Safu za hamisha","summary":"Kila karatasi ya kazi na safu ya hamisha ya XLSX na CSV, pamoja na fomula ambazo karatasi ya Estimate hubeba.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["hamisha","safu","xlsx","csv","karatasi ya kazi","kwa karatasi","alama","skeli","fomula","sehemu","makadirio"],"headings":[{"id":"estimate-karatasi-ya-kazi-ya-xlsx-na-csv","text":"Estimate (karatasi ya kazi ya XLSX na CSV)","level":2},{"id":"by-sheet-xlsx-pekee","text":"By sheet (XLSX pekee)","level":2},{"id":"marks-xlsx-pekee","text":"Marks (XLSX pekee)","level":2},{"id":"by-bid-area-xlsx-pekee-ukadiriaji-ukiwa-na-maeneo-ya-zabuni","text":"By bid area (XLSX pekee, ukadiriaji ukiwa na maeneo ya zabuni)","level":2},{"id":"scales-xlsx-pekee","text":"Scales (XLSX pekee)","level":2},{"id":"majina-ya-faili","text":"Majina ya faili","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"estimate-karatasi-ya-kazi-ya-xlsx-na-csv\"\u003EEstimate (karatasi ya kazi ya XLSX na CSV)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafu moja kwa kila kipengee, ikifuatiwa na safu moja kwa kila kipengele cha mkusanyiko wake (kimeingizwa). Kisha safu tupu na jumla ya kazi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EColumn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYaliyomo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKatika XLSX\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA Item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJina la kipengee (nzito) au jina la kipengele (lililoingizwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaandishi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EB Type\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area, Count au Component\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaandishi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC Unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, au kitengo cha kipengele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaandishi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ED Quantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJumla iliyopimwa, au matokeo ya fomula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENambari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EE Waste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpotevu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAsilimia (0.10 = 10%)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EF Qty with waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiasi × (1 + upotevu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula \u003Ccode\u003ED*(1+E)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EG Material per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiwango cha nyenzo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENambari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EH Labor per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiwango cha kazi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENambari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI Material\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENyenzo iliyopanuliwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*G,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJ Labor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKazi iliyopanuliwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*H,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EK Total\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENyenzo + kazi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula \u003Ccode\u003EI+J\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EL Notes\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula iliyotumika, hitilafu ya fomula, alama kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli, eneo la ukuta, mzunguko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaandishi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafu ya jumla ya kazi: \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E ya safu I, J na K juu ya kila safu, na &quot;Incomplete: see the notes above&quot; kwenye Notes wakati kitu kimeachwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafu yenye hitilafu ya fomula haina kiasi wala kiasi cha fedha; maelezo yake yanatoa hitilafu. Safu ya kichwa imegandishwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye CSV, safu hizo hizo zina thamani tupu, Waste % ni nambari ya asilimia (10 kwa 10%), na fedha ziko kwa dola zenye desimali mbili. Maandishi ambayo lahajedwali inaweza kuchukua kama fomula (yanayoanza na \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E au \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E) hupewa \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E mbele ili yabaki maandishi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-sheet-xlsx-pekee\"\u003EBy sheet (XLSX pekee)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EColumn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYaliyomo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJina la karatasi (pamoja na jina la PDF isipokuwa halijafunguliwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJina la kipengee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiasi cha kipengee hicho kwenye karatasi hiyo, katika kitengo chake\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKitengo cha kipengee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdadi ya alama\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marks-xlsx-pekee\"\u003EMarks (XLSX pekee)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMstari mmoja kwa kila alama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EColumn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYaliyomo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJina la karatasi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJina la kipengee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EType\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area au Count\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUrefu, eneo wavu, au 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF au m; SF, SY au m²; EA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDetail\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear: urefu wa sehemu, sehemu zilizotolewa zimewekwa alama &quot;(deduct)&quot;, na &quot;deducts (length) of (length) drawn&quot;. Area: maeneo ya jumla na yaliyokatwa wakati kuna mikato, pamoja na mzunguko. &quot;Sheet has no scale&quot; kwa alama zisizo na skeli.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBid area\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENi kwenye ukadiriaji wenye maeneo ya zabuni pekee: eneo la alama, au &quot;No bid area&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-bid-area-xlsx-pekee-ukadiriaji-ukiwa-na-maeneo-ya-zabuni\"\u003EBy bid area (XLSX pekee, ukadiriaji ukiwa na maeneo ya zabuni)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EColumn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYaliyomo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBid area\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJina la eneo, au &quot;No bid area&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKipengee, au kipengele kilichoingizwa chini yake\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKitengo cha kipengee au kipengele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKilichopimwa katika eneo hilo (vipengele: fomula kwenye jumla za eneo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQty with waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiasi × (1 + upotevu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial, Labor, Total\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZimepanuliwa hadi senti, kama kwenye Estimate\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENotes\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula, hitilafu na alama zisizo na skeli, kama kwenye Estimate\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila eneo linamalizika kwa safu ya &quot;(jina) subtotal&quot; ambayo gharama zake ni fomula za \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E juu ya safu zake; safu ya mwisho, \u003Cstrong\u003EAll bid areas\u003C/strong\u003E, inajumlisha subtotals. Karatasi ya \u003Cstrong\u003EMarks\u003C/strong\u003E basi ina safu ya saba, \u003Cstrong\u003EBid area\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"scales-xlsx-pekee\"\u003EScales (XLSX pekee)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMstari mmoja kwa kila karatasi yenye skeli au alama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EColumn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYaliyomo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJina la karatasi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJina la mpangilio uliowekwa, au skeli iliyorekebishwa, au &quot;No scale&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Preset&quot;, au &quot;Calibrated on (the distance you typed)&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeet per PDF unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKipengele halisi cha skeli ambacho TakeoffDesk inakitumia\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"majina-ya-faili\"\u003EMajina ya faili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E na \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E, ambapo jina linatoka kwenye PDF ya kwanza iliyofunguliwa kwenye ukadiriaji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECSV ni UTF-8 yenye alama ya mpangilio wa baiti na mwisho wa mistari wa Windows, ambayo programu za lahajedwali kwenye kila mfumo zinaisoma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Estimate (karatasi ya kazi ya XLSX na CSV) Safu moja kwa kila kipengee, ikifuatiwa na safu moja kwa kila kipengele cha mkusanyiko wake (kimeingizwa). Kisha safu tupu na jumla ya kazi. Column Yaliyomo Katika XLSX A Item Jina la kipengee (nzito) au jina la kipengele (lililoingizwa) Maandishi B Type Linear, Area, Count au Component Maandishi C Unit LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, au kitengo cha kipengele Maandishi D Quantity Jumla iliyopimwa, au matokeo ya fomula Nambari E Waste % Upotevu Asilimia (0.10 = 10%) F Qty with waste Kiasi × (1 + upotevu) Fomula D*(1+E) G Material per unit Kiwango cha nyenzo Nambari H Labor per unit Kiwango cha kazi Nambari I Material Nyenzo iliyopanuliwa Fomula ROUND(F*G,2) J Labor Kazi iliyopanuliwa Fomula ROUND(F*H,2) K Total Nyenzo + kazi Fomula I+J L Notes Fomula iliyotumika, hitilafu ya fomula, alama kwenye karatasi zisizo na skeli, eneo la ukuta, mzunguko Maandishi Safu ya jumla ya kazi: SUM ya safu I, J na K juu ya kila safu, na \"Incomplete: see the notes above\" kwenye Notes wakati kitu kimeachwa. Safu yenye hitilafu ya fomula haina kiasi wala kiasi cha fedha; maelezo yake yanatoa hitilafu. Safu ya kichwa imegandishwa. Kwenye CSV, safu hizo hizo zina thamani tupu, Waste % ni nambari ya asilimia (10 kwa 10%), na fedha ziko kwa dola zenye desimali mbili. Maandishi ambayo lahajedwali inaweza kuchukua kama fomula (yanayoanza na =, +, - au @) hupewa ' mbele ili yabaki maandishi. By sheet (XLSX pekee) Column Yaliyomo Sheet Jina la karatasi (pamoja na jina la PDF isipokuwa halijafunguliwa) Item Jina la kipengee Quantity Kiasi cha kipengee hicho kwenye karatasi hiyo, katika kitengo chake Unit Kitengo cha kipengee Marks Idadi ya alama Marks (XLSX pekee) Mstari mmoja kwa kila alama. Column Yaliyomo Sheet Jina la karatasi Item Jina la kipengee Type Linear, Area au Count Quantity Urefu, eneo wavu, au 1 Unit LF au m; SF, SY au m²; EA Detail Linear: urefu wa sehemu, sehemu zilizotolewa zimewekwa alama \"(deduct)\", na \"deducts (length) of (length) drawn\". Area: maeneo ya jumla na yaliyokatwa wakati kuna mikato, pamoja na mzunguko. \"Sheet has no scale\" kwa alama zisizo na skeli. Bid area Ni kwenye ukadiriaji wenye maeneo ya zabuni pekee: eneo la alama, au \"No bid area\" By bid area (XLSX pekee, ukadiriaji ukiwa na maeneo ya zabuni) Column Yaliyomo Bid area Jina la eneo, au \"No bid area\" Item Kipengee, au kipengele kilichoingizwa chini yake Unit Kitengo cha kipengee au kipengele Quantity Kilichopimwa katika eneo hilo (vipengele: fomula kwenye jumla za eneo) Qty with waste Kiasi × (1 + upotevu) Material, Labor, Total Zimepanuliwa hadi senti, kama kwenye Estimate Notes Fomula, hitilafu na alama zisizo na skeli, kama kwenye Estimate Kila eneo linamalizika kwa safu ya \"(jina) subtotal\" ambayo gharama zake ni fomula za SUM juu ya safu zake; safu ya mwisho, All bid areas, inajumlisha subtotals. Karatasi ya Marks basi ina safu ya saba, Bid area. Scales (XLSX pekee) Mstari mmoja kwa kila karatasi yenye skeli au alama. Column Yaliyomo Sheet Jina la karatasi Scale Jina la mpangilio uliowekwa, au skeli iliyorekebishwa, au \"No scale\" How \"Preset\", au \"Calibrated on (the distance you typed)\" Feet per PDF unit Kipengele halisi cha skeli ambacho TakeoffDesk inakitumia Majina ya faili (name).xlsx na (name).csv, ambapo jina linatoka kwenye PDF ya kwanza iliyofunguliwa kwenye ukadiriaji. CSV ni UTF-8 yenye alama ya mpangilio wa baiti na mwisho wa mistari wa Windows, ambayo programu za lahajedwali kwenye kila mfumo zinaisoma.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Utatuzi wa matatizo","summary":"Dalili, sababu na suluhisho za jumbe na mshangao unaoweza kukutana nao katika TakeoffDesk, zikinukuliwa jinsi programu inavyozionyesha.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["matatizo","makosa","haifanyi kazi","rekebisha","msaada","imekataliwa","haipimi","hakuna kipimo","alama zinakosekana","usafirishaji umeshindwa","nje ya mtandao","mguso"],"headings":[{"id":"kufungua-faili","text":"Kufungua faili","level":2},{"id":"kupima","text":"Kupima","level":2},{"id":"kipimo","text":"Kipimo","level":2},{"id":"viwango-na-fomula","text":"Viwango na fomula","level":2},{"id":"hesabu-otomatiki","text":"Hesabu otomatiki","level":2},{"id":"kuhifadhi-na-kusafirisha","text":"Kuhifadhi na kusafirisha","level":2},{"id":"vitufe-na-kipanya","text":"Vitufe na kipanya","level":2},{"id":"skrini-za-mguso","text":"Skrini za mguso","level":2},{"id":"kufanya-kazi-nje-ya-mtandao","text":"Kufanya kazi nje ya mtandao","level":2},{"id":"bado-umekwama","text":"Bado umekwama","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk inaeleza kukataliwa kwa mengi kwenye upau wa hali chini ya dirisha. Tafuta ujumbe hapa chini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kufungua-faili\"\u003EKufungua faili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUjumbe au dalili\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESuluhisho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKisoma PDF hakikuweza kupakia. Pakia ukurasa upya ujaribu tena.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKisoma PDF cha programu hakikupakia, mara nyingi kwa sababu uko nje ya mtandao na programu haikuhifadhiwa kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnganisha tena kisha upakie upya. Kisha chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E na usubiri \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E; tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EKufanya kazi nje ya mtandao\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(name) ina nenosiri. Fungua nakala isiyolindwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF inahitaji nenosiri ili kufunguka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOmba nakala isiyolindwa, au ondoa nenosiri kwenye programu ya PDF unayoiamini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(name) haikuweza kusomwa kama PDF (…)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaili limeharibika au si PDF kweli.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELipakue tena, au lihifadhi upya kutoka kwenye programu iliyolitengeneza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(name) tayari imefunguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF hiyo hiyo (yaliyomo yale yale) imefunguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna la kufanya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk inafungua PDF na miradi ya .takeoff.json. Imeruka: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAina nyingine za faili ziliachwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBadilisha michoro kuwa PDF kwanza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna kinachotokea ninapodondosha faili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaili lilidondoshwa nje ya dirisha la kivinjari, au kivinjari kilifungua PDF kwenye kichupo kipya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDondosha kwenye ukurasa wa TakeoffDesk wenyewe; fremu ya &quot;Dondosha PDF au .takeoff.json&quot; inaonyesha itakapofanya kazi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKufungua seti kubwa kunachukua muda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKila PDF inasomwa yote ili kuitambua.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESubiri ujumbe wa &quot;Inafungua (name)…&quot; ufutike. Picha ndogo zinajaa unaposogeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kupima\"\u003EKupima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUjumbe au dalili\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESuluhisho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFungua PDF kwanza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna karatasi iliyofunguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFungua PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaratasi hii bado haina kipimo, kwa hivyo haiwezi kupimwa. Chagua kipimo kilichowekwa au urekebishe kwanza (hesabu hufanya kazi bila kipimo).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZana za mstari, eneo, duara na shimo zinahitaji kipimo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EWeka kipimo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETengeneza kipengee cha mstari kwanza (kipe jina chini ya Vipengee), kisha ubofye kwenye karatasi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna kipengee cha aina hiyo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJaza fomu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipengee kipya\u003C/span\u003E iliyofunguka, kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChagua kipengee cha kupima kwanza (paneli ya Vipengee).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKipengee cha sasa kimefutwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya kipengee chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVipengee\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMstari unahitaji pointi angalau mbili.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlimaliza baada ya bofyo moja.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya pointi angalau mbili.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEneo linahitaji pointi angalau tatu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKona ni chache mno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya kona angalau tatu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMpaka unavuka wenyewe, kwa hivyo eneo lake lingekuwa si sahihi. Chora upya bila kuvuka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbo la namba nane.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChora kama maeneo mawili, au zunguka ukingo kwa mpangilio.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPointi hizo hazifungi eneo lolote.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPointi zote ziko kwenye mstari mmoja.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya kona zinazofunga nafasi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChagua alama ya eneo kwanza (zana ya Chagua), kisha uchague Shimo na uchore tundu ndani yake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShimo\u003C/span\u003E inahitaji eneo lililochaguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bofya eneo, kisha \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShimo lazima likae ndani kabisa ya eneo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETundu linavuka au linatoka nje ya mpaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChora tundu ndani ya eneo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashimo hayawezi kuingiliana.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMatundu mawili yanaingiliana.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChora tundu moja kuzunguka yote mawili, au yaweke mbali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E… Pointi imerudishwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKona iliyoburutwa ingefanya mpaka uvuke wenyewe au usukume shimo nje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuruta hadi mahali panapoweka umbo sahihi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya pointi kwenye ukingo wa duara, mbali na katikati yake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya ya pili ilikuwa karibu sana na katikati.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya mbali zaidi nje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMibofyo inasogeza karatasi badala ya kuongeza pointi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKielekezi kilisogea zaidi ya pikseli chache wakati kitufe kimebonyezwa; hilo linahesabiwa kama kuburuta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya bila kusogea, hasa kwenye trackpad.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift haifanyi nasa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnaweka pointi kwenye tao, au unachora duara.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENasa ya 45° inatumika kwenye sehemu zilizonyooka tu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPointi zinaruka kwenye mstari ulio karibu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro imewashwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuza ndani ili ubofye kati ya mistari, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuzima Nasa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna alama ya nasa inayoonekana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENasa imezimwa, karatasi ni skani, au zana haina nasa (Hesabu, Hesabu otomatiki, kubandika).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; kwenye skani hakuna mistari ya kunasa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUrefu si sahihi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKipimo si sahihi (mara nyingi PDF iliyobadilishwa ukubwa yenye kipimo kilichowekwa).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETumia \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKagua\u003C/span\u003E kwenye kipimo kinachojulikana, kisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERekebisha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kipimo\"\u003EKipimo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUjumbe au dalili\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESuluhisho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChagua pointi mbili zilizo mbali zaidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPointi za urekebishaji zimerundikana karibu kabisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERekebisha kwenye kipimo kirefu zaidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUjumbe kwenye kisanduku cha urekebishaji, kama &quot;That distance could not be read&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbali uko katika umbo ambalo TakeoffDesk haiwezi kulisoma.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUingizaji wa urefu, kiwango na asilimia\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaratasi hii bado haina kipimo, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kukagua. Irekebishe, au chagua kipimo kilichowekwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKagua\u003C/span\u003E kwenye karatasi isiyo na kipimo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeka kipimo kwanza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOrodha ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKipimo kilichowekwa\u003C/span\u003E imefifia\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna karatasi iliyofunguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFungua PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"viwango-na-fomula\"\u003EViwango na fomula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUjumbe au dalili\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESuluhisho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaijakamilika: … (haiko kwenye jumla)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHitilafu ya fomula, au alama kwenye karatasi zisizo na kipimo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities#the-incomplete-warning\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-hash=\"the-incomplete-warning\"\u003ESoma viwango na makadirio\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+(n) bila kipimo karibu na kipengee\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBaadhi ya alama zake ziko kwenye karatasi zisizo na kipimo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeka kipimo kwenye karatasi hizo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHitilafu ya fomula: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFomula haiwezi kukokotolewa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas#errors\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-hash=\"errors\"\u003ELugha ya fomula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKipengee hiki kina alama, kwa hivyo aina yake haiwezi kubadilika.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAina imefungwa mara alama zinapokuwepo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETengeneza kipengee kipya cha aina nyingine na uchore upya alama kwa kutumia hicho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKipengee kinahitaji jina.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESehemu ya jina imefutwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAndika jina.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAndika kiasi kama 12.50. / Andika asilimia kama 10 au 7.5.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKiwango au upotevu haukusomeka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUingizaji wa urefu, kiwango na asilimia\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJumla inaonekana mara mbili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKipengee kina viwango vyake na vipengele vinavyobeba gharama ile ile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeka viwango vya kipengee chenyewe kuwa 0 pale vipengele vyake vinapobeba gharama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlama za kipengee hiki ziko kwenye PDF ambazo hazijafunguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmebofya kipengee ambacho alama zake zote ziko kwenye PDF ambazo hujazifungua.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFungua PDF hizo; majina yake yameorodheshwa chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaratasi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hesabu-otomatiki\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUjumbe au dalili\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESuluhisho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKisanduku hicho ni kidogo mno. Kichore kuzunguka alama nzima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKisanduku ni kidogo sana.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuza ndani na uzungushe alama nzima kwa kisanduku.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKisanduku hicho karibu hakina kitu. Chora kuzunguka alama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKisanduku kina karatasi tu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungushia alama yenyewe kisanduku.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna zinazolingana. Shusha kitelezi cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlinganifu\u003C/span\u003E, au zungusha alama kwa kisanduku kikali zaidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna kilichopata alama ya kutosha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungusha alama kwa kisanduku kikali, au buruta kitelezi cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlinganifu\u003C/span\u003E chini zaidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZinazolingana ni nyingi mno, pamoja na alama zisizo sahihi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlama zinazofanana zinapata alama karibu na ile halisi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInua kitelezi cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlinganifu\u003C/span\u003E na ubofye visanduku visivyo sahihi ili vikataliwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZinazolingana hazipo kwenye karatasi nyingine\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaratasi hizo zinachora alama kwa ukubwa mwingine, au kwa pembe isiyo hatua ya 90°.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafuta karatasi hizo kwa kisanduku kilichochorwa hapo, au hesabu kwa mkono.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) karatasi zilikuwa kubwa mno kutafutwa kwa ukubwa huu wa alama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaratasi ingekuwa kubwa mno kwa ukubwa wa kazi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungusha alama kubwa zaidi, au hesabu karatasi hiyo kwa mkono.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUtafutaji umeshindwa: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUtafutaji wa chinichini ulisimama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJaribu tena; pakia ukurasa upya ikijirudia (hifadhi kwanza). Nje ya mtandao, unafanya kazi tu mara upau wa programu unapoonyesha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuburuta kunachora kisanduku badala ya kusogeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHivyo ndivyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHesabu otomatiki\u003C/span\u003E inavyofanya kazi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kisha buruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kati.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuhifadhi-na-kusafirisha\"\u003EKuhifadhi na kusafirisha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUjumbe au dalili\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESuluhisho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna cha kusafirisha bado: tengeneza kipengee na ukipime.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHakuna vipengee.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETengeneza kipengee kwanza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBado hakuna alama kwenye PDF zilizofunguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF yenye alama\u003C/span\u003E haina cha kuchora kwenye PDF zilizofunguliwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFungua PDF zenye alama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF hii ina nenosiri au imesimbwa, kwa hivyo nakala yenye alama haiwezi kuandikwa. …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF imesimbwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafirisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E badala yake, au tumia nakala isiyosimbwa ya PDF (kisha inahitaji ukadiriaji wake, kwa kuwa ni faili tofauti).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF yenye alama haikuweza kuandikwa: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMara nyingi: uko nje ya mtandao, na programu haikuhifadhiwa kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao, kwa hivyo kiandishi cha PDF hakipo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENenda mtandaoni kisha uchague tena \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF yenye alama\u003C/span\u003E. Ili kuepuka hili, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E na usubiri \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF moja tu yenye alama ilipakuliwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKivinjari kilizuia upakuaji mwingi kwa wakati mmoja.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERuhusu upakuaji mwingi kwa tovuti hii, kisha safirisha tena.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(file) si mradi wa TakeoffDesk (si JSON halali). / Hili si faili la mradi wa TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaili lisilo sahihi, au lililoharibika.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChagua faili la \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMradi huu ulihifadhiwa na TakeoffDesk mpya zaidi. Ufungue hapo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaili linatoka kwenye toleo jipya zaidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELifungue kwenye toleo jipya zaidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlama (n) ziliharibika na zikaachwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESehemu ya faili iliharibika au ilihaririwa kwa mkono.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIliyobaki imefunguka. Chora upya alama zilizokosekana, au fungua nakala ya zamani.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlama zinakosekana baada ya kufungua upya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF hazijafunguliwa, au mojawapo imebadilika.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003EHifadhi na ufungue tena ukadiriaji\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKivinjari kinauliza &quot;Leave site?&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuna mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBaki hapo, kisha uhifadhi kwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vitufe-na-kipanya\"\u003EVitufe na kipanya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDalili\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESuluhisho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVitufe vya herufi havifanyi kitu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKishale kiko kwenye sehemu (utafutaji, kihariri cha kipengee, jedwali).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBofya kwenye karatasi, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kutoka kwenye sehemu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGurudumu linakuza badala ya kusogeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGurudumu daima linakuza karatasi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuruta ili kusogeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkurasa mzima umekuwa mkubwa au mdogo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuzaji wa kivinjari (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Kuza karatasi kwa gurudumu au kwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pekee.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlama ilitoweka nilipobonyeza Backspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace inafuta alama iliyochaguliwa usipokuwa unachora.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inairudisha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKubofya kulia hakumalizi kwenye Mac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKubofya kwa Control kunafika kama bofyo la kawaida.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETumia kubofya kwa vidole viwili ukiwa umewasha bofyo la pili, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skrini-za-mguso\"\u003ESkrini za mguso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye skrini ya mguso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGusa\u003C/strong\u003E huweka pointi (au kuchagua alama kwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChagua\u003C/span\u003E). Kidole kimoja kikiburuta husogeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVidole viwili\u003C/strong\u003E hukuza kwa kubana karibu na nukta iliyo katikati yao, na husogeza vinaposogea pamoja. Kuweka kidole cha pili kunaghairi kile cha kwanza kilichoanza, kwa hivyo kubana hakuachi pointi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaliza\u003C/strong\u003E mstari au mpaka kwa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekubonyeza kwa muda mrefu\u003C/strong\u003E (bofyo la kulia), \u003Cstrong\u003Ekugusa mara mbili\u003C/strong\u003E, au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaliza\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau chini ya karatasi. Upau huo huo una \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENyuma\u003C/span\u003E (rudisha pointi ya mwisho) na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGhairi\u003C/span\u003E. Maeneo pia yanafungwa kwa kugusa pointi ya kwanza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVidole vina malengo makubwa zaidi: pointi zinanasa, zinafunga na kuchagua kutoka mbali zaidi, na vishikio vya kona ni vikubwa zaidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuandika urefu kunahitaji kibodi; kibodi ya skrini inafanya kazi wakati kisanduku cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAndika\u003C/span\u003E kimechaguliwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye kompyuta kibao, kibodi pamoja na kipanya au trackpad vinafanya ukadiriaji kuwa rahisi zaidi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kufanya-kazi-nje-ya-mtandao\"\u003EKufanya kazi nje ya mtandao\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKitufe au dalili\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESuluhisho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImeshindwa kuhifadhi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBaadhi ya faili za programu hazikupakuliwa wakati wa kuhifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAngalia muunganisho wako kisha uchague kitufe tena.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatumizi ya nje ya mtandao hayapatikani\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadirisha ya faragha na baadhi ya kompyuta zinazosimamiwa huzuia nakala za nje ya mtandao.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETumia dirisha la kawaida, au kivinjari kingine.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Inahifadhi…&quot; haianzi kamwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUko nje ya mtandao; kuhifadhi kunahitaji muunganisho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHifadhi ukiwa mtandaoni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProgramu ni ya zamani baada ya sasisho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENakala ya nje ya mtandao ni ya siku ya awali.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMtandaoni, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E, kisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi tena (pata toleo la hivi karibuni)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnataka nafasi irudi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENakala ya nje ya mtandao ina takriban MB 6.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E, kisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOndoa nakala ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EKufanya kazi nje ya mtandao\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bado-umekwama\"\u003EBado umekwama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPakia ukurasa upya programu ikikoma kujibu. Ukadiriaji wako unapotea ukipakia upya usipokuwa umeuhifadhi, kwa hivyo hifadhi kwanza kwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukiweza. Kwa maswali ya kivinjari tazama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EVivinjari na kompyuta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk inaeleza kukataliwa kwa mengi kwenye upau wa hali chini ya dirisha. Tafuta ujumbe hapa chini. Kufungua faili Ujumbe au dalili Sababu Suluhisho Kisoma PDF hakikuweza kupakia. Pakia ukurasa upya ujaribu tena. Kisoma PDF cha programu hakikupakia, mara nyingi kwa sababu uko nje ya mtandao na programu haikuhifadhiwa kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao. Unganisha tena kisha upakie upya. Kisha chagua Hifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao na usubiri Tayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao; tazama Kufanya kazi nje ya mtandao. (name) ina nenosiri. Fungua nakala isiyolindwa. PDF inahitaji nenosiri ili kufunguka. Omba nakala isiyolindwa, au ondoa nenosiri kwenye programu ya PDF unayoiamini. (name) haikuweza kusomwa kama PDF (…) Faili limeharibika au si PDF kweli. Lipakue tena, au lihifadhi upya kutoka kwenye programu iliyolitengeneza. (name) tayari imefunguliwa. PDF hiyo hiyo (yaliyomo yale yale) imefunguliwa. Hakuna la kufanya. TakeoffDesk inafungua PDF na miradi ya .takeoff.json. Imeruka: … Aina nyingine za faili ziliachwa. Badilisha michoro kuwa PDF kwanza. Hakuna kinachotokea ninapodondosha faili Faili lilidondoshwa nje ya dirisha la kivinjari, au kivinjari kilifungua PDF kwenye kichupo kipya. Dondosha kwenye ukurasa wa TakeoffDesk wenyewe; fremu ya \"Dondosha PDF au .takeoff.json\" inaonyesha itakapofanya kazi. Kufungua seti kubwa kunachukua muda Kila PDF inasomwa yote ili kuitambua. Subiri ujumbe wa \"Inafungua (name)…\" ufutike. Picha ndogo zinajaa unaposogeza. Kupima Ujumbe au dalili Sababu Suluhisho Fungua PDF kwanza. Hakuna karatasi iliyofunguliwa. Fungua PDF. Karatasi hii bado haina kipimo, kwa hivyo haiwezi kupimwa. Chagua kipimo kilichowekwa au urekebishe kwanza (hesabu hufanya kazi bila kipimo). Zana za mstari, eneo, duara na shimo zinahitaji kipimo. Weka kipimo. Tengeneza kipengee cha mstari kwanza (kipe jina chini ya Vipengee), kisha ubofye kwenye karatasi. Hakuna kipengee cha aina hiyo. Jaza fomu ya Kipengee kipya iliyofunguka, kisha uchague Ongeza. Chagua kipengee cha kupima kwanza (paneli ya Vipengee). Kipengee cha sasa kimefutwa. Bofya kipengee chini ya Vipengee. Mstari unahitaji pointi angalau mbili. Ulimaliza baada ya bofyo moja. Bofya pointi angalau mbili. Eneo linahitaji pointi angalau tatu. Kona ni chache mno. Bofya kona angalau tatu. Mpaka unavuka wenyewe, kwa hivyo eneo lake lingekuwa si sahihi. Chora upya bila kuvuka. Umbo la namba nane. Chora kama maeneo mawili, au zunguka ukingo kwa mpangilio. Pointi hizo hazifungi eneo lolote. Pointi zote ziko kwenye mstari mmoja. Bofya kona zinazofunga nafasi. Chagua alama ya eneo kwanza (zana ya Chagua), kisha uchague Shimo na uchore tundu ndani yake. Shimo inahitaji eneo lililochaguliwa. Bonyeza V, bofya eneo, kisha X. Shimo lazima likae ndani kabisa ya eneo. Tundu linavuka au linatoka nje ya mpaka. Chora tundu ndani ya eneo. Mashimo hayawezi kuingiliana. Matundu mawili yanaingiliana. Chora tundu moja kuzunguka yote mawili, au yaweke mbali. … Pointi imerudishwa. Kona iliyoburutwa ingefanya mpaka uvuke wenyewe au usukume shimo nje. Buruta hadi mahali panapoweka umbo sahihi. Bofya pointi kwenye ukingo wa duara, mbali na katikati yake. Bofya ya pili ilikuwa karibu sana na katikati. Bofya mbali zaidi nje. Mibofyo inasogeza karatasi badala ya kuongeza pointi Kielekezi kilisogea zaidi ya pikseli chache wakati kitufe kimebonyezwa; hilo linahesabiwa kama kuburuta. Bofya bila kusogea, hasa kwenye trackpad. Shift haifanyi nasa Unaweka pointi kwenye tao, au unachora duara. Nasa ya 45° inatumika kwenye sehemu zilizonyooka tu. Pointi zinaruka kwenye mstari ulio karibu Nasa kwenye mistari ya mchoro imewashwa. Kuza ndani ili ubofye kati ya mistari, au bonyeza F3 kuzima Nasa. Hakuna alama ya nasa inayoonekana Nasa imezimwa, karatasi ni skani, au zana haina nasa (Hesabu, Hesabu otomatiki, kubandika). Bonyeza F3; kwenye skani hakuna mistari ya kunasa. Urefu si sahihi Kipimo si sahihi (mara nyingi PDF iliyobadilishwa ukubwa yenye kipimo kilichowekwa). Tumia Kagua kwenye kipimo kinachojulikana, kisha Rekebisha. Kipimo Ujumbe au dalili Sababu Suluhisho Chagua pointi mbili zilizo mbali zaidi. Pointi za urekebishaji zimerundikana karibu kabisa. Rekebisha kwenye kipimo kirefu zaidi. Ujumbe kwenye kisanduku cha urekebishaji, kama \"That distance could not be read\" Umbali uko katika umbo ambalo TakeoffDesk haiwezi kulisoma. Tazama Uingizaji wa urefu, kiwango na asilimia. Karatasi hii bado haina kipimo, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kukagua. Irekebishe, au chagua kipimo kilichowekwa. Kagua kwenye karatasi isiyo na kipimo. Weka kipimo kwanza. Orodha ya Kipimo kilichowekwa imefifia Hakuna karatasi iliyofunguliwa. Fungua PDF. Viwango na fomula Ujumbe au dalili Sababu Suluhisho Haijakamilika: … (haiko kwenye jumla) Hitilafu ya fomula, au alama kwenye karatasi zisizo na kipimo. Tazama Soma viwango na makadirio. +(n) bila kipimo karibu na kipengee Baadhi ya alama zake ziko kwenye karatasi zisizo na kipimo. Weka kipimo kwenye karatasi hizo. Hitilafu ya fomula: … Fomula haiwezi kukokotolewa. Tazama Lugha ya fomula. Kipengee hiki kina alama, kwa hivyo aina yake haiwezi kubadilika. Aina imefungwa mara alama zinapokuwepo. Tengeneza kipengee kipya cha aina nyingine na uchore upya alama kwa kutumia hicho. Kipengee kinahitaji jina. Sehemu ya jina imefutwa. Andika jina. Andika kiasi kama 12.50. / Andika asilimia kama 10 au 7.5. Kiwango au upotevu haukusomeka. Tazama Uingizaji wa urefu, kiwango na asilimia. Jumla inaonekana mara mbili Kipengee kina viwango vyake na vipengele vinavyobeba gharama ile ile. Weka viwango vya kipengee chenyewe kuwa 0 pale vipengele vyake vinapobeba gharama. Alama za kipengee hiki ziko kwenye PDF ambazo hazijafunguliwa. Umebofya kipengee ambacho alama zake zote ziko kwenye PDF ambazo hujazifungua. Fungua PDF hizo; majina yake yameorodheshwa chini ya Karatasi. Hesabu otomatiki Ujumbe au dalili Sababu Suluhisho Kisanduku hicho ni kidogo mno. Kichore kuzunguka alama nzima. Kisanduku ni kidogo sana. Kuza ndani na uzungushe alama nzima kwa kisanduku. Kisanduku hicho karibu hakina kitu. Chora kuzunguka alama. Kisanduku kina karatasi tu. Zungushia alama yenyewe kisanduku. Hakuna zinazolingana. Shusha kitelezi cha Ulinganifu, au zungusha alama kwa kisanduku kikali zaidi. Hakuna kilichopata alama ya kutosha. Zungusha alama kwa kisanduku kikali, au buruta kitelezi cha Ulinganifu chini zaidi. Zinazolingana ni nyingi mno, pamoja na alama zisizo sahihi Alama zinazofanana zinapata alama karibu na ile halisi. Inua kitelezi cha Ulinganifu na ubofye visanduku visivyo sahihi ili vikataliwe. Zinazolingana hazipo kwenye karatasi nyingine Karatasi hizo zinachora alama kwa ukubwa mwingine, au kwa pembe isiyo hatua ya 90°. Tafuta karatasi hizo kwa kisanduku kilichochorwa hapo, au hesabu kwa mkono. (n) karatasi zilikuwa kubwa mno kutafutwa kwa ukubwa huu wa alama. Karatasi ingekuwa kubwa mno kwa ukubwa wa kazi. Zungusha alama kubwa zaidi, au hesabu karatasi hiyo kwa mkono. Utafutaji umeshindwa: … Utafutaji wa chinichini ulisimama. Jaribu tena; pakia ukurasa upya ikijirudia (hifadhi kwanza). Nje ya mtandao, unafanya kazi tu mara upau wa programu unapoonyesha Tayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao. Kuburuta kunachora kisanduku badala ya kusogeza Hivyo ndivyo Hesabu otomatiki inavyofanya kazi. Shikilia Space kisha buruta, au buruta kwa kitufe cha kati. Kuhifadhi na kusafirisha Ujumbe au dalili Sababu Suluhisho Hakuna cha kusafirisha bado: tengeneza kipengee na ukipime. Hakuna vipengee. Tengeneza kipengee kwanza. Bado hakuna alama kwenye PDF zilizofunguliwa. PDF yenye alama haina cha kuchora kwenye PDF zilizofunguliwa. Fungua PDF zenye alama. PDF hii ina nenosiri au imesimbwa, kwa hivyo nakala yenye alama haiwezi kuandikwa. … PDF imesimbwa. Safirisha XLSX badala yake, au tumia nakala isiyosimbwa ya PDF (kisha inahitaji ukadiriaji wake, kwa kuwa ni faili tofauti). PDF yenye alama haikuweza kuandikwa: … Mara nyingi: uko nje ya mtandao, na programu haikuhifadhiwa kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao, kwa hivyo kiandishi cha PDF hakipo. Nenda mtandaoni kisha uchague tena PDF yenye alama. Ili kuepuka hili, chagua Hifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao na usubiri Tayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao. PDF moja tu yenye alama ilipakuliwa Kivinjari kilizuia upakuaji mwingi kwa wakati mmoja. Ruhusu upakuaji mwingi kwa tovuti hii, kisha safirisha tena. (file) si mradi wa TakeoffDesk (si JSON halali). / Hili si faili la mradi wa TakeoffDesk. Faili lisilo sahihi, au lililoharibika. Chagua faili la .takeoff.json. Mradi huu ulihifadhiwa na TakeoffDesk mpya zaidi. Ufungue hapo. Faili linatoka kwenye toleo jipya zaidi. Lifungue kwenye toleo jipya zaidi. Alama (n) ziliharibika na zikaachwa. Sehemu ya faili iliharibika au ilihaririwa kwa mkono. Iliyobaki imefunguka. Chora upya alama zilizokosekana, au fungua nakala ya zamani. Alama zinakosekana baada ya kufungua upya PDF hazijafunguliwa, au mojawapo imebadilika. Tazama Hifadhi na ufungue tena ukadiriaji. Kivinjari kinauliza \"Leave site?\" Kuna mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa. Baki hapo, kisha uhifadhi kwa Ctrl+S. Vitufe na kipanya Dalili Sababu Suluhisho Vitufe vya herufi havifanyi kitu Kishale kiko kwenye sehemu (utafutaji, kihariri cha kipengee, jedwali). Bofya kwenye karatasi, au bonyeza Tab kutoka kwenye sehemu. Gurudumu linakuza badala ya kusogeza Gurudumu daima linakuza karatasi. Buruta ili kusogeza. Ukurasa mzima umekuwa mkubwa au mdogo Ukuzaji wa kivinjari (Ctrl++ au Ctrl+−). Bonyeza Ctrl+0. Kuza karatasi kwa gurudumu au kwa + na − pekee. Alama ilitoweka nilipobonyeza Backspace Backspace inafuta alama iliyochaguliwa usipokuwa unachora. Ctrl+Z inairudisha. Kubofya kulia hakumalizi kwenye Mac Kubofya kwa Control kunafika kama bofyo la kawaida. Tumia kubofya kwa vidole viwili ukiwa umewasha bofyo la pili, au bonyeza Enter. Skrini za mguso Kwenye skrini ya mguso: Gusa huweka pointi (au kuchagua alama kwa Chagua). Kidole kimoja kikiburuta husogeza. Vidole viwili hukuza kwa kubana karibu na nukta iliyo katikati yao, na husogeza vinaposogea pamoja. Kuweka kidole cha pili kunaghairi kile cha kwanza kilichoanza, kwa hivyo kubana hakuachi pointi. Maliza mstari au mpaka kwa kubonyeza kwa muda mrefu (bofyo la kulia), kugusa mara mbili, au Maliza kwenye upau chini ya karatasi. Upau huo huo una Nyuma (rudisha pointi ya mwisho) na Ghairi. Maeneo pia yanafungwa kwa kugusa pointi ya kwanza. Vidole vina malengo makubwa zaidi: pointi zinanasa, zinafunga na kuchagua kutoka mbali zaidi, na vishikio vya kona ni vikubwa zaidi. Kuandika urefu kunahitaji kibodi; kibodi ya skrini inafanya kazi wakati kisanduku cha Andika kimechaguliwa. Kwenye kompyuta kibao, kibodi pamoja na kipanya au trackpad vinafanya ukadiriaji kuwa rahisi zaidi. Kufanya kazi nje ya mtandao Kitufe au dalili Sababu Suluhisho Imeshindwa kuhifadhi Baadhi ya faili za programu hazikupakuliwa wakati wa kuhifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao. Angalia muunganisho wako kisha uchague kitufe tena. Matumizi ya nje ya mtandao hayapatikani Madirisha ya faragha na baadhi ya kompyuta zinazosimamiwa huzuia nakala za nje ya mtandao. Tumia dirisha la kawaida, au kivinjari kingine. \"Inahifadhi…\" haianzi kamwe Uko nje ya mtandao; kuhifadhi kunahitaji muunganisho. Hifadhi ukiwa mtandaoni. Programu ni ya zamani baada ya sasisho Nakala ya nje ya mtandao ni ya siku ya awali. Mtandaoni, chagua Tayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao, kisha Hifadhi tena (pata toleo la hivi karibuni). Unataka nafasi irudi Nakala ya nje ya mtandao ina takriban MB 6. Chagua Tayari kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao, kisha Ondoa nakala ya nje ya mtandao. Tazama Kufanya kazi nje ya mtandao. Bado umekwama Pakia ukurasa upya programu ikikoma kujibu. Ukadiriaji wako unapotea ukipakia upya usipokuwa umeuhifadhi, kwa hivyo hifadhi kwanza kwa Ctrl+S ukiweza. Kwa maswali ya kivinjari tazama Vivinjari na kompyuta.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"What is not built yet","summary":"Takeoff features this build does not have, and what to do instead today.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["limits","missing","not yet","roadmap","planned","workaround","per run","cloud","desktop"],"headings":[{"id":"measuring","text":"Measuring","level":2},{"id":"items-and-pricing","text":"Items and pricing","level":2},{"id":"drawings-dwg-and-dxf","text":"Drawings (DWG and DXF)","level":2},{"id":"auto-count","text":"Auto count","level":2},{"id":"files-and-sharing","text":"Files and sharing","level":2},{"id":"screen-and-input","text":"Screen and input","level":2},{"id":"3d-view","text":"3D view","level":2},{"id":"bidding","text":"Bidding","level":2},{"id":"panels","text":"Panels","level":2},{"id":"spreadsheets","text":"Spreadsheets","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk is in development. This list is what the current build does not do, and how to get the job done anyway.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"measuring\"\u003EMeasuring\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInserting a point in the middle of a run or outline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete the mark and draw it again.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBox (window) selection\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + click each mark, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E for every mark on the sheet. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ECopy, paste and duplicate marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERotating, mirroring or rescaling a pasted copy\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPaste on a sheet at the same scale and in the same orientation; draw the rest by hand.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReading a scale from a scanned sheet, or from a graphic scale bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPick the preset, or calibrate on the bar&#039;s length.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMore than one scale per sheet (detail areas, enlarged plans)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasure the part at the sheet&#039;s scale, and take off the detail on its own enlarged sheet if the set has one.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"items-and-pricing\"\u003EItems and pricing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAssembly formulas that use an item&#039;s other kinds of marks (the doors of a room item in its floor&#039;s formulas)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas use the main type&#039;s totals; price the other kinds on their own rows.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAssembly formulas worked out run by run\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas use the item&#039;s totals; use \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E for per-run extras.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas that use another item&#039;s quantities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERepeat the measurement in that item, or work it out in the spreadsheet export.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECrews on assembly components, or a working day other than 8 hours\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGive the crew to the item; read crew-days for another day length as crew-hours ÷ your day.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkups other than notes, clouds and highlights (arrows, dimensions, stamps), or replies on a note\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWrite it in the note&#039;s text; change its status as it is settled.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA price library shared by a team, or kept with your account\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe library is kept in this browser: export it as a CSV and import it on the other computer.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrade packs reviewed by working estimators\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery pack is a starter: check its assumptions against your job and your products before you price with it. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003ETrade packs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrices in trade packs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPacks bring assemblies only: set your own rates, or import your price list as a CSV.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERenaming the takeoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe name comes from the first PDF; rename the downloaded files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaming sheets by hand\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheets are named from the PDF&#039;s page labels; search by file name and page.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"drawings-dwg-and-dxf\"\u003EDrawings (DWG and DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPlot style tables, pen assignments and CTB files on a drawing&#039;s sheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA drawing is drawn black, or in its colors darkened for paper; line weights come from the drawing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpening a binary DXF, or a DWG older than AutoCAD 2000\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESave it as an ASCII DXF or a newer DWG.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding a linked drawing (xref) by the folder it sits in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the linked drawing&#039;s file too, with the host: it is found by file name among the open files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasuring 3D polylines, meshes, solids and regions\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount them by layer and type, or measure the plan view with the Linear and Area tools.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EText in a marked PDF from a drawing in scripts other than Latin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECharacters Helvetica has no glyph for print as &quot;?&quot; in the marked PDF; the drawing on screen is unaffected.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA hand-over of a drawing to another app from the sheet bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the same file in that app.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA drawing that carries the takeoff inside it, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E does for PDFs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E: the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E reopens on the same drawing, found by its contents.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrawing or counting PDF underlays, images and OLE objects placed in a drawing\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImages show as a frame only. Open the underlay PDF itself as a sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding symbols on a sheet with no scale drawn at another size\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGive the sheet its scale, or search it with a box drawn there.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding mirrored symbols\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount those by hand, or search again with a box around a mirrored one.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-and-sharing\"\u003EFiles and sharing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne PDF that both shows the marks and carries the takeoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E for people to see the marks; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E to reopen in TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA CSV of quantities by sheet or of the marks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUse \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E: its By sheet and Marks worksheets have them.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECloud saving\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot available yet. Save project files to your computer and back them up.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA desktop app\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in the browser, served from your own computer (\u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E) or any web server (the browser edition).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"screen-and-input\"\u003EScreen and input\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA right-click (or long-press) menu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUse the toolbar, the panels and the keys. A long press finishes a run or an outline.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERotating the view\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPages rotated in the PDF already show upright.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-view\"\u003E3D view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrawing or editing marks in 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGo back to the sheet (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) to draw; select and delete work in 3D.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELining up stacked floors plotted at different places on their pages\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStack floors plotted alike; check the others one sheet at a time.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount posts sized like the counted object\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery post on a sheet is the same size; it marks where a count is, not what it is.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bidding\"\u003EBidding\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESending a package to subcontractors from the app, addenda, award letters\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport the package&#039;s CSV (or the bid PDF), send it yourself, and type the bids that come back into the leveling table.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERepricing an alternate&#039;s bid area with a chosen bid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlternates and bid-area subtotals use your own prices; adjust the alternate by hand.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAutomatic reminders before a subcontractor&#039;s insurance or license date runs out\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe date is flagged on the Subcontractors page once it is past or within 30 days; check it when you invite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels\"\u003EPanels\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoving the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnly the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panels move. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spreadsheets\"\u003ESpreadsheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe XLSX workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent as TakeoffDesk. It has not been opened in Excel yet. If a spreadsheet program shows something unexpected, the CSV export holds the same estimate as plain values.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk is in development. This list is what the current build does not do, and how to get the job done anyway. Measuring Not built yet Instead, today Inserting a point in the middle of a run or outline Delete the mark and draw it again. Box (window) selection Shift + click each mark, or Ctrl+A for every mark on the sheet. See Copy, paste and duplicate marks. Rotating, mirroring or rescaling a pasted copy Paste on a sheet at the same scale and in the same orientation; draw the rest by hand. Reading a scale from a scanned sheet, or from a graphic scale bar Pick the preset, or calibrate on the bar's length. More than one scale per sheet (detail areas, enlarged plans) Measure the part at the sheet's scale, and take off the detail on its own enlarged sheet if the set has one. Items and pricing Not built yet Instead, today Assembly formulas that use an item's other kinds of marks (the doors of a room item in its floor's formulas) Formulas use the main type's totals; price the other kinds on their own rows. Assembly formulas worked out run by run Formulas use the item's totals; use N for per-run extras. Formulas that use another item's quantities Repeat the measurement in that item, or work it out in the spreadsheet export. Crews on assembly components, or a working day other than 8 hours Give the crew to the item; read crew-days for another day length as crew-hours ÷ your day. Markups other than notes, clouds and highlights (arrows, dimensions, stamps), or replies on a note Write it in the note's text; change its status as it is settled. A price library shared by a team, or kept with your account The library is kept in this browser: export it as a CSV and import it on the other computer. Trade packs reviewed by working estimators Every pack is a starter: check its assumptions against your job and your products before you price with it. See Trade packs. Prices in trade packs Packs bring assemblies only: set your own rates, or import your price list as a CSV. Renaming the takeoff The name comes from the first PDF; rename the downloaded files. Naming sheets by hand Sheets are named from the PDF's page labels; search by file name and page. Drawings (DWG and DXF) Not built yet Instead, today Plot style tables, pen assignments and CTB files on a drawing's sheets A drawing is drawn black, or in its colors darkened for paper; line weights come from the drawing. Opening a binary DXF, or a DWG older than AutoCAD 2000 Save it as an ASCII DXF or a newer DWG. Finding a linked drawing (xref) by the folder it sits in Open the linked drawing's file too, with the host: it is found by file name among the open files. Measuring 3D polylines, meshes, solids and regions Count them by layer and type, or measure the plan view with the Linear and Area tools. Text in a marked PDF from a drawing in scripts other than Latin Characters Helvetica has no glyph for print as \"?\" in the marked PDF; the drawing on screen is unaffected. A hand-over of a drawing to another app from the sheet bar Open the same file in that app. A drawing that carries the takeoff inside it, as PDF with the takeoff inside does for PDFs Save takeoff: the .takeoff.json reopens on the same drawing, found by its contents. Drawing or counting PDF underlays, images and OLE objects placed in a drawing Images show as a frame only. Open the underlay PDF itself as a sheet. Auto count Not built yet Instead, today Finding symbols on a sheet with no scale drawn at another size Give the sheet its scale, or search it with a box drawn there. Finding mirrored symbols Count those by hand, or search again with a box around a mirrored one. Files and sharing Not built yet Instead, today One PDF that both shows the marks and carries the takeoff Marked PDF for people to see the marks; PDF with the takeoff inside to reopen in TakeoffDesk. A CSV of quantities by sheet or of the marks Use XLSX: its By sheet and Marks worksheets have them. Cloud saving Not available yet. Save project files to your computer and back them up. A desktop app TakeoffDesk runs in the browser, served from your own computer (npm start) or any web server (the browser edition). Screen and input Not built yet Instead, today A right-click (or long-press) menu Use the toolbar, the panels and the keys. A long press finishes a run or an outline. Rotating the view Pages rotated in the PDF already show upright. 3D view Not built yet Instead, today Drawing or editing marks in 3D Go back to the sheet (3) to draw; select and delete work in 3D. Lining up stacked floors plotted at different places on their pages Stack floors plotted alike; check the others one sheet at a time. Count posts sized like the counted object Every post on a sheet is the same size; it marks where a count is, not what it is. Bidding Not built yet Instead, today Sending a package to subcontractors from the app, addenda, award letters Export the package's CSV (or the bid PDF), send it yourself, and type the bids that come back into the leveling table. Repricing an alternate's bid area with a chosen bid Alternates and bid-area subtotals use your own prices; adjust the alternate by hand. Automatic reminders before a subcontractor's insurance or license date runs out The date is flagged on the Subcontractors page once it is past or within 30 days; check it when you invite. Panels Not built yet Instead, today Moving the Quantities table Only the Sheets and Items panels move. See Arrange the panels. Spreadsheets The XLSX workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent as TakeoffDesk. It has not been opened in Excel yet. If a spreadsheet program shows something unexpected, the CSV export holds the same estimate as plain values.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Kutumia msaada huu","summary":"Fungua msaada, utafute ndani yake, na uone hatua za kompyuta yako.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["msaada","f1","tafuta","mafunzo","mwongozo"],"headings":[{"id":"fungua-msaada","text":"Fungua msaada","level":2},{"id":"tafuta-mada","text":"Tafuta mada","level":2},{"id":"hatua-za-kompyuta-yako","text":"Hatua za kompyuta yako","level":2},{"id":"msaada-uleule-kwenye-tovuti","text":"Msaada uleule kwenye tovuti","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKila programu ina msaada wake. Ni sehemu ya programu, kwa hiyo unafunguka bila muunganisho na daima unaeleza toleo unalotumia.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fungua-msaada\"\u003EFungua msaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, au chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMsaada\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau ulio juu ya programu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFunga\u003C/span\u003E ili kuuficha. Mchoro wako unabaki kama ulivyokuwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye kibodi nyingi za Mac, safu ya juu inadhibiti mwangaza na sauti. Bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pamoja na kitufe cha \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (au kitufe cha dunia), au tumia kitufe cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMsaada\u003C/span\u003E. Ona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EVitufe kwenye Mac\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafuta-mada\"\u003ETafuta mada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAndika kwenye kisanduku cha kutafuta juu ya msaada. Matokeo yanabadilika unapoandika na yanajumuisha majina ya amri za programu nyingine, kwa hiyo kuandika kile ungeandika mahali pengine mara nyingi kunakupeleka kwenye ukurasa sahihi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMada zinapangwa kwa namna ile ile kwenye kila programu: kuanza, mafunzo ya hatua kwa hatua, kutoka kwenye programu nyingine, marejeo, na utatuzi wa matatizo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EViungo ndani ya mada vinafungua mada inayofuata kwenye paneli ile ile. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERudi\u003C/span\u003E inakurudisha ulipokuwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hatua-za-kompyuta-yako\"\u003EHatua za kompyuta yako\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaadhi ya hatua zinatofautiana kati ya Mac, Windows na Linux, kati ya vivinjari, na kati ya kuwa mtandaoni au nje ya mtandao. Msaada unagundua kinachokuhusu na kuonyesha hatua hizo. Mstari ulio juu ya mada unasema ulichochagua, kwa mfano &quot;Inaonyesha hatua za Mac, Chrome au Edge, mtandaoni&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBadili\u003C/span\u003E kwenye mstari huo ili uchague kompyuta au kivinjari kingine, kwa mfano kumsaidia mwenzako.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnyesha zote\u003C/span\u003E ili kuona kila toleo la kila hatua, kila moja likiwa na lebo yake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENjia za mkato za kibodi zinaandikwa jinsi kibodi yako inavyozitaja: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inasomeka kama ⌘S kwenye Mac na Ctrl+S kwenye Windows na Linux.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"msaada-uleule-kwenye-tovuti\"\u003EMsaada uleule kwenye tovuti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETovuti inaonyesha mada zilezile kwenye getcadcraft.com/tutorials, pamoja na hatua za kila jukwaa. Ndani ya programu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua kwenye tovuti\u003C/span\u003E chini ya mada inafungua ukurasa huo ukiwa mtandaoni.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kila programu ina msaada wake. Ni sehemu ya programu, kwa hiyo unafunguka bila muunganisho na daima unaeleza toleo unalotumia. Fungua msaada Bonyeza F1, au chagua Msaada kwenye upau ulio juu ya programu. Bonyeza Esc au chagua Funga ili kuuficha. Mchoro wako unabaki kama ulivyokuwa. Kwenye kibodi nyingi za Mac, safu ya juu inadhibiti mwangaza na sauti. Bonyeza F1 pamoja na kitufe cha fn (au kitufe cha dunia), au tumia kitufe cha Msaada. Ona Vitufe kwenye Mac. Tafuta mada Andika kwenye kisanduku cha kutafuta juu ya msaada. Matokeo yanabadilika unapoandika na yanajumuisha majina ya amri za programu nyingine, kwa hiyo kuandika kile ungeandika mahali pengine mara nyingi kunakupeleka kwenye ukurasa sahihi. Mada zinapangwa kwa namna ile ile kwenye kila programu: kuanza, mafunzo ya hatua kwa hatua, kutoka kwenye programu nyingine, marejeo, na utatuzi wa matatizo. Viungo ndani ya mada vinafungua mada inayofuata kwenye paneli ile ile. Rudi inakurudisha ulipokuwa. Hatua za kompyuta yako Baadhi ya hatua zinatofautiana kati ya Mac, Windows na Linux, kati ya vivinjari, na kati ya kuwa mtandaoni au nje ya mtandao. Msaada unagundua kinachokuhusu na kuonyesha hatua hizo. Mstari ulio juu ya mada unasema ulichochagua, kwa mfano \"Inaonyesha hatua za Mac, Chrome au Edge, mtandaoni\". Chagua Badili kwenye mstari huo ili uchague kompyuta au kivinjari kingine, kwa mfano kumsaidia mwenzako. Chagua Onyesha zote ili kuona kila toleo la kila hatua, kila moja likiwa na lebo yake. Njia za mkato za kibodi zinaandikwa jinsi kibodi yako inavyozitaja: Ctrl+S inasomeka kama ⌘S kwenye Mac na Ctrl+S kwenye Windows na Linux. Msaada uleule kwenye tovuti Tovuti inaonyesha mada zilezile kwenye getcadcraft.com/tutorials, pamoja na hatua za kila jukwaa. Ndani ya programu, Fungua kwenye tovuti chini ya mada inafungua ukurasa huo ukiwa mtandaoni.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Vivinjari na kompyuta","summary":"Programu zinaendeshwa ndani ya vivinjari gani, vinatofautianaje, na kompyuta yako inahitaji nini.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","kivinjari","mac","windows","linux","ipad","kompyuta kibao","webgl","mahitaji","kumbukumbu"],"headings":[{"id":"kivinjari-gani","text":"Kivinjari gani","level":2},{"id":"tofauti-kati-ya-vivinjari","text":"Tofauti kati ya vivinjari","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-na-linux","text":"Mac, Windows na Linux","level":2},{"id":"kompyuta-kibao-na-skrini-za-kugusa","text":"Kompyuta kibao na skrini za kugusa","level":2},{"id":"kivinjari-na-mfumo-wa-zamani-zaidi","text":"Kivinjari na mfumo wa zamani zaidi","level":2},{"id":"kompyuta-yako-inahitaji-nini","text":"Kompyuta yako inahitaji nini","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EProgramu zinafanya kazi ndani ya kivinjari cha wavuti. Zinafanya kazi kwenye kompyuta yako: faili zako zinafunguliwa hapo na hazitumwi kwetu (ona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EMahali faili zako zinapoenda\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kivinjari-gani\"\u003EKivinjari gani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETumia toleo la kisasa la mojawapo ya haya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKivinjari\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInjini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaelezo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKamili zaidi: kuchagua folda, kuhifadhi kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao, ushughulikiaji wa faili.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInafanya kazi. Kufungua folda nzima kunatumia kichagua rahisi zaidi. Kuhifadhi nje ya mtandao huenda kisifanye kazi katika madirisha ya faragha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInafanya kazi kwenye Mac na iPad. Kufungua folda nzima kunatumia kichagua rahisi zaidi. Safari inaweza kufuta nakala ya nje ya mtandao ambayo hujaitumia kwa wiki chache.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInjini zote tatu zinafaa kwa kazi ya kila siku. Pale programu inapofanya kitu kwa njia tofauti katika mojawapo, msaada wake unaonyesha hatua za kivinjari chako.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tofauti-kati-ya-vivinjari\"\u003ETofauti kati ya vivinjari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKufungua folda.\u003C/strong\u003E Vivinjari vya Chromium vinaonyesha kichagua halisi cha folda na vinaweza kusoma folda moja kwa moja. Firefox na Safari zinakuomba uchague folda kisha zinasoma kila faili ndani yake, jambo linalochukua muda zaidi kwa folda kubwa za miradi; kuburuta folda hadi kwenye programu kunafanya kazi katika vyote vitatu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuhifadhi.\u003C/strong\u003E Programu zinahifadhi kwa kupakua faili. Kivinjari chako ndicho kinachoamua upakuaji unakwenda wapi na kama kinauliza kwanza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKatika Chrome au Edge, washa &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; (katika Settings, chini ya Downloads) ili uchague folda kila mara.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKatika Firefox, fungua Settings, kisha General, kisha Downloads, na uchague &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; ili uchague folda kila mara.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKatika Safari, fungua Settings, kisha General, na uweke &quot;File download location&quot; kuwa &quot;Ask for each download&quot; ili uchague folda kila mara.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-na-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows na Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProgramu ni zile zile kwenye kila kompyuta. Kinachobadilika ni kibodi: njia za mkato zinaandikwa kwa kompyuta yako kiotomatiki. Ona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EVitufe, panya na pedi za kugusa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kompyuta-kibao-na-skrini-za-kugusa\"\u003EKompyuta kibao na skrini za kugusa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaadhi ya programu zinakubali mguso (kidole kimoja huchora au kuchagua, vidole viwili hubana kuvuta karibu na kusogeza). Msaada wa kila programu unaonyesha kama inakubali. Kwenye iPad, tumia Safari au Chrome. Kibodi inasaidia kwa programu zinazotumia amri zilizoandikwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kivinjari-na-mfumo-wa-zamani-zaidi\"\u003EKivinjari na mfumo wa zamani zaidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETunasoma hizi kutoka kwenye msimbo wa programu toleo la 0.7, si kubahatisha: kila faili lilichambuliwa na kila kipengele cha lugha kilichotumika kiliangaliwa kwenye data iliyochapishwa ya upatanifu wa vivinjari. Chini ya matoleo haya programu haziwezi hata kuanza, kwa sababu kivinjari hakielewi msimbo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EToleo la zamani kabisa linaloweza kuanzisha programu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS na iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio ina injini yake ya wavuti kwenye Windows, kwa hiyo inahitaji Windows 10 au 11; kwenye Mac inatumia ya mfumo, kwa hiyo inahitaji macOS 13.3 au mpya zaidi. Mipangilio › Masasisho katika Studio inaonyesha nakala yako inaendeshwa kwenye nini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHii ni toleo la zamani kabisa linalo*anza*, kulingana na msimbo. Si orodha ya vivinjari vya zamani ambavyo tuliendesha programu ndani yake, kwa hiyo kivinjari cha zamani kinachoanza kinaweza bado kukosa kipengele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kompyuta-yako-inahitaji-nini\"\u003EKompyuta yako inahitaji nini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHizi ni viwango vya chini vilivyopangwa kwa programu, si mahitaji yaliyopimwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGB 8 za kumbukumbu (GB 16 zinapendekezwa kwa modeli kubwa zilizounganishwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChipu ya picha yenye WebGL 2 kwa programu za 3D. Ikiwa mwonekano wa 3D unabaki tupu, angalia kama kuongeza kasi ya vifaa kumewashwa kwenye mipangilio ya kivinjari chako.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkrini yenye upana wa angalau pikseli 1280 kwa upau kamili wa zana; skrini ndogo zinazifunga kwenye mistari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaili kubwa sana (seti kubwa za mipango, modeli kubwa) hutumia kumbukumbu nyingi kwenye kichupo cha kivinjari. Funga vichupo vingine vizito ikiwa programu inaanza kupunguza kasi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Programu zinafanya kazi ndani ya kivinjari cha wavuti. Zinafanya kazi kwenye kompyuta yako: faili zako zinafunguliwa hapo na hazitumwi kwetu (ona Mahali faili zako zinapoenda). Kivinjari gani Tumia toleo la kisasa la mojawapo ya haya: Kivinjari Injini Maelezo Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Kamili zaidi: kuchagua folda, kuhifadhi kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao, ushughulikiaji wa faili. Firefox Gecko Inafanya kazi. Kufungua folda nzima kunatumia kichagua rahisi zaidi. Kuhifadhi nje ya mtandao huenda kisifanye kazi katika madirisha ya faragha. Safari WebKit Inafanya kazi kwenye Mac na iPad. Kufungua folda nzima kunatumia kichagua rahisi zaidi. Safari inaweza kufuta nakala ya nje ya mtandao ambayo hujaitumia kwa wiki chache. Injini zote tatu zinafaa kwa kazi ya kila siku. Pale programu inapofanya kitu kwa njia tofauti katika mojawapo, msaada wake unaonyesha hatua za kivinjari chako. Tofauti kati ya vivinjari Kufungua folda. Vivinjari vya Chromium vinaonyesha kichagua halisi cha folda na vinaweza kusoma folda moja kwa moja. Firefox na Safari zinakuomba uchague folda kisha zinasoma kila faili ndani yake, jambo linalochukua muda zaidi kwa folda kubwa za miradi; kuburuta folda hadi kwenye programu kunafanya kazi katika vyote vitatu. Kuhifadhi. Programu zinahifadhi kwa kupakua faili. Kivinjari chako ndicho kinachoamua upakuaji unakwenda wapi na kama kinauliza kwanza. Katika Chrome au Edge, washa \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" (katika Settings, chini ya Downloads) ili uchague folda kila mara. Katika Firefox, fungua Settings, kisha General, kisha Downloads, na uchague \"Always ask you where to save files\" ili uchague folda kila mara. Katika Safari, fungua Settings, kisha General, na uweke \"File download location\" kuwa \"Ask for each download\" ili uchague folda kila mara. Mac, Windows na Linux Programu ni zile zile kwenye kila kompyuta. Kinachobadilika ni kibodi: njia za mkato zinaandikwa kwa kompyuta yako kiotomatiki. Ona Vitufe, panya na pedi za kugusa. Kompyuta kibao na skrini za kugusa Baadhi ya programu zinakubali mguso (kidole kimoja huchora au kuchagua, vidole viwili hubana kuvuta karibu na kusogeza). Msaada wa kila programu unaonyesha kama inakubali. Kwenye iPad, tumia Safari au Chrome. Kibodi inasaidia kwa programu zinazotumia amri zilizoandikwa. Kivinjari na mfumo wa zamani zaidi Tunasoma hizi kutoka kwenye msimbo wa programu toleo la 0.7, si kubahatisha: kila faili lilichambuliwa na kila kipengele cha lugha kilichotumika kiliangaliwa kwenye data iliyochapishwa ya upatanifu wa vivinjari. Chini ya matoleo haya programu haziwezi hata kuanza, kwa sababu kivinjari hakielewi msimbo. Toleo la zamani kabisa linaloweza kuanzisha programu Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS na iOS 16.4) CadCraft Studio ina injini yake ya wavuti kwenye Windows, kwa hiyo inahitaji Windows 10 au 11; kwenye Mac inatumia ya mfumo, kwa hiyo inahitaji macOS 13.3 au mpya zaidi. Mipangilio › Masasisho katika Studio inaonyesha nakala yako inaendeshwa kwenye nini. Hii ni toleo la zamani kabisa linalo*anza*, kulingana na msimbo. Si orodha ya vivinjari vya zamani ambavyo tuliendesha programu ndani yake, kwa hiyo kivinjari cha zamani kinachoanza kinaweza bado kukosa kipengele. Kompyuta yako inahitaji nini Hizi ni viwango vya chini vilivyopangwa kwa programu, si mahitaji yaliyopimwa: GB 8 za kumbukumbu (GB 16 zinapendekezwa kwa modeli kubwa zilizounganishwa). Chipu ya picha yenye WebGL 2 kwa programu za 3D. Ikiwa mwonekano wa 3D unabaki tupu, angalia kama kuongeza kasi ya vifaa kumewashwa kwenye mipangilio ya kivinjari chako. Skrini yenye upana wa angalau pikseli 1280 kwa upau kamili wa zana; skrini ndogo zinazifunga kwenye mistari. Faili kubwa sana (seti kubwa za mipango, modeli kubwa) hutumia kumbukumbu nyingi kwenye kichupo cha kivinjari. Funga vichupo vingine vizito ikiwa programu inaanza kupunguza kasi.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Vitufe, panya na pedi za kugusa","summary":"Jinsi njia za mkato zinavyoandikwa, vitufe vya kazi kwenye Mac, kubofya kulia na kusogeza bila panya.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["kibodi","njia ya mkato","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","vitufe vya kazi","pedi ya kugusa","bofya kulia","kitufe cha kati","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"njia-za-mkato-zinavyoandikwa","text":"Njia za mkato zinavyoandikwa","level":2},{"id":"vitufe-vya-kazi-kwenye-mac","text":"Vitufe vya kazi kwenye Mac","level":2},{"id":"njia-za-mkato-ambazo-kivinjari-kinazihifadhi","text":"Njia za mkato ambazo kivinjari kinazihifadhi","level":2},{"id":"vitufe-vya-panya-kwenye-pedi-ya-kugusa","text":"Vitufe vya panya kwenye pedi ya kugusa","level":2},{"id":"kuandika-kwenye-kisanduku-cha-maandishi","text":"Kuandika kwenye kisanduku cha maandishi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"njia-za-mkato-zinavyoandikwa\"\u003ENjia za mkato zinavyoandikwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMsaada unaandika kila njia ya mkato jinsi kibodi yako inavyoitaja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImeandikwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKwenye Mac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKwenye Windows na Linux\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) na S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl na S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) na F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift na F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) na ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt na ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekitufe cha Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn na Delete (futa mbele)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlama ya kuongeza inamaanisha shikilia vitufe pamoja. &quot;Kisha&quot; inamaanisha bonyeza kimoja baada ya kingine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENjia nyingi za programu zinakubali Command au Control kwenye Mac, kwa hiyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inafanya kazi kwa njia zote mbili. Chache, kama skrini kamili (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), zinatumia kitufe cha Control kwenye kila kompyuta; msaada unasema hivyo mahali inapohusika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vitufe-vya-kazi-kwenye-mac\"\u003EVitufe vya kazi kwenye Mac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye kibodi nyingi za Mac, safu ya juu inabadilisha mwangaza, sauti na midia. Ili kutuma F1 hadi F12:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eshikilia \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (au kitufe cha dunia) unapobonyeza kitufe, au\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Efungua \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, kisha \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard\u003C/strong\u003E, kisha \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong\u003E, kisha \u003Cstrong\u003EFunction Keys\u003C/strong\u003E, na uwashe &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaadhi ya vitufe vya F pia vinadaiwa na macOS yenyewe (kwa mfano Mission Control). Kitufe kisipofanya kitu kwenye programu, jaribu kwa fn, au tumia kitufe cha upau wa zana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"njia-za-mkato-ambazo-kivinjari-kinazihifadhi\"\u003ENjia za mkato ambazo kivinjari kinazihifadhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkurasa wa wavuti hauwezi kuchukua baadhi ya njia za mkato kutoka kwenye kivinjari, bila kujali unachofanya. Katika kila programu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kila mara hufungua au kufunga madirisha na vichupo vya kivinjari. Programu zinatumia vitufe vya Mpya na Funga badala yake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwenye Mac na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwenye Windows vinafunga kivinjari. Ukiwa na kazi ambayo haijahifadhiwa, kivinjari kinauliza kwanza (&quot;Leave site?&quot;); chagua kubaki, kisha uhifadhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkrini kamili ya kivinjari yenyewe (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, au kitufe cha kijani kwenye dirisha\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) bado inafanya kazi. Programu pia zina hali zao za skrini kwenye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ambazo zinaweza kuficha pia upau wa programu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vitufe-vya-panya-kwenye-pedi-ya-kugusa\"\u003EVitufe vya panya kwenye pedi ya kugusa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProgramu zinatumia kitufe cha kulia na kitufe cha kati. Bila panya yenye vitufe vitatu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBofya kulia:\u003C/strong\u003E bofya kwa vidole viwili. Washa &quot;Secondary click&quot; kwenye \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, kisha \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, ikiwa kubofya kwa vidole viwili hakufanyi kitu. Kushikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E unapobofya kunafungua menyu ya kivinjari, lakini ndani ya mchoro baadhi ya programu inalisoma kama bofya la kawaida (pamoja na Control), kwa hiyo pendelea bofya kwa vidole viwili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuburuta kwa kitufe cha kati (kusogeza):\u003C/strong\u003E kila programu inatoa njia nyingine ya kusogeza, kama kushikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E unapoburuta au kuburuta kwa kitufe cha kulia. Ukurasa wa kibodi wa programu unasema ni ipi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuvuta kwa gurudumu:\u003C/strong\u003E kutelezesha vidole viwili kwenye pedi ya kugusa kunavuta karibu kwenye programu nyingi. Kubana pia kunavuta karibu pale programu inapolikubali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBofya kulia:\u003C/strong\u003E bofya kwa vidole viwili, au bofya kona ya chini kulia ya pedi ya kugusa. Hii inategemea mipangilio ya pedi yako ya kugusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuburuta kwa kitufe cha kati (kusogeza):\u003C/strong\u003E kila programu inatoa njia nyingine ya kusogeza, kama kushikilia \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E unapoburuta au kuburuta kwa kitufe cha kulia. Ukurasa wa kibodi wa programu unasema ni ipi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuvuta kwa gurudumu:\u003C/strong\u003E kutelezesha vidole viwili kwenye pedi ya kugusa kunavuta karibu kwenye programu nyingi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuandika-kwenye-kisanduku-cha-maandishi\"\u003EKuandika kwenye kisanduku cha maandishi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnapoandika kwenye kisanduku (jina, maelezo, utafutaji), njia za mkato za herufi moja za programu zimezimwa, kwa hiyo kuandika &quot;L&quot; kunaandika L. Bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E au bofya mchoro ili kurudisha vitufe kwa programu.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Njia za mkato zinavyoandikwa Msaada unaandika kila njia ya mkato jinsi kibodi yako inavyoitaja. Imeandikwa Kwenye Mac Kwenye Windows na Linux Ctrl+S Command (⌘) na S Ctrl na S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) na F Ctrl, Shift na F Alt+← Option (⌥) na ← Alt na ← Backspace kitufe cha Delete Backspace Delete fn na Delete (futa mbele) Delete Enter Return Enter Alama ya kuongeza inamaanisha shikilia vitufe pamoja. \"Kisha\" inamaanisha bonyeza kimoja baada ya kingine. Njia nyingi za programu zinakubali Command au Control kwenye Mac, kwa hiyo Ctrl+Z inafanya kazi kwa njia zote mbili. Chache, kama skrini kamili (Ctrl+Shift+F), zinatumia kitufe cha Control kwenye kila kompyuta; msaada unasema hivyo mahali inapohusika. Vitufe vya kazi kwenye Mac Kwenye kibodi nyingi za Mac, safu ya juu inabadilisha mwangaza, sauti na midia. Ili kutuma F1 hadi F12: shikilia fn (au kitufe cha dunia) unapobonyeza kitufe, au fungua System Settings, kisha Keyboard, kisha Keyboard Shortcuts, kisha Function Keys, na uwashe \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\". Baadhi ya vitufe vya F pia vinadaiwa na macOS yenyewe (kwa mfano Mission Control). Kitufe kisipofanya kitu kwenye programu, jaribu kwa fn, au tumia kitufe cha upau wa zana. Njia za mkato ambazo kivinjari kinazihifadhi Ukurasa wa wavuti hauwezi kuchukua baadhi ya njia za mkato kutoka kwenye kivinjari, bila kujali unachofanya. Katika kila programu: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T na Ctrl+W kila mara hufungua au kufunga madirisha na vichupo vya kivinjari. Programu zinatumia vitufe vya Mpya na Funga badala yake. Ctrl+Q kwenye Mac na Alt+F4 kwenye Windows vinafunga kivinjari. Ukiwa na kazi ambayo haijahifadhiwa, kivinjari kinauliza kwanza (\"Leave site?\"); chagua kubaki, kisha uhifadhi. Skrini kamili ya kivinjari yenyewe (Control-Command-F, au kitufe cha kijani kwenye dirisha / F11) bado inafanya kazi. Programu pia zina hali zao za skrini kwenye Ctrl+Shift+F, ambazo zinaweza kuficha pia upau wa programu. Vitufe vya panya kwenye pedi ya kugusa Programu zinatumia kitufe cha kulia na kitufe cha kati. Bila panya yenye vitufe vitatu: Bofya kulia: bofya kwa vidole viwili. Washa \"Secondary click\" kwenye System Settings, kisha Trackpad, ikiwa kubofya kwa vidole viwili hakufanyi kitu. Kushikilia Ctrl unapobofya kunafungua menyu ya kivinjari, lakini ndani ya mchoro baadhi ya programu inalisoma kama bofya la kawaida (pamoja na Control), kwa hiyo pendelea bofya kwa vidole viwili. Kuburuta kwa kitufe cha kati (kusogeza): kila programu inatoa njia nyingine ya kusogeza, kama kushikilia Space unapoburuta au kuburuta kwa kitufe cha kulia. Ukurasa wa kibodi wa programu unasema ni ipi. Kuvuta kwa gurudumu: kutelezesha vidole viwili kwenye pedi ya kugusa kunavuta karibu kwenye programu nyingi. Kubana pia kunavuta karibu pale programu inapolikubali. Bofya kulia: bofya kwa vidole viwili, au bofya kona ya chini kulia ya pedi ya kugusa. Hii inategemea mipangilio ya pedi yako ya kugusa. Kuburuta kwa kitufe cha kati (kusogeza): kila programu inatoa njia nyingine ya kusogeza, kama kushikilia Space unapoburuta au kuburuta kwa kitufe cha kulia. Ukurasa wa kibodi wa programu unasema ni ipi. Kuvuta kwa gurudumu: kutelezesha vidole viwili kwenye pedi ya kugusa kunavuta karibu kwenye programu nyingi. Kuandika kwenye kisanduku cha maandishi Unapoandika kwenye kisanduku (jina, maelezo, utafutaji), njia za mkato za herufi moja za programu zimezimwa, kwa hiyo kuandika \"L\" kunaandika L. Bonyeza Esc au bofya mchoro ili kurudisha vitufe kwa programu.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Tafuta zana au mpangilio","summary":"Bonyeza Ctrl+K na uandike herufi chache ili kuendesha zana yoyote, kubadilisha mpangilio au kufungua mada ya msaada.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["tafuta","utafutaji","amri","orodha ya amri","fungua haraka","endesha amri","ctrl k","cmd k","zana","mpangilio","njia ya mkato"],"headings":[{"id":"tafuta-na-endesha","text":"Tafuta na endesha","level":2},{"id":"mambo-ya-kufahamu","text":"Mambo ya kufahamu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKila programu ina kisanduku cha kutafuta kwa zana zake, mipangilio yake na msaada huu. Huhitaji kujua zana iko wapi kwenye upau wa zana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafuta-na-endesha\"\u003ETafuta na endesha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, au chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafuta\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau ulio juu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAndika herufi chache za unachotaka: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;maandishi ya paneli&quot;, &quot;vipimo&quot;. Kila neno unaloandika lazima lilingane, kwa hiyo ongeza neno la pili ili kupunguza orodha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuendesha mechi ya kwanza, au sogeza kwa vitufe vya mishale kwanza. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hufunga kisanduku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZana inaendeshwa kana kwamba uliibonyeza kwenye upau wa zana. Mpangilio unafungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E kwenye mpangilio huo. Mada ya msaada inafunguka hapa, kwenye paneli ya msaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mambo-ya-kufahamu\"\u003EMambo ya kufahamu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUlichotumia mwisho kinakuja kwanza wakati ujao, kwa hiyo zana unayoitumia mara nyingi iko umbali wa kitufe kimoja tu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZana ambazo haziwezi kuendeshwa sasa, kwa mfano kabla faili halijafunguliwa, zinaorodheshwa lakini zimefifishwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZana za nyongeza pia ziko kwenye orodha, mara tu nyongeza imewashwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Kila programu ina kisanduku cha kutafuta kwa zana zake, mipangilio yake na msaada huu. Huhitaji kujua zana iko wapi kwenye upau wa zana. Tafuta na endesha Bonyeza Ctrl+K, au chagua Tafuta kwenye upau ulio juu. Andika herufi chache za unachotaka: \"fillet\", \"maandishi ya paneli\", \"vipimo\". Kila neno unaloandika lazima lilingane, kwa hiyo ongeza neno la pili ili kupunguza orodha. Bonyeza Enter kuendesha mechi ya kwanza, au sogeza kwa vitufe vya mishale kwanza. Esc hufunga kisanduku. Zana inaendeshwa kana kwamba uliibonyeza kwenye upau wa zana. Mpangilio unafungua Mipangilio kwenye mpangilio huo. Mada ya msaada inafunguka hapa, kwenye paneli ya msaada. Mambo ya kufahamu Ulichotumia mwisho kinakuja kwanza wakati ujao, kwa hiyo zana unayoitumia mara nyingi iko umbali wa kitufe kimoja tu. Zana ambazo haziwezi kuendeshwa sasa, kwa mfano kabla faili halijafunguliwa, zinaorodheshwa lakini zimefifishwa. Zana za nyongeza pia ziko kwenye orodha, mara tu nyongeza imewashwa.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Panga paneli na utumie skrini ya pili","summary":"Bandika paneli za pembeni upande wa kushoto, kulia au chini, zipange juu ya nyingine, zipange kama vichupo, zibandike au uzifiche, zielee juu ya mchoro, fanya mpangilio uwe mnene zaidi, chagua idadi ya safu za upau wa zana, au uzihamishe kwenye dirisha lao kwenye skrini nyingine.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["paneli","bandika","elea","hamisha paneli","buruta","mpangilio","vichupo","kundi la vichupo","panga juu ya nyingine","pini","kuficha kiotomatiki","ficha paneli","funga paneli","kubana","msongamano wa mpangilio","mnene","safu za upau wa zana","funga kwenye mstari","safu 1","safu 2","mistari ya upau wa zana","skrini ya pili","skrini mbili","skrini nyingi","mfuatiliaji mwingine","dirisha","ibukizi","weka upya mpangilio"],"headings":[{"id":"hamisha-paneli-ndani-ya-dirisha","text":"Hamisha paneli ndani ya dirisha","level":2},{"id":"panga-paneli-kama-vichupo","text":"Panga paneli kama vichupo","level":2},{"id":"bandika-ficha-na-urudishe","text":"Bandika, ficha na urudishe","level":2},{"id":"fanya-mpangilio-uwe-mnene-zaidi","text":"Fanya mpangilio uwe mnene zaidi","level":2},{"id":"chagua-idadi-ya-safu-za-upau-wa-zana","text":"Chagua idadi ya safu za upau wa zana","level":2},{"id":"tumia-kibodi","text":"Tumia kibodi","level":2},{"id":"weka-paneli-kwenye-skrini-ya-pili","text":"Weka paneli kwenye skrini ya pili","level":2},{"id":"madirisha-zaidi-ya-moja-ya-paneli","text":"Madirisha zaidi ya moja ya paneli","level":2},{"id":"njia-ile-ile-kwa-kila-sehemu-ya-mpangilio","text":"Njia ile ile kwa kila sehemu ya mpangilio","level":2},{"id":"hamisha-kisanduku-cha-mazungumzo","text":"Hamisha kisanduku cha mazungumzo","level":2},{"id":"rudisha-paneli","text":"Rudisha paneli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPaneli zilizo kando ya mchoro zinaweza kuhamishwa. Ziweke mahali panapokufaa, au ipe paneli dirisha lao wenyewe kwenye skrini ya pili ili mchoro upate skrini nzima ya kwanza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila paneli ina upau wa kichwa: upau mwembamba wenye jina la paneli, menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, pini na kitufe cha kufunga juu ya paneli. Matoleo kabla ya 0.7 yana jina na menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E pekee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamisha-paneli-ndani-ya-dirisha\"\u003EHamisha paneli ndani ya dirisha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuruta paneli kwa jina lake lililo juu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnapoburuta, maeneo yenye mistari yanaonekana upande wa kushoto, kulia na chini ya mchoro. Dondosha paneli juu ya moja ya maeneo hayo ili ibandikwe hapo. Eneo ulilopo linakuwa jeusi zaidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDondosha mahali popote pengine juu ya mchoro ili ielee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaneli zinaweza kushiriki upande mmoja: zinapangwa juu ya nyingine, na kila mstari kati ya mbili unaweza kuburutwa ili kugawana nafasi (ukiwa umelenga mstari, vitufe vya mishale vinausogeza, na kubofya mara mbili kunagawanya nafasi sawasawa). Buruta ukingo wa ndani wa upande uliobandikwa ili uwe mpana au mwembamba zaidi; bofya mara mbili ukingo ili urudishwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaneli inayoelea hukaa juu ya mchoro. Isogeze kwa jina lake, na ubadilishe ukubwa wake kwa kuburuta kona yake ya chini kulia (au tumia kichupo kufika kwenye kona kisha utumie vitufe vya mishale). Bofya mara mbili jina lake ili ibandikwe tena mahali ilipokuwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuruta kwa kidole kimoja kwenye jina la paneli. Buruta kona ya chini kulia ya paneli inayoelea kwa kidole kimoja ili ubadilishe ukubwa wake, na ukingo kati ya paneli zilizobandikwa kwa njia hiyohiyo. Ili kuelea au kubandika bila kuburuta, tumia menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panga-paneli-kama-vichupo\"\u003EPanga paneli kama vichupo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaneli mbili zinaweza kushiriki fremu moja na kuonyesha moja kwa wakati. Buruta paneli kwa jina lake hadi kwenye upau wa kichwa wa paneli nyingine (upau huo unaonekana umewekewa mstari unapokuwa juu yake) kisha uachie: fremu sasa ina kichupo kwa kila paneli, kwenye upau wake wa kichwa. Bofya kichupo ili uonyeshe paneli hiyo. Kichupo kikiwa kimelengwa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hubadilisha vichupo, na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huenda kwenye cha kwanza na cha mwisho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kutoa paneli kwenye kundi, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToka kwenye kundi la vichupo\u003C/span\u003E kwenye menyu yake ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, au iburute mahali pengine. Chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka kichupo pamoja na\u003C/span\u003E kisha jina la paneli ili kuziunganisha bila kuburuta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bandika-ficha-na-urudishe\"\u003EBandika, ficha na urudishe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPini iliyo kwenye upau wa kichwa wa paneli huifanya \u003Cstrong\u003Eifiche kiotomatiki\u003C/strong\u003E: paneli inaondoka kwenye upande wake uliobandikwa na kuwa kichupo kidogo kwenye ukingo huo. Elekeza kwenye kichupo, kilenge au ukibofye, na paneli inateleza ikitoka juu ya mchoro; ukiondoka (au ubonyeze \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), inateleza kurudi. Bonyeza pini tena, au chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOndoa pini\u003C/span\u003E, ili kuibandika kwa kudumu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKitufe cha kufunga, au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFicha paneli hii\u003C/span\u003E kwenye menyu, kinaficha paneli na kufunga nafasi yake ya upande. Kichupo chenye mistari ya nukta kwenye ukingo kinairudisha: bofya, au ulenge na ubonyeze \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fanya-mpangilio-uwe-mnene-zaidi\"\u003EFanya mpangilio uwe mnene zaidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa ujumla\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMsongamano wa mpangilio\u003C/span\u003E lina chaguo mbili. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStarehe\u003C/span\u003E ndicho chaguo-msingi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKubana\u003C/span\u003E hupunguza urefu wa safu, nafasi ndani ya paneli, vitufe vya upau wa zana na maandishi ya paneli za programu hiyo, ili vitu zaidi viingie kwenye skrini. Huhifadhiwa kwa kila programu. Skrini ya kugusa huweka vitufe vyake vikubwa katika chaguo zote mbili, na simu huweka mpangilio wake yenyewe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka upya mpangilio\u003C/span\u003E haibadilishi msongamano uliouweka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chagua-idadi-ya-safu-za-upau-wa-zana\"\u003EChagua idadi ya safu za upau wa zana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa ujumla\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafu za upau wa zana\u003C/span\u003E lina chaguo tatu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFunga kwenye mstari\u003C/span\u003E ndicho chaguo-msingi: kila kikundi cha zana kinaonekana, kwenye mistari mingi kadiri kinavyohitaji. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafu 2\u003C/span\u003E huweka upau wa zana kwenye mistari miwili, na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafu 1\u003C/span\u003E kwenye mstari mmoja, ili mchoro upate urefu; vikundi visivyoingia husogea kando ndani ya upau wa zana (tumia gurudumu la kipanya, kutelezesha vidole viwili, au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hadi zana). Upau wa zana unaotoshea tayari kwenye mistari miwili unabaki hivyo chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafu 2\u003C/span\u003E, kwa sababu gridi ingeufanya uwe mrefu zaidi tu. Chaguo huhifadhiwa kwa kila programu. Skrini ya kugusa na simu huhifadhi mpangilio wao. CadCraft ina mpangilio wake wa upau wake, chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tumia-kibodi\"\u003ETumia kibodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila kitufe cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E cha paneli hufungua menyu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBandika upande wa kushoto\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBandika upande wa kulia\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBandika chini\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElea juu ya mchoro\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPini kwenye ukingo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFicha paneli hii\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka kichupo pamoja na\u003C/span\u003E paneli nyingine, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha kwenda dirisha jipya\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIweke tena\u003C/span\u003E. Nenda kwenye kitufe kwa kichupo, bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, sogeza kwa vitufe vya mishale, kisha ubonyeze \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tena. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hufunga menyu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weka-paneli-kwenye-skrini-ya-pili\"\u003EWeka paneli kwenye skrini ya pili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kwenye paneli, kisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha paneli zote kwenda dirisha jipya\u003C/span\u003E. Unaweza pia kuchagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamishia paneli kwenye dirisha jipya\u003C/span\u003E katika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDirisha dogo linafunguka likiwa na paneli ndani yake.Liburute hadi kwenye skrini yako nyingine na ulifanye kubwa kadiri unavyotaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEndelea kufanya kazi: paneli zinatenda kazi kwenye mchoro kama kawaida, na mchoro unajaza dirisha kuu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENjia za mkato zinaendelea kufanya kazi dirisha la paneli likiwa mbele: vitufe unavyobonyeza hapo, isipokuwa kuandika kwenye kisanduku, vinaenda kwenye mchoro. Maswali na mazungumzo ambayo programu inauliza bado hufunguka kwenye dirisha kuu, kwa hiyo yatazame hapo yanapotokea. Mandhari na ukubwa wa maandishi ya paneli hufuata dirisha kuu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome na Edge zinaweza kuweka dirisha kwenye skrini nyingine kwa ajili yako. Ukiwa na skrini ya pili imeunganishwa, chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka kwenye skrini yangu nyingine\u003C/span\u003E kwenye dirisha la paneli (au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka paneli kwenye skrini yangu nyingine\u003C/span\u003E kwenye menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ya paneli). Kivinjari kinauliza mara moja kama tovuti hii inaweza kuona skrini zako; ukiruhusu, dirisha la paneli hufunguka kwenye skrini hiyo kila mara.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuruta dirisha la paneli hadi kwenye skrini nyingine mwenyewe. Wakati ujao litafunguka mahali pamoja na kwa ukubwa uleule.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"madirisha-zaidi-ya-moja-ya-paneli\"\u003EMadirisha zaidi ya moja ya paneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila paneli inaweza kuwa na dirisha lake: hadi madirisha manne ya paneli, kwa mfano moja kwa kila skrini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ya paneli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha kwenda dirisha jipya\u003C/span\u003E hufungua dirisha jingine kwa paneli hiyo, na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamishia kwenye dirisha la paneli 2\u003C/span\u003E (na kadhalika) huihamishia kwenye dirisha lililo wazi tayari. Dirisha la pili linaitwa &quot;paneli 2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuruta paneli kwa jina lake kutoka dirisha moja hadi jingine: dondosha juu ya dirisha kuu ili ibandikwe hapo (maeneo yenye mistari yanaonekana unapokuwa juu yake) au ili ielee, au juu ya dirisha lingine la paneli ili ihamie ndani yake. Ukiidondosha mahali pengine popote, inabaki ilipokuwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDirisha la paneli lisilo na paneli tena hujifunga lenyewe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaada ya kupakia upya, programu inakupa tena madirisha yako ya paneli. Vivinjari hufungua dirisha moja kwa kila kubofya, kwa hiyo chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua ijayo\u003C/span\u003E mara moja kwa kila dirisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"njia-ile-ile-kwa-kila-sehemu-ya-mpangilio\"\u003ENjia ile ile kwa kila sehemu ya mpangilio\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUtepe, kisanduku cha zana, safu za zana na upau wa hali huenda kwenye dirisha lao wenyewe kwa njia ile ile ambayo paneli hufanya: fungua menyu ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kwenye sehemu hiyo na uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha kwenda dirisha jipya\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIweke tena\u003C/span\u003E (au kufunga dirisha) inairudisha nyumbani. Vitufe unavyobonyeza kwenye dirisha hilo hufika kwenye programu, kama vile kutoka dirisha la paneli. Kila sehemu ina menyu moja kama hiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamisha-kisanduku-cha-mazungumzo\"\u003EHamisha kisanduku cha mazungumzo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKila kisanduku cha mazungumzo kinaweza kuhamishwa ili kisifiche mchoro: bonyeza na uburute upau wake wa kichwa. Kisanduku kinakumbuka mahali ulipokiacha, kila kisanduku peke yake, na kurudi mahali hapo wakati mwingine kinapofunguka. Bofya mara mbili upau wa kichwa ili kikae katikati tena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwa kibodi, bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pamoja na kitufe cha mshale ukiwa umelenga ndani ya kisanduku ili kukisogeza pikseli 16 kwa wakati; ongeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kwa 64. Kisanduku kinachoishia nje ya skrini (baada ya dirisha au skrini kuwa ndogo) kinarudishwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye simu, visanduku vya mazungumzo vinabaki karatasi za upana kamili na havihamishwi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKatika CadCraft Studio, kisanduku cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChapisha kwenda PDF\u003C/span\u003E cha CadCraft, ambacho unaweza kukiacha wazi unapofanya kazi, kina kitufe kwenye upau wake wa kichwa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua kwenye dirisha lake\u003C/span\u003E. Kisanduku kinahamia kwenye dirisha lake mwenyewe ambalo unaweza kuliweka kwenye skrini nyingine. Kufunga kisanduku hufunga dirisha, na kufunga dirisha hufunga kisanduku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rudisha-paneli\"\u003ERudisha paneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERudisha paneli\u003C/span\u003E kwenye dirisha la paneli, au funga tu. Paneli zinarudi zilipokuwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufunga au kupakia upya dirisha kuu pia kunafunga dirisha la paneli. Programu inapofunguka tena inasema paneli zako zilikuwa kwenye dirisha lao wenyewe; chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua\u003C/span\u003E ili kurudisha dirisha, au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZiweke hapa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKwa ujumla\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka upya mpangilio\u003C/span\u003E inarudisha kila paneli mahali ilipoanzia.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkiwa hakuna kinachofunguka unapohamisha paneli kwenda dirisha jipya, kivinjari kimezuia dirisha ibukizi. Programu inasema hivyo na inaweka paneli zilipokuwa. Ruhusu madirisha ibukizi kwa getcadcraft.com, kisha ujaribu tena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMpangilio huhifadhiwa kwa kila programu kwenye kivinjari hiki, pamoja na mipangilio yako mingine.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Paneli zilizo kando ya mchoro zinaweza kuhamishwa. Ziweke mahali panapokufaa, au ipe paneli dirisha lao wenyewe kwenye skrini ya pili ili mchoro upate skrini nzima ya kwanza. Kila paneli ina upau wa kichwa: upau mwembamba wenye jina la paneli, menyu ya ⋯, pini na kitufe cha kufunga juu ya paneli. Matoleo kabla ya 0.7 yana jina na menyu ya ⋯ pekee. Hamisha paneli ndani ya dirisha Buruta paneli kwa jina lake lililo juu. Unapoburuta, maeneo yenye mistari yanaonekana upande wa kushoto, kulia na chini ya mchoro. Dondosha paneli juu ya moja ya maeneo hayo ili ibandikwe hapo. Eneo ulilopo linakuwa jeusi zaidi. Dondosha mahali popote pengine juu ya mchoro ili ielee. Paneli zinaweza kushiriki upande mmoja: zinapangwa juu ya nyingine, na kila mstari kati ya mbili unaweza kuburutwa ili kugawana nafasi (ukiwa umelenga mstari, vitufe vya mishale vinausogeza, na kubofya mara mbili kunagawanya nafasi sawasawa). Buruta ukingo wa ndani wa upande uliobandikwa ili uwe mpana au mwembamba zaidi; bofya mara mbili ukingo ili urudishwe. Paneli inayoelea hukaa juu ya mchoro. Isogeze kwa jina lake, na ubadilishe ukubwa wake kwa kuburuta kona yake ya chini kulia (au tumia kichupo kufika kwenye kona kisha utumie vitufe vya mishale). Bofya mara mbili jina lake ili ibandikwe tena mahali ilipokuwa. Buruta kwa kidole kimoja kwenye jina la paneli. Buruta kona ya chini kulia ya paneli inayoelea kwa kidole kimoja ili ubadilishe ukubwa wake, na ukingo kati ya paneli zilizobandikwa kwa njia hiyohiyo. Ili kuelea au kubandika bila kuburuta, tumia menyu ya ⋯. Panga paneli kama vichupo Paneli mbili zinaweza kushiriki fremu moja na kuonyesha moja kwa wakati. Buruta paneli kwa jina lake hadi kwenye upau wa kichwa wa paneli nyingine (upau huo unaonekana umewekewa mstari unapokuwa juu yake) kisha uachie: fremu sasa ina kichupo kwa kila paneli, kwenye upau wake wa kichwa. Bofya kichupo ili uonyeshe paneli hiyo. Kichupo kikiwa kimelengwa, ← na → hubadilisha vichupo, na Home na End huenda kwenye cha kwanza na cha mwisho. Ili kutoa paneli kwenye kundi, chagua Toka kwenye kundi la vichupo kwenye menyu yake ya ⋯, au iburute mahali pengine. Chagua Weka kichupo pamoja na kisha jina la paneli ili kuziunganisha bila kuburuta. Bandika, ficha na urudishe Pini iliyo kwenye upau wa kichwa wa paneli huifanya ifiche kiotomatiki: paneli inaondoka kwenye upande wake uliobandikwa na kuwa kichupo kidogo kwenye ukingo huo. Elekeza kwenye kichupo, kilenge au ukibofye, na paneli inateleza ikitoka juu ya mchoro; ukiondoka (au ubonyeze Esc), inateleza kurudi. Bonyeza pini tena, au chagua Ondoa pini, ili kuibandika kwa kudumu. Kitufe cha kufunga, au Ficha paneli hii kwenye menyu, kinaficha paneli na kufunga nafasi yake ya upande. Kichupo chenye mistari ya nukta kwenye ukingo kinairudisha: bofya, au ulenge na ubonyeze Enter. Fanya mpangilio uwe mnene zaidi Mipangilio › Kwa ujumla › Msongamano wa mpangilio lina chaguo mbili. Starehe ndicho chaguo-msingi. Kubana hupunguza urefu wa safu, nafasi ndani ya paneli, vitufe vya upau wa zana na maandishi ya paneli za programu hiyo, ili vitu zaidi viingie kwenye skrini. Huhifadhiwa kwa kila programu. Skrini ya kugusa huweka vitufe vyake vikubwa katika chaguo zote mbili, na simu huweka mpangilio wake yenyewe. Weka upya mpangilio haibadilishi msongamano uliouweka. Chagua idadi ya safu za upau wa zana Mipangilio › Kwa ujumla › Safu za upau wa zana lina chaguo tatu. Funga kwenye mstari ndicho chaguo-msingi: kila kikundi cha zana kinaonekana, kwenye mistari mingi kadiri kinavyohitaji. Safu 2 huweka upau wa zana kwenye mistari miwili, na Safu 1 kwenye mstari mmoja, ili mchoro upate urefu; vikundi visivyoingia husogea kando ndani ya upau wa zana (tumia gurudumu la kipanya, kutelezesha vidole viwili, au Tab hadi zana). Upau wa zana unaotoshea tayari kwenye mistari miwili unabaki hivyo chini ya Safu 2, kwa sababu gridi ingeufanya uwe mrefu zaidi tu. Chaguo huhifadhiwa kwa kila programu. Skrini ya kugusa na simu huhifadhi mpangilio wao. CadCraft ina mpangilio wake wa upau wake, chini ya Mipangilio › CadCraft. Tumia kibodi Kila kitufe cha ⋯ cha paneli hufungua menyu: Bandika upande wa kushoto, Bandika upande wa kulia, Bandika chini, Elea juu ya mchoro, Pini kwenye ukingo, Ficha paneli hii, Weka kichupo pamoja na paneli nyingine, Hamisha kwenda dirisha jipya na Iweke tena. Nenda kwenye kitufe kwa kichupo, bonyeza Enter, sogeza kwa vitufe vya mishale, kisha ubonyeze Enter tena. Esc hufunga menyu. Weka paneli kwenye skrini ya pili Chagua ⋯ kwenye paneli, kisha Hamisha paneli zote kwenda dirisha jipya. Unaweza pia kuchagua Hamishia paneli kwenye dirisha jipya katika Mipangilio. Dirisha dogo linafunguka likiwa na paneli ndani yake.Liburute hadi kwenye skrini yako nyingine na ulifanye kubwa kadiri unavyotaka. Endelea kufanya kazi: paneli zinatenda kazi kwenye mchoro kama kawaida, na mchoro unajaza dirisha kuu. Njia za mkato zinaendelea kufanya kazi dirisha la paneli likiwa mbele: vitufe unavyobonyeza hapo, isipokuwa kuandika kwenye kisanduku, vinaenda kwenye mchoro. Maswali na mazungumzo ambayo programu inauliza bado hufunguka kwenye dirisha kuu, kwa hiyo yatazame hapo yanapotokea. Mandhari na ukubwa wa maandishi ya paneli hufuata dirisha kuu. Chrome na Edge zinaweza kuweka dirisha kwenye skrini nyingine kwa ajili yako. Ukiwa na skrini ya pili imeunganishwa, chagua Weka kwenye skrini yangu nyingine kwenye dirisha la paneli (au Weka paneli kwenye skrini yangu nyingine kwenye menyu ya ⋯ ya paneli). Kivinjari kinauliza mara moja kama tovuti hii inaweza kuona skrini zako; ukiruhusu, dirisha la paneli hufunguka kwenye skrini hiyo kila mara. Buruta dirisha la paneli hadi kwenye skrini nyingine mwenyewe. Wakati ujao litafunguka mahali pamoja na kwa ukubwa uleule. Madirisha zaidi ya moja ya paneli Kila paneli inaweza kuwa na dirisha lake: hadi madirisha manne ya paneli, kwa mfano moja kwa kila skrini. Kwenye menyu ya ⋯ ya paneli, Hamisha kwenda dirisha jipya hufungua dirisha jingine kwa paneli hiyo, na Hamishia kwenye dirisha la paneli 2 (na kadhalika) huihamishia kwenye dirisha lililo wazi tayari. Dirisha la pili linaitwa \"paneli 2\". Buruta paneli kwa jina lake kutoka dirisha moja hadi jingine: dondosha juu ya dirisha kuu ili ibandikwe hapo (maeneo yenye mistari yanaonekana unapokuwa juu yake) au ili ielee, au juu ya dirisha lingine la paneli ili ihamie ndani yake. Ukiidondosha mahali pengine popote, inabaki ilipokuwa. Dirisha la paneli lisilo na paneli tena hujifunga lenyewe. Baada ya kupakia upya, programu inakupa tena madirisha yako ya paneli. Vivinjari hufungua dirisha moja kwa kila kubofya, kwa hiyo chagua Fungua ijayo mara moja kwa kila dirisha. Njia ile ile kwa kila sehemu ya mpangilio Utepe, kisanduku cha zana, safu za zana na upau wa hali huenda kwenye dirisha lao wenyewe kwa njia ile ile ambayo paneli hufanya: fungua menyu ya ⋯ kwenye sehemu hiyo na uchague Hamisha kwenda dirisha jipya; Iweke tena (au kufunga dirisha) inairudisha nyumbani. Vitufe unavyobonyeza kwenye dirisha hilo hufika kwenye programu, kama vile kutoka dirisha la paneli. Kila sehemu ina menyu moja kama hiyo. Hamisha kisanduku cha mazungumzo Kila kisanduku cha mazungumzo kinaweza kuhamishwa ili kisifiche mchoro: bonyeza na uburute upau wake wa kichwa. Kisanduku kinakumbuka mahali ulipokiacha, kila kisanduku peke yake, na kurudi mahali hapo wakati mwingine kinapofunguka. Bofya mara mbili upau wa kichwa ili kikae katikati tena. Kwa kibodi, bonyeza Alt+Shift pamoja na kitufe cha mshale ukiwa umelenga ndani ya kisanduku ili kukisogeza pikseli 16 kwa wakati; ongeza Ctrl kwa 64. Kisanduku kinachoishia nje ya skrini (baada ya dirisha au skrini kuwa ndogo) kinarudishwa. Kwenye simu, visanduku vya mazungumzo vinabaki karatasi za upana kamili na havihamishwi. Katika CadCraft Studio, kisanduku cha Chapisha kwenda PDF cha CadCraft, ambacho unaweza kukiacha wazi unapofanya kazi, kina kitufe kwenye upau wake wa kichwa, Fungua kwenye dirisha lake. Kisanduku kinahamia kwenye dirisha lake mwenyewe ambalo unaweza kuliweka kwenye skrini nyingine. Kufunga kisanduku hufunga dirisha, na kufunga dirisha hufunga kisanduku. Rudisha paneli Chagua Rudisha paneli kwenye dirisha la paneli, au funga tu. Paneli zinarudi zilipokuwa. Kufunga au kupakia upya dirisha kuu pia kunafunga dirisha la paneli. Programu inapofunguka tena inasema paneli zako zilikuwa kwenye dirisha lao wenyewe; chagua Fungua ili kurudisha dirisha, au Ziweke hapa. Mipangilio › Kwa ujumla › Weka upya mpangilio inarudisha kila paneli mahali ilipoanzia. Ikiwa hakuna kinachofunguka unapohamisha paneli kwenda dirisha jipya, kivinjari kimezuia dirisha ibukizi. Programu inasema hivyo na inaweka paneli zilipokuwa. Ruhusu madirisha ibukizi kwa getcadcraft.com, kisha ujaribu tena. Mpangilio huhifadhiwa kwa kila programu kwenye kivinjari hiki, pamoja na mipangilio yako mingine.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Fanya kazi kwenye mpangilio wa utepe na kivinjari cha mradi","summary":"Badilisha programu iwe utepe wa vichupo juu ya mchoro, pamoja na Sifa na kivinjari cha mradi upande wa kushoto na kichupo kwa kila mwonekano uliofunguliwa, kisha urudi kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida wakati wowote unapotaka.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["mpangilio","nafasi ya kazi","utepe","vichupo vya utepe","kivinjari cha mradi","kivinjari","paleti","paleti ya sifa","vichupo vya mionekano","upau wa hali","ufikiaji wa haraka","kunja utepe","punguza utepe","dirisha la utepe","mpangilio wa kawaida","badilisha mpangilio","badili mpangilio","imebandikwa"],"headings":[{"id":"chagua","text":"Chagua","level":2},{"id":"kilichopo-wapi","text":"Kilichopo wapi","level":2},{"id":"tumia-utepe-kwa-kibodi","text":"Tumia utepe kwa kibodi","level":2},{"id":"kunja-utepe-au-upe-dirisha-lake","text":"Kunja utepe au upe dirisha lake","level":2},{"id":"paneli-zako-zinabaki-zako","text":"Paneli zako zinabaki zako","level":2},{"id":"rudi-kwenye-mpangilio-wa-kawaida","text":"Rudi kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUtepe na kivinjari cha mradi\u003C/strong\u003E ni mojawapo ya mipangilio mitatu ya nafasi ya kazi ya programu. Utepe wa vichupo unapita juu, Sifa na kivinjari cha mradi vinashiriki paneli ya kushoto, kila mwonekano unaofungua unapata kichupo juu ya mchoro, na upau wa hali uko chini. Zana ni za programu yenyewe: kila unachoweza kufanya kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida kinafanya kazi hapa pia, na mchoro wako, mtindo wa menyu na njia zako za mkato vinabaki vilevile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chagua\"\u003EChagua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E (gia, au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua kichupo cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimataifa\u003C/span\u003E, kisha nenda kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMpangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENafasi ya kazi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUtepe na kivinjari cha mradi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMpangilio unabadilika mara moja. Chaguo ni moja kwa kila programu kwenye kivinjari hiki: kila programu inafunguka ndani yake kuanzia hapo, na linakuwepo kabla ukurasa haujachorwa, kwa hiyo hutaona mpangilio wa kawaida kwanza kamwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kilichopo-wapi\"\u003EKilichopo wapi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUpau wa kichwa:\u003C/strong\u003E jina la programu, vitufe vya ufikiaji wa haraka (fungua, hifadhi, tendua, rudia), jina la faili lililo wazi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKila zana hufanya nini hapa\u003C/span\u003E (orodha ya zana zote yenye kisanduku cha kutafuta, inayoonyesha zipi ziko tayari sasa na kwa nini nyingine hazipatikani), skrini nzima, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMsaada\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E. Katika mpangilio huu upau wa kichwa unachukua nafasi ya upau wa programu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUtepe:\u003C/strong\u003E zana za programu katika vichupo, kila kichupo kikiwa na vikundi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaili\u003C/span\u003E upande wa kushoto unafungua, unahifadhi na mengineyo. Programu zingine huongeza kichupo chao wakati unafanya kazi katika hali au nafasi fulani; kinawaka kikiwa kinatumika kisha kinatoweka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUpau wa chaguo:\u003C/strong\u003E chini ya utepe, kinachohitajiwa na zana inayoendeshwa, au kilichochaguliwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaneli ya kushoto:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifa\u003C/span\u003E juu, na chini yake paleti (kivinjari cha mradi na maudhui ya paneli yenyewe) kama vichupo. Buruta mstari kati yake ili kugawana nafasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVichupo vya mionekano:\u003C/strong\u003E kichupo kimoja kwa kila mwonekano uliofungua (karatasi, mpango, eneo la 3D…). Funga kimoja kwa kitufe chake cha kufunga; faili linabaki wazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUpau wa mwonekano na upau wa hali:\u003C/strong\u003E chini ya mchoro, vidhibiti vya mwonekano husika (kipimo, kukuza); chini kabisa, ujumbe wa programu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZana isiyoweza kufanya kazi sasa inakuwa ya kijivu, na kidokezo chake kinaeleza sababu (kwa mfano &quot;Fungua faili kwanza&quot;, au kwamba programu bado haina zana hiyo). Bofya, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E juu yake, ili kusoma sababu kwenye kisanduku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tumia-utepe-kwa-kibodi\"\u003ETumia utepe kwa kibodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKichupo cha utepe kikiwa kimelengwa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E husogea kati ya vichupo, na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E huenda kwenye cha kwanza na cha mwisho. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E husimamisha zana inayoendeshwa kwanza, kama kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida, na kila njia ya mkato pamoja na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (njia za skrini) hufanya kazi kama zamani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kunja-utepe-au-upe-dirisha-lake\"\u003EKunja utepe au upe dirisha lake\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBofya mara mbili kichupo cha utepe ili kukunja utepe hadi vichupo vyake; kubofya kichupo kisha kunaonyesha zana zake hadi uendelee. Bofya mara mbili tena ili kuweka utepe wazi. Kitufe cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha utepe\u003C/span\u003E kilicho upande wa kulia wa utepe kina \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKunja utepe\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka utepe wazi\u003C/span\u003E pia. Kila programu inakumbuka hili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha utepe\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha kwenda dirisha jipya\u003C/span\u003E huweka utepe kwenye dirisha lake, kwa mfano kwenye skrini ya pili. Vitufe vinavyobonyezwa hapo vinafika kwenye programu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERudisha utepe\u003C/span\u003E, au kufunga dirisha hilo, unairudisha nyumbani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMipangilio ya upau wa zana inatumika kwenye utepe: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimataifa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpau wa zana\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAikoni na lebo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAikoni pekee\u003C/span\u003E (utepe basi unaonyesha safu mbili za aikoni ndogo kwa kila kikundi) au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELebo pekee\u003C/span\u003E, na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnyesha majina ya vikundi (Faili, Chora, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paneli-zako-zinabaki-zako\"\u003EPaneli zako zinabaki zako\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaneli za kushoto na kulia zinabaki na kila kitu kilichoelezwa katika \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EPanga paneli\u003C/a\u003E: kubandika, kuelea, pini, kuficha, vichupo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha kwenda dirisha jipya\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka upya mpangilio\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rudi-kwenye-mpangilio-wa-kawaida\"\u003ERudi kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimataifa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMpangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENafasi ya kazi\u003C/span\u003E kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft ya kawaida\u003C/span\u003E. Kila upau wa zana, kila kichupo na kila paneli vinarudi mahali vilipokuwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye simu, au kwenye dirisha lenye upana wa pikseli 760 au chini ya hapo, programu inatumia mpangilio wake wa simu bila kujali ulichochagua. Dirisha pana zaidi huleta mpangilio wako tena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kujaribu mpangilio mwingine, angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Empangilio wa kisanduku cha zana na kisanduku cha taarifa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kubadilisha kinachoonyeshwa na mpangilio huu, angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBadilisha mpangilio kwenye skrini\u003C/a\u003E; kwa mpangilio mweusi wenye upau wa menyu na utepe, angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Empangilio wa Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Utepe na kivinjari cha mradi ni mojawapo ya mipangilio mitatu ya nafasi ya kazi ya programu. Utepe wa vichupo unapita juu, Sifa na kivinjari cha mradi vinashiriki paneli ya kushoto, kila mwonekano unaofungua unapata kichupo juu ya mchoro, na upau wa hali uko chini. Zana ni za programu yenyewe: kila unachoweza kufanya kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida kinafanya kazi hapa pia, na mchoro wako, mtindo wa menyu na njia zako za mkato vinabaki vilevile. Chagua Fungua Mipangilio (gia, au Ctrl+,). Chagua kichupo cha Kimataifa, kisha nenda kwenye Mpangilio › Nafasi ya kazi. Chagua Utepe na kivinjari cha mradi. Mpangilio unabadilika mara moja. Chaguo ni moja kwa kila programu kwenye kivinjari hiki: kila programu inafunguka ndani yake kuanzia hapo, na linakuwepo kabla ukurasa haujachorwa, kwa hiyo hutaona mpangilio wa kawaida kwanza kamwe. Kilichopo wapi Upau wa kichwa: jina la programu, vitufe vya ufikiaji wa haraka (fungua, hifadhi, tendua, rudia), jina la faili lililo wazi, Kila zana hufanya nini hapa (orodha ya zana zote yenye kisanduku cha kutafuta, inayoonyesha zipi ziko tayari sasa na kwa nini nyingine hazipatikani), skrini nzima, Msaada na Mipangilio. Katika mpangilio huu upau wa kichwa unachukua nafasi ya upau wa programu. Utepe: zana za programu katika vichupo, kila kichupo kikiwa na vikundi. Faili upande wa kushoto unafungua, unahifadhi na mengineyo. Programu zingine huongeza kichupo chao wakati unafanya kazi katika hali au nafasi fulani; kinawaka kikiwa kinatumika kisha kinatoweka. Upau wa chaguo: chini ya utepe, kinachohitajiwa na zana inayoendeshwa, au kilichochaguliwa. Paneli ya kushoto: Sifa juu, na chini yake paleti (kivinjari cha mradi na maudhui ya paneli yenyewe) kama vichupo. Buruta mstari kati yake ili kugawana nafasi. Vichupo vya mionekano: kichupo kimoja kwa kila mwonekano uliofungua (karatasi, mpango, eneo la 3D…). Funga kimoja kwa kitufe chake cha kufunga; faili linabaki wazi. Upau wa mwonekano na upau wa hali: chini ya mchoro, vidhibiti vya mwonekano husika (kipimo, kukuza); chini kabisa, ujumbe wa programu. Zana isiyoweza kufanya kazi sasa inakuwa ya kijivu, na kidokezo chake kinaeleza sababu (kwa mfano \"Fungua faili kwanza\", au kwamba programu bado haina zana hiyo). Bofya, au bonyeza Enter juu yake, ili kusoma sababu kwenye kisanduku. Tumia utepe kwa kibodi Kichupo cha utepe kikiwa kimelengwa, ← na → husogea kati ya vichupo, na Home na End huenda kwenye cha kwanza na cha mwisho. Esc husimamisha zana inayoendeshwa kwanza, kama kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida, na kila njia ya mkato pamoja na Ctrl+Shift+F (njia za skrini) hufanya kazi kama zamani. Kunja utepe au upe dirisha lake Bofya mara mbili kichupo cha utepe ili kukunja utepe hadi vichupo vyake; kubofya kichupo kisha kunaonyesha zana zake hadi uendelee. Bofya mara mbili tena ili kuweka utepe wazi. Kitufe cha Hamisha utepe kilicho upande wa kulia wa utepe kina Kunja utepe na Weka utepe wazi pia. Kila programu inakumbuka hili. Hamisha utepe › Hamisha kwenda dirisha jipya huweka utepe kwenye dirisha lake, kwa mfano kwenye skrini ya pili. Vitufe vinavyobonyezwa hapo vinafika kwenye programu. Rudisha utepe, au kufunga dirisha hilo, unairudisha nyumbani. Mipangilio ya upau wa zana inatumika kwenye utepe: Mipangilio › Kimataifa › Upau wa zana › Aikoni na lebo, Aikoni pekee (utepe basi unaonyesha safu mbili za aikoni ndogo kwa kila kikundi) au Lebo pekee, na Onyesha majina ya vikundi (Faili, Chora, …). Paneli zako zinabaki zako Paneli za kushoto na kulia zinabaki na kila kitu kilichoelezwa katika Panga paneli: kubandika, kuelea, pini, kuficha, vichupo, Hamisha kwenda dirisha jipya na Weka upya mpangilio. Rudi kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida Fungua Mipangilio › Kimataifa › Mpangilio › Nafasi ya kazi kisha uchague CadCraft ya kawaida. Kila upau wa zana, kila kichupo na kila paneli vinarudi mahali vilipokuwa. Kwenye simu, au kwenye dirisha lenye upana wa pikseli 760 au chini ya hapo, programu inatumia mpangilio wake wa simu bila kujali ulichochagua. Dirisha pana zaidi huleta mpangilio wako tena. Ili kujaribu mpangilio mwingine, angalia mpangilio wa kisanduku cha zana na kisanduku cha taarifa. Ili kubadilisha kinachoonyeshwa na mpangilio huu, angalia Badilisha mpangilio kwenye skrini; kwa mpangilio mweusi wenye upau wa menyu na utepe, angalia mpangilio wa Drafting.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Fanya kazi kwenye mpangilio wa kisanduku cha zana na kisanduku cha taarifa","summary":"Badilisha programu iwe safu ya zana upande wa kushoto zenye nafasi za zana zako, kisanduku cha taarifa juu kinachofuata zana inayoendeshwa au kitu ulichochagua, kidirisha cha urambazaji upande wa kulia, kichupo kwa kila mwonekano, chaguo za haraka na paleti ya uhariri, kisha urudi kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida wakati wowote.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["mpangilio","nafasi ya kazi","kisanduku cha zana","safu ya zana","kisanduku cha taarifa","upau wa taarifa","urambazaji","ramani ya mradi","upau wa haraka","chaguo za haraka","paleti ya uhariri","paleti ya kipenzi","zana zangu","zana ninazopenda","vichupo vya mionekano","dirisha la kisanduku cha zana","mpangilio wa kawaida","badilisha mpangilio","badili mpangilio"],"headings":[{"id":"chagua","text":"Chagua","level":2},{"id":"kilichopo-wapi","text":"Kilichopo wapi","level":2},{"id":"ipe-kisanduku-cha-zana-dirisha-lake","text":"Ipe kisanduku cha zana dirisha lake","level":2},{"id":"paneli-zako-zinabaki-zako","text":"Paneli zako zinabaki zako","level":2},{"id":"rudi-kwenye-mpangilio-wa-kawaida","text":"Rudi kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKisanduku cha zana na kisanduku cha taarifa\u003C/strong\u003E ni mojawapo ya mipangilio mitatu ya nafasi ya kazi ya programu. Zana za kuchora zinasimama kwenye safu upande wa kushoto, kisanduku cha taarifa kinapita juu na kuonyesha kinachohitajika na zana inayoendeshwa au kile ulichochagua, kila mwonekano una kichupo, na upau wa haraka chini ya mchoro unashikilia chaguo chache za kila siku. Zana ni za programu yenyewe: kila unachoweza kufanya kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida kinafanya kazi hapa pia, na mchoro wako, mtindo wa menyu na njia zako za mkato vinabaki vilevile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chagua\"\u003EChagua\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E (gia, au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua kichupo cha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimataifa\u003C/span\u003E, kisha nenda kwenye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMpangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENafasi ya kazi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKisanduku cha zana na kisanduku cha taarifa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMpangilio unabadilika mara moja. Chaguo ni moja kwa kila programu kwenye kivinjari hiki: kila programu inafunguka ndani yake kuanzia hapo, na linakuwepo kabla ukurasa haujachorwa, kwa hiyo hutaona mpangilio wa kawaida kwanza kamwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kilichopo-wapi\"\u003EKilichopo wapi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUpau wa zana:\u003C/strong\u003E upau wa zana wa programu unabaki juu ya eneo la kuchora, pamoja na menyu zake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKisanduku cha taarifa:\u003C/strong\u003E chini ya upau wa zana. Zana inapoendeshwa, kinaonyesha zana hiyo na kinachohitaji. Unapochagua kitu, kinaonyesha mipangilio yake mikuu (kwa ukuta: aina yake, unene, urefu, mstari wa mahali na kimo), na unaweza kuibadilisha hapo hapo: mabadiliko hapo ni sawa na yale ya Sifa, na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inayarudisha. Pasipo kitu kilichochaguliwa kinasema &quot;Hakuna kilichochaguliwa&quot;. Kila programu huongeza visanduku vyake hapa, kama vile tabaka au ngazi ya sasa, au hati iliyo wazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZana:\u003C/strong\u003E safu upande wa kushoto, zana za programu katika vikundi. Bofya jina la kikundi ili kukikunja au kukifungua tena. Zana inayoendeshwa inawaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZana zangu:\u003C/strong\u003E kikundi cha kwanza cha safu ya zana, chenye nafasi nane tupu za zana unazotumia zaidi. Bofya nafasi tupu ili kuchagua zana au amri yoyote ya programu; au bofya kulia zana kwenye safu ya zana kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOngeza kwenye Zana zangu\u003C/span\u003E; au buruta zana hadi kwenye nafasi. Bofya kulia nafasi ili kuibadilisha au kuitoa. Nafasi zako zinahifadhiwa kwa kila programu kwenye kivinjari hiki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKidirisha cha urambazaji:\u003C/strong\u003E paneli ya kulia. Kivinjari cha mradi cha programu kiko juu (mipango, sehemu, mionekano ya mbele, mionekano ya 3D, jedwali, karatasi, kama programu ilivyonavyo): bofya moja kuifungua. Chini yake, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifa\u003C/span\u003E na kichupo chenye maudhui mengine ya paneli ya kulia.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVichupo vya mionekano:\u003C/strong\u003E kichupo kwa kila mwonekano wa faili lililo wazi (karatasi, mpango, eneo la 3D…), juu ya mchoro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUpau wa haraka:\u003C/strong\u003E chini ya mchoro, mipangilio ya mwonekano na chaguo za kila siku za programu, kama kipimo, kiwango cha maelezo, upeo wa mwonekano, kutoshea, mpango, mgawanyiko au 3D, mivuto na vipimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaleti ya uhariri:\u003C/strong\u003E bofya kitu kwenye mchoro na paleti ndogo inaonekana karibu na kielekezi, ikiwa na amri za uhariri wa programu kwa kitu hicho, kama sogeza, nakili, zungusha, akisi, rudufu au futa, pamoja na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifa\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, gurudumu la kipanya, kubofya tena au kitufe chake cha kufunga vinaiondoa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZana isiyoweza kufanya kazi sasa inakuwa ya kijivu, na kidokezo chake kinaeleza sababu. Bofya, au bonyeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E juu yake, ili kusoma sababu kwenye kisanduku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E husimamisha zana inayoendeshwa kwanza, kama kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida, na kila njia ya mkato pamoja na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (njia za skrini) hufanya kazi kama zamani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipe-kisanduku-cha-zana-dirisha-lake\"\u003EIpe kisanduku cha zana dirisha lake\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha kisanduku cha zana\u003C/span\u003E kilicho juu ya kisanduku cha zana kina \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha kwenda dirisha jipya\u003C/span\u003E: kisanduku cha zana kinafunguka kwenye dirisha jembamba lake mwenyewe unaloweza kuliweka kando ya programu au kwenye skrini ya pili. Vitufe vinavyobonyezwa hapo vinafika kwenye programu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERudisha kisanduku cha zana\u003C/span\u003E, au kufunga dirisha hilo, kinakirudisha nyumbani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMipangilio ya upau wa zana inatumika pia kwenye kisanduku cha zana: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimataifa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpau wa zana\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAikoni na lebo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAikoni pekee\u003C/span\u003E au \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELebo pekee\u003C/span\u003E, na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnyesha majina ya vikundi (Faili, Chora, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paneli-zako-zinabaki-zako\"\u003EPaneli zako zinabaki zako\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaneli za kushoto na kulia zinabaki na kila kitu kilichoelezwa katika \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EPanga paneli\u003C/a\u003E: kubandika, kuelea, pini, kuficha, vichupo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha kwenda dirisha jipya\u003C/span\u003E na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeka upya mpangilio\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rudi-kwenye-mpangilio-wa-kawaida\"\u003ERudi kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimataifa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMpangilio\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENafasi ya kazi\u003C/span\u003E kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft ya kawaida\u003C/span\u003E. Kila upau wa zana, kila kichupo na kila paneli vinarudi mahali vilipokuwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwenye simu, au kwenye dirisha lenye upana wa pikseli 760 au chini ya hapo, programu inatumia mpangilio wake wa simu bila kujali ulichochagua. Dirisha pana zaidi huleta mpangilio wako tena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kujaribu mpangilio mwingine, angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Empangilio wa utepe na kivinjari cha mradi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kubadilisha kinachoonyeshwa na mpangilio huu, angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBadilisha mpangilio kwenye skrini\u003C/a\u003E; kwa mpangilio mweusi wenye upau wa menyu na utepe, angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Empangilio wa Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kisanduku cha zana na kisanduku cha taarifa ni mojawapo ya mipangilio mitatu ya nafasi ya kazi ya programu. Zana za kuchora zinasimama kwenye safu upande wa kushoto, kisanduku cha taarifa kinapita juu na kuonyesha kinachohitajika na zana inayoendeshwa au kile ulichochagua, kila mwonekano una kichupo, na upau wa haraka chini ya mchoro unashikilia chaguo chache za kila siku. Zana ni za programu yenyewe: kila unachoweza kufanya kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida kinafanya kazi hapa pia, na mchoro wako, mtindo wa menyu na njia zako za mkato vinabaki vilevile. Chagua Fungua Mipangilio (gia, au Ctrl+,). Chagua kichupo cha Kimataifa, kisha nenda kwenye Mpangilio › Nafasi ya kazi. Chagua Kisanduku cha zana na kisanduku cha taarifa. Mpangilio unabadilika mara moja. Chaguo ni moja kwa kila programu kwenye kivinjari hiki: kila programu inafunguka ndani yake kuanzia hapo, na linakuwepo kabla ukurasa haujachorwa, kwa hiyo hutaona mpangilio wa kawaida kwanza kamwe. Kilichopo wapi Upau wa zana: upau wa zana wa programu unabaki juu ya eneo la kuchora, pamoja na menyu zake. Kisanduku cha taarifa: chini ya upau wa zana. Zana inapoendeshwa, kinaonyesha zana hiyo na kinachohitaji. Unapochagua kitu, kinaonyesha mipangilio yake mikuu (kwa ukuta: aina yake, unene, urefu, mstari wa mahali na kimo), na unaweza kuibadilisha hapo hapo: mabadiliko hapo ni sawa na yale ya Sifa, na Ctrl+Z inayarudisha. Pasipo kitu kilichochaguliwa kinasema \"Hakuna kilichochaguliwa\". Kila programu huongeza visanduku vyake hapa, kama vile tabaka au ngazi ya sasa, au hati iliyo wazi. Zana: safu upande wa kushoto, zana za programu katika vikundi. Bofya jina la kikundi ili kukikunja au kukifungua tena. Zana inayoendeshwa inawaka. Zana zangu: kikundi cha kwanza cha safu ya zana, chenye nafasi nane tupu za zana unazotumia zaidi. Bofya nafasi tupu ili kuchagua zana au amri yoyote ya programu; au bofya kulia zana kwenye safu ya zana kisha uchague Ongeza kwenye Zana zangu; au buruta zana hadi kwenye nafasi. Bofya kulia nafasi ili kuibadilisha au kuitoa. Nafasi zako zinahifadhiwa kwa kila programu kwenye kivinjari hiki. Kidirisha cha urambazaji: paneli ya kulia. Kivinjari cha mradi cha programu kiko juu (mipango, sehemu, mionekano ya mbele, mionekano ya 3D, jedwali, karatasi, kama programu ilivyonavyo): bofya moja kuifungua. Chini yake, Sifa na kichupo chenye maudhui mengine ya paneli ya kulia. Vichupo vya mionekano: kichupo kwa kila mwonekano wa faili lililo wazi (karatasi, mpango, eneo la 3D…), juu ya mchoro. Upau wa haraka: chini ya mchoro, mipangilio ya mwonekano na chaguo za kila siku za programu, kama kipimo, kiwango cha maelezo, upeo wa mwonekano, kutoshea, mpango, mgawanyiko au 3D, mivuto na vipimo. Paleti ya uhariri: bofya kitu kwenye mchoro na paleti ndogo inaonekana karibu na kielekezi, ikiwa na amri za uhariri wa programu kwa kitu hicho, kama sogeza, nakili, zungusha, akisi, rudufu au futa, pamoja na Sifa. Esc, gurudumu la kipanya, kubofya tena au kitufe chake cha kufunga vinaiondoa. Zana isiyoweza kufanya kazi sasa inakuwa ya kijivu, na kidokezo chake kinaeleza sababu. Bofya, au bonyeza Enter juu yake, ili kusoma sababu kwenye kisanduku. Esc husimamisha zana inayoendeshwa kwanza, kama kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida, na kila njia ya mkato pamoja na Ctrl+Shift+F (njia za skrini) hufanya kazi kama zamani. Ipe kisanduku cha zana dirisha lake Hamisha kisanduku cha zana kilicho juu ya kisanduku cha zana kina Hamisha kwenda dirisha jipya: kisanduku cha zana kinafunguka kwenye dirisha jembamba lake mwenyewe unaloweza kuliweka kando ya programu au kwenye skrini ya pili. Vitufe vinavyobonyezwa hapo vinafika kwenye programu. Rudisha kisanduku cha zana, au kufunga dirisha hilo, kinakirudisha nyumbani. Mipangilio ya upau wa zana inatumika pia kwenye kisanduku cha zana: Mipangilio › Kimataifa › Upau wa zana › Aikoni na lebo, Aikoni pekee au Lebo pekee, na Onyesha majina ya vikundi (Faili, Chora, …). Paneli zako zinabaki zako Paneli za kushoto na kulia zinabaki na kila kitu kilichoelezwa katika Panga paneli: kubandika, kuelea, pini, kuficha, vichupo, Hamisha kwenda dirisha jipya na Weka upya mpangilio. Rudi kwenye mpangilio wa kawaida Fungua Mipangilio › Kimataifa › Mpangilio › Nafasi ya kazi kisha uchague CadCraft ya kawaida. Kila upau wa zana, kila kichupo na kila paneli vinarudi mahali vilipokuwa. Kwenye simu, au kwenye dirisha lenye upana wa pikseli 760 au chini ya hapo, programu inatumia mpangilio wake wa simu bila kujali ulichochagua. Dirisha pana zaidi huleta mpangilio wako tena. Ili kujaribu mpangilio mwingine, angalia mpangilio wa utepe na kivinjari cha mradi. Ili kubadilisha kinachoonyeshwa na mpangilio huu, angalia Badilisha mpangilio kwenye skrini; kwa mpangilio mweusi wenye upau wa menyu na utepe, angalia mpangilio wa Drafting.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Panga mpangilio wako mwenyewe na uhifadhi usanidi wako","summary":"Chagua paneli ipi itaonyesha kivinjari cha mradi, Sifa au maudhui ya paneli yenyewe, mahali kisanduku cha zana kitakapokuwa, na vilivyomo kwenye upau; hifadhi kama mpangilio wako mwenyewe, na uweke usanidi kamili chini ya jina ili ubadilishe kati yao.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["mpangilio","nafasi ya kazi","panga","binafsisha","mpangilio wangu","mpangilio wangu mwenyewe","paneli","wahariri","kivinjari cha mradi","sifa","kisanduku cha zana","upau wa haraka","kisanduku cha taarifa","mazingira ya kazi","usanidi","wasifu","hifadhi usanidi","badili usanidi","hamisha usanidi","ingiza usanidi","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"panga-mpangilio-wako-mwenyewe","text":"Panga mpangilio wako mwenyewe","level":2},{"id":"hifadhi-usanidi-wako-kama-mazingira-ya-kazi","text":"Hifadhi usanidi wako kama mazingira ya kazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMbali na mipangilio mitatu iliyojengewa ndani, unaweza kupanga yako mwenyewe, na kuhifadhi usanidi wako wote chini ya jina ili urudi kwake kwa hatua moja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panga-mpangilio-wako-mwenyewe\"\u003EPanga mpangilio wako mwenyewe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMipangilio\u003C/span\u003E (gia, au \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), chagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKimataifa\u003C/span\u003E, kisha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMpangilio\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanga mpangilio wako mwenyewe…\u003C/span\u003E. Kisanduku kinaanza kutoka mpangilio unaotumia sasa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELipe jina, kisha chagua:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJuu ya mchoro:\u003C/strong\u003E upau wa zana wa programu, utepe au hakuna; upau wa kichwa; kisanduku cha taarifa na vidhibiti vinavyoshikilia.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKando ya mchoro:\u003C/strong\u003E kisanduku cha zana upande wa kushoto, kulia au hakuna, pamoja au bila \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZana zangu\u003C/span\u003E; paneli ipi inashikilia paleti, ipi iko juu (kivinjari cha mradi au Sifa, kwa mfano), na ipi ni vichupo chini yake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEneo la mchoro:\u003C/strong\u003E vichupo vya mionekano, upau wa haraka na upau wa mionekano wenye vidhibiti unavyovichagua, paleti ya uhariri, upau wa hali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMwonekano:\u003C/strong\u003E ukubwa, mistari ya vitufe na mtindo wa vichupo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETumia mpangilio huu\u003C/span\u003E. Programu inabadilika mara moja, na kila programu inayotumia mipangilio pia inautumia.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENi vile tu programu hii inavyo ndivyo vinavyotolewa. Mpangilio wako unaorodheshwa chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKutoka kwenye nyongeza na faili\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha mpangilio huu\u003C/span\u003E unauhifadhi kama faili unalompa mwenzako, na kitufe cha kuondoa kinauondoa. Paneli zinazojazwa nao bado zinabandikwa, zinaelea na kuhamia kwenye madirisha yao wenyewe, kama ilivyo katika \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EPanga paneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hifadhi-usanidi-wako-kama-mazingira-ya-kazi\"\u003EHifadhi usanidi wako kama mazingira ya kazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMazingira ya kazi ni usanidi wako wote kwa kila programu kwenye kivinjari hiki: mpangilio, mtindo wa menyu na njia zako za mkato, mtindo wa upau wa zana, paneli na ukubwa wake, na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZana zangu\u003C/span\u003E. Mandhari na lugha havimo ndani yake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHifadhi:\u003C/strong\u003E andika jina chini ya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMazingira ya kazi\u003C/span\u003E kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi usanidi wangu\u003C/span\u003E. Kuhifadhi chini ya jina lililopo kunabadilisha usanidi huo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadili:\u003C/strong\u003E chagua usanidi kwenye orodha kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBadili kwenda kwake\u003C/span\u003E. Programu inapakia upya kwa usanidi huo; ukiwa na kazi ambayo hujahifadhi, programu inauliza kwanza, kama inavyofanya kwenye upakiaji upya wowote.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShiriki:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamisha\u003C/span\u003E huhifadhi usanidi uliochaguliwa kama faili la \u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngiza usanidi…\u003C/span\u003E huongeza moja kutoka kwenye faili. Faili huweka chaguo hizi tu, si kitu kingine.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOndoa:\u003C/strong\u003E chagua usanidi kisha uchague \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOndoa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnaweza kuhifadhi usanidi hadi kumi na mbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIli kubadilisha mpangilio bila kufungua kisanduku (buruta bloku, bofya kulia zana), angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBadilisha mpangilio kwenye skrini\u003C/a\u003E. Ili kujaribu mipangilio iliyojengewa ndani kwanza, angalia \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Empangilio wa kisanduku cha zana na kisanduku cha taarifa\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Empangilio wa utepe na kivinjari cha mradi\u003C/a\u003E na \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Empangilio wa Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Mbali na mipangilio mitatu iliyojengewa ndani, unaweza kupanga yako mwenyewe, na kuhifadhi usanidi wako wote chini ya jina ili urudi kwake kwa hatua moja. Panga mpangilio wako mwenyewe Fungua Mipangilio (gia, au Ctrl+,), chagua Kimataifa, kisha Mpangilio. Chagua Panga mpangilio wako mwenyewe…. Kisanduku kinaanza kutoka mpangilio unaotumia sasa. Lipe jina, kisha chagua: Juu ya mchoro: upau wa zana wa programu, utepe au hakuna; upau wa kichwa; kisanduku cha taarifa na vidhibiti vinavyoshikilia. Kando ya mchoro: kisanduku cha zana upande wa kushoto, kulia au hakuna, pamoja au bila Zana zangu; paneli ipi inashikilia paleti, ipi iko juu (kivinjari cha mradi au Sifa, kwa mfano), na ipi ni vichupo chini yake. Eneo la mchoro: vichupo vya mionekano, upau wa haraka na upau wa mionekano wenye vidhibiti unavyovichagua, paleti ya uhariri, upau wa hali. Mwonekano: ukubwa, mistari ya vitufe na mtindo wa vichupo. Chagua Tumia mpangilio huu. Programu inabadilika mara moja, na kila programu inayotumia mipangilio pia inautumia. Ni vile tu programu hii inavyo ndivyo vinavyotolewa. Mpangilio wako unaorodheshwa chini ya Kutoka kwenye nyongeza na faili; Hamisha mpangilio huu unauhifadhi kama faili unalompa mwenzako, na kitufe cha kuondoa kinauondoa. Paneli zinazojazwa nao bado zinabandikwa, zinaelea na kuhamia kwenye madirisha yao wenyewe, kama ilivyo katika Panga paneli. Hifadhi usanidi wako kama mazingira ya kazi Mazingira ya kazi ni usanidi wako wote kwa kila programu kwenye kivinjari hiki: mpangilio, mtindo wa menyu na njia zako za mkato, mtindo wa upau wa zana, paneli na ukubwa wake, na Zana zangu. Mandhari na lugha havimo ndani yake. Hifadhi: andika jina chini ya Mazingira ya kazi kisha uchague Hifadhi usanidi wangu. Kuhifadhi chini ya jina lililopo kunabadilisha usanidi huo. Badili: chagua usanidi kwenye orodha kisha uchague Badili kwenda kwake. Programu inapakia upya kwa usanidi huo; ukiwa na kazi ambayo hujahifadhi, programu inauliza kwanza, kama inavyofanya kwenye upakiaji upya wowote. Shiriki: Hamisha huhifadhi usanidi uliochaguliwa kama faili la .ccenv.json; Ingiza usanidi… huongeza moja kutoka kwenye faili. Faili huweka chaguo hizi tu, si kitu kingine. Ondoa: chagua usanidi kisha uchague Ondoa. Unaweza kuhifadhi usanidi hadi kumi na mbili. Ili kubadilisha mpangilio bila kufungua kisanduku (buruta bloku, bofya kulia zana), angalia Badilisha mpangilio kwenye skrini. Ili kujaribu mipangilio iliyojengewa ndani kwanza, angalia mpangilio wa kisanduku cha zana na kisanduku cha taarifa, mpangilio wa utepe na kivinjari cha mradi na mpangilio wa Drafting.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Kufanya kazi nje ya mtandao","summary":"Hifadhi programu kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao, kinachofanya kazi bila muunganisho, na kinachohitaji muunganisho.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["nje ya mtandao","hakuna intaneti","ndege","ziara ya eneo","akiba","cache","service worker","sakinisha","pakua","muunganisho"],"headings":[{"id":"hifadhi-programu-kwa-matumizi-nje-ya-mtandao","text":"Hifadhi programu kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao","level":2},{"id":"kinachofanya-kazi-nje-ya-mtandao","text":"Kinachofanya kazi nje ya mtandao","level":2},{"id":"kinachohitaji-muunganisho","text":"Kinachohitaji muunganisho","level":2},{"id":"mambo-ya-kufahamu","text":"Mambo ya kufahamu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EProgramu zinafanya kazi yao kwenye kompyuta yako, kwa hiyo mengi yake yanafanya kazi bila muunganisho wowote. Kivinjari kinahitaji tu kuwa kimehifadhi faili za programu kwanza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hifadhi-programu-kwa-matumizi-nje-ya-mtandao\"\u003EHifadhi programu kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFungua programu ukiwa mtandaoni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChagua \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E kwenye upau ulio juu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESubiri ujumbe &quot;Tayari kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao&quot;. Faili za programu, wasomaji wake wa faili na msaada huu sasa vimehifadhiwa kwenye kivinjari chako. Programu zinazosoma faili za DWG au PDF nazo zinahifadhi wasomaji wake, kwa hiyo hili linaweza kuchukua dakika moja mara ya kwanza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFanya hivi mara moja kwa kila programu, katika kila kivinjari unachotumia. Ili kurudi kwenye programu baadaye bila muunganisho, fungua anwani ile ile uliyotumia hapo awali, au alamisho lake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESasa hivi uko nje ya mtandao. Ikiwa programu hii ilihifadhiwa kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao, kila kitu hapa chini kinafanya kazi. Kama haikuhifadhiwa, bado unaweza kutumia kile kilichokwishapakiwa kwenye kichupo hiki, lakini usikipakie upya hadi uwe mtandaoni tena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kinachofanya-kazi-nje-ya-mtandao\"\u003EKinachofanya kazi nje ya mtandao\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufungua faili kutoka kwenye kompyuta yako, kuchora, kuhariri, kupima na kukagua.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuhifadhi na kuhamisha: kila hifadhi ni upakuaji kwenye kompyuta yako.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMsaada huu, pamoja na utafutaji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kinachohitaji-muunganisho\"\u003EKinachohitaji muunganisho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufungua programu kwa mara ya kwanza, na kuihifadhi kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKupata toleo jipya zaidi la programu. Ukiwa mtandaoni, programu inachukua toleo jipya zaidi wakati mwingine inapofunguka, na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao\u003C/span\u003E inasasisha nakala iliyohifadhiwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EViungo vya tovuti, kama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFungua kwenye tovuti\u003C/span\u003E, na viungo vya kurasa nyingine.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuhifadhi kwenye wingu na kusawazisha kati ya kompyuta, ambavyo bado havipatikani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mambo-ya-kufahamu\"\u003EMambo ya kufahamu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENakala iliyohifadhiwa ni ya kivinjari kimoja kwenye kompyuta moja. Kufuta data ya tovuti ya kivinjari kunaiondoa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMadirisha ya faragha kwenye baadhi ya vivinjari, na baadhi ya kompyuta za kazi zilizofungwa, haziruhusu kuhifadhi nje ya mtandao. Kitufe kinakuambia wakati hakiwezi kuhifadhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari huondoa data ya tovuti iliyohifadhiwa kwa tovuti ambazo hujazitembelea kwa wiki kadhaa. Fungua programu mara kwa mara ukiwa mtandaoni, au ihifadhi tena kabla ya safari.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECadCraft Studio, programu ya eneo-kazi yenye programu zote nane kwenye usakinishaji mmoja, inapatikana kwenye getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Programu zinafanya kazi yao kwenye kompyuta yako, kwa hiyo mengi yake yanafanya kazi bila muunganisho wowote. Kivinjari kinahitaji tu kuwa kimehifadhi faili za programu kwanza. Hifadhi programu kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao Fungua programu ukiwa mtandaoni. Chagua Hifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao kwenye upau ulio juu. Subiri ujumbe \"Tayari kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao\". Faili za programu, wasomaji wake wa faili na msaada huu sasa vimehifadhiwa kwenye kivinjari chako. Programu zinazosoma faili za DWG au PDF nazo zinahifadhi wasomaji wake, kwa hiyo hili linaweza kuchukua dakika moja mara ya kwanza. Fanya hivi mara moja kwa kila programu, katika kila kivinjari unachotumia. Ili kurudi kwenye programu baadaye bila muunganisho, fungua anwani ile ile uliyotumia hapo awali, au alamisho lake. Sasa hivi uko nje ya mtandao. Ikiwa programu hii ilihifadhiwa kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao, kila kitu hapa chini kinafanya kazi. Kama haikuhifadhiwa, bado unaweza kutumia kile kilichokwishapakiwa kwenye kichupo hiki, lakini usikipakie upya hadi uwe mtandaoni tena. Kinachofanya kazi nje ya mtandao Kufungua faili kutoka kwenye kompyuta yako, kuchora, kuhariri, kupima na kukagua. Kuhifadhi na kuhamisha: kila hifadhi ni upakuaji kwenye kompyuta yako. Msaada huu, pamoja na utafutaji. Kinachohitaji muunganisho Kufungua programu kwa mara ya kwanza, na kuihifadhi kwa matumizi nje ya mtandao. Kupata toleo jipya zaidi la programu. Ukiwa mtandaoni, programu inachukua toleo jipya zaidi wakati mwingine inapofunguka, na Hifadhi kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao inasasisha nakala iliyohifadhiwa. Viungo vya tovuti, kama Fungua kwenye tovuti, na viungo vya kurasa nyingine. Kuhifadhi kwenye wingu na kusawazisha kati ya kompyuta, ambavyo bado havipatikani. Mambo ya kufahamu Nakala iliyohifadhiwa ni ya kivinjari kimoja kwenye kompyuta moja. Kufuta data ya tovuti ya kivinjari kunaiondoa. Madirisha ya faragha kwenye baadhi ya vivinjari, na baadhi ya kompyuta za kazi zilizofungwa, haziruhusu kuhifadhi nje ya mtandao. Kitufe kinakuambia wakati hakiwezi kuhifadhi. Safari huondoa data ya tovuti iliyohifadhiwa kwa tovuti ambazo hujazitembelea kwa wiki kadhaa. Fungua programu mara kwa mara ukiwa mtandaoni, au ihifadhi tena kabla ya safari. CadCraft Studio, programu ya eneo-kazi yenye programu zote nane kwenye usakinishaji mmoja, inapatikana kwenye getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Mahali faili zako zinapoenda","summary":"Faili zinabaki kwenye kompyuta yako, jinsi kuhifadhi kunavyofanya kazi, na kile kivinjari kinachokumbuka.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["faragha","pakia","wingu","hifadhi","pakua","uhifadhi","ndani","usalama","siri"],"headings":[{"id":"faili-zako-zinabaki-kwenye-kompyuta-yako","text":"Faili zako zinabaki kwenye kompyuta yako","level":2},{"id":"jinsi-kuhifadhi-kunavyofanya-kazi","text":"Jinsi kuhifadhi kunavyofanya kazi","level":2},{"id":"kile-kivinjari-kinachokumbuka","text":"Kile kivinjari kinachokumbuka","level":2},{"id":"kuhifadhi-kwenye-wingu","text":"Kuhifadhi kwenye wingu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"faili-zako-zinabaki-kwenye-kompyuta-yako\"\u003EFaili zako zinabaki kwenye kompyuta yako\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnapofungua mchoro, modeli au PDF, programu inasoma ndani ya kivinjari chako. \u003Cstrong\u003EFaili halipakiwi.\u003C/strong\u003E Hatuliwezi kuliona, na linafanya kazi vilevile bila muunganisho wowote.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jinsi-kuhifadhi-kunavyofanya-kazi\"\u003EJinsi kuhifadhi kunavyofanya kazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkurasa wa kivinjari hauwezi kubatilisha faili kwenye kompyuta yako peke yake, kwa hiyo programu zinahifadhi kwa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekupakua\u003C/strong\u003E faili jipya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUpakuaji unakwenda pale kivinjari chako kinapoweka upakuaji, kwa kawaida folda yako ya Downloads, isipokuwa umekiweka kiulize kila mara (ona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EVivinjari na kompyuta\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProgramu zinazobadilisha faili zinahifadhi nakala yenye jina jipya, kama &quot;(edited)&quot; au &quot;(marked up)&quot;, ili asili yako ibaki bila kuguswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkifunga kichupo chenye kazi ambayo haijahifadhiwa, kivinjari kinauliza kwanza (&quot;Leave site?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kile-kivinjari-kinachokumbuka\"\u003EKile kivinjari kinachokumbuka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaadhi ya programu zinakumbuka mipangilio midogo kwenye kivinjari chako, kama jina lako la mwandishi au mitindo ya zana. Zinabaki kwenye kivinjari hicho kwenye kompyuta hiyo, na kufuta data ya tovuti kunazifuta. Msaada wa kila programu unaeleza ni nini inakihifadhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuhifadhi-kwenye-wingu\"\u003EKuhifadhi kwenye wingu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuhifadhi kwenye wingu na kusawazisha kati ya kompyuta ni sehemu ya leseni ya kibiashara. Bado hazipatikani. Hadi wakati huo, hifadhi faili zako mahali unapohifadhi faili zako nyingine za mradi, na uziweke nakala rudufu kwa njia ya kawaida.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Faili zako zinabaki kwenye kompyuta yako Unapofungua mchoro, modeli au PDF, programu inasoma ndani ya kivinjari chako. Faili halipakiwi. Hatuliwezi kuliona, na linafanya kazi vilevile bila muunganisho wowote. Jinsi kuhifadhi kunavyofanya kazi Ukurasa wa kivinjari hauwezi kubatilisha faili kwenye kompyuta yako peke yake, kwa hiyo programu zinahifadhi kwa kupakua faili jipya: Upakuaji unakwenda pale kivinjari chako kinapoweka upakuaji, kwa kawaida folda yako ya Downloads, isipokuwa umekiweka kiulize kila mara (ona Vivinjari na kompyuta). Programu zinazobadilisha faili zinahifadhi nakala yenye jina jipya, kama \"(edited)\" au \"(marked up)\", ili asili yako ibaki bila kuguswa. Ukifunga kichupo chenye kazi ambayo haijahifadhiwa, kivinjari kinauliza kwanza (\"Leave site?\"). Kile kivinjari kinachokumbuka Baadhi ya programu zinakumbuka mipangilio midogo kwenye kivinjari chako, kama jina lako la mwandishi au mitindo ya zana. Zinabaki kwenye kivinjari hicho kwenye kompyuta hiyo, na kufuta data ya tovuti kunazifuta. Msaada wa kila programu unaeleza ni nini inakihifadhi. Kuhifadhi kwenye wingu Kuhifadhi kwenye wingu na kusawazisha kati ya kompyuta ni sehemu ya leseni ya kibiashara. Bado hazipatikani. Hadi wakati huo, hifadhi faili zako mahali unapohifadhi faili zako nyingine za mradi, na uziweke nakala rudufu kwa njia ya kawaida.","lang":"sw"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPen pressure and tilt don&#039;t change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen&#039;s pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Pen pressure and tilt don't change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen's pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffDesk, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffDesk&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffDesk by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffDesk, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffDesk\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffDesk by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffDesk The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"sw","chain":["sw","en"]};
